window.SITE_DATA = {"categories": [{"name": "固定搭配 · 第五部分", "modules": [{"id": "p5_什么是固定搭配", "code": "", "title": "什么是固定搭配", "articles": [{"title": "导读", "section": "导读", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>什么是固定搭配</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>固定搭配的定义</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>固定搭配是语言中的约定俗成表达，掌握这些搭配能让语言更加地道。</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>例句：</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>The project is in full swing.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>正确翻译：这个项目如火如荼地进行中。</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>中文对比：</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>类似于“提心吊胆”“碰钉子”等表达，需要整体理解。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>如何学习固定搭配？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">1. 输入为主：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 学习500 个最常用的固定搭配。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">2. 分类学习：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 动词与介词搭配：e.g., rely on, look after</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>形容词与介词搭配：e.g., interested in, good at</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>名词与介词搭配：e.g., a key to, an answer to</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>---</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_什么是固定搭配_01", "moduleId": "p5_什么是固定搭配"}, {"title": "英文原文", "section": "英文原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>（本篇无独立原文段落）</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_什么是固定搭配_02", "moduleId": "p5_什么是固定搭配"}, {"title": "搭配总结", "section": "搭配总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>（本篇无独立固定搭配词条）</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_什么是固定搭配_03", "moduleId": "p5_什么是固定搭配"}]}, {"id": "p5_汤姆的艺术之旅", "code": "", "title": "汤姆的艺术之旅", "articles": [{"title": "故事精讲", "section": "故事精讲", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>故事精讲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第一段：汤姆的梦想</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Once there was a boy named Tom.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He <mark>dreamed of</mark> being a great artist one day.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He <strong><mark>ran into</mark></strong> his teacher, talked to her, and she <strong><mark>pointed out</mark></strong> his talent.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Tom <mark>listened to</mark> her <strong>advice</strong>.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. dream of doing something：梦想做某事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I dream of becoming a doctor.（我梦想成为一名医生。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：She dreams of traveling around the world.（她梦想环游世界。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. run into：偶遇</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I ran into an old friend on the street.（我在街上偶遇了一位</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>老朋友。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>例句：He ran into difficulties in his business.（他在生意上遇到了</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>困难。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. talk to somebody about something：向某人谈论关于某事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Talk to your teacher about your problems.（和你的老师谈谈   你的问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>例句：The politician is talking to the public about important issues.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（这位政治家正在向公众谈论重要问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. point out：指出</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Please point out my mistakes.（请指出我的错误。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. listen to：听某人说话或某种声音</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Listen to the music.（听音乐。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>例句：She's listening to his story attentively.（她专心地听他讲故事。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第二段：课堂表现</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p><mark>In class</mark>, Tom would <mark>talk with</mark> his friends <mark>about</mark> art.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>They <mark>depended on</mark> each other for inspiration.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>When there was a quiz, they <mark>filled in</mark> the answers carefully.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p><mark>At the end of</mark> the term, Tom had to <mark>hand in</mark> his project.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He also had to <mark>hand over</mark> some art supplies to a classmate who needed them.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. in class：在课上</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：In class, we should pay attention to the teacher.（在课上，我</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>们应该注意听老师讲课。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. talk with somebody about something：与某人谈论某事            - 例句：Talk with your friends about your plans.（和你的朋友谈谈你</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>的计划。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. depend on：依靠，依赖</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I depend on my parents.（我依靠我的父母。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>例句：The success of the project depends on everyone's efforts.（这</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>个项目的成功取决于每个人的努力。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. fill in：填写</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Fill in the blanks with the correct answers.（用正确答案填写</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>空白。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. at the end of：在……的末尾</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：At the end of the year, we will have a holiday.（在年末，我</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>们将有一个假期。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. hand in：上交</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Hand in your homework on time.（按时上交你的作业。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. hand over：交出，移交</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He had to hand over his phone.（他不得不交出他的手机。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第三段：测验前的准备</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Before the quiz, Tom <mark>handed out</mark> pencils to those who forgot to bring theirs. He worked hard, and his project <mark>stood out</mark>. He knew his work       <mark>belonged to</mark> him. His friends <mark>stood by</mark> him. For Tom, art <mark>stands for</mark> freedom and expression.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. hand out：分发</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The teacher handed out the test papers.（老师分发了试卷。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>例句：Volunteers handed out food to the homeless.（志愿者们向无</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>家可归的人分发食物。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. forget to do something：忘记做某事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I forgot to bring my book.（我忘记带我的书了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. stand out：杰出，突出</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He stands out in the team for his leadership skills.（他在团队</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>中因领导能力而突出。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. belong to：属于</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：This book belongs to me.（这本书属于我。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. stand by：支持</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I'll stand by you.（我会支持你。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. stand for：象征</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：VIP stands for Very Important Person.（VIP 代表非常重要的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>人。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>例句：This symbol stands for peace and unity.（这个符号象征着和</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>平与团结。）   课后练习</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 造句练习：使用今天学到的固定搭配造句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I dream of traveling around the world.（我梦想环游世界。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>例句：He ran into an old friend on the street.（他在街上偶遇了一位</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>老朋友。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>---</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_汤姆的艺术之旅_01", "moduleId": "p5_汤姆的艺术之旅"}, {"title": "英文原文", "section": "英文原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>Once there was a boy named Tom.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He dreamed of being a great artist one day.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He <strong>ran into</strong> his teacher, talked to her, and she <strong>pointed out</strong> his talent.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Tom listened to her <strong>advice</strong>.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>In class, Tom would talk with his friends about art.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>They depended on each other for inspiration.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>When there was a quiz, they filled in the answers carefully.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>At the end of the term, Tom had to hand in his project.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He also had to hand over some art supplies to a classmate who needed them.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Before the quiz, Tom handed out pencils to those who forgot to bring theirs. He worked hard, and his project stood out. He knew his work       belonged to him. His friends stood by him. For Tom, art stands for freedom and expression.</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_汤姆的艺术之旅_02", "moduleId": "p5_汤姆的艺术之旅"}, {"title": "搭配总结", "section": "搭配总结", "blocks": [{"type": "ol", "html": "<ol><li>dream of doing something：梦想做某事</li><li>run into：偶遇</li><li>talk to somebody about something：向某人谈论关于某事</li><li>point out：指出</li><li>listen to：听某人说话或某种声音</li><li>in class：在课上</li><li>talk with somebody about something：与某人谈论某事</li><li>depend on：依靠，依赖</li><li>fill in：填写</li><li>at the end of：在……的末尾</li><li>hand in：上交</li><li>hand over：交出，移交</li><li>hand out：分发</li><li>forget to do something：忘记做某事</li><li>stand out：杰出，突出</li><li>belong to：属于</li><li>stand by：支持</li><li>stand for：象征</li></ol>"}], "id": "a_p5_汤姆的艺术之旅_03", "moduleId": "p5_汤姆的艺术之旅"}]}, {"id": "p5_艾克的神奇冒险", "code": "", "title": "艾克的神奇冒险", "articles": [{"title": "故事精讲", "section": "故事精讲", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>故事精讲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第一段：艾克的好奇心</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Act was a <mark>curious</mark> child. He always <mark>insisted on</mark> having exciting adventures.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>One day, he <mark>heard about</mark> a mysterious place and decided to go there.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>When he arrived, he <mark>turned on</mark> his flashlight, but soon he <mark>realized</mark> that it wasn't so dark, so he turned it off.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. curious：好奇的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He is a curious child.（他是一个充满好奇心的孩子。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. insist on doing something：坚持做某事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He insists on doing it himself.（他坚持自己做。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>例句：She insists on wearing that dress to the party.（她坚持要穿那</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>件裙子去参加聚会。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. hear about：听说</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I heard about a mysterious place.（我听说了一个神秘的地方。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. decide to do something：决定做某事            - 例句：He decided to go there.（他决定去那里。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. turn on：打开</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He turned on his flashlight.（他打开手电筒。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. turn off：关闭</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He turned off his flashlight.（他关闭手电筒。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第二段：艾克的冒险</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>As he was walking, he was <mark>concentrating on</mark> looking for something special. <mark>Suddenly</mark>, he heard a noise and <mark>turned around</mark>. To his surprise, he <mark>ran into</mark> a friendly elf. \"Hello there,\" said the elf. \"What are you looking for?\" Act replied, \"I'm looking for a magic stone.\" The elf smiled and pointed in a direction.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. concentrate on something：全神贯注于某事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He was concentrating on looking for something special.（他全</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>神贯注地寻找特别的东西。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. suddenly：突然</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Suddenly, he heard a noise.（突然，他听到了一个声响。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. turn around：转身</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He turned around.（他转过身来。）        4. to one's surprise：令某人惊讶的是</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>例句：To his surprise, he ran into a friendly elf.（令他惊讶的是，</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>他遇到了一个友好的小精灵。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. run into：偶遇</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He ran into a friendly elf.（他遇到了一个友好的小精灵。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第三段：艾克的挑战</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Act <mark>became excited</mark> and started looking for it. However, his water <mark>ran out</mark>, and he had to <mark>deal with</mark> being thirsty. Just then, he <mark>found</mark> a little bird.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>\"Don't worry, little one,\" said Act, \"I'll <mark>look after</mark> you.\" He decided to <mark>look after</mark> the bird.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. become excited：变得兴奋</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Act became excited.（艾克变得兴奋。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. run out：用完，耗尽</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：His water ran out.（他的水用完了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. deal with：处理，解决</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He had to deal with being thirsty.（他需要解决口渴的问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. look after：照顾            - 例句：I'll look after you.（我会照顾你的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第四段：艾克的坚持</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He <mark>stuck to</mark> his search and <mark>relied on</mark> his luck. <mark>Although</mark> it was not easy, he didn't <mark>give up</mark>. Finally, he  <mark>filled in</mark> his notebook with this amazing adventure.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. stick to something：坚持某事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He stuck to his search.（他坚持他的搜索。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. rely on：依赖</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He relied on his luck.（他依赖他的运气。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. although：尽管</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Although it was not easy, he didn't give up.（尽管不容易，</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>他没有放弃。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. give up：放弃</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He didn't give up.（他没有放弃。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. fill in：填写</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He filled in his notebook with this amazing adventure.（他在</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>笔记本中写下了这次精彩的冒险。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>课后练习</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>造句练习：使用今天学到的固定搭配造句。            - 例句：He insists on doing it himself.（他坚持自己做。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>例句：I heard about a mysterious place.（我听说了一个神秘的地方。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>例句：He turned on his flashlight.（他打开手电筒。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>例句：He was concentrating on looking for something special.（他全</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>神贯注地寻找特别的东西。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>例句：To his surprise, he ran into a friendly elf.（令他惊讶的是，</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>他遇到了一个友好的小精灵。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>例句：His water ran out.（他的水用完了。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>例句：He had to deal with being thirsty.（他需要解决口渴的问题。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>例句：I'll look after you.（我会照顾你的。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>例句：He stuck to his search.（他坚持他的搜索。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>例句：He relied on his luck.（他依赖他的运气。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>例句：Although it was not easy, he didn't give up.（尽管不容易，</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>他没有放弃。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>例句：He filled in his notebook with this amazing adventure.（他在</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>笔记本中写下了这次精彩的冒险。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>---</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_艾克的神奇冒险_01", "moduleId": "p5_艾克的神奇冒险"}, {"title": "英文原文", "section": "英文原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>Act was a curious child. He always insisted on having exciting adventures.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>One day, he heard about a mysterious place and decided to go there.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>When he arrived, he turned on his flashlight, but soon he realized that it wasn't so dark, so he turned it off.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>As he was walking, he was concentrating on looking for something special. Suddenly, he heard a noise and turned around. To his surprise, he ran into a friendly elf. \"Hello there,\" said the elf. \"What are you looking for?\" Act replied, \"I'm looking for a magic stone.\" The elf smiled and pointed in a direction.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Act became excited and started looking for it. However, his water ran out, and he had to deal with being thirsty. Just then, he found a little bird.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>\"Don't worry, little one,\" said Act, \"I'll look after you.\" He decided to look after the bird.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He stuck to his search and relied on his luck. Although it was not easy, he didn't give up. Finally, he  filled in his notebook with this amazing adventure.</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_艾克的神奇冒险_02", "moduleId": "p5_艾克的神奇冒险"}, {"title": "搭配总结", "section": "搭配总结", "blocks": [{"type": "ol", "html": "<ol><li>curious：好奇的</li><li>insist on doing something：坚持做某事</li><li>hear about：听说</li><li>decide to do something：决定做某事</li><li>turn on：打开</li><li>turn off：关闭</li><li>concentrate on something：全神贯注于某事</li><li>suddenly：突然</li><li>turn around：转身</li><li>run into：偶遇</li><li>become excited：变得兴奋</li><li>run out：用完，耗尽</li><li>deal with：处理，解决</li><li>look after：照顾</li><li>stick to something：坚持某事</li><li>rely on：依赖</li><li>although：尽管</li><li>give up：放弃</li><li>fill in：填写</li></ol>"}], "id": "a_p5_艾克的神奇冒险_03", "moduleId": "p5_艾克的神奇冒险"}]}, {"id": "p5_学校旅行", "code": "", "title": "学校旅行", "articles": [{"title": "故事精讲", "section": "故事精讲", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>故事精讲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第一段：旅行计划与反对</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>There was a plan for a school trip. Some kids <mark>objected to</mark> getting up early.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>\"It's too hard,\" they said. As they <mark>prepared for</mark> the trip, they <mark>reflected on</mark> past outings and referred to a great one they had before.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. there be 句型：表示有</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：There was a plan for a school trip.（学校有一个旅行计划。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. object to doing something：反对做某事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Some kids objected to getting up early.（一些孩子反对早起。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. prepare for：为某事做准备</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：As they prepared for the trip, they reflected on past outings.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（在他们为这次旅行做准备的时候，他们回忆起过去的出游经历。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. reflect on：反思，回忆</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：We should reflect on our actions.（我们应该反思我们的行为。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. refer to：提及，参考            - 例句：Please refer to the dictionary if you don't know the word.（如</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>果你不知道这个单词，请查词典。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第二段：坏消息与希望</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>They <mark>thought about</mark> how much fun it was, but then came bad news. The trip might be <mark>called off</mark> <mark>due to</mark> bad weather. The kids were disappointed, but <mark>held on to</mark> their hope. They <mark>looked into</mark> other possibilities.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. think about：思考，考虑</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：They thought about how much fun it was.（他们回想着那次</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>旅行有多么的有趣。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. call off：取消</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The trip might be called off due to bad weather.（由于天气不</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>佳，这次旅行可能会被取消。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. due to：由于</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The trip might be called off due to bad weather.（由于天气不</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>佳，这次旅行可能会被取消。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. hold on to：坚持，紧紧抓住</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The kids were disappointed, but held on to their hope.（孩子</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>们很失望，但依然坚守希望。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. look into：调查，探寻            - 例句：They looked into other possibilities.（他们探寻其他的可能</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>性。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第三段：解决方案与室内活动</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>They <mark>took in</mark> the situation and <mark>concentrated on</mark> <mark>finding</mark> a solution. They knew they had to <mark>keep up</mark> their excitement so that they could <mark>have fun</mark> in any alternative plan. <mark>In the end</mark>, they had an indoor activity day at school and still <mark>had a good time</mark>.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. take in：理解，接受</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：They took in the situation.（他们理解并接受了现状。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. concentrate on：专注于</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：They concentrated on finding a solution.（他们专注于寻找解</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>决方案。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. keep up：保持</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：They knew they had to keep up their excitement.（他们知道</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>必须保持兴奋。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. in the end：最终</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：In the end, they had an indoor activity day at school and still</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>had a good time.（最终，他们在学校举办了一个室内活动日，依然度过了一段美好的时光。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>课后练习</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 造句练习：使用今天学到的固定搭配造句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- there be 句型：There is a plan for a school trip.（学校有一个旅行计</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>划。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>object to doing something：I object to working on weekends.（我反</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>对周末工作。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>prepare for：We are preparing for the exam.（我们正在为考试做准</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>备。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>reflect on：We should reflect on our mistakes.（我们应该反思我们</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>的错误。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>refer to：Please refer to the manual if you have any questions.（如果</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>你有任何问题，请参考手册。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>think about：She is thinking about changing her job.（她正在考虑换</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>工作。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>call off：They called off the meeting due to the emergency.（由于紧</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>急情况，他们取消了会议。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>due to：The flight was delayed due to bad weather.（由于天气不佳，</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>航班被延误。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>hold on to：Hold on to your dreams, no matter what.（无论发生什么，   都要坚持你的梦想。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>look into：The police are looking into the case.（警察正在调查这个</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>案件。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>take in：He took in the beautiful view.（他欣赏着美丽的风景。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>concentrate on：Concentrate on your work, and you will finish it</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>faster.（专注于你的工作，你会更快完成。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>keep up：Keep up the good work!（保持良好的工作状态！）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>in the end：In the end, everything worked out well.（最终，一切都</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>很好。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>---</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_学校旅行_01", "moduleId": "p5_学校旅行"}, {"title": "英文原文", "section": "英文原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>There was a plan for a school trip. Some kids objected to getting up early.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>\"It's too hard,\" they said. As they prepared for the trip, they reflected on past outings and referred to a great one they had before.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>They thought about how much fun it was, but then came bad news. The trip might be called off due to bad weather. The kids were disappointed, but held on to their hope. They looked into other possibilities.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>They took in the situation and concentrated on finding a solution. They knew they had to keep up their excitement so that they could have fun in any alternative plan. In the end, they had an indoor activity day at school and still had a good time.</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_学校旅行_02", "moduleId": "p5_学校旅行"}, {"title": "搭配总结", "section": "搭配总结", "blocks": [{"type": "ol", "html": "<ol><li>there be 句型：表示有</li><li>object to doing something：反对做某事</li><li>prepare for：为某事做准备</li><li>reflect on：反思，回忆</li><li>refer to：提及，参考</li><li>think about：思考，考虑</li><li>call off：取消</li><li>due to：由于</li><li>hold on to：坚持，紧紧抓住</li><li>look into：调查，探寻</li><li>take in：理解，接受</li><li>concentrate on：专注于</li><li>keep up：保持</li><li>in the end：最终</li></ol>"}], "id": "a_p5_学校旅行_03", "moduleId": "p5_学校旅行"}]}, {"id": "p5_才艺秀风云", "code": "", "title": "才艺秀风云", "articles": [{"title": "故事精讲", "section": "故事精讲", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>故事精讲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第一段：才艺表演的准备</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>There is a school talent show <mark>coming up</mark>, and the kids are all excited. The show <mark>centers on</mark> <mark>a variety of</mark> fun acts. The kids <mark>look over</mark> their plans carefully and <mark>get ready with</mark> great enthusiasm. They <mark>pay close attention to</mark> every tiny detail to make sure everything is perfect.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. there be 句型：表示有</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：There is a school talent show coming up.（学校要举办一场</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>才艺表演。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. center on：以……为中心</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The show centers on a variety of fun acts.（这场表演以各种</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>有趣的节目为中心。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. a variety of：各种各样的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The show centers on a variety of fun acts.（这场表演以各种</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>有趣的节目为中心。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. look over：检查，查看            - 例句：The kids look over their plans carefully.（孩子们认真查看他</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>们的计划。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. get ready with：准备好，伴随着</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The kids get ready with great enthusiasm.（孩子们热情满满</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>地准备着。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. pay close attention to：密切关注</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：They pay close attention to every tiny detail.（他们密切关注</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>每一个细小的细节。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第二段：遇到问题</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>But then troubles <mark>come up</mark>. The microphone stops working, and a costume falls apart. This makes the kids worried, but they know they can <mark>count on</mark> each  other. They  <mark>realize</mark>  that they need to <mark>take on</mark> these challenges and not let the problems <mark>get the better of</mark> them.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. come up：发生</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：But then troubles come up.（但是麻烦出现了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. stop doing something：停止做某事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The microphone stops working.（麦克风坏了。）        3. fall apart：散架，崩溃</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：A costume falls apart.（戏服散架了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. count on：指望，依靠</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：They know they can count on each other.（他们知道可以互</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>相依靠。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. take on：承担，应对</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：They realize that they need to take on these challenges.（他们</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>意识到需要应对这些挑战。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. get the better of：战胜，打败</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Not let the problems get the better of them.（不能让问题打败</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>他们。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第三段：解决问题</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>They quickly <mark>call on</mark> the teacher for help. Then, bravely <mark>taking on</mark> the problems, they <mark>set up</mark> a new plan <mark>in no time</mark>. As they go on preparing, they <mark>refer to</mark> past shows for inspiration. <mark>In the end</mark>, they <mark>put on</mark> an amazing show and <mark>live up to</mark> everyone's expectations.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. call on：请求，拜访            - 例句：They quickly call on the teacher for help.（他们急忙向老师</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>寻求帮助。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. set up：建立，制定</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：They set up a new plan in no time.（他们立刻制定出一个新</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>计划。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. in no time：立刻，马上</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：They set up a new plan in no time.（他们立刻制定出一个新</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>计划。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. go on doing something：继续做某事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：As they go on preparing, they refer to past shows for</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>inspiration.（在他们继续准备的时候，他们参考过去的表演以获取灵感。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. refer to：参考，提及</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：They refer to past shows for inspiration.（他们参考过去的表</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>演以获取灵感。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. put on：表演，上演</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：They put on an amazing show.（他们表演了一场精彩的表演。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. live up to：不辜负，达到</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：They live up to everyone's expectations.（他们达到了大家的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>期望。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>课后练习</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 造句练习：使用今天学到的固定搭配造句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- there be 句型：There is a school talent show coming up.（学校要举</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>办一场才艺表演。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>center on：The debate centered on economic issues.（辩论以经济问</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>题为中心。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>a variety of：The store offers a variety of products.（这家商店提供</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>各种各样的产品。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>look over：The doctor looked over the patient carefully.（医生仔细</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>检查了病人。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>get ready with：We are getting ready with great enthusiasm.（我们热</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>情满满地准备着。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>pay close attention to：Pay close attention to the teacher.（注意听老</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>师讲。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>come up：Problems always come up unexpectedly.（问题总是意外</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>出现。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>stop doing something：He stopped talking.（他停止说话。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>fall apart：The old book fell apart.（这本旧书散架了。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>count on：You can count on me for help.（你可以指望我帮忙。）            - take on：He took on a new project.（他承担了一个新项目。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>get the better of：I won't let fear get the better of me.（我不会让恐惧</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>战胜我。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>call on：I call on you to help.（我请求你帮忙。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>set up：They set up a new company.（他们成立了一家新公司。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>in no time：He finished the task in no time.（他立刻完成了任务。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>go on doing something：The party will go on.（聚会将继续。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>refer to：Please refer to the manual for more information.（请参考手</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>册获取更多信息。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>put on：They put on a great performance.（他们表演了一场精彩的</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>表演。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>live up to：She lived up to her reputation as a great artist.（她不辜负</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>她作为伟大艺术家的声誉。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>---</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_才艺秀风云_01", "moduleId": "p5_才艺秀风云"}, {"title": "英文原文", "section": "英文原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>There is a school talent show coming up, and the kids are all excited. The show centers on a variety of fun acts. The kids look over their plans carefully and get ready with great enthusiasm. They pay close attention to every tiny detail to make sure everything is perfect.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>But then troubles come up. The microphone stops working, and a costume falls apart. This makes the kids worried, but they know they can count on each  other. They  realize  that they need to take on these challenges and not let the problems get the better of them.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>They quickly call on the teacher for help. Then, bravely taking on the problems, they set up a new plan in no time. As they go on preparing, they refer to past shows for inspiration. In the end, they put on an amazing show and live up to everyone's expectations.</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_才艺秀风云_02", "moduleId": "p5_才艺秀风云"}, {"title": "搭配总结", "section": "搭配总结", "blocks": [{"type": "ol", "html": "<ol><li>there be 句型：表示有</li><li>center on：以……为中心</li><li>a variety of：各种各样的</li><li>look over：检查，查看</li><li>get ready with：准备好，伴随着</li><li>pay close attention to：密切关注</li><li>come up：发生</li><li>stop doing something：停止做某事</li><li>count on：指望，依靠</li><li>take on：承担，应对</li><li>get the better of：战胜，打败</li><li>call on：请求，拜访</li><li>set up：建立，制定</li><li>in no time：立刻，马上</li><li>go on doing something：继续做某事</li><li>refer to：参考，提及</li><li>put on：表演，上演</li><li>live up to：不辜负，达到</li></ol>"}], "id": "a_p5_才艺秀风云_03", "moduleId": "p5_才艺秀风云"}]}, {"id": "p5_砍价大作战", "code": "", "title": "砍价大作战", "articles": [{"title": "故事精讲", "section": "故事精讲", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>故事精讲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第一段：艾米的期待</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Amy was really <mark>looking forward to</mark> going to the supermarket. She <mark>took after</mark> her grandma, who was good at bargaining. When she got to the supermarket, she saw they had <mark>set up</mark> some tempting deals. Amy started paying attention to the prices.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. look forward to doing something：期待做某事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I look forward to seeing you.（我期待见到你。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. take after：与……相像</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：She takes after her mother.（她长得像她妈妈。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. be good at doing something：擅长做某事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：She is good at bargaining.（她擅长讨价还价。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. set up：设置</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：They set up some tempting deals.（他们设置了一些诱人的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>优惠活动。）        5. pay attention to：关注</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>例句：Amy started paying attention to the prices.（艾米开始留意这</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>些价格。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第二段：竞争与挫折</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She <mark>noticed</mark> another shopper who <mark>seemed to be</mark> on the same hunt. They started <mark>competing with</mark> each other. Just as Amy thought she had <mark>found</mark> an amazing deal, her shopping cart <mark>broke down</mark>. She was frustrated. \"<mark>Come on</mark>,\" she said to herself, \"this can't <mark>interfere with</mark> my hunt.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. notice：注意到</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：She noticed another shopper.（她注意到另一个购物者。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. seem to be：似乎是</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He seemed to be on the same hunt.（他似乎也在淘货。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. compete with：与……竞争</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：We need to compete with other companies.（我们需要与其他</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>公司竞争。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. break down：出故障，坏掉</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Her shopping cart broke down.（她的购物车坏了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. interfere with：干扰            - 例句：This can't interfere with my hunt.（这不能影响我的淘宝行</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>动。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第三段：警报与忘记</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p><mark>Suddenly</mark>, an alarm <mark>went off</mark> in the supermarket. Everyone was <mark>startled</mark>, but Amy didn't let it <mark>interfere with</mark> her mission. After a while, the alarm stopped, but then she <mark>realized</mark> she had left her wallet at home. She panicked.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. go off：响起来</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The alarm went off.（警报响了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. startled：惊恐的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Everyone was startled.（大家都很惊恐。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. realize：意识到</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：She realized she had left her wallet at home.（她意识到她把</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>钱包忘在家里了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. panic：惊慌</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：She panicked.（她惊慌了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第四段：解决问题</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Just when she was about to <mark>give up</mark>, a kind cashier offered to hold her items until she could go back and get her wallet. Amy rushed home and back. <mark>In the end</mark>, she got some great bargains and <mark>got off</mark> the checkout line with a big smile.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. be about to do something：即将做某事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I am about to go to school.（我即将去上学。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. give up：放弃</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Just when she was about to give up.（就在她即将放弃的时</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>候。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. offer to do something：提出做某事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：A kind cashier offered to hold her items.（一个善良的收银员</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>提出帮她保留物品。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. hold：保留</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Hold her items until she could go back and get her wallet.（帮</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>她保留物品，直到她能回去拿钱包。）        5. rush home：匆忙回家</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Amy rushed home and back.（艾米匆忙回家又匆匆返回。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. get off：离开</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：She got off the checkout line with a big smile.（她带着灿烂</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>的笑容离开了收银台。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>课后练习</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 造句练习：使用今天学到的固定搭配造句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- look forward to doing something：I look forward to seeing you.（我</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>期待见到你。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>take after：She takes after her mother.（她长得像她妈妈。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be good at doing something：She is good at bargaining.（她擅长讨价</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>还价。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>set up：They set up some tempting deals.（他们设置了一些诱人的</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>优惠活动。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>pay attention to：Amy started paying attention to the prices.（艾米开</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>始留意这些价格。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>notice：She noticed another shopper.（她注意到另一个购物者。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>seem to be：He seemed to be on the same hunt.（他似乎也在淘货。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>compete with：We need to compete with other companies.（我们需</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>要与其他公司竞争。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>break down：Her shopping cart broke down.（她的购物车坏了。）            - interfere with：This can't interfere with my hunt.（这不能影响我的</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>淘宝行动。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>go off：The alarm went off.（警报响了。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>startled：Everyone was startled.（大家都很惊恐。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>realize：She realized she had left her wallet at home.（她意识到她把</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>钱包忘在家里了。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>panic：She panicked.（她惊慌了。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be about to do something：I am about to go to school.（我即将去上</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>学。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>give up：Just when she was about to give up.（就在她即将放弃的时</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>候。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>offer to do something：A kind cashier offered to hold her items.（一</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>个善良的收银员提出帮她保留物品。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>hold：Hold her items until she could go back and get her wallet.（帮</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>她保留物品，直到她能回去拿钱包。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>rush home：Amy rushed home and back.（艾米匆忙回家又匆匆返</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>回。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>get off：She got off the checkout line with a big smile.（她带着灿烂</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>的笑容离开了收银台。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>---</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_砍价大作战_01", "moduleId": "p5_砍价大作战"}, {"title": "英文原文", "section": "英文原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>Amy was really looking forward to going to the supermarket. She took after her grandma, who was good at bargaining. When she got to the supermarket, she saw they had set up some tempting deals. Amy started paying attention to the prices.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She noticed another shopper who seemed to be on the same hunt. They started competing with each other. Just as Amy thought she had found an amazing deal, her shopping cart broke down. She was frustrated. \"Come on,\" she said to herself, \"this can't interfere with my hunt.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Suddenly, an alarm went off in the supermarket. Everyone was startled, but Amy didn't let it interfere with her mission. After a while, the alarm stopped, but then she realized she had left her wallet at home. She panicked.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Just when she was about to give up, a kind cashier offered to hold her items until she could go back and get her wallet. Amy rushed home and back. In the end, she got some great bargains and got off the checkout line with a big smile.</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_砍价大作战_02", "moduleId": "p5_砍价大作战"}, {"title": "搭配总结", "section": "搭配总结", "blocks": [{"type": "ol", "html": "<ol><li>look forward to doing something：期待做某事</li><li>take after：与……相像</li><li>be good at doing something：擅长做某事</li><li>set up：设置</li><li>notice：注意到</li><li>seem to be：似乎是</li><li>compete with：与……竞争</li><li>break down：出故障，坏掉</li><li>interfere with：干扰</li><li>go off：响起来</li><li>startled：惊恐的</li><li>realize：意识到</li><li>panic：惊慌</li><li>be about to do something：即将做某事</li><li>give up：放弃</li><li>offer to do something：提出做某事</li><li>hold：保留</li><li>get off：离开</li></ol>"}], "id": "a_p5_砍价大作战_03", "moduleId": "p5_砍价大作战"}]}, {"id": "p5_炫酷音乐节", "code": "", "title": "炫酷音乐节", "articles": [{"title": "故事精讲", "section": "故事精讲", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>故事精讲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第一段：听说音乐节</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>海绵宝宝最近听说有一个特别棒的音乐节要召开了，于是他去找派大星说：\"Hi, I <mark>heard of</mark> this amazing music festival. Wanna go?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. hear of：听说某事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Have you heard of this singer?（你听说过这个歌手吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. wanna：want to 的口语形式，表示“想”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I wanna go to the concert.（我想去音乐会。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第二段：讨论计划</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>派大星说：\"Music festival, sounds cool. But what should we expect?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>海绵宝宝回答：\"Let's <mark>go over</mark> what we know. We should <mark>think of</mark> a way to <mark>enjoy</mark> it without <mark>getting into trouble</mark>.\"   固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. go over：复习，检查</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Let's go over the lesson again.（让我们再复习一遍这节课。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. think of：想起，想出</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I can't think of his name.（我想不起他的名字。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. get into trouble：惹麻烦</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Don't get into trouble.（不要惹麻烦。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第三段：避免拥挤</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>海绵宝宝建议：\"Maybe we can <mark>keep away from</mark> crowded areas.\" 派大星同意：\"Good plan. We also need to <mark>look out for</mark> any unexpected situations.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. keep away from：远离</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Keep away from the fire.（远离火。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. look out for：留意，提防</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Look out for cars when you cross the street.（过马路时要留</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>意车辆。）   第四段：到达现场 原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>派大星说：\"When we <mark>arrive at</mark> the festival, I bet there will be a lot of great performances. Something amazing will surely <mark>come out</mark>.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. arrive at：到达（较小的地点）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：We arrived at the station.（我们到达了车站。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. come out：出现</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The sun came out.（太阳出来了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第五段：应对竞争</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>派大星问：\"What if there are other people <mark>competing for</mark> the best spots?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>海绵宝宝回答：\"We don't have to <mark>compete with</mark> them. We can just <mark>find</mark> a place <mark>based on</mark> our own comfort.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. compete for：竞争某物</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：They compete for the best spots.（他们竞争最好的位置。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. base on：以……为基础</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：We should base our decision on facts.（我们应该基于事实做</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>决定。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第六段：发现惊喜</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>海绵宝宝说：\"And if we <mark>go through</mark> the different stages carefully, we might <mark>discover</mark> some hidden gems.\" 派大星担心：\"But what if it gets too overwhelming and we want to <mark>break away from</mark> the crowd?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. go through：经历，仔细检查</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I went through a difficult time.（我经历了一段困难的时期。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. discover：发现</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：We might discover some hidden gems.（我们可能会发现一</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>些隐藏的宝藏。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. break away from：脱离</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He broke away from the bad habit.（他摆脱了那个坏习惯。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第七段：找到安静的地方</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>海绵宝宝建议：\"Then we can <mark>find</mark> a <mark>quieter spot</mark> and <mark>relax</mark>.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. quieter spot：更安静的地方</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Find a quieter spot to study.（找一个更安静的地方学习。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. relax：放松</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Relax after a long day.（在漫长的一天后放松。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>课后练习</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 造句练习：使用今天学到的固定搭配造句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- hear of: Have you heard of this movie?（你听说过这部电影吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>wanna：I wanna go to the park.（我想去公园。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>go over：Let's go over the plan again.（让我们再复习一遍计划。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>think of：I can't think of her name.（我想不起她的名字。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>get into trouble：Don't get into trouble.（不要惹麻烦。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>keep away from：Keep away from the noise.（远离噪音。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>look out for：Look out for pickpockets.（提防小偷。）            - arrive at：We arrived at the museum early.（我们早早到达了博物馆。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>come out：The flowers came out in spring.（春天花朵绽放。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>compete for：They compete for the prize.（他们竞争奖品。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>base on：We should base our actions on our values.（我们应该基于</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我们的价值观采取行动。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>go through：She went through a lot of difficulties.（她经历了很多困</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>难。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>discover：We discovered a new species.（我们发现了一个新物种。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>break away from：He broke away from the crowd.（他脱离了人群。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>quieter spot：Find a quieter spot to read.（找一个更安静的地方读书。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>relax：I relax by listening to music.（我通过听音乐放松。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>---</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_炫酷音乐节_01", "moduleId": "p5_炫酷音乐节"}, {"title": "英文原文", "section": "英文原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>海绵宝宝最近听说有一个特别棒的音乐节要召开了，于是他去找派大星说：\"Hi, I heard of this amazing music festival. Wanna go?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>派大星说：\"Music festival, sounds cool. But what should we expect?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>海绵宝宝回答：\"Let's go over what we know. We should think of a way to enjoy it without getting into trouble.\"   固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>海绵宝宝建议：\"Maybe we can keep away from crowded areas.\" 派大星同意：\"Good plan. We also need to look out for any unexpected situations.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>派大星说：\"When we arrive at the festival, I bet there will be a lot of great performances. Something amazing will surely come out.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>派大星问：\"What if there are other people competing for the best spots?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>海绵宝宝回答：\"We don't have to compete with them. We can just find a place based on our own comfort.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>海绵宝宝说：\"And if we go through the different stages carefully, we might discover some hidden gems.\" 派大星担心：\"But what if it gets too overwhelming and we want to break away from the crowd?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>海绵宝宝建议：\"Then we can find a quieter spot and relax.\"</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_炫酷音乐节_02", "moduleId": "p5_炫酷音乐节"}, {"title": "搭配总结", "section": "搭配总结", "blocks": [{"type": "ol", "html": "<ol><li>hear of：听说某事</li><li>wanna：want to 的口语形式，表示“想”</li><li>go over：复习，检查</li><li>think of：想起，想出</li><li>get into trouble：惹麻烦</li><li>keep away from：远离</li><li>look out for：留意，提防</li><li>arrive at：到达（较小的地点）</li><li>come out：出现</li><li>compete for：竞争某物</li><li>base on：以……为基础</li><li>go through：经历，仔细检查</li><li>discover：发现</li><li>break away from：脱离</li><li>quieter spot：更安静的地方</li><li>relax：放松</li></ol>"}], "id": "a_p5_炫酷音乐节_03", "moduleId": "p5_炫酷音乐节"}]}, {"id": "p5_摇滚还是流行", "code": "", "title": "摇滚还是流行", "articles": [{"title": "故事精讲", "section": "故事精讲", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>故事精讲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第一段：崇拜歌手</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小白说：\"Hey, I heard you were <mark>looking up to</mark> that famous singer. Why?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>静静回答：\"Yeah, I really <mark>admire</mark> her. She <mark>brings</mark> out the best in her music, and I always look <mark>up</mark> her songs online.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. look up to：尊敬，敬仰</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I look up to my teacher.（我尊敬我的老师。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. admire：崇拜，敬慕</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I admire her talent.（我崇拜她的才华。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. bring out：展现，显现</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：She brings out the best in her music.（她在音乐中展现了最</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>好的一面。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. look up：查找</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I look up words in the dictionary.（我在字典中查找单词。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第二段：歌手的困难</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小白说：\"But I heard she <mark>suffered from</mark> some difficulties in the past.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>静静回答：\"That makes me <mark>respect</mark> her even more. She <mark>went through</mark> a lot, but still succeeded.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. suffer from：遭受</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He suffers from a headache.（他头疼。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. go through：经历</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：She went through a lot of difficulties.（她经历了很多困难。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. respect：尊敬，敬重</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I respect her for her achievements.（我尊敬她的成就。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第三段：音乐偏好</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小白说：\"Well, I <mark>prefer</mark> <mark>listening to</mark> different kinds of music. I don't really <mark>look up to</mark> just one singer.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>静静问：\"I see. What kind of music do you <mark>prefer</mark>, rock or pop?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小白回答：\"I <mark>prefer</mark> rock to pop. It's more <mark>energetic</mark>.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>固定搭配：        1. <mark>prefer</mark>：更喜欢</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I prefer tea to coffee.（我更喜欢茶而不是咖啡。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. look up to：崇拜</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I don't look up to just one singer.（我不会只崇拜一个歌手。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. energetic：有活力的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Rock music is more energetic.（摇滚音乐更有活力。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第四段：一起听音乐</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>静静说：\"Hmm, I might <mark>join with</mark> you in <mark>listening to</mark> some rock music sometime.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小白回答：\"That'd be great.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. join with：与……一起</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I might join with you in listening to some rock music.（我可</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>能会和你一起听一些摇滚音乐。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. sometime：将来的某个时间</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：We can go for a walk sometime.（我们某个时候可以去散步。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第五段：火灾事件</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小白说：\"By the way, <mark>have you heard about</mark> the fire that was <mark>put out</mark>       yesterday?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>静静问：\"No, what happened?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小白回答：\"There was a small fire in the neighborhood. The firefighters quickly put it out.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. hear about：听说</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Have you heard about the fire?（你听说火灾了吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. put out：扑灭</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The firefighters put out the fire.（消防员扑灭了火灾。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第六段：旅行计划</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>静静问：\"That's good. And when are you planning to <mark>set off</mark> on your next trip?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小白回答：\"I'm not sure yet, but I'm <mark>thinking of</mark> <mark>taking off</mark> soon, maybe next week.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. set off：出发            - 例句：They set off on a journey.（他们出发去旅行。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. take off：起飞，出发</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The plane took off smoothly.（飞机平稳起飞。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. not yet：还没有</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I'm not sure yet.（我还不确定。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>课后练习</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 造句练习：使用今天学到的固定搭配造句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- look up to：I look up to my teacher.（我尊敬我的老师。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>admire：I admire her talent.（我崇拜她的才华。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>bring out：She brings out the best in her music.（她在音乐中展现了</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>最好的一面。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>look up：I look up words in the dictionary.（我在字典中查找单词。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>suffer from：He suffers from a headache.（他头疼。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>go through：She went through a lot of difficulties.（她经历了很多困</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>难。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>respect：I respect her for her achievements.（我尊敬她的成就。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>prefer：I prefer tea to coffee.（我更喜欢茶而不是咖啡。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>energetic：Rock music is more energetic.（摇滚音乐更有活力。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>join with：I might join with you in listening to some rock music.（我</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>可能会和你一起听一些摇滚音乐。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>sometime：We can go for a walk sometime.（我们某个时候可以去   散步。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>hear about：Have you heard about the fire?（你听说火灾了吗？）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>put out：The firefighters put out the fire.（消防员扑灭了火灾。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>set off：They set off on a journey.（他们出发去旅行。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>take off：The plane took off smoothly.（飞机平稳起飞。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>not yet：I'm not sure yet.（我还不确定。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>---</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_摇滚还是流行_01", "moduleId": "p5_摇滚还是流行"}, {"title": "英文原文", "section": "英文原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>小白说：\"Hey, I heard you were looking up to that famous singer. Why?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>静静回答：\"Yeah, I really admire her. She brings out the best in her music, and I always look up her songs online.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小白说：\"But I heard she suffered from some difficulties in the past.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>静静回答：\"That makes me respect her even more. She went through a lot, but still succeeded.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小白说：\"Well, I prefer listening to different kinds of music. I don't really look up to just one singer.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>静静问：\"I see. What kind of music do you prefer, rock or pop?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小白回答：\"I prefer rock to pop. It's more energetic.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>固定搭配：        1. prefer：更喜欢</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>静静说：\"Hmm, I might join with you in listening to some rock music sometime.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小白回答：\"That'd be great.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小白说：\"By the way, have you heard about the fire that was put out       yesterday?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>静静问：\"No, what happened?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小白回答：\"There was a small fire in the neighborhood. The firefighters quickly put it out.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>静静问：\"That's good. And when are you planning to set off on your next trip?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小白回答：\"I'm not sure yet, but I'm thinking of taking off soon, maybe next week.\"</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_摇滚还是流行_02", "moduleId": "p5_摇滚还是流行"}, {"title": "搭配总结", "section": "搭配总结", "blocks": [{"type": "ol", "html": "<ol><li>look up to：尊敬，敬仰</li><li>admire：崇拜，敬慕</li><li>bring out：展现，显现</li><li>look up：查找</li><li>suffer from：遭受</li><li>go through：经历</li><li>respect：尊敬，敬重</li><li>look up to：崇拜</li><li>energetic：有活力的</li><li>join with：与……一起</li><li>sometime：将来的某个时间</li><li>hear about：听说</li><li>put out：扑灭</li><li>set off：出发</li><li>take off：起飞，出发</li><li>not yet：还没有</li></ol>"}], "id": "a_p5_摇滚还是流行_03", "moduleId": "p5_摇滚还是流行"}]}, {"id": "p5_迷你花园计划", "code": "", "title": "迷你花园计划", "articles": [{"title": "故事精讲", "section": "故事精讲", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>故事精讲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第一段：感到困惑</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>大头儿子说：\"Hey, what's new?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小头爸爸回答：\"Nothing much, just feeling a bit <mark>stuck</mark>.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. what's new：有什么新鲜事儿吗？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：What's new?（有什么新鲜事儿吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. a bit：有点儿</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I'm a bit tired.（我有点儿累。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. stuck：被困住，难以继续</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I'm stuck.（我卡住了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第二段：建议新项目</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小头爸爸说：\"Well, why don't you start something new? You could <mark>begin with</mark> a small project.\"    大头儿子问：\"Like what?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小头爸爸回答：\"<mark>For instance</mark>, start a mini garden. That could <mark>bring about</mark> some freshness.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. why don't you do something：为什么不做某事呢？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Why don't you try a new hobby?（为什么不去尝试一个新的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>爱好呢？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. begin with：以……开始</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The class begins with a warm-up exercise.（课程以热身运动</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>开始。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. bring about：引起，带来</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The new policy brought about positive results.（新政策带来</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>了积极的结果。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. for instance：例如</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：For instance, you could start with a mini garden.（例如，你</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>可以从一个小花园开始。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第三段：学习园艺</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>大头儿子说：\"Hmm, <mark>sounds interesting</mark>, but I don't know much about gardening.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小头爸爸回答：\"You can <mark>learn as you go</mark>. Just keep on trying.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. sound interesting：听起来有趣</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：That sounds interesting.（那听起来很有趣。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. learn as you go：边干边学</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：You can learn as you go.（你可以边干边学。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. keep on doing something：持续做某事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Keep on trying.（持续尝试。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第四段：邀请邻居</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>大头儿子说：\"Maybe I can ask my neighbors to <mark>join in</mark>.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小头爸爸回答：\"That's a great idea. More people can <mark>share the fun</mark>.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. ask someone to do something：让某人做某事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I asked my friend to help me.（我让我的朋友帮我。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. join in：加入</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Join in the game.（加入游戏。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. share the fun：分享乐趣            - 例句：More people can share the fun.（更多的人可以分享乐趣。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第五段：期待邻居参与</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>大头儿子说：\"I <mark>haven't heard from</mark> some of my neighbors in a while.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Hope they'll come in.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小头爸爸回答：\"What if you <mark>run into</mark> problems? You can <mark>bring</mark> them <mark>up</mark>, and we can <mark>find solutions together</mark>.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. haven't heard from：没有收到……的消息</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I haven't heard from him for a long time.（我很久没有收到他</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>的消息了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. run into：偶然遇到</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：What if you run into problems?（如果你遇到问题怎么办？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. bring something up：提出</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：You can bring them up.（你可以把这些问题提出来。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. find solutions together：一起寻找解决方案</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：We can find solutions together.（我们可以一起寻找解决方</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>案。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第六段：警惕害虫</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小头爸爸说：\"And don't forget to <mark>fight against</mark> the pests that might <mark>show up</mark>.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>大头儿子回答：\"Right, <mark>gotta be</mark> vigilant. Maybe this will <mark>take off</mark> and become a great community project.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. fight against：与……作斗争</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：We should fight against pollution.（我们应该与污染作斗争。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. show up：出现</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The pests might show up.（害虫可能会出现。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. gotta be：得……</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Gotta be vigilant.（得警惕。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. take off：突然成功</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Maybe this will take off.（也许这会突然成功。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>课后练习</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 造句练习：使用今天学到的固定搭配造句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- what's new：What's new?（有什么新鲜事儿吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>a bit：I'm a bit hungry.（我有点儿饿。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>stuck：I'm stuck.（我卡住了。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>why don't you do something：Why don't you try a new hobby?（为什</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>么不去尝试一个新的爱好呢？）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>begin with：The class begins with a warm-up exercise.（课程以热身</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>运动开始。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>bring about：The new policy brought about positive results.（新政策</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>带来了积极的结果。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>for instance：For instance, you could start with a mini garden.（例如，</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>你可以从一个小花园开始。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>sound interesting：That sounds interesting.（那听起来很有趣。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>learn as you go：You can learn as you go.（你可以边干边学。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>keep on doing something：Keep on trying.（持续尝试。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>ask someone to do something：I asked my friend to help me.（我让我</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>的朋友帮我。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>join in：Join in the game.（加入游戏。）            - share the fun：More people can share the fun.（更多的人可以分享乐</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>趣。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>haven't heard from：I haven't heard from him for a long time.（我很</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>久没有收到他的消息了。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>run into: What if you run into problems?（如果你遇到问题怎么办？）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>bring something up：You can bring them up.（你可以把这些问题提</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>出来。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>find solutions together：We can find solutions together.（我们可以一</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>起寻找解决方案。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>fight against：We should fight against pollution.（我们应该与污染</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>作斗争。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>show up：The pests might show up.（害虫可能会出现。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>gotta be：Gotta be vigilant.（得警惕。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>take off：Maybe this will take off.（也许这会突然成功。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>---</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_迷你花园计划_01", "moduleId": "p5_迷你花园计划"}, {"title": "英文原文", "section": "英文原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>大头儿子说：\"Hey, what's new?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小头爸爸回答：\"Nothing much, just feeling a bit stuck.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小头爸爸说：\"Well, why don't you start something new? You could begin with a small project.\"    大头儿子问：\"Like what?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小头爸爸回答：\"For instance, start a mini garden. That could bring about some freshness.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>大头儿子说：\"Hmm, sounds interesting, but I don't know much about gardening.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小头爸爸回答：\"You can learn as you go. Just keep on trying.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>大头儿子说：\"Maybe I can ask my neighbors to join in.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小头爸爸回答：\"That's a great idea. More people can share the fun.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>大头儿子说：\"I haven't heard from some of my neighbors in a while.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Hope they'll come in.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小头爸爸回答：\"What if you run into problems? You can bring them up, and we can find solutions together.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小头爸爸说：\"And don't forget to fight against the pests that might show up.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>大头儿子回答：\"Right, gotta be vigilant. Maybe this will take off and become a great community project.\"</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_迷你花园计划_02", "moduleId": "p5_迷你花园计划"}, {"title": "搭配总结", "section": "搭配总结", "blocks": [{"type": "ol", "html": "<ol><li>what's new：有什么新鲜事儿吗？</li><li>a bit：有点儿</li><li>stuck：被困住，难以继续</li><li>why don't you do something：为什么不做某事呢？</li><li>begin with：以……开始</li><li>bring about：引起，带来</li><li>for instance：例如</li><li>sound interesting：听起来有趣</li><li>learn as you go：边干边学</li><li>keep on doing something：持续做某事</li><li>ask someone to do something：让某人做某事</li><li>join in：加入</li><li>share the fun：分享乐趣</li><li>haven't heard from：没有收到……的消息</li><li>run into：偶然遇到</li><li>bring something up：提出</li><li>find solutions together：一起寻找解决方案</li><li>fight against：与……作斗争</li><li>show up：出现</li><li>gotta be：得……</li><li>take off：突然成功</li></ol>"}], "id": "a_p5_迷你花园计划_03", "moduleId": "p5_迷你花园计划"}]}, {"id": "p5_宠物时装秀", "code": "", "title": "宠物时装秀", "articles": [{"title": "故事精讲", "section": "故事精讲", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>故事精讲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第一段：邀请参加宠物时装秀</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小美说：\"Hey, there's a pet fashion show <mark>coming up</mark>. <mark>Wanna join</mark>?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>安安回答：\"Pet fashion show? Sounds fun, but I have so much to do. I might <mark>put off</mark> deciding for now.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. come up：即将发生</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：There's a pet fashion show coming up.（有一个宠物时装秀</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>即将举办。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. wanna join：想参加吗？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Do you wanna join?（你想参加吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. put off：推迟</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I might put off deciding for now.（我可能先不决定参加，往</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>后推推吧。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第二段：劝说参加</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小美说：\"<mark>Come on</mark>, your pet will look so cute all <mark>dressed up</mark>. And <mark>think about</mark> how it could <mark>contribute to</mark> a great day.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>安安回答：\"Well, maybe let me think.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. come on：快点儿，来嘛</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Come on, let's go.（快点儿，我们走吧。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. dress up：打扮</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：You don't need to dress up for dinner.（你不必为了晚宴盛装</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>打扮。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. contribute to：有助于</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Exercise contributes to good health.（运动有助于健康。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第三段：担心和犹豫</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>安安说：\"I hope I don't get too nervous. What if our pets don't cooperate? That could <mark>bring down</mark> our chances.\"     小美回答：\"Don't worry, we'll <mark>figure</mark> it <mark>out</mark>. And we can <mark>compare</mark> our pets' look <mark>with</mark> the others.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. get nervous：变得紧张</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I hope I don't get too nervous.（我希望我不会太紧张。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. what if：要是……怎么办？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：What if our pets don't cooperate?（要是我们的宠物不配合怎</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>么办？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. bring down：降低</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：That could bring down our chances.（那会降低我们的机会。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. figure it out：解决，想出办法</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Don't worry, we'll figure it out.（别担心，我们能解决的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. compare something with something：把……与……比较</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：We can compare our pets' look with the others.（我们可以把</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我们的宠物的造型和别的宠物的造型比一比。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第四段：决定参加</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>安安说：\"Okay, I <mark>agree to</mark> <mark>think about</mark> it more seriously.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小美回答：\"Great, let's <mark>get on with</mark> planning what our pets will wear.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>安安回答：\"Sure, this could be a really fun event.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. agree to：同意</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I agree to think about it more seriously.（我同意仔细考虑一</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>下。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. get on with：开始做某事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Let's get on with planning what our pets will wear.（让我们开</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>始计划我们的宠物应该穿什么吧。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>课后练习</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 造句练习：使用今天学到的固定搭配造句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- come up：There's a meeting coming up.（有一个会议即将举办。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>wanna join: Do you wanna join the club?（你想加入这个俱乐部吗？）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>put off：I might put off going to the gym for now.（我可能先不去健</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>身房，往后推推吧。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>come on：Come on, we don't have much time.（快点儿，我们没有</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>多少时间了。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>dress up：She likes to dress up for special occasions.（她喜欢在特殊</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>场合盛装打扮。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>contribute to：Reading contributes to knowledge.（阅读有助于知识</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>积累。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>get nervous：I get nervous before exams.（我在考试前会变得紧张。）            - what if：What if it rains tomorrow?（要是明天下雨怎么办？）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>bring down：We need to bring down the cost.（我们需要降低成本。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>figure it out：We can figure it out together.（我们可以一起解决。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>compare something with something：Compare your answer with mine.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（把你的答案和我的比较一下。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>agree to：He agreed to help me.（他同意帮助我。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>get on with：Let's get on with the task.（让我们开始做这项任务吧。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>---</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_宠物时装秀_01", "moduleId": "p5_宠物时装秀"}, {"title": "英文原文", "section": "英文原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>小美说：\"Hey, there's a pet fashion show coming up. Wanna join?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>安安回答：\"Pet fashion show? Sounds fun, but I have so much to do. I might put off deciding for now.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小美说：\"Come on, your pet will look so cute all dressed up. And think about how it could contribute to a great day.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>安安回答：\"Well, maybe let me think.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>安安说：\"I hope I don't get too nervous. What if our pets don't cooperate? That could bring down our chances.\"     小美回答：\"Don't worry, we'll figure it out. And we can compare our pets' look with the others.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>安安说：\"Okay, I agree to think about it more seriously.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小美回答：\"Great, let's get on with planning what our pets will wear.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>安安回答：\"Sure, this could be a really fun event.\"</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_宠物时装秀_02", "moduleId": "p5_宠物时装秀"}, {"title": "搭配总结", "section": "搭配总结", "blocks": [{"type": "ol", "html": "<ol><li>come up：即将发生</li><li>wanna join：想参加吗？</li><li>put off：推迟</li><li>come on：快点儿，来嘛</li><li>dress up：打扮</li><li>contribute to：有助于</li><li>get nervous：变得紧张</li><li>what if：要是……怎么办？</li><li>bring down：降低</li><li>figure it out：解决，想出办法</li><li>compare something with something：把……与……比较</li><li>agree to：同意</li><li>get on with：开始做某事</li></ol>"}], "id": "a_p5_宠物时装秀_03", "moduleId": "p5_宠物时装秀"}]}, {"id": "p5_发现新魔法", "code": "", "title": "发现新魔法", "articles": [{"title": "故事精讲", "section": "故事精讲", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>故事精讲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第一段：发现新咒语</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>哈利波特说：\"Hermione, I was <mark>looking through</mark> the old books and <mark>found</mark> a strange spell.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. look through：浏览，温习</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I was looking through the old books.（我正在翻看那些旧书。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. find：发现</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I found a strange spell.（我发现了一个奇怪的咒语。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第二段：决定研究咒语</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>赫敏说：\"Oh, let's <mark>take a look</mark>. We can't <mark>fall behind</mark> in learning new magic.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>They <mark>put on</mark> their robes and <mark>start studying</mark> the spell.\"   固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. take a look：看一看</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Let's take a look.（让我们看一看。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. fall behind：落后</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：We can't fall behind in learning new magic.（我们不能在学</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>习新魔法上落后。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. put on：穿上</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：They put on their robes.（他们穿上了长袍。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. start studying：开始研究</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：They start studying the spell.（他们开始研究这个咒语。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第三段：讨论使用材料</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>赫敏说：\"The shop owner <mark>provided</mark> the shop <mark>with</mark> some <mark>rare</mark> ingredients.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Maybe we can <mark>use</mark> them <mark>with</mark> this spell.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. provide something with something：提供某物</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The shop owner provided the shop with some rare ingredients.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（店主为商店提供了一些稀有材料。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. use something with something：与某物一起使用</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Maybe we can use them with this spell.（也许我们可以把这   些材料和这个咒语一起使用。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第四段：担心风险</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>哈利波特说：\"That could be <mark>risky</mark>. We don't want any <mark>mishaps</mark> to <mark>break out</mark>.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. risky：有风险的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：That could be risky.（那可能有风险。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. mishap：不幸的事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：We don't want any mishaps to break out.（我们不希望发生任</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>何不幸的事。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. break out：爆发</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：A fire broke out.（火灾爆发了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第五段：解决分歧</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>赫敏说：\"I think we should do it this way.\" 哈利波特说：\"No, I think my plan is better.\" 赫敏说：\"Let's <mark>set aside</mark> our differences and <mark>work together</mark>.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. set aside：搁置</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Let's set aside our differences.（让我们搁置分歧。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. work together：一起工作</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Let's work together.（让我们一起工作。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第六段：达成一致</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>哈利波特说：\"Agreed, we need to <mark>figure</mark> this <mark>out</mark>.\" 赫敏说：\"See, our efforts <mark>resulted in</mark> <mark>mastering</mark> the spell.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. figure something out：弄明白</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：We need to figure this out.（我们需要弄明白这件事。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. result in：导致</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Our efforts resulted in mastering the spell.（我们的努力让我</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>们掌握了这个咒语。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第七段：分享新魔法</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>哈利波特说：\"Yeah, and when others <mark>arrive in</mark> the shop, we can show them what we've learned.\" 赫敏说：\"They both smile and <mark>agree on</mark> sharing their newfound magic with everyone.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. arrive in：到达</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：When others arrive in the shop, we can show them what we've</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>learned.（当其他人到达商店时，我们可以展示我们学到的东西。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. agree on doing something：同意做某事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：They both smile and agree on sharing their newfound magic</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>with everyone.（他们都笑了，同意与大家分享他们新发现的魔法。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>课后练习</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 造句练习：使用今天学到的固定搭配造句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- look through：I looked through my notes before the exam.（我在考</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>试前温习了我的笔记。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>find：I found a strange spell in the old book.（我在旧书中发现了一</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>个奇怪的咒语。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>take a look：Let's take a look at the new spell.（让我们看一看这个</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>新咒语。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>fall behind：We can't fall behind in our studies.（我们不能在学习上</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>落后。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>put on：They put on their robes for the ceremony.（他们为仪式穿上</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>了长袍。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>start studying：They start studying the new spell.（他们开始研究这</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>个新咒语。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>provide something with something：The shop owner provided the</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>shop with rare ingredients.（店主为商店提供了稀有材料。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>use something with something：We can use these ingredients with the</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>spell.（我们可以把这些材料和这个咒语一起使用。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>risky：That plan could be risky.（那个计划可能有风险。）            - mishap：We don't want any mishaps during the experiment.（我们不</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>希望实验中发生任何不幸的事。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>break out：A fire broke out in the building.（大楼里发生了火灾。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>set aside：Let's set aside our differences and work together.（让我们</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>搁置分歧，一起工作。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>work together：We need to work together to solve this problem.（我</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>们需要一起解决这个问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>figure something out：We need to figure out how to use this spell.（我</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>们需要弄明白如何使用这个咒语。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>result in：Hard work results in success.（努力工作会带来成功。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>arrive in：When they arrive in the shop, we can show them the new</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>spell.（当他们到达商店时，我们可以展示这个新咒语。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>agree on doing something：They agreed on sharing the new spell with</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>everyone.（他们同意与大家分享这个新咒语。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>---</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_发现新魔法_01", "moduleId": "p5_发现新魔法"}, {"title": "英文原文", "section": "英文原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>哈利波特说：\"Hermione, I was looking through the old books and found a strange spell.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>赫敏说：\"Oh, let's take a look. We can't fall behind in learning new magic.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>They put on their robes and start studying the spell.\"   固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>赫敏说：\"The shop owner provided the shop with some rare ingredients.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Maybe we can use them with this spell.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>哈利波特说：\"That could be risky. We don't want any mishaps to break out.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>赫敏说：\"I think we should do it this way.\" 哈利波特说：\"No, I think my plan is better.\" 赫敏说：\"Let's set aside our differences and work together.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>哈利波特说：\"Agreed, we need to figure this out.\" 赫敏说：\"See, our efforts resulted in mastering the spell.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>哈利波特说：\"Yeah, and when others arrive in the shop, we can show them what we've learned.\" 赫敏说：\"They both smile and agree on sharing their newfound magic with everyone.\"</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_发现新魔法_02", "moduleId": "p5_发现新魔法"}, {"title": "搭配总结", "section": "搭配总结", "blocks": [{"type": "ol", "html": "<ol><li>look through：浏览，温习</li><li>find：发现</li><li>take a look：看一看</li><li>fall behind：落后</li><li>put on：穿上</li><li>start studying：开始研究</li><li>provide something with something：提供某物</li><li>use something with something：与某物一起使用</li><li>risky：有风险的</li><li>mishap：不幸的事</li><li>break out：爆发</li><li>set aside：搁置</li><li>work together：一起工作</li><li>figure something out：弄明白</li><li>result in：导致</li><li>arrive in：到达</li><li>agree on doing something：同意做某事</li></ol>"}], "id": "a_p5_发现新魔法_03", "moduleId": "p5_发现新魔法"}]}, {"id": "p5_古董店", "code": "", "title": "古董店", "articles": [{"title": "故事精讲", "section": "故事精讲", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>故事精讲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第一段：发现古董店</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>叔叔说：\"Hey, guess what? I <mark>found</mark> a really cool antique shop.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>婶婶说：\"Oh, what's so special about it? I don't usually <mark>dwell on</mark> old stuff.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. guess what：猜猜</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Guess what? I found a really cool antique shop.（猜猜？我发</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>现了一个非常酷的古董店。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. dwell on：细想，纠结</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I don't usually dwell on old stuff.（我通常不纠结于旧东西。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第二段：古董店的陈列</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>叔叔说：\"You should see it. They've <mark>put up</mark> all these beautiful displays.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>There are <mark>ancient</mark> clocks, <mark>rare</mark> books, and <mark>unique</mark> jewelry.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. put up：张贴，布置</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：They've put up all these beautiful displays.（他们布置了所有</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>这些美丽的陈列。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. ancient：古代的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：There are ancient clocks.（有古代的时钟。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. rare：稀有的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：There are rare books.（有稀有的书籍。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. unique：独一无二的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：There is unique jewelry.（有独一无二的珠宝。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第三段：偏好现代物品</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>婶婶说：\"<mark>Sounds interesting</mark>, but I still <mark>prefer</mark> modern things. I don't think I'd <mark>get along with</mark> all that old-fashioned stuff.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. prefer：更喜欢</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I still prefer modern things.（我仍然更喜欢现代的东西。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. get along with：与……相处</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I don't think I'd get along with all that old-fashioned stuff.（我   不认为我会喜欢那些老式的东西。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第四段：邀请参观</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>叔叔说：\"<mark>Come on</mark>, you can at least <mark>take a look</mark>. It's like stepping back in time. You can <mark>separate</mark> yourself <mark>from</mark> the <mark>hustle and bustle</mark> of modern life.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. take a look：看一看</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：You can at least take a look.（你至少可以看一看。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. step back in time：回到过去</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：It's like stepping back in time.（就像回到过去一样。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. separate something from something：把……与……分开</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：You can separate yourself from the hustle and bustle of</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>modern life.（你可以把自己从现代生活的喧嚣中分开。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. hustle and bustle：喧嚣，忙忙碌碌</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I don't like the hustle and bustle of the city.（我不喜欢城市的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>喧嚣。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第五段：担心价格</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>婶婶说：\"Well, maybe. But I'm <mark>worried about</mark> the prices. What if they're       too high?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>叔叔说：\"You never know until you <mark>check it out</mark>. And <mark>think about</mark> it, these items are <mark>one of a kind</mark>. You can't <mark>compare</mark> them <mark>to</mark> mass-produced stuff.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. worried about：担心</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I'm worried about the prices.（我担心价格。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. check it out：查看</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：You never know until you check it out.（你不亲自去瞧瞧，</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>永远都不会知道。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. one of a kind：独一份儿的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：These items are one of a kind.（这些物品都是独一份儿的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. compare something to something：把……与……相比</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：You can't compare them to mass-produced stuff.（你不能把</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>它们和批量生产的东西相比。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>课后练习</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 造句练习：使用今天学到的固定搭配造句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- guess what：Guess what? I got a new job.（猜猜？我得到了一份新</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>工作。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>dwell on：Don't dwell on past mistakes.（不要纠结于过去的错误。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>put up：They put up a tent in the camping site.（他们在露营地搭建</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>了一个帐篷。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>ancient：The ancient castle is very beautiful.（这座古老的城堡非常</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>美丽。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>rare：There are rare plants in the forest.（森林里有稀有的植物。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>unique：This painting is unique.（这幅画是独一无二的。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>prefer：I prefer tea to coffee.（我更喜欢茶而不是咖啡。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>get along with：I get along well with my classmates.（我和我的同学</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>相处得很好。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>take a look：You should take a look at this book.（你应该看看这本</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>书。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>step back in time：Reading old letters is like stepping back in time.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（读旧信就像回到过去一样。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>separate something from something：Separate the good apples from        the bad ones.（把好苹果和坏苹果分开。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>hustle and bustle：I don't like the hustle and bustle of the city.（我不</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>喜欢城市的喧嚣。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>worried about：I'm worried about the exam.（我担心考试。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>check it out：You should check it out before you buy it.（你应该在购</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>买之前查看一下。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>one of a kind：This antique is one of a kind.（这个古董是独一份儿</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>的。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>compare something to something：You can't compare this handmade</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>craft to mass-produced items.（你不能把这件手工制品和批量生产的产品相比。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>---</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_古董店_01", "moduleId": "p5_古董店"}, {"title": "英文原文", "section": "英文原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>叔叔说：\"Hey, guess what? I found a really cool antique shop.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>婶婶说：\"Oh, what's so special about it? I don't usually dwell on old stuff.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>叔叔说：\"You should see it. They've put up all these beautiful displays.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>There are ancient clocks, rare books, and unique jewelry.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>婶婶说：\"Sounds interesting, but I still prefer modern things. I don't think I'd get along with all that old-fashioned stuff.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>叔叔说：\"Come on, you can at least take a look. It's like stepping back in time. You can separate yourself from the hustle and bustle of modern life.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>婶婶说：\"Well, maybe. But I'm worried about the prices. What if they're       too high?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>叔叔说：\"You never know until you check it out. And think about it, these items are one of a kind. You can't compare them to mass-produced stuff.\"</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_古董店_02", "moduleId": "p5_古董店"}, {"title": "搭配总结", "section": "搭配总结", "blocks": [{"type": "ol", "html": "<ol><li>guess what：猜猜</li><li>dwell on：细想，纠结</li><li>put up：张贴，布置</li><li>ancient：古代的</li><li>rare：稀有的</li><li>unique：独一无二的</li><li>prefer：更喜欢</li><li>get along with：与……相处</li><li>take a look：看一看</li><li>step back in time：回到过去</li><li>separate something from something：把……与……分开</li><li>hustle and bustle：喧嚣，忙忙碌碌</li><li>worried about：担心</li><li>check it out：查看</li><li>one of a kind：独一份儿的</li><li>compare something to something：把……与……相比</li></ol>"}], "id": "a_p5_古董店_03", "moduleId": "p5_古董店"}]}, {"id": "p5_航海梦", "code": "", "title": "航海梦", "articles": [{"title": "故事精讲", "section": "故事精讲", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>故事精讲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第一段：对航海的兴趣</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p><mark>Once upon a time</mark> in a small seaside town, there was a boy named Sam.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Sam was always interested in sailing. He would spend hours <mark>by the shore</mark>, <mark>watching the boats go by</mark> and imagining himself on the open sea.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. once upon a time：从前</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Once upon a time, there was a small village.（从前有一个小</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>村庄。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. be interested in：对……感兴趣</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I am interested in music.（我对音乐感兴趣。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. spend time doing something：花时间做某事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He spends hours reading books.（他花几个小时读书。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. by the shore：在岸边</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：We sat by the shore.（我们坐在岸边。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. watching the boats go by：看着船只经过            - 例句：They watched the boats go by.（他们看着船只经过。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. imagine oneself doing something：想象自己做某事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I imagine myself traveling around the world.（我想象自己环</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>游世界。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第二段：对深水的恐惧</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>But Sam was also afraid of the deep water. He thought he might <mark>be bad at</mark> sailing and <mark>get lost</mark> or <mark>encounter</mark> a storm.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. be afraid of：害怕</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I am afraid of heights.（我害怕高处。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. be bad at：不擅长</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I am bad at math.（我不擅长数学。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. get lost：迷路</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I am afraid I will get lost.（我担心我会迷路。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. encounter：遇到，遭遇</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I encountered a problem.（我遇到了一个问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第三段：老水手的故事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>One day, he met an old sailor who was known for his adventures. The sailor told him stories of <mark>faraway lands</mark> and <mark>exciting voyages</mark>.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. be known for：因……而闻名</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：China is known for its tea.（中国因茶而闻名。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. tell stories of：讲述……的故事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He told stories of his childhood.（他讲述了他的童年故事。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. faraway lands：遥远的国度</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He traveled to faraway lands.（他旅行到遥远的国度。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. exciting voyages：激动人心的航海之旅</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He went on exciting voyages.（他进行了激动人心的航海之</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>旅。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第四段：朋友的鼓励</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Sam was fascinated. His friend Jake was good at building model ships.       Jake encouraged Sam to take a sailing lesson.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. be fascinated：入迷，着迷</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I was fascinated by the movie.（我被这部电影迷住了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. be good at：擅长</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He is good at building model ships.（他擅长制作船舶模型。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. encourage somebody to do something：鼓励某人做某事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：My mom encourages me to read books.（我的妈妈鼓励我读</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>书。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第五段：尝试航海课程</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Sam was hesitant at first, but then decided to <mark>give it a try</mark>.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. be hesitant：犹豫</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I was hesitant to try it.（我犹豫是否要尝试。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. give it a try：尝试一下</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：You should give it a try.（你应该尝试一下。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第六段：进步与自豪</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>As Sam started the lessons, he <mark>realized</mark> he wasn't as bad at sailing as he thought. He began to <mark>be proud of</mark> himself. Soon he was <mark>getting better and better</mark>. His new skills were so different from his old self who was afraid.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. as：当……的时候</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：As he started the lessons, he realized he wasn't as bad at sailing</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>as he thought.（当他开始上课时，他意识到他并不像自己想的那样不擅长航海。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. be proud of：为……感到骄傲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I am proud of my country.（我为我的国家感到骄傲。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. get better and better：变得越来越好</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He is getting better and better.（他变得越来越好。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. be different from：与……不同</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：His new skills were so different from his old self.（他的新技</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>能与他曾经的自己截然不同。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第七段：接近梦想</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p><mark>With time</mark>, Sam <mark>got closer to</mark> his <mark>dream of</mark> sailing on the open sea.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. with time：随着时间的流逝</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：With time, he became more confident.（随着时间的流逝，</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>他变得更加自信。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. get closer to：接近</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He got closer to his dream.（他接近了他的梦想。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>课后练习</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 造句练习：使用今天学到的固定搭配造句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- once upon a time：Once upon a time, there was a small village.（从前</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>有一个小村庄。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be interested in：I am interested in music.（我对音乐感兴趣。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>spend time doing something：He spends hours reading books.（他花</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>几个小时读书。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>by the shore：We sat by the shore.（我们坐在岸边。）            - watching the boats go by：They watched the boats go by.（他们看着</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>船只经过。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>imagine oneself doing something：I imagine myself traveling around</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>the world.（我想象自己环游世界。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be afraid of：I am afraid of heights.（我害怕高处。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be bad at：I am bad at math.（我不擅长数学。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>get lost：I am afraid I will get lost.（我担心我会迷路。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>encounter：I encountered a problem.（我遇到了一个问题。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be known for：China is known for its tea.（中国因茶而闻名。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>tell stories of：He told stories of his childhood.（他讲述了他的童年</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>故事。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>faraway lands：He traveled to faraway lands.（他旅行到遥远的国度。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>exciting voyages：He went on exciting voyages.（他进行了激动人</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>心的航海之旅。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be fascinated：I was fascinated by the movie.（我被这部电影迷住了。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be good at：He is good at building model ships.（他擅长制作船舶模</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>型。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>encourage somebody to do something：My mom encourages me to</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>read books.（我的妈妈鼓励我读书。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be hesitant：I was hesitant to try it.（我犹豫是否要尝试。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>give it a try：You should give it a try.（你应该尝试一下。）            - as：As he started the lessons, he realized he wasn't as bad at sailing as</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>he thought.（当他开始上课时，他意识到他并不像自己想的那样不擅长航海。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be proud of：I am proud of my country.（我为我的国家感到骄傲。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>get better and better：He is getting better and better.（他变得越来越</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>好。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be different from：His new skills were so different from his old self.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（他的新技能与他曾经的自己截然不同。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>with time：With time, he became more confident.（随着时间的流逝，</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>他变得更加自信。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>get closer to：He got closer to his dream.（他接近了他的梦想。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>---</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_航海梦_01", "moduleId": "p5_航海梦"}, {"title": "英文原文", "section": "英文原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>Once upon a time in a small seaside town, there was a boy named Sam.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Sam was always interested in sailing. He would spend hours by the shore, watching the boats go by and imagining himself on the open sea.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>But Sam was also afraid of the deep water. He thought he might be bad at sailing and get lost or encounter a storm.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>One day, he met an old sailor who was known for his adventures. The sailor told him stories of faraway lands and exciting voyages.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Sam was fascinated. His friend Jake was good at building model ships.       Jake encouraged Sam to take a sailing lesson.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Sam was hesitant at first, but then decided to give it a try.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>As Sam started the lessons, he realized he wasn't as bad at sailing as he thought. He began to be proud of himself. Soon he was getting better and better. His new skills were so different from his old self who was afraid.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>With time, Sam got closer to his dream of sailing on the open sea.</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_航海梦_02", "moduleId": "p5_航海梦"}, {"title": "搭配总结", "section": "搭配总结", "blocks": [{"type": "ol", "html": "<ol><li>once upon a time：从前</li><li>be interested in：对……感兴趣</li><li>spend time doing something：花时间做某事</li><li>by the shore：在岸边</li><li>watching the boats go by：看着船只经过</li><li>imagine oneself doing something：想象自己做某事</li><li>be afraid of：害怕</li><li>be bad at：不擅长</li><li>get lost：迷路</li><li>encounter：遇到，遭遇</li><li>be known for：因……而闻名</li><li>tell stories of：讲述……的故事</li><li>faraway lands：遥远的国度</li><li>exciting voyages：激动人心的航海之旅</li><li>be fascinated：入迷，着迷</li><li>be good at：擅长</li><li>encourage somebody to do something：鼓励某人做某事</li><li>be hesitant：犹豫</li><li>give it a try：尝试一下</li><li>as：当……的时候</li><li>be proud of：为……感到骄傲</li><li>get better and better：变得越来越好</li><li>be different from：与……不同</li><li>with time：随着时间的流逝</li><li>get closer to：接近</li></ol>"}], "id": "a_p5_航海梦_03", "moduleId": "p5_航海梦"}]}, {"id": "p5_烘焙小能手", "code": "", "title": "烘焙小能手", "articles": [{"title": "故事精讲", "section": "故事精讲", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>故事精讲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第一段：对话开始</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小吃说：\"Hi, <mark>what are you</mark> doing <mark>these days</mark>?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小摊说：\"I've been into baking lately. I'm really fond of it.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. what are you doing these days：你最近在忙啥呢？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：What are you doing these days?（你最近在忙啥呢？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. be into：对……感兴趣</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I've been into baking lately.（我最近迷上了烘焙。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. be fond of：喜欢</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I'm really fond of it.（我真的很喜欢它。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第二段：烘焙的乐趣</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小吃说：\"Oh, baking? I'm not so familiar with that. What's so fun about it?\"     小摊说：\"Well, you can <mark>create</mark> <mark>all kinds of</mark> delicious treats. It's amazing.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Like yesterday, I made a strawberry cheesecake. It was full of flavor.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. be familiar with：对……熟悉</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I'm not so familiar with baking.（我对烘焙不太熟悉。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. create：创造</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：You can create all kinds of delicious treats.（你可以做出各种</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>各样的美味点心。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. be full of：充满</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：It was full of flavor.（它味道浓郁。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第三段：烘焙的挑战</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小吃说：\"Sounds great. Are you ever <mark>worried about</mark> your bakes not turning out right?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小摊说：\"Sometimes. But when they do, I'm really pleased. Like that cheesecake, I was so happy with how it <mark>came out</mark>.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. be worried about：担心</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Are you ever worried about your bakes not turning out right?   （你会不会担心你做的点心不成功？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. be pleased with：对……满意</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I was so happy with how it came out.（我对它的成品非常满</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>意。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第四段：未来的计划</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小吃说：\"I can imagine. Are you satisfied with just making cakes and stuff?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小摊说：\"For now, yes. But I might try other things later. I'm a bit tired of always making the same things.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. be satisfied with：对……满意</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Are you satisfied with just making cakes and stuff?（你只满</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>足于做蛋糕之类的东西吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. be tired of：对……感到厌倦</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I'm a bit tired of always making the same things.（我有点儿</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>厌倦总是做一样的东西。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第五段：享受自由</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小吃说：\"Makes sense. Hey, <mark>have you thought about</mark> selling your bakes?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小摊说：\"Nah, not yet. I just do it <mark>for fun</mark> and I don't want to <mark>stress about</mark> it. Right now, I'm just <mark>enjoying</mark> being free of that kind of pressure.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. have you thought about：你有没有想过</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Have you thought about selling your bakes?（你有没有想过</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>卖你的烘焙制品？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. do something for fun：为了好玩做某事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I just do it for fun.（我只是为了好玩才做的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. stress about：对……感到有压力</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I don't want to stress about it.（我不想为此有压力。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. be free of：摆脱</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I'm just enjoying being free of that kind of pressure.（我正在</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>享受摆脱那种压力的自由。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>课后练习</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 造句练习：使用今天学到的固定搭配造句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- what are you doing these days：What are you doing these days?（你</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>最近在忙啥呢？）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be into：I've been into painting lately.（我最近迷上了绘画。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be fond of：I'm really fond of reading.（我真的很喜欢阅读。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be familiar with：I'm not so familiar with this software.（我对这个软</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>件不太熟悉。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>create：You can create all kinds of art.（你可以创作各种各样的艺</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>术作品。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be full of：The room is full of books.（房间里充满了书。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be worried about：I'm worried about the exam.（我担心考试。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be pleased with：I'm pleased with my performance.（我对我的表现</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>很满意。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be satisfied with：Are you satisfied with your job?（你对你的工作满</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>意吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be tired of：I'm tired of eating the same food every day.（我厌倦了每</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>天吃同样的食物。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>have you thought about：Have you thought about traveling abroad?   （你有没有想过出国旅行？）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>do something for fun：I do it for fun.（我只是为了好玩才做的。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>stress about：I don't want to stress about money.（我不想为钱感到</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>压力。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be free of：I'm free of debt.（我摆脱了债务。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>---</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_烘焙小能手_01", "moduleId": "p5_烘焙小能手"}, {"title": "英文原文", "section": "英文原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>小吃说：\"Hi, what are you doing these days?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小摊说：\"I've been into baking lately. I'm really fond of it.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小吃说：\"Oh, baking? I'm not so familiar with that. What's so fun about it?\"     小摊说：\"Well, you can create all kinds of delicious treats. It's amazing.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Like yesterday, I made a strawberry cheesecake. It was full of flavor.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小吃说：\"Sounds great. Are you ever worried about your bakes not turning out right?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小摊说：\"Sometimes. But when they do, I'm really pleased. Like that cheesecake, I was so happy with how it came out.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小吃说：\"I can imagine. Are you satisfied with just making cakes and stuff?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小摊说：\"For now, yes. But I might try other things later. I'm a bit tired of always making the same things.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小吃说：\"Makes sense. Hey, have you thought about selling your bakes?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小摊说：\"Nah, not yet. I just do it for fun and I don't want to stress about it. Right now, I'm just enjoying being free of that kind of pressure.\"</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_烘焙小能手_02", "moduleId": "p5_烘焙小能手"}, {"title": "搭配总结", "section": "搭配总结", "blocks": [{"type": "ol", "html": "<ol><li>what are you doing these days：你最近在忙啥呢？</li><li>be into：对……感兴趣</li><li>be fond of：喜欢</li><li>be familiar with：对……熟悉</li><li>create：创造</li><li>be full of：充满</li><li>be worried about：担心</li><li>be pleased with：对……满意</li><li>be satisfied with：对……满意</li><li>be tired of：对……感到厌倦</li><li>have you thought about：你有没有想过</li><li>do something for fun：为了好玩做某事</li><li>stress about：对……感到有压力</li><li>be free of：摆脱</li></ol>"}], "id": "a_p5_烘焙小能手_03", "moduleId": "p5_烘焙小能手"}]}, {"id": "p5_学个新语言", "code": "", "title": "学个新语言", "articles": [{"title": "故事精讲", "section": "故事精讲", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>故事精讲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第一段：对话开始</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A 同学说：\"Hi! <mark>What's new with you</mark>?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B 同学说：\"I want to learn a new language. I'm keen on French.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. what's new with you：最近怎么样？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：What's new with you?（最近怎么样？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. be keen on：热衷于</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I'm keen on French.（我热衷于法语。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第二段：学习语言的挑战</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A 同学说：\"That's great. But are you aware that it takes a lot of time? You might <mark>be short of</mark> free time.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>固定搭配：        1. be aware of：意识到</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>例句：Are you aware that it takes a lot of time?（你知不知道这得花</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>好多时间？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. be short of：缺少</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：You might be short of free time.（你可能会缺少空闲时间。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第三段：自我要求与时间管理</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B 同学说：\"I'll <mark>be strict with</mark> myself and <mark>make time</mark>.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. be strict with：对……严格</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I'll be strict with myself.（我会对自己严格要求。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. make time：挤出时间</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I'll make time.（我会挤出时间。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第四段：学习语言的重要性</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B 同学说：\"I know learning a language is essential to broadening my horizons.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>固定搭配：        1. <mark>be essential to</mark>：对……至关重要</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>例句：Learning a language is essential to broadening my horizons.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（学习语言对拓宽我的视野至关重要。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. broaden one's horizons：拓宽视野</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Traveling abroad can broaden your horizons.（出国旅行可以</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>拓宽你的视野。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第五段：兴趣差异</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A 同学说：\"I'm not so into languages. I'm more into sports. It's opposite to your choice.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. be into：喜欢</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I'm more into sports.（我更喜欢运动。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. be opposite to：与……相反</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：It's opposite to your choice.（这与你的选择相反。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第六段：嫉妒与鼓励</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B 同学说：\"That's okay. But sometimes I'm jealous of your athletic skills.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A 同学说：\"Don't be. You'll <mark>be great at</mark> French.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>固定搭配：        1. be jealous of：嫉妒</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I'm jealous of your athletic skills.（我嫉妒你的运动才能。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. be great at：擅长</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：You'll be great at French.（你学法语肯定能行。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第七段：避免过度压力</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A 同学说：\"And <mark>be careful of</mark> being too hard on yourself. It could <mark>be harmful to</mark> your motivation.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. be careful of：小心</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Be careful of being too hard on yourself.（小心对自己太狠了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. be harmful to：对……有害</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：It could be harmful to your motivation.（这可能会打击你的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>积极性。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第八段：警惕错误方法</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A 同学说：\"Also, <mark>be wary of</mark> false language learning methods.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. be wary of：警惕            - 例句：Be wary of false language learning methods.（警惕错误的语</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>言学习方法。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>课后练习</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 造句练习：使用今天学到的固定搭配造句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- what's new with you：What's new with you?（最近怎么样？）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be keen on：I'm keen on painting.（我热衷于绘画。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be aware of：Are you aware that it takes a lot of time?（你知不知道</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>这得花好多时间？）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be short of：We are short of time.（我们时间不够。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be strict with：My teacher is strict with us.（我的老师对我们严格要</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>求。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>make time：I need to make time for my hobbies.（我需要为我的爱</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>好挤出时间。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be essential to：Water is essential to life.（水对生命至关重要。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>broaden one's horizons：Traveling can broaden your horizons.（旅行</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>可以拓宽你的视野。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be into：I'm into music.（我喜欢音乐。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be opposite to：His opinion is opposite to mine.（他的观点与我的相</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>反。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be jealous of：She is jealous of her sister's beauty.（她嫉妒她妹妹的</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>美貌。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be great at：He is great at playing the piano.（他擅长弹钢琴。）            - be careful of：Be careful of making mistakes.（小心犯错。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be harmful to：Pollution is harmful to the environment.（污染对环境</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>有害。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be wary of：Be wary of scams.（警惕诈骗。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>---</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_学个新语言_01", "moduleId": "p5_学个新语言"}, {"title": "英文原文", "section": "英文原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>A 同学说：\"Hi! What's new with you?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B 同学说：\"I want to learn a new language. I'm keen on French.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A 同学说：\"That's great. But are you aware that it takes a lot of time? You might be short of free time.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B 同学说：\"I'll be strict with myself and make time. I know learning a language is essential to broadening my horizons.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A 同学说：\"I'm not so into languages. I'm more into sports. It's opposite to your choice.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B 同学说：\"That's okay. But sometimes I'm jealous of your athletic skills.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A 同学说：\"Don't be. You'll be great at French. And be careful of being too hard on yourself. It could be harmful to your motivation. Also, be wary of false language learning methods.\"</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_学个新语言_02", "moduleId": "p5_学个新语言"}, {"title": "搭配总结", "section": "搭配总结", "blocks": [{"type": "ol", "html": "<ol><li>what's new with you：最近怎么样？</li><li>be keen on：热衷于</li><li>be short of：缺少</li><li>be strict with：对……严格</li><li>make time：挤出时间</li><li>broaden one's horizons：拓宽视野</li><li>be into：喜欢</li><li>be opposite to：与……相反</li><li>be great at：擅长</li><li>be careful of：小心</li><li>be harmful to：对……有害</li><li>be wary of：警惕</li></ol>"}], "id": "a_p5_学个新语言_03", "moduleId": "p5_学个新语言"}]}, {"id": "p5_乐器好啊", "code": "", "title": "乐器好啊", "articles": [{"title": "故事精讲", "section": "故事精讲", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>故事精讲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第一段：提出建议</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>卡卡说：\"Hey, <mark>have you considered</mark> learning a musical instrument?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>弟弟说：\"No, not really. <mark>Why should I</mark>?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. have you considered：你有没有考虑过</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Have you considered learning a new language?（你有没有考</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>虑过学习一门新语言？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. why should I：为什么我要</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Why should I go to the party?（为什么我要去派对？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第二段：解释好处</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>卡卡说：\"Learning a musical instrument is essential to developing creativity. When you learn an instrument, you can <mark>be confident of</mark> <mark>expressing yourself</mark> <mark>in a unique way</mark>.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. be essential to：对……至关重要</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Water is essential to life.（水对生命至关重要。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. be confident of：对……有信心</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I am confident of passing the exam.（我对通过考试有信心。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. express yourself：表达自己</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：You can express yourself in many ways.（你可以以多种方式</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>表达自己。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. in a unique way：以独特的方式</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：She speaks in a gentle way.（她以温柔的方式说话。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第三段：进一步鼓励</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>卡卡说：\"<mark>Mastering</mark> an instrument is worthy of your dedication. You are responsible for <mark>cultivating</mark> your talents.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. master something：掌握某事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Mastering a new skill takes time.（掌握一项新技能需要时间。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. be worthy of：值得            - 例句：This book is worthy of reading.（这本书值得一读。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. be responsible for：对……负责</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I am responsible for cleaning the room.（我负责打扫房间。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. cultivate：培养</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：You should cultivate your talents.（你应该培养你的才能。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第四段：更多好处</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>卡卡说：\"Learning a musical instrument is also beneficial to your <mark>brain development</mark>.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. be beneficial to：对……有益</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Exercise is beneficial to health.（运动对健康有益。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. brain development：大脑发展</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Reading books is beneficial to mental development.（读书对</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>心智发展有益。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第五段：弟弟的回应</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>弟弟说：\"True. But I'm kind of addicted to <mark>playing video games</mark>.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. be addicted to：对……上瘾</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He is addicted to smoking.（他对吸烟上瘾。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. playing video games：玩电子游戏</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Some people are addicted to playing video games.（一些人对</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>玩电子游戏上瘾。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第六段：最终建议</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>卡卡说：\"Well, you should <mark>try</mark> learning an instrument and <mark>see how much fun it can be</mark>.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. try doing something：尝试做某事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：You should try learning a new language.（你应该尝试学习一</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>门新语言。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. see how much fun it can be：看看它能带来多少乐趣</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Try this activity and see how much fun it can be.（尝试这个   活动，看看它能带来多少乐趣。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>课后练习</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 造句练习：使用今天学到的固定搭配造句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- have you considered：Have you considered traveling abroad?（你有</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>没有考虑过出国旅行？）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>why should I：Why should I study this subject?（为什么我要学这门</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>课？）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be essential to：Water is essential to life.（水对生命至关重要。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be confident of：I am confident of passing the exam.（我对通过考试</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>有信心。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>express yourself：You can express yourself in many ways.（你可以</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>以多种方式表达自己。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>in a unique way：She speaks in a gentle way.（她以温柔的方式说话。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>master something：Mastering a new skill takes time.（掌握一项新技</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>能需要时间。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be worthy of：This book is worthy of reading.（这本书值得一读。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be responsible for：I am responsible for cleaning the room.（我负责</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>打扫房间。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>cultivate：You should cultivate your talents.（你应该培养你的才能。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be beneficial to：Exercise is beneficial to health.（运动对健康有益。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>brain development：Reading books is beneficial to mental</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>development.（读书对心智发展有益。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be addicted to：He is addicted to smoking.（他对吸烟上瘾。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>playing video games：Some people are addicted to playing video</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>games.（一些人对玩电子游戏上瘾。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>try doing something：You should try learning a new language.（你应</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>该尝试学习一门新语言。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>see how much fun it can be：Try this activity and see how much fun it</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>can be.（尝试这个活动，看看它能带来多少乐趣。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>---</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_乐器好啊_01", "moduleId": "p5_乐器好啊"}, {"title": "英文原文", "section": "英文原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>卡卡说：\"Hey, have you considered learning a musical instrument?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>弟弟说：\"No, not really. Why should I?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>卡卡说：\"Learning a musical instrument is essential to developing creativity. When you learn an instrument, you can be confident of expressing yourself in a unique way.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>卡卡说：\"Mastering an instrument is worthy of your dedication. You are responsible for cultivating your talents.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>卡卡说：\"Learning a musical instrument is also beneficial to your brain development.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>弟弟说：\"True. But I'm kind of addicted to playing video games.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>卡卡说：\"Well, you should try learning an instrument and see how much fun it can be.\"</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_乐器好啊_02", "moduleId": "p5_乐器好啊"}, {"title": "搭配总结", "section": "搭配总结", "blocks": [{"type": "ol", "html": "<ol><li>have you considered：你有没有考虑过</li><li>why should I：为什么我要</li><li>be essential to：对……至关重要</li><li>be confident of：对……有信心</li><li>express yourself：表达自己</li><li>in a unique way：以独特的方式</li><li>master something：掌握某事</li><li>be worthy of：值得</li><li>be responsible for：对……负责</li><li>cultivate：培养</li><li>be beneficial to：对……有益</li><li>brain development：大脑发展</li><li>be addicted to：对……上瘾</li><li>playing video games：玩电子游戏</li><li>try doing something：尝试做某事</li><li>see how much fun it can be：看看它能带来多少乐趣</li></ol>"}], "id": "a_p5_乐器好啊_03", "moduleId": "p5_乐器好啊"}]}, {"id": "p5_电影和游戏", "code": "", "title": "电影和游戏", "articles": [{"title": "故事精讲", "section": "故事精讲", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>故事精讲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第一段：电影情节讨论</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小胖说：\"I really like this new movie. The <mark>plot</mark> is so <mark>fascinating</mark>.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小美说：\"Yeah, me too, but I think the ending is a bit contrary to my expectations.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. plot：情节</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The plot of the movie is very interesting.（电影的情节非常有</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>趣。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. fascinating：吸引人的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The story is fascinating.（这个故事非常吸引人。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. be contrary to：与……相反</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The result is contrary to my expectations.（结果与我的期望</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>相反。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第二段：电影结局讨论</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小胖说：\"Oh, really? How so?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小美说：\"Well, I thought it would be a happy ending, but it <mark>turned out to be</mark> quite sad.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. how so：何以见得</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：How so?（何以见得？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. turn out to be：结果是</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：It turned out to be a great success.（结果非常成功。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第三段：电影表演讨论</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小胖说：\"Hmm, I see what you mean. But sometimes a <mark>bittersweet</mark> ending can be more <mark>memorable</mark>.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小美说：\"Maybe. Anyway, the <mark>acting</mark> in the movie is really good. The actors are all very <mark>talented</mark>.\"   固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. bittersweet：苦乐参半</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The ending was bittersweet.（结局苦乐参半。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. memorable：令人难忘的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The experience was memorable.（这次经历令人难忘。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. acting：演技</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The acting in the movie is excellent.（电影中的演技非常出</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>色。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. talented：有才华的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The actors are very talented.（这些演员很有才华。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第四段：电影表演与经典电影对比</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小胖说：\"Yes, I agree. Their performances are very similar to those in some classic movies.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. be similar to：与……相似</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：This picture is similar to that one.（这幅画与那幅画相似。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. those：那些（指代前面提到的名词）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Their performances are similar to those in some classic movies.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（他们的表演与一些经典电影中的表演相似。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第五段：电影中的熟悉面孔</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小美说：\"That's true. It's nice to see some <mark>familiar faces</mark> on the big screen.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. it's nice to do something：做某事真好</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：It's nice to see you.（见到你真好。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. familiar faces：熟悉的面孔</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：It's nice to see some familiar faces.（看到一些熟悉的面孔真</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>好。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第六段：游戏体验讨论</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小胖说：\"Hey, <mark>have you tried</mark> that new video game?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小美说：\"No, I haven't. What's it like?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小胖说：\"It's really fun. You <mark>get exposed to</mark> <mark>all kinds of</mark> different challenges.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. have you tried：你尝试过吗？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Have you tried this new restaurant?（你尝试过这家新餐厅</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. get exposed to：接触</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Children should not be exposed to violence.（孩子们不应该</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>接触暴力。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. all kinds of：各种各样的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：You get exposed to all kinds of different challenges.（你会接</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>触到各种各样的挑战。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第七段：游戏投入讨论</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小美说：\"<mark>Sounds interesting</mark>. Are you dedicated to <mark>playing video games</mark>?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小胖说：\"Well, not really, but I do <mark>enjoy</mark> them. Sometimes I feel my skills are inferior to other players.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. be dedicated to：致力于            - 例句：He is dedicated to his work.（他致力于他的工作。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. enjoy：享受</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I do enjoy them.（我确实享受这些。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. be inferior to：次于</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：My skills are inferior to other players.（我的技术不如其他玩</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>家。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第八段：游戏规则讨论</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小美说：\"Don't worry. You can always improve. Are you subjected to any strict rules in the game?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小胖说：\"Hmm, a few, but I know I'm obliged to follow them to <mark>have a good time</mark>.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. be subjected to：遭受，经受</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The city was subjected to a severe storm.（这个城市遭受了</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>一场严重的风暴。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. be obliged to：有义务</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I am obliged to follow the rules.（我有义务遵守规则。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. have a good time：玩得愉快</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：We had a good time at the party.（我们在派对上玩得很愉快。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>课后练习</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 造句练习：使用今天学到的固定搭配造句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- plot：The plot of the book is very interesting.（这本书的情节非常有</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>趣。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>fascinating：The story is fascinating.（这个故事非常吸引人。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be contrary to：The result is contrary to my expectations.（结果与我</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>的期望相反。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>how so：How so?（何以见得？）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>turn out to be：It turned out to be a great success.（结果非常成功。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>bittersweet：The ending was bittersweet.（结局苦乐参半。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>memorable：The experience was memorable.（这次经历令人难忘。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>acting：The acting in the movie is excellent.（电影中的演技非常出</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>色。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>talented：The actors are very talented.（这些演员很有才华。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be similar to：This picture is similar to that one.（这幅画与那幅画相</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>似。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>those：Their performances are similar to those in some classic movies.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（他们的表演与一些经典电影中的表演相似。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>it's nice to do something：It's nice to see you.（见到你真好。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>familiar faces：It's nice to see some familiar faces.（看到一些熟悉的   面孔真好。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>have you tried：Have you tried this new restaurant?（你尝试过这家</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>新餐厅吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>get exposed to：Children should not be exposed to violence.（孩子们</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>不应该接触暴力。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>all kinds of：You get exposed to all kinds of different challenges.（你</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>会接触到各种各样的挑战。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be dedicated to：He is dedicated to his work.（他致力于他的工作。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>enjoy：I do enjoy them.（我确实享受这些。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be inferior to：My skills are inferior to other players.（我的技术不如</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>其他玩家。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be subjected to：The city was subjected to a severe storm.（这个城市</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>遭受了一场严重的风暴。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be obliged to：I am obliged to follow the rules.（我有义务遵守规则。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>have a good time：We had a good time at the party.（我们在派对上</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>玩得很愉快。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>---</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_电影和游戏_01", "moduleId": "p5_电影和游戏"}, {"title": "英文原文", "section": "英文原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>小胖说：\"I really like this new movie. The plot is so fascinating.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小美说：\"Yeah, me too, but I think the ending is a bit contrary to my expectations.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小胖说：\"Oh, really? How so?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小美说：\"Well, I thought it would be a happy ending, but it turned out to be quite sad.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小胖说：\"Hmm, I see what you mean. But sometimes a bittersweet ending can be more memorable.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小美说：\"Maybe. Anyway, the acting in the movie is really good. The actors are all very talented.\"   固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小胖说：\"Yes, I agree. Their performances are very similar to those in some classic movies.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小美说：\"That's true. It's nice to see some familiar faces on the big screen.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小胖说：\"Hey, have you tried that new video game?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小美说：\"No, I haven't. What's it like?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小胖说：\"It's really fun. You get exposed to all kinds of different challenges.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小美说：\"Sounds interesting. Are you dedicated to playing video games?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小胖说：\"Well, not really, but I do enjoy them. Sometimes I feel my skills are inferior to other players.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小美说：\"Don't worry. You can always improve. Are you subjected to any strict rules in the game?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小胖说：\"Hmm, a few, but I know I'm obliged to follow them to have a good time.\"</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_电影和游戏_02", "moduleId": "p5_电影和游戏"}, {"title": "搭配总结", "section": "搭配总结", "blocks": [{"type": "ol", "html": "<ol><li>plot：情节</li><li>fascinating：吸引人的</li><li>be contrary to：与……相反</li><li>how so：何以见得</li><li>turn out to be：结果是</li><li>bittersweet：苦乐参半</li><li>memorable：令人难忘的</li><li>acting：演技</li><li>talented：有才华的</li><li>be similar to：与……相似</li><li>those：那些（指代前面提到的名词）</li><li>it's nice to do something：做某事真好</li><li>familiar faces：熟悉的面孔</li><li>have you tried：你尝试过吗？</li><li>get exposed to：接触</li><li>all kinds of：各种各样的</li><li>be dedicated to：致力于</li><li>enjoy：享受</li><li>be inferior to：次于</li><li>be subjected to：遭受，经受</li><li>be obliged to：有义务</li><li>have a good time：玩得愉快</li></ol>"}], "id": "a_p5_电影和游戏_03", "moduleId": "p5_电影和游戏"}]}, {"id": "p5_职场和手机", "code": "", "title": "职场和手机", "articles": [{"title": "故事精讲", "section": "故事精讲", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>故事精讲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第一段：讨论同事的行为</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>宁宁说：\"Hey, did you <mark>hear about</mark> David? He thought he could <mark>skip work</mark> and still <mark>get a promotion</mark>.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>大白说：\"That's insane. He's clearly ignorant of how things work here.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. hear about：听说</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Did you hear about the new project?（你听说新项目了吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. skip work：翘班，不工作</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He thought he could skip work.（他以为他可以翘班。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. get a promotion：晋升</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He still got a promotion.（他还是得到了晋升。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. be ignorant of：对……无知</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He is ignorant of the latest technology.（他对最新技术一无</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>所知。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第二段：讨论同事的勤奋</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>宁宁说：\"Yeah, he's not being diligent in his job at all.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>大白说：\"People who are lazy like that are liable to <mark>get into trouble</mark>.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. be diligent in：在……上勤奋</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He is diligent in his studies.（他在学习上很勤奋。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. be liable to：容易……</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He is liable to get angry easily.（他很容易生气。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. get into trouble：惹麻烦</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Lazy people are likely to get into trouble.（懒惰的人容易惹</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>麻烦。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第三段：讨论同事的行为与期望</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>宁宁说：\"True. And his actions are not consistent with what the boss expects.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>大白说：\"Poor David. He might <mark>end up</mark> being deprived of that bonus too.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. be consistent with：与……一致</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：His actions are consistent with his words.（他的行动与他的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>话一致。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. end up doing something：最终……</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：If you keep driving so fast, you will end up getting a ticket.（如</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>果你继续开这么快，你最终会收到一张罚单。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. be deprived of：被剥夺</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He was deprived of his freedom.（他被剥夺了自由。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第四段：讨论同事的教训</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>宁宁说：\"Huh, he <mark>deserves</mark> it. He should <mark>learn to</mark> work hard.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. deserve：值得</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He deserves this reward.（他值得这个奖励。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. learn to：学会</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He should learn to work hard.（他应该学会努力工作。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>课后练习</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 造句练习：使用今天学到的固定搭配造句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- hear about：Did you hear about the new project?（你听说新项目了</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>skip work：He thought he could skip work.（他以为他可以翘班。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>get a promotion：He still got a promotion.（他还是得到了晋升。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be ignorant of：He is ignorant of the latest technology.（他对最新技</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>术一无所知。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be diligent in：He is diligent in his studies.（他在学习上很勤奋。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be liable to：He is liable to get angry easily.（他很容易生气。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>get into trouble：Lazy people are likely to get into trouble.（懒惰的</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>人容易惹麻烦。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be consistent with：His actions are consistent with his words.（他的</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>行动与他的话一致。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>end up doing something：If you keep driving so fast, you will end up</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>getting a ticket.（如果你继续开这么快，你最终会收到一张罚单。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be deprived of：He was deprived of his freedom.（他被剥夺了自由。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>deserve：He deserves this reward.（他值得这个奖励。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>learn to：He should learn to work hard.（他应该学会努力工作。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>---</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_职场和手机_01", "moduleId": "p5_职场和手机"}, {"title": "英文原文", "section": "英文原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>宁宁说：\"Hey, did you hear about David? He thought he could skip work and still get a promotion.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>大白说：\"That's insane. He's clearly ignorant of how things work here.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>宁宁说：\"Yeah, he's not being diligent in his job at all.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>大白说：\"People who are lazy like that are liable to get into trouble.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>宁宁说：\"True. And his actions are not consistent with what the boss expects.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>大白说：\"Poor David. He might end up being deprived of that bonus too.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>宁宁说：\"Huh, he deserves it. He should learn to work hard.\"</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_职场和手机_02", "moduleId": "p5_职场和手机"}, {"title": "搭配总结", "section": "搭配总结", "blocks": [{"type": "ol", "html": "<ol><li>hear about：听说</li><li>skip work：翘班，不工作</li><li>get a promotion：晋升</li><li>be ignorant of：对……无知</li><li>be diligent in：在……上勤奋</li><li>be liable to：容易……</li><li>get into trouble：惹麻烦</li><li>be consistent with：与……一致</li><li>end up doing something：最终……</li><li>be deprived of：被剥夺</li><li>deserve：值得</li><li>learn to：学会</li></ol>"}], "id": "a_p5_职场和手机_03", "moduleId": "p5_职场和手机"}]}, {"id": "p5_接力赛和攀岩", "code": "", "title": "接力赛和攀岩", "articles": [{"title": "故事精讲", "section": "故事精讲", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>故事精讲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第一段：接力赛的讨论</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>王同学说：\"Hey, <mark>have you heard about</mark> the relay race?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>张同学说：\"Yeah, but I'm a bit reluctant to <mark>take part</mark>. I'm not sure I'm good enough.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. have you heard about：你听说过……吗？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Have you heard about the new project?（你听说过新项目吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. be reluctant to：不情愿做某事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：She is reluctant to get up early.（她不情愿早起。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. take part：参加</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I'm not sure if I'm good enough to take part.（我不确定我是</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>否足够好可以参加。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第二段：鼓励与信心</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>原文：王同学说：\"<mark>Come on</mark>, <mark>have faith in</mark> yourself. We've been training hard.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>张同学说：\"But I'm still suspicious of my running speed. What if I <mark>let</mark> the team <mark>down</mark>?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. have faith in：对……有信心</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I have faith in my abilities.（我对自己的能力有信心。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. be suspicious of：怀疑</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I am suspicious of his motives.（我怀疑他的动机。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. let someone down：让某人失望</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I don't want to let my parents down.（我不想让我的父母失</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>望。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第三段：团队与机会</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>王同学说：\"Don't think like that. Our team is not inferior to others. We have a good chance.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>张同学说：\"Well, I know some people are preoccupied with their own stuff. Will they <mark>be committed to</mark> the race?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. be inferior to：不如            - 例句：This phone is not inferior to my old one.（这部手机不比我的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>旧手机差。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. be preoccupied with：忙于</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He is preoccupied with his work.（他忙于工作。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. be committed to：致力于</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：We should be committed to protecting the environment.（我</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>们应该致力于保护环境。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第四段：尝试与精神</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>王同学说：\"Don't worry. We'll all do our best.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>张同学说：\"Okay, maybe I'll <mark>give it a try</mark>.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>王同学说：\"<mark>That's the spirit</mark>. Let's rock this relay race.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. do one's best：尽全力</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：We'll all do our best.（我们都会尽全力。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. give it a try：尝试</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Maybe I'll give it a try.（也许我会尝试一下。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. that's the spirit：这就是精神</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：That's the spirit!（这就是精神！）   第五段：攀岩的讨论</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>静静说：\"Hey, I want to try <mark>rock climbing</mark>. What do you think?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>西西说：\"That sounds exciting, but I'm a little worried. I'm not sure if I <mark>have the strength</mark>.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. rock climbing：攀岩</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I want to try rock climbing.（我想尝试攀岩。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. be worried：担心</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I'm a little worried.（我有点担心。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. have the strength：有力量</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I'm not sure if I have the strength.（我不确定我是否有力量。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第六段：鼓励与热情</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>静静说：\"<mark>Come on</mark>, we should <mark>be zealous for</mark> new challenges. Don't be so cautious.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>西西说：\"Well, I guess I can <mark>give it a try</mark>, but I hope you will <mark>be tolerant about</mark> my slow progress.\"   固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. be zealous for：热衷于</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：We should be zealous for new challenges.（我们应该热衷于</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>新的挑战。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. be cautious：谨慎</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Don't be so cautious.（不要这么谨慎。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. be tolerant about：对……宽容</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I hope you will be tolerant about my slow progress.（我希望</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>你能对我的缓慢进展宽容一些。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第七段：享受与尝试</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>静静说：\"Of course, we're just <mark>having fun</mark> and <mark>exploring</mark> something <mark>new</mark>.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>西西说：\"That's good to hear. I hope I can <mark>enjoy</mark> it as much as you <mark>seem to be</mark>.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>静静说：\"Don't worry, let's <mark>go for it</mark> with enthusiasm.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. have fun：玩得开心</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：We're just having fun.（我们只是玩得开心。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. explore something new：探索新事物            - 例句：We're exploring something new.（我们正在探索新事物。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. go for it：大胆尝试</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Let's go for it with enthusiasm.（让我们满怀热情地去尝试</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>吧。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>课后练习</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 造句练习：使用今天学到的固定搭配造句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- have you heard about：Have you heard about the new movie?（你听</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>说过新电影吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be reluctant to：She is reluctant to speak in public.（她不情愿在公共</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>场合讲话。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>take part：I want to take part in the competition.（我想参加比赛。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>have faith in：I have faith in my abilities.（我对自己的能力有信心。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be suspicious of：I am suspicious of his motives.（我怀疑他的动机。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>let someone down：I don't want to let my team down.（我不想让我</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>的团队失望。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be inferior to：This product is not inferior to the others.（这个产品不</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>比其他产品差。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be preoccupied with：He is preoccupied with his studies.（他忙于学</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>习。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be committed to：We should be committed to our goals.（我们应该   致力于我们的目标。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>do one's best：We will do our best to win.（我们会尽全力赢得比赛。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>give it a try：I will give it a try.（我会尝试一下。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>that's the spirit：That's the spirit!（这就是精神！）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>rock climbing：I love rock climbing.（我喜欢攀岩。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be worried：I am worried about the exam.（我担心考试。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>have the strength：I hope I have the strength to finish.（我希望我有</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>力量完成。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be zealous for：He is zealous for his work.（他对工作很热心。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be cautious：Be cautious when crossing the street.（过马路时要小心。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be tolerant about：Be tolerant about different opinions.（对不同意见</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>要宽容。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>have fun：We had fun at the party.（我们在派对上玩得很开心。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>explore something new：I enjoy exploring new places.（我喜欢探索</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>新地方。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>go for it：Go for it!（大胆尝试！）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>---</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_接力赛和攀岩_01", "moduleId": "p5_接力赛和攀岩"}, {"title": "英文原文", "section": "英文原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>王同学说：\"Hey, have you heard about the relay race?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>张同学说：\"Yeah, but I'm a bit reluctant to take part. I'm not sure I'm good enough.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>王同学说：\"Come on, have faith in yourself. We've been training hard.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>张同学说：\"But I'm still suspicious of my running speed. What if I let the team down?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>王同学说：\"Don't think like that. Our team is not inferior to others. We have a good chance.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>张同学说：\"Well, I know some people are preoccupied with their own stuff. Will they be committed to the race?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>王同学说：\"Don't worry. We'll all do our best.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>张同学说：\"Okay, maybe I'll give it a try.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>王同学说：\"That's the spirit. Let's rock this relay race.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>静静说：\"Hey, I want to try rock climbing. What do you think?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>西西说：\"That sounds exciting, but I'm a little worried. I'm not sure if I have the strength.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>静静说：\"Come on, we should be zealous for new challenges. Don't be so cautious.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>西西说：\"Well, I guess I can give it a try, but I hope you will be tolerant about my slow progress.\"   固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>静静说：\"Of course, we're just having fun and exploring something new.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>西西说：\"That's good to hear. I hope I can enjoy it as much as you seem to be.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>静静说：\"Don't worry, let's go for it with enthusiasm.\"</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_接力赛和攀岩_02", "moduleId": "p5_接力赛和攀岩"}, {"title": "搭配总结", "section": "搭配总结", "blocks": [{"type": "ol", "html": "<ol><li>have you heard about：你听说过……吗？</li><li>be reluctant to：不情愿做某事</li><li>take part：参加</li><li>have faith in：对……有信心</li><li>be suspicious of：怀疑</li><li>let someone down：让某人失望</li><li>be inferior to：不如</li><li>be preoccupied with：忙于</li><li>be committed to：致力于</li><li>do one's best：尽全力</li><li>give it a try：尝试</li><li>that's the spirit：这就是精神</li><li>rock climbing：攀岩</li><li>be worried：担心</li><li>have the strength：有力量</li><li>be zealous for：热衷于</li><li>be cautious：谨慎</li><li>be tolerant about：对……宽容</li><li>have fun：玩得开心</li><li>explore something new：探索新事物</li><li>go for it：大胆尝试</li></ol>"}], "id": "a_p5_接力赛和攀岩_03", "moduleId": "p5_接力赛和攀岩"}]}, {"id": "p5_开个小吃店吧", "code": "", "title": "开个小吃店吧", "articles": [{"title": "故事精讲", "section": "故事精讲", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>故事精讲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第一段：提出开店想法</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>沈公子说：\"Hey, I have a big idea. I <mark>have a love for</mark> food and I want to <mark>open a special snack shop</mark>. Do you <mark>have any interest in</mark> this?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. have a love for：热爱</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I have a love for music.（我热爱音乐。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. open a special snack shop：开一家独具特色的小吃店</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I want to open a special snack shop.（我想开一家独具特色</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>的小吃店。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. have any interest in：对……有兴趣</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Do you have any interest in this?（你对这个有兴趣吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第二段：考虑市场需求</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>卡总说：\"That <mark>sounds interesting</mark>, but I think you need to <mark>consider</mark> <mark>the</mark>      <mark>demand for</mark> such snacks in our area.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. consider：考虑</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：You need to consider the demand.（你需要考虑需求。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. the demand for：对……的需求</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：There is a high demand for smartphones.（对智能手机有很</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>高的需求。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第三段：进行市场调研</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>沈公子说：\"Yeah, I know. I've been doing <mark>some research</mark>. There <mark>seems to be</mark> <mark>a high demand for</mark> <mark>unique</mark> and delicious snacks.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. do some research：进行一些调研</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I've been doing some research.（我一直在进行一些调研。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. there seems to be：似乎有</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：There seems to be a problem.（似乎有个问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. a high demand for：对……有很高的需求</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：There is a high demand for unique and delicious snacks.（对   独特又美味的小吃有很高的需求。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第四段：寻找供应商</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>沈公子说：\"But I still haven't <mark>found</mark> <mark>a good solution to</mark> the problem of <mark>finding reliable suppliers</mark>.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. a good solution to：对……的解决方案</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I haven't found a good solution to the problem.（我还没有找</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>到一个好的解决方案。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. finding reliable suppliers：寻找可靠的供应商</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Finding reliable suppliers is a challenge.（寻找可靠的供应商</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>是一个挑战。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第五段：提出建议</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>卡总说：\"Well, maybe you can ask around or <mark>search online</mark>. Do you <mark>have access to</mark> some business networks?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>固定搭配：        1. ask around：四处打听</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：You can ask around.（你可以四处打听。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. search online：上网搜索</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：You can search online.（你可以网上搜索。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. have access to：有权使用</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Do you have access to some business networks?（你能接触到</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>一些商业网络吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第六段：讨论关键因素</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>卡总说：\"Great. And do you know <mark>the key to</mark> <mark>making the shop popular</mark>?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. the key to：……的关键</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The key to success is hard work.（成功的关键是努力工作。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. making the shop popular：让店铺受欢迎</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The key to making the shop popular is good service.（让店铺</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>受欢迎的关键是优质的服务。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第七段：强调质量和服务</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>原文：沈公子说：\"I think it's <mark>the quality and taste of</mark> the food. Also, <mark>good service</mark> is very important.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. the quality and taste of：……的质量和口味</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The quality and taste of the food are important.（食物的质量</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>和口味很重要。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. good service：优质的服务</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Good service is very important.（优质的服务非常重要。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第八段：连接当地文化</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>卡总说：\"Exactly. And there should be <mark>a connection to</mark> local culture to <mark>attract more customers</mark>.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. a connection to：与……的联系</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：There should be a connection to local culture.（应该与当地文</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>化有联系。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. attract more customers：吸引更多的顾客</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Good marketing can attract more customers.（好的营销可以</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>吸引更多的顾客。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第九段：讨论营销的重要性</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>沈公子说：\"That's a good point. I'll <mark>think about</mark> it. Do you know <mark>the importance of</mark> marketing in this business?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. the importance of：……的重要性</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Do you know the importance of marketing?（你知道营销的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>重要性吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. bring in：带来</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Good marketing can bring in more customers.（好的营销可</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>以带来更多的顾客。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>课后练习</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 造句练习：使用今天学到的固定搭配造句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- have a love for：I have a love for music.（我热爱音乐。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>open a special snack shop：I want to open a special snack shop.（我</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>想开一家独具特色的小吃店。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>have any interest in：Do you have any interest in this?（你对这个有</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>兴趣吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>consider：You need to consider the demand.（你需要考虑需求。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>the demand for：There is a high demand for smartphones.（对智能手</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>机有很高的需求。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>do some research：I've been doing some research.（我一直在进行一</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>些调研。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>there seems to be：There seems to be a problem.（似乎有个问题。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>a high demand for：There is a high demand for unique and delicious</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>snacks.（对独特又美味的小吃有很高的需求。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>a good solution to：I haven't found a good solution to the problem.（我</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>还没有找到一个好的解决方案。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>finding reliable suppliers：Finding reliable suppliers is a challenge.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（寻找可靠的供应商是一个挑战。）            - ask around：You can ask around.（你可以四处打听。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>search online：You can search online.（你可以网上搜索。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>have access to：Do you have access to some business networks?（你</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>能接触到一些商业网络吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>the key to：The key to success is hard work.（成功的关键是努力工</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>作。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>making the shop popular：The key to making the shop popular is good</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>service.（让店铺受欢迎的关键是优质的服务。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>the quality and taste of：The quality and taste of the food are</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>important.（食物的质量和口味很重要。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>good service：Good service is very important.（优质的服务非常重</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>要。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>a connection to：There should be a connection to local culture.（应该</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>与当地文化有联系。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>attract more customers：Good marketing can attract more customers.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（好的营销可以吸引更多的顾客。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>the importance of：Do you know the importance of marketing?（你知</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>道营销的重要性吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>bring in：Good marketing can bring in more customers.（好的营销可</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>以带来更多的顾客。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>---</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_开个小吃店吧_01", "moduleId": "p5_开个小吃店吧"}, {"title": "英文原文", "section": "英文原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>沈公子说：\"Hey, I have a big idea. I have a love for food and I want to open a special snack shop. Do you have any interest in this?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>卡总说：\"That sounds interesting, but I think you need to consider the      demand for such snacks in our area.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>沈公子说：\"Yeah, I know. I've been doing some research. There seems to be a high demand for unique and delicious snacks.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>沈公子说：\"But I still haven't found a good solution to the problem of finding reliable suppliers.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>卡总说：\"Well, maybe you can ask around or search online. Do you have access to some business networks?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>固定搭配：        1. ask around：四处打听</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>卡总说：\"Great. And do you know the key to making the shop popular?\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>沈公子说：\"I think it's the quality and taste of the food. Also, good service is very important.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>卡总说：\"Exactly. And there should be a connection to local culture to attract more customers.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>沈公子说：\"That's a good point. I'll think about it. Do you know the importance of marketing in this business?\"</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_开个小吃店吧_02", "moduleId": "p5_开个小吃店吧"}, {"title": "搭配总结", "section": "搭配总结", "blocks": [{"type": "ol", "html": "<ol><li>have a love for：热爱</li><li>open a special snack shop：开一家独具特色的小吃店</li><li>have any interest in：对……有兴趣</li><li>consider：考虑</li><li>the demand for：对……的需求</li><li>do some research：进行一些调研</li><li>there seems to be：似乎有</li><li>a high demand for：对……有很高的需求</li><li>a good solution to：对……的解决方案</li><li>finding reliable suppliers：寻找可靠的供应商</li><li>search online：上网搜索</li><li>have access to：有权使用</li><li>the key to：……的关键</li><li>making the shop popular：让店铺受欢迎</li><li>the quality and taste of：……的质量和口味</li><li>good service：优质的服务</li><li>a connection to：与……的联系</li><li>attract more customers：吸引更多的顾客</li><li>the importance of：……的重要性</li><li>bring in：带来</li></ol>"}], "id": "a_p5_开个小吃店吧_03", "moduleId": "p5_开个小吃店吧"}]}, {"id": "p5_科技和通勤", "code": "", "title": "科技和通勤", "articles": [{"title": "故事精讲", "section": "故事精讲", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>故事精讲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第一段：科技与日常生活的对话</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>原文：小牛说：\"I was just <mark>thinking about</mark> <mark>the relationship between</mark> technology and our daily lives. What do you think?\" 小马说：\"Well, I think it <mark>has a huge influence on</mark> us. It <mark>makes</mark> everything so <mark>convenient</mark>.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>True, but there are also some <mark>limitations on</mark> it, like people spending too much time on their phones. Yeah, and what about the <mark>contribution to</mark> the environment? Does it <mark>have a positive or negative impact</mark>? That's a good question. I think it <mark>depends on</mark> how we use it.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. think about：思考</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I was just thinking about the relationship between technology</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>and our daily lives.（我刚刚在想科技和我们日常生活之间的关系。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. the relationship between：……之间的关系</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：There is a close relationship between diet and health.（饮食和</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>健康之间有着密切的关系。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. have a huge influence on：对……有巨大影响            - 例句：Technology has a huge influence on our lives.（科技对我们</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>的生活有巨大影响。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. make something convenient：使……方便</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：It makes everything so convenient.（它使一切都变得很方便。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. limitations on：对……的限制</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：There are some limitations on it.（它有一些限制。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. spend time on：在……上花费时间</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：People spend too much time on their phones.（人们在手机上</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>花费了太多时间。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. contribution to：对……的贡献</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：What about the contribution to the environment?（对环境的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>贡献怎么样？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. have a positive or negative impact：有积极或消极的影响</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Does it have a positive or negative impact?（它有积极的还是</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>消极的影响？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>9. depend on：取决于</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：It depends on how we use it.（这取决于我们怎么使用它。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第二段：通勤方式的对话</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>原文：小牛说：\"I'm <mark>thinking about</mark> how to go to work every day.\" 小马说：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>\"Well, you have many choices. Do you <mark>have a preference for</mark> any particular one?\" 小牛说：\"I'm not sure. I need to <mark>think about</mark> <mark>the connection with</mark> cost and convenience.\" 小马说：\"That's important. And you also have to <mark>consider your responsibility for</mark> the environment.\" 小牛说：\"Right. Different transportation methods <mark>have different impacts on</mark> the environment.\" 小马说：\"For example, taking a bus has <mark>a lower demand of</mark> personal cost, but might <mark>take more time</mark>. Yeah, and driving a car is more convenient, but <mark>has a greater impact on</mark> air pollution.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. how to do something：如何做某事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I'm thinking about how to go to work every day.（我每天在</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>想怎么去上班。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. have a preference for：对……有偏好</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Do you have a preference for any particular one?（你有没有</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>特别的偏好？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. the connection with：与……的关联</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I need to think about the connection with cost and convenience.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（我需要考虑成本和便利性之间的关联。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. consider your responsibility for：考虑你对……的责任</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：You also have to consider your responsibility for the    environment.（你还需要考虑你对环境的责任。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. have different impacts on：对……有不同的影响</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Different transportation methods have different impacts on the</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>environment.（不同的交通方式对环境有不同的影响。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. a lower demand of：对……有更低的需求</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Taking a bus has a lower demand of personal cost.（坐公交对</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>个人成本的需求更低。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. take more time：花费更多的时间</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：But might take more time.（但可能会花费更多的时间。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. be more convenient：更方便</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Driving a car is more convenient.（开车更方便。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>9. have a greater impact on：对……有更大的影响</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：But has a greater impact on air pollution.（但对空气污染有</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>更大的影响。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>课后练习</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 造句练习：使用今天学到的固定搭配造句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- think about：I often think about my future.（我经常思考我的未来。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>the relationship between：There is a strong relationship between        exercise and health.（锻炼和健康之间有很强的关系。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>have a huge influence on：Books have a huge influence on my life.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（书籍对我的生活有巨大影响。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>make something convenient：The internet makes shopping very</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>convenient.（互联网使购物非常方便。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>limitations on：There are some limitations on the use of this software.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（这个软件有一些使用限制。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>spend time on：I spend a lot of time on my hobbies.（我在爱好上花</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>费了很多时间。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>contribution to：He made a significant contribution to the project.（他</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>对项目做出了重要贡献。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>have a positive or negative impact：This policy has a positive impact</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>on the economy.（这项政策对经济有积极影响。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>depend on：Success depends on hard work.（成功取决于努力工作。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>how to do something：I'm thinking about how to improve my English.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（我在想如何提高我的英语。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>have a preference for：She has a preference for sweet foods.（她偏爱</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>甜食。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>the connection with：I need to think about the connection with my</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>goals.（我需要考虑与我的目标的关联。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>consider your responsibility for：You should consider your</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>responsibility for the community.（你应该考虑你对社区的责任。）            - have different impacts on：Different diets have different impacts on health.（不同的饮食对健康有不同的影响。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>a lower demand of：This product has a lower demand of resources.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（这个产品对资源的需求更低。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>take more time：Learning a new language takes more time.（学习一</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>门新语言需要更多时间。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be more convenient：Online shopping is more convenient.（在线购</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>物更方便。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>have a greater impact on：Industrial pollution has a greater impact on</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>the environment.（工业污染对环境有更大的影响。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>---</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_科技和通勤_01", "moduleId": "p5_科技和通勤"}, {"title": "英文原文", "section": "英文原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>小牛说：\"I was just thinking about the relationship between technology and our daily lives. What do you think?\" 小马说：\"Well, I think it has a huge influence on us. It makes everything so convenient.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>True, but there are also some limitations on it, like people spending too much time on their phones. Yeah, and what about the contribution to the environment? Does it have a positive or negative impact? That's a good question. I think it depends on how we use it.\"</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小牛说：\"I'm thinking about how to go to work every day.\" 小马说：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>\"Well, you have many choices. Do you have a preference for any particular one?\" 小牛说：\"I'm not sure. I need to think about the connection with cost and convenience.\" 小马说：\"That's important. And you also have to consider your responsibility for the environment.\" 小牛说：\"Right. Different transportation methods have different impacts on the environment.\" 小马说：\"For example, taking a bus has a lower demand of personal cost, but might take more time. Yeah, and driving a car is more convenient, but has a greater impact on air pollution.\"</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_科技和通勤_02", "moduleId": "p5_科技和通勤"}, {"title": "搭配总结", "section": "搭配总结", "blocks": [{"type": "ol", "html": "<ol><li>think about：思考</li><li>the relationship between：……之间的关系</li><li>have a huge influence on：对……有巨大影响</li><li>make something convenient：使……方便</li><li>limitations on：对……的限制</li><li>spend time on：在……上花费时间</li><li>contribution to：对……的贡献</li><li>have a positive or negative impact：有积极或消极的影响</li><li>depend on：取决于</li><li>how to do something：如何做某事</li><li>have a preference for：对……有偏好</li><li>the connection with：与……的关联</li><li>consider your responsibility for：考虑你对……的责任</li><li>have different impacts on：对……有不同的影响</li><li>a lower demand of：对……有更低的需求</li><li>take more time：花费更多的时间</li><li>be more convenient：更方便</li><li>have a greater impact on：对……有更大的影响</li></ol>"}], "id": "a_p5_科技和通勤_03", "moduleId": "p5_科技和通勤"}]}, {"id": "p5_这外语得学呀", "code": "", "title": "这外语得学呀", "articles": [{"title": "故事精讲", "section": "故事精讲", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>故事精讲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第一段：学习外语的重要性</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>原文： <mark>Learning English</mark> <mark>has a significant importance to</mark> our lives.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. learning English：学英语</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Learning English is important.（学英语很重要。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. has a significant importance to：对……有重大意义</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Learning English has a significant importance to our lives.（学</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>英语对我们的生活有重大意义。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第二段：全球关系的加强</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>原文： <mark>The relationship to</mark> the global community <mark>is strengthened</mark> when we are proficient in English.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. the relationship to：与……的关系</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The relationship to the global community is very close.（与全   球社会的关系非常密切。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. be proficient in：对……精通</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He is proficient in several languages.（他精通几门语言。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. is strengthened：被加强</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The relationship is strengthened.（关系被加强。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第三段：学习外语的优势</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>原文： People who <mark>show a dedication to</mark> <mark>learning English</mark> often <mark>find more opportunities</mark>. It gives them an advantage over others in the job market.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. show a dedication to：对……展示出奉献</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He shows a dedication to his work.（他对工作非常奉献。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. find more opportunities：找到更多机会</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：People who learn English often find more opportunities.（学</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>习英语的人经常找到更多机会。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. have an advantage over：比……有优势</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Our product has an advantage over competitors.（我们的产品</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>比竞争对手有优势。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第四段：避免死记硬背</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>原文： However, some students <mark>rely too much on</mark> rote learning. This      method <mark>has its limitations</mark>.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. rely too much on：过于依赖</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Some students rely too much on rote learning.（一些学生过</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>于依赖死记硬背。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. have its limitations：有局限性</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：This method has its limitations.（这种方法有局限性。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第五段：积极学习的重要性</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>原文： We should <mark>have a commitment to</mark> active learning and <mark>improving our language skills</mark>.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. have a commitment to：致力于</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：We should have a commitment to active learning.（我们应该</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>致力于积极学习。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. improving our language skills：提高我们的语言技能</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Improving our language skills is important.（提高我们的语言</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>技能很重要。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第六段：实践优先于理论 原文： <mark>When it comes to</mark> language learning, practice should <mark>have priority over</mark> theory.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. when it comes to：当谈到……的时候</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：When it comes to sports, I like swimming best.（当谈到运动</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>时，我最喜欢游泳。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. have priority over：比……更优先</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Safety should have priority over speed.（安全应该比速度更</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>优先。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第七段：对不同口音和文化的敏感度 原文： <mark>Sensitivity to</mark> different accents and <mark>cultural aspects</mark> <mark>is also crucial</mark>.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. sensitivity to：对……敏感</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He has a sensitivity to criticism.（他对批评很敏感。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. cultural aspects：文化方面</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Cultural aspects are important.（文化方面很重要。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. is also crucial：也至关重要</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：This is also crucial.（这也至关重要。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第八段：持续进步的决心</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>原文： With <mark>a devotion to</mark> <mark>continuous improvement</mark>, we can <mark>master</mark> English and <mark>open up a world of possibilities</mark>.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. a devotion to：对……的奉献</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He has a devotion to his family.（他对家庭非常奉献。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. continuous improvement：持续进步</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Continuous improvement is important.（持续进步很重要。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. master English：掌握英语</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：We can master English.（我们可以掌握英语。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. open up a world of possibilities：开启无限可能</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Learning English can open up a world of possibilities.（学英</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>语可以开启无限可能。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>课后练习</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 造句练习：使用今天学到的固定搭配造句。            - learning English：Learning English is important.（学英语很重要。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- has a significant importance to：Learning English has a significant</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>importance to our lives.（学英语对我们的生活有重大意义。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>the relationship to：The relationship to the global community is very</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>close.（与全球社会的关系非常密切。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be proficient in：He is proficient in several languages.（他精通几门</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>语言。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>is strengthened：The relationship is strengthened.（关系被加强。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>show a dedication to：He shows a dedication to his work.（他对工作</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>非常奉献。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>find more opportunities：People who learn English often find more</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>opportunities.（学习英语的人经常找到更多机会。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>have an advantage over：Our product has an advantage over</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>competitors.（我们的产品比竞争对手有优势。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>rely too much on：Some students rely too much on rote learning.（一</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>些学生过于依赖死记硬背。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>have its limitations：This method has its limitations.（这种方法有局</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>限性。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>have a commitment to：We should have a commitment to active</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>learning.（我们应该致力于积极学习。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>improving our language skills：Improving our language skills is</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>important.（提高我们的语言技能很重要。）            - when it comes to：When it comes to sports, I like swimming best.（当谈到运动时，我最喜欢游泳。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>have priority over：Safety should have priority over speed.（安全应</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>该比速度更优先。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>sensitivity to：He has a sensitivity to criticism.（他对批评很敏感。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>cultural aspects：Cultural aspects are important.（文化方面很重要。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>is also crucial：This is also crucial.（这也至关重要。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>a devotion to：He has a devotion to his family.（他对家庭非常奉献。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>continuous improvement：Continuous improvement is important.（持</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>续进步很重要。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>master English：We can master English.（我们可以掌握英语。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>open up a world of possibilities：Learning English can open up a</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>world of possibilities.（学英语可以开启无限可能。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>---</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_这外语得学呀_01", "moduleId": "p5_这外语得学呀"}, {"title": "英文原文", "section": "英文原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>Learning English has a significant importance to our lives.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The relationship to the global community is strengthened when we are proficient in English.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>People who show a dedication to learning English often find more opportunities. It gives them an advantage over others in the job market.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>However, some students rely too much on rote learning. This      method has its limitations.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>We should have a commitment to active learning and improving our language skills.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>When it comes to language learning, practice should have priority over theory.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Sensitivity to different accents and cultural aspects is also crucial.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>With a devotion to continuous improvement, we can master English and open up a world of possibilities.</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_这外语得学呀_02", "moduleId": "p5_这外语得学呀"}, {"title": "搭配总结", "section": "搭配总结", "blocks": [{"type": "ol", "html": "<ol><li>learning English：学英语</li><li>has a significant importance to：对……有重大意义</li><li>the relationship to：与……的关系</li><li>be proficient in：对……精通</li><li>is strengthened：被加强</li><li>show a dedication to：对……展示出奉献</li><li>find more opportunities：找到更多机会</li><li>have an advantage over：比……有优势</li><li>rely too much on：过于依赖</li><li>have its limitations：有局限性</li><li>have a commitment to：致力于</li><li>improving our language skills：提高我们的语言技能</li><li>when it comes to：当谈到……的时候</li><li>have priority over：比……更优先</li><li>sensitivity to：对……敏感</li><li>cultural aspects：文化方面</li><li>is also crucial：也至关重要</li><li>a devotion to：对……的奉献</li><li>continuous improvement：持续进步</li><li>master English：掌握英语</li><li>open up a world of possibilities：开启无限可能</li></ol>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>外刊——特殊固定搭配（一）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>故事精讲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第一段：着眼于某事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>原文： <mark>With an eye to</mark> the future, they are making <mark>long-term plans</mark>.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. with an eye to：着眼于，考虑到</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：With an eye to the future, they are making long-term plans.（着</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>眼于未来，他们正在制定长期计划。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. long-term plans：长期计划</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：They are making long-term plans.（他们正在制定长期计划。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. make plans：制定计划</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：We need to make plans.（我们需要制定计划。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第二段：存钱买房子</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>原文： She saves <mark>with an eye to</mark> <mark>buying a house</mark>.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>固定搭配：        1. save：存钱</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：She saves money.（她存钱。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. buying a house：买房子</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：She is saving with an eye to buying a house.（她存钱是为了</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>买房子。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第三段：城市规划中的建议</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>原文： In the article about <mark>urban planning</mark>, the author <mark>suggests</mark> that new infrastructure projects should <mark>be developed with an eye to</mark> sustainable development and <mark>environmental protection</mark>.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. urban planning：城市规划</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The article is about urban planning.（文章是关于城市规划的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. suggest：建议</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The author suggests that we should do this.（作者建议我们做</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>这件事。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. be developed with an eye to：被开发以着眼于</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：New infrastructure projects should be developed with an eye to</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>sustainable development.（新的基础设施项目应该被开发以着眼于可持续发展。）        4. sustainable development：可持续发展</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Sustainable development is important.（可持续发展很重要。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. environmental protection：环境保护</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Environmental protection is crucial.（环境保护至关重要。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第四段：如果发生某事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>原文： <mark>In the event of</mark> bad weather, the outdoor events will be <mark>postponed</mark>.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. in the event of：如果发生，万一</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：In the event of an emergency, call me.（如果发生紧急情况，</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>给我打电话。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. postpone：推迟</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The meeting was postponed.（会议被推迟了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第五段：濒临某事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>原文： He is <mark>on the verge of</mark> tears.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. on the verge of：濒临，接近于</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He is on the verge of tears.（他快要哭了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. verge：边缘            - 例句：The project is on the verge of completion.（这个项目接近完</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>成了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第六段：与某事保持联系</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>原文： I <mark>keep in touch with</mark> my friends.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. in touch with：与……保持联系</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：I keep in touch with my friends.（我与朋友保持联系。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. keep in touch with：保持联系</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：We should keep in touch with our family.（我们应该与家人</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>保持联系。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. get in touch with：与……取得联系</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：We need to get in touch with the teacher.（我们需要与老师</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>取得联系。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第七段：关于某事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>原文： <mark>With regard to</mark> the <mark>trade negotiations</mark> between the two countries, there are still many <mark>uncertainties</mark>.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. with regard to：关于</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：With regard to your question, I'll answer later.（关于你的问</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>题，我稍后回答。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. trade negotiations：贸易谈判</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Trade negotiations are ongoing.（贸易谈判正在进行。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. uncertainty：不确定性</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：There are many uncertainties.（存在许多不确定性。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第八段：在某领域</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>原文： <mark>In the field of</mark> environmental science, the issue of <mark>climate change</mark> has become a <mark>major concern</mark> for researchers and policymakers alike.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. in the field of：在……领域</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：In the field of medicine, he is an expert.（在医学领域，他是</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>专家。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. climate change：气候变化</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Climate change is a major issue.（气候变化是一个主要问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. major concern：主要问题</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：This is a major concern.（这是一个主要问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第九段：紧跟某事之后</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>原文： <mark>In the wake of</mark> the storm, there was a lot of <mark>damage</mark>.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. in the wake of：紧跟……之后</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：In the wake of the storm, there was a lot of damage.（风暴过</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>后，有很多地方遭到了破坏。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. damage：破坏</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The storm caused a lot of damage.（风暴造成了很多破坏。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>课后练习</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 造句练习：使用今天学到的固定搭配造句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- with an eye to：With an eye to the future, they are making long-term</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>plans.（着眼于未来，他们正在制定长期计划。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>long-term plans：They are making long-term plans.（他们正在制定</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>长期计划。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>make plans：We need to make plans.（我们需要制定计划。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>save：She saves money.（她存钱。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>buying a house：She is saving with an eye to buying a house.（她存   钱是为了买房子。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>urban planning：The article is about urban planning.（文章是关于城</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>市规划的。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>suggest：The author suggests that we should do this.（作者建议我们</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>做这件事。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be developed with an eye to：New infrastructure projects should be</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>developed with an eye to sustainable development.（新的基础设施项目应该被开发以着眼于可持续发展。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>sustainable development：Sustainable development is important.（可</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>持续发展很重要。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>environmental protection：Environmental protection is crucial.（环境</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>保护至关重要。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>in the event of：In the event of an emergency, call me.（如果发生紧</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>急情况，给我打电话。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>postpone：The meeting was postponed.（会议被推迟了。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>on the verge of：He is on the verge of tears.（他快要哭了。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>verge：The project is on the verge of completion.（这个项目接近完</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>成了。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>in touch with：I keep in touch with my friends.（我与朋友保持联系。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>keep in touch with：We should keep in touch with our family.（我们</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>应该与家人保持联系。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>get in touch with：We need to get in touch with the teacher.（我们需   要与老师取得联系。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>with regard to：With regard to your question, I'll answer later.（关于</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>你的问题，我稍后回答。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>trade negotiations：Trade negotiations are ongoing.（贸易谈判正在</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>进行。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>uncertainty：There are many uncertainties.（存在许多不确定性。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>in the field of：In the field of medicine, he is an expert.（在医学领域，</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>他是专家。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>climate change：Climate change is a major issue.（气候变化是一个</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>主要问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>major concern：This is a major concern.（这是一个主要问题。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>in the wake of：In the wake of the storm, there was a lot of damage.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（风暴过后，有很多地方遭到了破坏。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>damage：The storm caused a lot of damage.（风暴造成了很多破坏。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>---</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_这外语得学呀_03", "moduleId": "p5_这外语得学呀"}]}, {"id": "p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_一", "code": "", "title": "外刊——特殊固定搭配（一）", "articles": [{"title": "英文原文", "section": "英文原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>With an eye to the future, they are making long-term plans.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She saves with an eye to buying a house.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>固定搭配：        1. save：存钱</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>In the article about urban planning, the author suggests that new infrastructure projects should be developed with an eye to sustainable development and environmental protection.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>In the event of bad weather, the outdoor events will be postponed.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He is on the verge of tears.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I keep in touch with my friends.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>With regard to the trade negotiations between the two countries, there are still many uncertainties.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>In the field of environmental science, the issue of climate change has become a major concern for researchers and policymakers alike.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>In the wake of the storm, there was a lot of damage.</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_一_01", "moduleId": "p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_一"}, {"title": "搭配总结", "section": "搭配总结", "blocks": [{"type": "ol", "html": "<ol><li>with an eye to：着眼于，考虑到</li><li>long-term plans：长期计划</li><li>make plans：制定计划</li><li>buying a house：买房子</li><li>urban planning：城市规划</li><li>suggest：建议</li><li>be developed with an eye to：被开发以着眼于</li><li>environmental protection：环境保护</li><li>in the event of：如果发生，万一</li><li>postpone：推迟</li><li>on the verge of：濒临，接近于</li><li>verge：边缘</li><li>in touch with：与……保持联系</li><li>keep in touch with：保持联系</li><li>get in touch with：与……取得联系</li><li>with regard to：关于</li><li>trade negotiations：贸易谈判</li><li>uncertainty：不确定性</li><li>in the field of：在……领域</li><li>climate change：气候变化</li><li>major concern：主要问题</li><li>in the wake of：紧跟……之后</li><li>damage：破坏</li></ol>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>外刊——特殊固定搭配（二）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>故事精讲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第一段：追求梦想</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>原文： Many young people work hard day and night <mark>in pursuit of</mark> their <mark>dreams of a better life</mark>.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. in pursuit of：追求</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He is in pursuit of his dreams.（他在追求他的梦想。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. dreams of a better life：更美好生活的梦想</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Many people work hard in pursuit of a better life.（许多人努</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>力工作以追求更美好的生活。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第二段：基于理由</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>原文： He was fired <mark>on the grounds of</mark> negligence.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. on the grounds of：基于……的理由</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：He was fired on the grounds of negligence.（他因疏忽被解雇。）        2. negligence：疏忽</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>例句：The accident was caused by negligence.（事故是由疏忽引起</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第三段：在……之中</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>原文： <mark>In the midst of</mark> the <mark>economic downturn</mark>, many companies are struggling to survive.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. in the midst of：在……之中</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：In the midst of the economic downturn, many companies are</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>struggling to survive.（在经济衰退中，许多公司都在艰难求生。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. economic downturn：经济衰退</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The economic downturn has affected many industries.（经济</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>衰退影响了许多行业。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第四段：受……支配</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>原文： Travelers in remote areas are <mark>at the mercy of</mark> the weather.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. at the mercy of：受……支配</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Farmers are sometimes at the mercy of natural disasters.（农</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>民有时受自然灾害的支配。）        2. natural disasters：自然灾害</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>例句：Natural disasters can cause significant damage.（自然灾害可</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>能造成重大破坏。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第五段：基于……</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>原文： The theory is constructed <mark>on the basis of</mark> <mark>solid evidence</mark>.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. on the basis of：基于</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The decision was made on the basis of extensive research.（这</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>个决定是基于广泛的研究做出的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. solid evidence：可靠的证据</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：The case was solved based on solid evidence.（这个案件是基</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>于可靠的证据解决的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第六段：在……背景下</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>原文： <mark>In the context of</mark> global warming, people's values are also changing.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. in the context of：在……背景下</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：In the context of social transformation, people's values are</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>changing.（在社会转型的背景下，人们的价值观也在变化。）        2. global warming：全球变暖</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>例句：Global warming is a major environmental issue.（全球变暖是</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>一个主要的环境问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第七段：追求新发现</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>原文： Scientists are <mark>in quest of</mark> <mark>new discoveries</mark>.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. in quest of：追求</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Scientists are in quest of new discoveries.（科学家们在追求</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>新的发现。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. new discoveries：新发现</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- 例句：Researchers are in quest of new solutions.（研究人员在追求</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>新的解决方案。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>课后练习</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 造句练习：使用今天学到的固定搭配造句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- in pursuit of：He is in pursuit of his dreams.（他在追求他的梦想。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>dreams of a better life：Many people work hard in pursuit of a better</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>life.（许多人努力工作以追求更美好的生活。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>on the grounds of：He was fired on the grounds of negligence.（他因</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>疏忽被解雇。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>negligence：The accident was caused by negligence.（事故是由疏忽</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>引起的。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>in the midst of：In the midst of the economic downturn, many</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>companies are struggling to survive.（在经济衰退中，许多公司都在艰难求生。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>economic downturn：The economic downturn has affected many</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>industries.（经济衰退影响了许多行业。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>at the mercy of：Farmers are sometimes at the mercy of natural</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>disasters.（农民有时受自然灾害的支配。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>natural disasters：Natural disasters can cause significant damage.（自</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>然灾害可能造成重大破坏。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>on the basis of：The decision was made on the basis of extensive    research.（这个决定是基于广泛的研究做出的。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>solid evidence：The case was solved based on solid evidence.（这个</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>案件是基于可靠的证据解决的。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>in the context of：In the context of social transformation, people's</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>values are changing.（在社会转型的背景下，人们的价值观也在变化。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>global warming：Global warming is a major environmental issue.（全</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>球变暖是一个主要的环境问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>in quest of：Scientists are in quest of new discoveries.（科学家们在</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>追求新的发现。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>new discoveries：Researchers are in quest of new solutions.（研究人</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>员在追求新的解决方案。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>---</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_一_02", "moduleId": "p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_一"}]}, {"id": "p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_二", "code": "", "title": "外刊——特殊固定搭配（二）", "articles": [{"title": "英文原文", "section": "英文原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>Many young people work hard day and night in pursuit of their dreams of a better life.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He was fired on the grounds of negligence.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>In the midst of the economic downturn, many companies are struggling to survive.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Travelers in remote areas are at the mercy of the weather.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The theory is constructed on the basis of solid evidence.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>In the context of global warming, people's values are also changing.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Scientists are in quest of new discoveries.</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_二_01", "moduleId": "p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_二"}, {"title": "搭配总结", "section": "搭配总结", "blocks": [{"type": "ol", "html": "<ol><li>in pursuit of：追求</li><li>dreams of a better life：更美好生活的梦想</li><li>on the grounds of：基于……的理由</li><li>in the midst of：在……之中</li><li>economic downturn：经济衰退</li><li>at the mercy of：受……支配</li><li>on the basis of：基于</li><li>solid evidence：可靠的证据</li><li>in the context of：在……背景下</li><li>in quest of：追求</li><li>new discoveries：新发现</li></ol>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>外刊——特殊固定搭配（三）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>故事精讲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第一段：与……和谐共处</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The design should be in harmony with the surrounding environment.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>in harmony with：与……和谐共处例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>We should strive to be in harmony with nature.（我们应该努力与自然</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>和谐共处。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>surrounding environment：周围环境例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>The surrounding environment has a significant impact on our well-being.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（周围环境对我们的福祉有重要影响。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第二段：凭借……</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She won the award by virtue of her outstanding performance.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>by virtue of：凭借…… 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He succeeded by virtue of hard work.（他凭借努力工作成功了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>outstanding performance：出色的表现例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>Her outstanding performance earned her a promotion.（她出色的表现为</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>她赢得了晋升。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第三段：因为……</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The flight was delayed on account of bad weather conditions.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>on account of：因为…… 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>We postponed the meeting on account of his absence.（由于他缺席，我</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>们推迟了会议。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>bad weather conditions：恶劣的天气条件</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>Bad weather conditions can cause flight delays.（恶劣的天气条件可能   导致航班延误。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第四段：以……的名义</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>In the name of justice, the lawyer fought for the rights of the clients.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>in the name of：以……的名义例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>They donated in the name of charity.（他们以慈善的名义捐款。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">justice：正义例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>In the name of justice, the court ruled in favor of the victim.（以正义的</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>名义，法庭做出了有利于受害者的裁决。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第五段：通过……的方式</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Scientists have developed a new material by means of advanced technology.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>by means of：通过……的方式   例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>We communicate by means of language.（我们通过语言进行交流。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>advanced technology：先进技术例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>Advanced technology has transformed many industries.（先进技术已经</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>改变了众多行业。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第六段：除了……之外</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>With the exception of John, everyone attended the meeting.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>with the exception of：除了……之外例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>With the exception of a few minor details, the plan is perfect.（除了几个</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>小细节之外，这个计划很完美。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>attend the meeting：参加会议例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>All employees are required to attend the meeting.（所有员工都被要求</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>参加会议。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">第七段：鉴于…… 原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>In view of the limited time, we need to work efficiently.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>in view of：鉴于…… 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>In view of his illness, he took a rest.（鉴于他生病了，他休息了一下。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>limited time：有限的时间例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>In view of the limited time, we must prioritize our tasks.（鉴于时间有限， 我们必须优先处理任务。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第八段：在……方面</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>In terms of quality, this brand is reliable.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>in terms of：在……方面例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>In terms of price, this product is affordable.（在价格方面，这个产品是</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>负担得起的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>reliable：可靠的例句：         - This brand is reliable in terms of durability.（这个品牌在耐用性方面是可靠的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>课后练习</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 造句练习：使用今天学到的固定搭配造句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- in harmony with：We should strive to be in harmony with nature.（我</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>们应该努力与自然和谐共处。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>by virtue of：He succeeded by virtue of hard work.（他凭借努力工</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>作成功了。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>on account of：We postponed the meeting on account of his absence.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（由于他缺席，我们推迟了会议。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>in the name of：They donated in the name of charity.（他们以慈善的</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>名义捐款。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>by means of：We communicate by means of language.（我们通过语</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>言进行交流。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>with the exception of：With the exception of a few minor details, the</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>plan is perfect.（除了几个小细节之外，这个计划很完美。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>in view of：In view of his illness, he took a rest.（鉴于他生病了，他</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>休息了一下。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>in terms of：In terms of price, this product is affordable.（在价格方</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>面，这个产品是负担得起的。)</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>---</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_二_02", "moduleId": "p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_二"}]}, {"id": "p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_三", "code": "", "title": "外刊——特殊固定搭配（三）", "articles": [{"title": "英文原文", "section": "英文原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>The design should be in harmony with the surrounding environment.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She won the award by virtue of her outstanding performance.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The flight was delayed on account of bad weather conditions.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>In the name of justice, the lawyer fought for the rights of the clients.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Scientists have developed a new material by means of advanced technology.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>With the exception of John, everyone attended the meeting.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>In view of the limited time, we need to work efficiently.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>In terms of quality, this brand is reliable.</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_三_01", "moduleId": "p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_三"}, {"title": "搭配总结", "section": "搭配总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>（本篇无独立固定搭配词条）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>外刊——特殊固定搭配（四）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>故事精讲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第一段：紧跟潮流</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He is always in the swim and knows all the latest trends.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>in the swim：紧跟潮流，积极参与例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>She is always in the swim and knows all the latest trends.（她总是很时</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>髦，知道所有的最新潮流。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>latest trends：最新潮流例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>In the fast-paced world of technology, those who are constantly learning</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>and experimenting are always in the swim, while others risk being left behind.（在快速发展的科技世界中，那些不断学习和尝试的人总是紧跟潮流，而其他人则有落后的风险。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">第二段：谈本行 原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>They always talk shop when they get together.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>talk shop：谈本行，说行话例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>The group of engineers would frequently meet in the cafeteria and talk</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>shop about their ongoing projects.（这群工程师会经常在自助餐厅碰面， 谈论他们正在进行的项目。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>get together：聚在一起例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>They always talk shop when they get together.（他们聚在一起时，总</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>是谈本行的工作。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第三段：假钞</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p><mark>Be careful of</mark> funny money.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>funny money：假钞，来路不明的钱例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>The police are cracking down on the circulation of funny money in the    city.（警方正在打击城市中假钞的流通。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>crack down on：打击例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>Because the use of counterfeit currency has been on the rise recently,</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>the police have launched a campaign to crack down on it.（由于最近假钞的使用呈上升趋势，警方已发起打击行动。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第四段：切题</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>His answer was to the point.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>to the point：切题，中肯例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>The professor's comments were always to the point.（教授的评论总是</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>很切题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">argument：论点例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>The argument in the article is to the point.（文章中的论点很切题。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">第五段：不知所措 原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He was at a loss when faced with the difficult question.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>at a loss：不知所措，困惑例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>I was at a loss what to do next.（我不知道接下来该做什么。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">faced with：面对例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>When faced with a difficult decision, he always seeks advice from others.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（面对困难的决定时，他总是向他人寻求建议。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第六段：发生</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Many changes have taken place in recent years.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>take place：发生，举行例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>The meeting will take place tomorrow.（会议将在明天举行。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>recent years：近年来例句：         - In recent years, many changes have taken place in our city.（近年来， 我们的城市发生了许多变化。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第七段：钻研</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He had to study up on the local history before his trip.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>study up on：钻研，为……做专门研究例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>He needs to study up for the exam.（他需要为考试而钻研。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>local history：当地历史例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>Before visiting the museum, she studied up on the local history.（在参观</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>博物馆之前，她对当地历史进行了专门研究。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第八段：勉勉强强</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She plays the piano after a fashion.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>after a fashion：勉勉强强，马马虎虎例句：         - He can play the piano after a fashion, but not as well as a professional.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（他勉勉强强会弹钢琴，但不如专业人士。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>professional：专业人士例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>After a fashion, she managed to complete the task, but it wasn't perfect.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（她勉勉强强完成了任务，但并不完美。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第九段：绝密</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The plan for the surprise party was supposed to be a dead secret, but somehow word got out.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>a dead secret：绝密例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>The details of the project were supposed to be a dead secret, but</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>someone leaked them.（项目细节本应是绝密的，但有人泄露了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>word got out：消息泄露例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>Despite efforts to keep it a dead secret, word got out about the surprise</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>party.（尽管努力保密，但惊喜派对的消息还是泄露了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第十段：匆忙</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>In modern society, people often have to make decisions on the fly.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>on the fly：匆忙中，即时地例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>He made a decision on the fly.（他匆忙做了一个决定。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>modern society：现代社会例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>In modern society, people often have to make decisions on the fly.（在现</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>代社会，人们常常不得不匆忙做出决定。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>课后练习</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 造句练习：使用今天学到的固定搭配造句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- in the swim：She is always in the swim and knows all the latest trends.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（她总是很时髦，知道所有的最新潮流。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>talk shop：They always talk shop when they get together.（他们聚在</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>一起时，总是谈本行的工作。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>funny money：Be careful of funny money.（小心假钞。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>to the point：His answer was to the point.（他的回答很切题。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>at a loss：I was at a loss what to do next.（我不知道接下来该做什么。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>take place：The meeting will take place tomorrow.（会议将在明天举</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>行。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>study up on：He needs to study up for the exam.（他需要为考试而</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>钻研。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>after a fashion：He can play the piano after a fashion, but not as well</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>as a professional.（他勉勉强强会弹钢琴，但不如专业人士。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>a dead secret：The details of the project were supposed to be a dead</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>secret, but someone leaked them.（项目细节本应是绝密的，但有人泄露了。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>on the fly：He made a decision on the fly.（他匆忙做了一个决定。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>---</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_三_02", "moduleId": "p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_三"}]}, {"id": "p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_四", "code": "", "title": "外刊——特殊固定搭配（四）", "articles": [{"title": "英文原文", "section": "英文原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>He is always in the swim and knows all the latest trends.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>They always talk shop when they get together.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Be careful of funny money.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>His answer was to the point.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He was at a loss when faced with the difficult question.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Many changes have taken place in recent years.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He had to study up on the local history before his trip.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She plays the piano after a fashion.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The plan for the surprise party was supposed to be a dead secret, but somehow word got out.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>In modern society, people often have to make decisions on the fly.</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_四_01", "moduleId": "p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_四"}, {"title": "搭配总结", "section": "搭配总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>（本篇无独立固定搭配词条）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>外刊——特殊固定搭配（五）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>故事精讲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第一段：按规则办事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She always does everything by the book.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>by the book：按规则办事，照章办事例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>In the workplace, it's important to follow procedures by the book.（在工</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>作场所，按照规则办事非常重要。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>follow procedures：遵循程序例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>The manager expects all employees to conduct business by the book.（经</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>理希望所有员工都照章办事。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第二段：陷入困境</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Their relationship is on the rocks after that argument.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>on the rocks：陷入困境，濒于破裂例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>The company's finances are on the rocks, and they need to find a</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>solution quickly.（公司的财务陷入了困境，需要尽快找到解决办法。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">argument：争吵例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>After the argument, their relationship is on the rocks.（争吵之后，他们</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>的关系濒于破裂。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第三段：胜券在握</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Once he crossed that hurdle, he knew he was home free.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>home free：胜券在握，轻易完成例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>After finishing the difficult part of the exam, he felt home free.（完成考</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>试的难点部分之后，他觉得自己胜券在握。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>hurdle：障碍例句：         - Once he crossed that hurdle, he knew he was home free.（跨过那个障碍后，他知道胜券在握。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第四段：说得通</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>These numbers don't add up.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>add up：加起来，说得通例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>His story doesn't add up, so we are suspicious.（他的说法说不通，因此</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我们很怀疑。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>suspicious：怀疑的例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>The evidence just doesn't add up.（证据不合理。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第五段：亏损</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The business is in the red this year.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>in the red：亏损例句：         - Many companies are in the red due to the economic downturn.（由于经济衰退，许多公司都处于亏损状态。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>economic downturn：经济衰退例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>The business is in the red this year.（这家公司今年亏损了。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第六段：逍遥法外</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The criminal is still at large, and the police are searching for him.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>at large：逍遥法外，未被捕例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>The criminal is still at large, and the police are searching for him.（罪犯</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>仍在逍遥法外，警方正在搜捕他。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">search for：搜寻例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>The public at large is concerned about the issue.（公众普遍关心这个问</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第七段：恢复元气</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>原文： After a short break, he got his second wind and continued working.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>second wind：恢复元气，重获精力例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>During the marathon, she found her second wind and sped up.（在马拉</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>松比赛中，她恢复了体力并加快了速度。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">speed up：加速例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>After a short break, he got his second wind and continued working.（短</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>暂休息后，他恢复了精力并继续工作。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第八段：机灵敏锐</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She is always on the ball and catches every detail.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>on the ball：机灵敏锐，能干例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>In this job, you need to be on the ball to handle unexpected situations.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（在这份工作中，你需要机灵才能应对意外情况。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>handle unexpected situations：应对意外情况例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>She is always on the ball and catches every detail.（她总是很机灵，能</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>注意到每一个细节。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第九段：昼夜不停</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The hospital staff work around the clock to save lives.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>around the clock：昼夜不停，夜以继日例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>The factory operates around the clock to meet the demand.（工厂昼夜不</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>停地运转以满足需求。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>meet the demand：满足需求例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>The hospital staff work around the clock to save lives.（医院工作人员</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>昼夜不停工作以拯救生命。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第十段：战胜，克服</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He tried hard not to let his fear <mark>get the better of</mark> him.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>get the better of：战胜，克服，占上风例句：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>In the end, his determination got the better of the difficulties.（最终，他</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>的决心战胜了困难。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>determination：决心例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-He tried hard not to let his fear get the better of him.（他努力不让恐惧战胜自己。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>课后练习</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 造句练习：使用今天学到的固定搭配造句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- by the book：In the workplace, it's important to follow procedures by</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>the book.（在工作场所，按照规则办事非常重要。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>on the rocks：The company's finances are on the rocks, and they need</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>to find a solution quickly.（公司的财务陷入了困境，需要尽快找到解决办法。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>home free：After finishing the difficult part of the exam, he felt home</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>free.（完成考试的难点部分之后，他觉得自己胜券在握。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>add up：His story doesn't add up, so we are suspicious.（他的说法说</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>不通，因此我们很怀疑。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>in the red：Many companies are in the red due to the economic</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>downturn.（由于经济衰退，许多公司都处于亏损状态。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>at large：The criminal is still at large, and the police are searching for</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>him.（罪犯仍在逍遥法外，警方正在搜捕他。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>second wind：During the marathon, she found her second wind and</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>sped up.（在马拉松比赛中，她恢复了体力并加快了速度。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>on the ball：In this job, you need to be on the ball to handle</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>unexpected situations.（在这份工作中，你需要机灵才能应对意外情况。）            - around the clock：The factory operates around the clock to meet the demand.（工厂昼夜不停地运转以满足需求。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>get the better of：In the end, his determination got the better of the</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>difficulties.（最终，他的决心战胜了困难。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>---</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_四_02", "moduleId": "p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_四"}]}, {"id": "p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_五", "code": "", "title": "外刊——特殊固定搭配（五）", "articles": [{"title": "英文原文", "section": "英文原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>She always does everything by the book.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Their relationship is on the rocks after that argument.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Once he crossed that hurdle, he knew he was home free.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>These numbers don't add up.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The business is in the red this year.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The criminal is still at large, and the police are searching for him.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>After a short break, he got his second wind and continued working.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She is always on the ball and catches every detail.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The hospital staff work around the clock to save lives.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He tried hard not to let his fear get the better of him.</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_五_01", "moduleId": "p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_五"}, {"title": "搭配总结", "section": "搭配总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>（本篇无独立固定搭配词条）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>外刊——特殊固定搭配（六）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>故事精讲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第一段：勇敢面对困难</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He bit the bullet and faced the bully.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>bite the bullet：勇敢面对困难例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-He decided to bite the bullet and take on the challenging project.（他决定勇敢面对困难，承担这个具有挑战性的项目。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>bully：恶霸（名词）/ 欺负（动词）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-He bit the bullet and faced the bully.（他勇敢面对，向恶霸发起挑战。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第二段：发泄情绪</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She blew off steam by dancing wildly.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>blow off steam：发泄情绪例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-After a stressful day at work, he went to the gym to blow off steam.（在紧张的一天工作之后，他去健身房发泄情绪。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>stressful：压力大的例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-My job is very stressful, but I manage to stay calm.（我的工作压力很大， 但我设法保持冷静。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第三段：熬夜工作</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He burned the midnight oil for his dream.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>burn the midnight oil：熬夜工作例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-To meet the deadline, she burned the midnight oil for several days.（为了赶上截止日期，她连续几天熬夜工作。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>midnight：午夜例句：      -He burned the midnight oil to finish his report.（他熬夜完成了报告。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第四段：走捷径</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Don't cut corners on safety.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>cut corners：走捷径（常有负面含义）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-He cut corners when making a cake, and it didn't taste good.（他在做蛋糕时走了捷径，结果蛋糕不好吃。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>cut corners on something：在某事上走捷径例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-Don't cut corners on safety.（不要在安全问题上走捷径。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第五段：感到紧张或害怕</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She got cold feet before the big jump.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>get cold feet：感到紧张或害怕例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-She was going to sing on stage but got cold feet at the last minute.（她本   要在舞台上唱歌，但在最后一刻害怕了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>at the last minute：在最后一刻例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-He almost got cold feet before the interview but managed to calm down.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（他在面试前几乎害怕了，但设法平静下来。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第六段：错过机会</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He missed the boat on that amazing deal.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>miss the boat：错过机会例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-If you don't apply for that job now, you will miss the boat.（如果你现在不申请那份工作，你会错过这个机会。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">deal：交易例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-He missed the boat on the investment opportunity.（他错过了投资机会。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第七段：处于危险境地</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He's on thin ice with his girlfriend.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>on thin ice：处于危险或不确定的境地（如履薄冰）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-I'm on thin ice with my roommate after using her stuff without asking.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（未经允许用了室友的东西之后，我跟她关系如履薄冰。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">roommate：室友例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-He's on thin ice with his boss after making a mistake.（犯错之后，他与老板的关系如履薄冰。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第八段：脱离困境</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Finally, we are out of the woods and free.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>out of the woods：脱离困境例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-After a long struggle, they emerged from the darkness and realized they were out of the woods at last.（经过漫长的挣扎，他们从黑暗中走出来， 终于意识到自己脱离了困境。）     struggle：挣扎（动词）/ 斗争（名词）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-He struggled to find a job but finally succeeded.（他努力找工作，最终成功了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第九段：领会言外之意</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You need to read between the lines to understand his real intentions.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>read between the lines：领会言外之意例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-As she read the letter, she tried to read between the lines to understand the hidden message.（她读信时，试图领会言外之意，理解隐藏的信息。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>hidden message：隐藏的信息例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-Sometimes you need to read between the lines to grasp the true meaning.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（有时你需要领会言外之意，才能理解真正的含义。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第十段：唤起记忆</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>原文： The place she mentioned doesn't ring a bell for me.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>ring a bell：唤起记忆，听起来熟悉例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-Does this name ring a bell?（这个名字听起来熟悉吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>hidden message：隐藏的信息例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-The place she mentioned doesn't ring a bell for me.（她提到的这个地方我一点儿也想不起来。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第十一段：改期</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Can I take a rain check on that date? 固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>take a rain check：改期例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-She had to take a rain check on the fun event as unexpected work popped up.（由于意外的工作，她不得不把那个有趣的活动改期。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>pop up：突然出现例句：      -Can I take a rain check on that date?（我可以把那个约会改期吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第十二段：放弃</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Don't throw in the towel so soon.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>throw in the towel：放弃，认输例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-As the challenges piled up, he was tempted to throw in the towel, but he remembered his dreams and kept going.（当挑战不断增加时，他很想放弃，但他想起了自己的梦想，于是继续坚持。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">pile up：不断增加例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-Don't throw in the towel so soon.（不要这么快就放弃。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第十三段：改过自新</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He promised to turn over a new leaf and be more responsible.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>turn over a new leaf：改过自新例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-He decided to turn over a new leaf and focus on his studies.（他决定改过自新，专注于学习。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>responsible：有责任心的例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-He promised to turn over a new leaf and be more responsible.（他承诺会改过自新，变得更负责任。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>课后练习</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 造句练习：使用今天学到的固定搭配造句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- bite the bullet：He decided to bite the bullet and take on the</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>challenging project.（他决定勇敢面对困难，承担这个具有挑战性的项目。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>blow off steam：After a stressful day at work, he went to the gym to</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>blow off steam.（在紧张的一天工作之后，他去健身房发泄情绪。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>burn the midnight oil：He burned the midnight oil to finish his report.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（他熬夜完成了报告。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>cut corners：Don't cut corners on safety.（不要在安全问题上走捷径。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>get cold feet：She got cold feet before the big jump.（她在大跳跃前</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>感到紧张害怕。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>miss the boat：If you don't apply for that job now, you will miss the</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>boat.（如果你现在不申请那份工作，你会错过这个机会。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>on thin ice：He's on thin ice with his girlfriend.（他和女朋友的关系</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>如履薄冰。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>out of the woods：Finally, we are out of the woods and free.（我们终</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>于脱离了困境，获得了自由。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>read between the lines：You need to read between the lines to       understand his real intentions.（你需要领会言外之意，才能理解他的真</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>正意图。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>ring a bell：The place she mentioned doesn't ring a bell for me.（她提</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>到的这个地方我一点儿也想不起来。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>take a rain check：Can I take a rain check on that date?（我可以把那</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>个约会改期吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>throw in the towel：Don't throw in the towel so soon.（不要这么快就</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>放弃。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>turn over a new leaf：He decided to turn over a new leaf and focus on</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>his studies.（他决定改过自新，专注于学习。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>---</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_五_02", "moduleId": "p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_五"}]}, {"id": "p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_六", "code": "", "title": "外刊——特殊固定搭配（六）", "articles": [{"title": "英文原文", "section": "英文原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>He bit the bullet and faced the bully.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She blew off steam by dancing wildly.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He burned the midnight oil for his dream.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Don't cut corners on safety.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She got cold feet before the big jump.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He missed the boat on that amazing deal.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He's on thin ice with his girlfriend.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Finally, we are out of the woods and free.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You need to read between the lines to understand his real intentions.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The place she mentioned doesn't ring a bell for me.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Can I take a rain check on that date? 固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>take a rain check：改期例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-She had to take a rain check on the fun event as unexpected work popped up.（由于意外的工作，她不得不把那个有趣的活动改期。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>pop up：突然出现例句：      -Can I take a rain check on that date?（我可以把那个约会改期吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Don't throw in the towel so soon.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He promised to turn over a new leaf and be more responsible.</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_六_01", "moduleId": "p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_六"}, {"title": "搭配总结", "section": "搭配总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>（本篇无独立固定搭配词条）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>外刊——特殊固定搭配（七）习语</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>故事精讲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第一段：掌上明珠</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She is the apple of her father's eye.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>apple of one's eye：掌上明珠，珍爱之物例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-The antique watch is the apple of his collection.（这块古董手表是他收藏中的珍爱之物。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第二段：泰然自若</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He walked into the difficult meeting as cool as a cucumber.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>as cool as a cucumber：泰然自若，冷静沉着例句：       -Even in the face of a huge problem, he remained as cool as a cucumber.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（即使面对一个巨大的问题，他依然泰然自若。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第三段：找错对象</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>If you think I did it, you are barking up the wrong tree.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>barking up the wrong tree：找错对象，弄错方向例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-Don't waste time barking up the wrong tree; look for the real culprit.（不要浪费时间找错对象，去找真正的罪魁祸首。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第四段：祝你好运</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He wished his friend break a leg on the important exam.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>break a leg：祝你好运例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-She wished her friend break a leg before the performance.（她在演出前祝朋友好运。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第五段：电视迷</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She is a total couch potato, spending hours in front of the TV every day.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>couch potato：电视迷，懒惰的人例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-He used to be a couch potato, but now he has started going to the gym regularly.（他以前是个整天看电视的懒人，但现在开始定期去健身房了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第六段：祈求好运</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She crossed her fingers as she waited for the job interview results.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>cross one's fingers：祈求好运例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-He crossed his fingers before opening the lottery ticket.（他在打开彩票   之前祈求好运。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第七段：倾盆大雨</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p><mark>Suddenly</mark> it rained cats and dogs, and we had to seek shelter in a nearby building.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>rain cats and dogs：倾盆大雨例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-It rained cats and dogs all night, causing traffic jams the next morning.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（整夜下着倾盆大雨，导致第二天早上交通堵塞。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第八段：平摊费用</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Let's go Dutch on this dinner; we can split the bill evenly.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>go Dutch：平摊费用（AA 制）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-We decided to go Dutch for the movie tickets.（我们决定各付各的电影票钱。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第九段：身体不适</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She felt under the weather and had to take a day off work.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>under the weather：身体不适例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-He's been under the weather for a few days.（他已经身体不舒服好几天了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第十段：陷入困境</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The company is in hot water <mark>due to</mark> financial mismanagement.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>in hot water：陷入困境例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-She found herself in hot water after making that mistake.（她在犯了那个错误之后陷入了困境。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第十一段：泄露秘密</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She accidentally let the cat out of the bag about the surprise party.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>let the cat out of the bag：泄露秘密例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-Don't let the cat out of the bag before the right time.（不要在合适的时间之前泄露秘密。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第十二段：经验法则</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>As a rule of thumb, you should water plants once a week.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>rule of thumb：经验法则例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-By rule of thumb, it takes about two hours to drive that distance.（凭经验来讲，开车经过那段距离需要两个小时左右。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第十三段：意见一致</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The two managers see eye to eye on most business matters.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>see eye to eye：意见一致例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>They finally see eye to eye on the important decision.（他们最终在这个重要的决定上意见一致。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第十四段：泄露秘密</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He promised not to spill the beans but he couldn't resist.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>spill the beans：泄露秘密例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She promised not to spill the beans but accidentally let the cat out of the bag.（她承诺不泄露秘密，但不小心说漏了嘴。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>课后练习</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 造句练习：使用今天学到的固定搭配造句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- apple of one's eye：The antique watch is the apple of his collection.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（这块古董手表是他收藏中的珍爱之物。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>as cool as a cucumber：Even in the face of a huge problem, he</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>remained as cool as a cucumber.（即使面对一个巨大的问题，他依然泰然自若。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>barking up the wrong tree：If you think I did it, you are barking up the</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>wrong tree.（如果你认为是我做的，那你就找错对象了。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>break a leg：She wished her friend break a leg before the performance.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（她在演出前祝朋友好运。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>couch potato：She is a total couch potato, spending hours in front of</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>the TV every day.（她完全是个电视迷，每天都在电视机前花好几个小时。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>cross one's fingers：He crossed his fingers before opening the lottery</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>ticket.（他在打开彩票之前祈求好运。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>rain cats and dogs：It rained cats and dogs all night, causing traffic</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>jams the next morning.（整夜下着倾盆大雨，导致第二天早上交通堵塞。）            - go Dutch：We decided to go Dutch for the movie tickets.（我们决定各付各的电影票钱。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>under the weather：She felt under the weather and had to take a day</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>off work.（她觉得不舒服，不得不请一天假。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>in hot water：The company is in hot water due to financial</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>mismanagement.（这家公司因为财务管理不善而陷入了困境。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>let the cat out of the bag：She accidentally let the cat out of the bag</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>about the surprise party.（她不小心泄露了惊喜派对的秘密。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>rule of thumb：As a rule of thumb, you should water plants once a</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>week.（一般来说，你应该每周给植物浇一次水。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>see eye to eye：The two managers see eye to eye on most business</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>matters.（这两位经理在大多数业务问题上意见一致。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>spill the beans：He promised not to spill the beans but he couldn't</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>resist.（他承诺不泄露秘密，但他忍不住。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>---</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_六_02", "moduleId": "p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_六"}]}, {"id": "p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_七_习语", "code": "", "title": "外刊——特殊固定搭配（七）习语", "articles": [{"title": "英文原文", "section": "英文原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>She is the apple of her father's eye.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He walked into the difficult meeting as cool as a cucumber.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>If you think I did it, you are barking up the wrong tree.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He wished his friend break a leg on the important exam.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She is a total couch potato, spending hours in front of the TV every day.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She crossed her fingers as she waited for the job interview results.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Suddenly it rained cats and dogs, and we had to seek shelter in a nearby building.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Let's go Dutch on this dinner; we can split the bill evenly.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She felt under the weather and had to take a day off work.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The company is in hot water due to financial mismanagement.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She accidentally let the cat out of the bag about the surprise party.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>As a rule of thumb, you should water plants once a week.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The two managers see eye to eye on most business matters.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He promised not to spill the beans but he couldn't resist.</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_七_习语_01", "moduleId": "p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_七_习语"}, {"title": "搭配总结", "section": "搭配总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>（本篇无独立固定搭配词条）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>外刊——特殊固定搭配（八）习语</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>故事精讲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第一段：沧海一粟</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>What I did is a drop in the bucket, but it's better than nothing.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>a drop in the bucket：沧海一粟，微不足道例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-Her donation was a drop in the bucket, yet it still mattered.（她的捐赠只是沧海一粟，但仍然很重要。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>matter：重要（动词）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-What I did is a drop in the bucket, but it's better than nothing.（我所做的只是微不足道的一点，但总比什么都不做强。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第二段：洗耳恭听</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She was all ears when he started talking about his adventures.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>be all ears：洗耳恭听，全神贯注地听例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-When he started talking about his adventures, she was all ears.（当他开始谈论他的冒险时，她全神贯注地听着。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>adventures：冒险（名词）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm all ears.（我洗耳恭听。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第三段：破釜沉舟</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She decided to burn her bridges and start a new life in a different city.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>burn one's bridges：破釜沉舟，自断后路例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-Don't burn your bridges until you are sure it's the right move.（在你确定这是正确的行动之前，不要自断后路。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>move：行动（名词）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-She decided to burn her bridges and start a new life in a different city.   （她决定破釜沉舟，在另一个城市开始新生活。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第四段：逼疯某人</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The noise outside is driving everyone up the wall.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>drive someone up the wall：逼疯某人，让某人抓狂例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-His constant complaining is driving me up the wall.（他不停地抱怨，把我逼疯了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>complaining：抱怨（动名词）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-The noise outside is driving everyone up the wall.（外面的噪音把每个人都逼疯了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第五段：收回前言</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He had to eat his words when he <mark>realized</mark> he was wrong.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>固定搭配：        eat one's words：收回前言，承认错误例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-Don't be too quick to speak, or you might have to eat your words later.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（不要说得太快，否则你以后可能不得不收回前言。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p><mark>realize</mark>：意识到例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>--He had to eat his words when he <mark>realized</mark> he was wrong.（当他意识到自己错了的时候，他不得不收回前言。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第六段：失败，达不到预期</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Her joke fell flat, and no one laughed.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>fall flat：失败，达不到预期效果例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-Her speech fell flat and didn't inspire the audience.（她的演讲没有达到预期效果，没有激励听众。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>inspire：激励（动词）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-His joke fell flat, and no one laughed.（他的笑话没有引起笑声。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第七段：惹恼某人</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Her constant criticism is getting on his nerves.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>get on someone's nerves：惹恼某人，让某人烦躁例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-The traffic noise gets on everyone's nerves.（交通噪音让每个人都很烦躁。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>criticism：批评（名词）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-Her constant criticism is getting on his nerves.（他不断地批评，让他很烦躁。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第八段：尝试一下</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Why don't you give it a shot? You might surprise yourself.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>固定搭配：       give it a shot：尝试一下（与“<mark>give it a try</mark>”同义）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-She encouraged him to give it a shot and learn a new language.（她鼓励他尝试一下，学习一门新的语言。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>surprise：让……感到惊讶例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Why don't you give it a shot? You might surprise yourself.（你为什么不尝试一下呢？你可能会让自己感到惊讶。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第九段：顺其自然</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He decided to go with the flow and not worry too much about the future.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>go with the flow：顺其自然，随大流例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-She likes to go with the flow and not plan everything in advance.（她喜欢顺其自然，不提前计划一切。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>in advance：提前例句：      -He decided to go with the flow and not worry too much about the future.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（他决定顺其自然，不要太担心未来。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第十段：用功学习</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's time to hit the books for the upcoming exams.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>hit the books：用功学习，复习功课例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-She spent the weekend hitting the books to prepare for the test.（她整个周末都在复习功课，为考试做准备。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>upcoming：即将到来的例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-It's time to hit the books for the upcoming exams.（是时候为即将到来的考试复习功课了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第十一段：忍耐的极限</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>His rudeness was the last straw for her.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>固定搭配：        the last straw：忍耐的极限（压死骆驼的最后一根稻草）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-The delay was the last straw, and they decided to cancel the trip.（延误是最后一根稻草，他们决定取消旅行。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">cancel：取消例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-His rudeness was the last straw for her.（他的粗鲁是她忍耐的极限。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第十二段：跳出框框思考</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>We need to think outside the box to solve this complex problem.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>think outside the box：跳出框框思考，创新思维例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-Encourage your team to think outside the box and come up with creative solutions.（鼓励你的团队跳出框框思考，想出有创意的解决方案。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">creative：有创意的例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-We need to think outside the box to solve this complex problem.（我们需   要跳出框框思考，解决这个复杂的问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第十三段：悬而未决</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The future of the project is still up in the air.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>up in the air：悬而未决，不确定例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-His plans are up in the air until he gets more information.（在他的计划得到更多信息之前，仍然是不确定的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>information：信息例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-The future of the project is still up in the air.（这个项目的未来仍然悬而未决。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第十四段：出色完成</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She passed the exam with flying colors.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>with flying colors：出色完成，成功例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-He performed in the play with flying colors.（他在戏剧中的表演非常出色。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>perform：表演（动词）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-She passed the exam with flying colors.（她出色地通过了考试。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>课后练习</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 造句练习：使用今天学到的固定搭配造句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- a drop in the bucket：Her donation was a drop in the bucket, yet it still</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>mattered.（她的捐赠只是沧海一粟，但仍然很重要。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be all ears：When he started talking about his adventures, she was all</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>ears.（当他开始谈论他的冒险时，她全神贯注地听着。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>burn one's bridges：Don't burn your bridges until you are sure it's the</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>right move.（在你确定这是正确的行动之前，不要自断后路。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>drive someone up the wall：The noise outside is driving everyone up</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>the wall.（外面的噪音把每个人都逼疯了。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>eat one's words：Don't be too quick to speak, or you might have to eat</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>your words later.（不要说得太快，否则你以后可能不得不收回前言。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>fall flat：Her joke fell flat, and no one laughed.（她的笑话没有引起</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>笑声。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>get on someone's nerves：Her constant criticism is getting on his</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>nerves.（他不断地批评，让他很烦躁。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>give it a shot：Why don't you give it a shot? You might surprise</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>yourself.（你为什么不尝试一下呢？你可能会让自己感到惊讶。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>go with the flow：He decided to go with the flow and not worry too      much about the future.（他决定顺其自然，不要太担心未来。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>hit the books：It's time to hit the books for the upcoming exams.（是</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>时候为即将到来的考试复习功课了。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>the last straw：His rudeness was the last straw for her.（他的粗鲁是</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>她忍耐的极限。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>think outside the box：We need to think outside the box to solve this</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>complex problem.（我们需要跳出框框思考，解决这个复杂的问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>up in the air：The future of the project is still up in the air.（这个项目</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>的未来仍然悬而未决。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>with flying colors：She passed the exam with flying colors.（她出色</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>地通过了考试。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>---</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_七_习语_02", "moduleId": "p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_七_习语"}]}, {"id": "p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_八_习语", "code": "", "title": "外刊——特殊固定搭配（八）习语", "articles": [{"title": "英文原文", "section": "英文原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>What I did is a drop in the bucket, but it's better than nothing.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She was all ears when he started talking about his adventures.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She decided to burn her bridges and start a new life in a different city.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The noise outside is driving everyone up the wall.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He had to eat his words when he realized he was wrong.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>固定搭配：        eat one's words：收回前言，承认错误例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-Don't be too quick to speak, or you might have to eat your words later.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（不要说得太快，否则你以后可能不得不收回前言。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">realize：意识到例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>--He had to eat his words when he realized he was wrong.（当他意识到自己错了的时候，他不得不收回前言。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Her joke fell flat, and no one laughed.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Her constant criticism is getting on his nerves.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Why don't you give it a shot? You might surprise yourself.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>固定搭配：       give it a shot：尝试一下（与“give it a try”同义）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-She encouraged him to give it a shot and learn a new language.（她鼓励他尝试一下，学习一门新的语言。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>surprise：让……感到惊讶例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Why don't you give it a shot? You might surprise yourself.（你为什么不尝试一下呢？你可能会让自己感到惊讶。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He decided to go with the flow and not worry too much about the future.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's time to hit the books for the upcoming exams.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>His rudeness was the last straw for her.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>固定搭配：        the last straw：忍耐的极限（压死骆驼的最后一根稻草）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-The delay was the last straw, and they decided to cancel the trip.（延误是最后一根稻草，他们决定取消旅行。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">cancel：取消例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-His rudeness was the last straw for her.（他的粗鲁是她忍耐的极限。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>We need to think outside the box to solve this complex problem.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The future of the project is still up in the air.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She passed the exam with flying colors.</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_八_习语_01", "moduleId": "p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_八_习语"}, {"title": "搭配总结", "section": "搭配总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>（本篇无独立固定搭配词条）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>真题长难句精读（进阶选修1.0）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>故事精讲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第一段：面对问题时的困惑</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>When I am confronted with such questions, my mind goes blank, and I can hardly remember my own date of birth, which is quite frustrating.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>be confronted with：面对 go blank：一片空白 date of birth：出生日期 frustrating：令人沮丧的例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-When I am confronted with such questions, my mind goes blank, and I can hardly remember my own date of birth, which is quite frustrating.（当我面对这些问题时，我的大脑一片空白，我几乎记不起自己的出生日期，这非常令人沮丧。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第二段：主语一致与强调</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>原文： The manager, <mark>together with</mark> some workers, is visiting the new company now, which has raised questions about the future of the project.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配及语法点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. together with：与……一起（作伴随状语，谓语动词与前面主语保</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>持一致）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 非限制性定语从句：补充说明，不影响句子完整性</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-The manager, together with some workers, is visiting the new company now, which has raised questions about the future of the project.（经理和一些工人正在参观新公司，这引发了关于项目未来的疑问。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第三段：能源供应与未来趋势</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>While fossil fuels still generate roughly eighty-five percent of the world's energy supply, it's clearer than ever that the future <mark>belongs to</mark> renewable resources, such as wind and solar.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>generate：产生 renewable resources：可再生能源 clearer than ever：比以往任何时候都更清楚例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-While fossil fuels still generate roughly eighty-five percent of the world's energy supply, it's clearer than ever that the future belongs to renewable resources, such as wind and solar.（尽管化石燃料仍产生约 85%的世界能源供应，但比以往任何时候都更清楚的是，未来属于风能和太阳能等可再生能源。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第四段：欧洲铁路的维护成本</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It is calculated that European railways alone spend approximately twenty billion euros a year on maintenance, including sending maintenance staff often at night to inspect and repair the rail infrastructure.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It is calculated that：据计算 spend ... on：在……上花费 maintenance：维护 inspect and repair：检查和维修例句：          It is calculated that European railways alone spend approximately twenty billion euros a year on maintenance, including sending maintenance staff often at night to inspect and repair the rail infrastructure.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（据计算，仅欧洲铁路每年在维护上花费约200 亿欧元，包括夜间派遣维护人员检查和维修铁路基础设施。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第五段：石油价格与经济影响</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The OECD estimates in its latest economic outlook that if oil prices average twenty-two dollars a barrel for a full year, compared with thirteen dollars in nineteen ninety-eight, this would increase the oil import bill in rich economies by only zero point two five to zero point five percent of GDP.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>average：平均为 compared with：与……相比 oil import bill：石油进口费用 GDP：国内生产总值例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-The OECD estimates in its latest economic outlook that if oil prices average twenty-two dollars a barrel for a full year, compared with thirteen        dollars in nineteen ninety-eight, this would increase the oil import bill in rich economies by only 0.25% to 0.5% of GDP.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（经合组织在其最新的经济展望中估计，如果油价全年平均为每桶 22 美元，与1998 年的13 美元相比，这将使富裕经济体的石油进口费用仅增加0.25%到0.5%的GDP。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第六段：艺术与自我认知</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It is only through art that we can escape from ourselves and know how another person sees the universe, whose landscapes would otherwise have remained as unknown as any on the moon.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>escape from：摆脱 see the universe：看待宇宙 remain unknown：保持未知例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It is only through art that we can escape from ourselves and know how another person sees the universe, whose landscapes would otherwise have remained as unknown as any on the moon.（只有通过艺术，我们才能摆脱自我，了解他人如何看待宇宙，否则这些宇宙的风景将像月球上的   任何一处风景一样不为人知。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第七段：机器人与自主决策</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>But if robots are to reach the next stage of labor-saving utility, they will have to operate with less human supervision and be able to make at least a few decisions for themselves—goals that pose a real challenge.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>reach the next stage：达到下一个阶段 labor-saving utility：节省劳力的效用 pose a challenge：构成挑战例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-But if robots are to reach the next stage of labor-saving utility, they will have to operate with less human supervision and be able to make at least a few decisions for themselves—goals that pose a real challenge.（但如果机器人要达到节省劳力的下一个阶段，它们将不得不在更少的人类监督下运行，并至少能够为自己做出一些决定——这些目标构成了真正的挑战。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第八段：纸质阅读的优势</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The benefits of print reading particularly shine through when experimenters move from posing simple tasks like identifying the main idea in a reading passage to ones that require mental abstraction, such as drawing inferences from a text.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>shine through：显现 pose simple tasks：设置简单任务 mental abstraction：心理抽象 draw inferences：得出推论例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-The benefits of print reading particularly shine through when experimenters move from posing simple tasks like identifying the main idea in a reading passage to ones that require mental abstraction, such as drawing inferences from a text.（纸质阅读的好处尤其显现出来，当实验者从设置简单的任务（如识别阅读文章的主旨）转向需要心理抽象的任务（如从文本中得出推论）时。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第九段：幽默与有效沟通</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Your humor must be relevant to the audience and should help to show them that you are one of them or that you understand their situation and are in sympathy with their point of view, which is crucial for effective communication.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>be relevant to：与……相关 in sympathy with：同情，支持 point of view：观点 be crucial for：对……至关重要例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-Your humor must be relevant to the audience and should help to show them that you are one of them or that you understand their situation and are in sympathy with their point of view, which is crucial for effective communication.（你的幽默必须与听众相关，并且应该帮助他们明白你是他们中的一员，或者你理解他们的处境并支持他们的观点，这对于有效沟通至关重要。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第十段：社会结构与个人牺牲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The coming of age in the post-war baby boom and an entry of women into the male-dominated job market have limited the opportunities of teenagers who are already questioning the heavy personal sacrifices involved in climbing Japan's rigid social ladder to good schools and jobs.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>coming of age：成年 post-war baby boom：战后婴儿潮 male-dominated job market：男性主导的就业市场 rigid social ladder：僵化的社会阶梯 heavy personal sacrifices：重大的个人牺牲例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-The coming of age in the post-war baby boom and an entry of women into the male-dominated job market have limited the opportunities of teenagers who are already questioning the heavy personal sacrifices involved in climbing Japan's rigid social ladder to good schools and jobs.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（战后婴儿潮一代逐渐成年，女性开始进入男性主导的就业市场，这   使得青少年的机会受到限制，而这些青少年已经在质疑为了爬上日本僵化的社会阶梯以进入好学校和获得好工作而做出的巨大个人牺牲是否值得。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>课后练习</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 造句练习：使用今天学到的固定搭配造句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- be confronted with：When I am confronted with difficult problems, I</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>try to stay calm.（当我面对困难问题时，我尽量保持冷静。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>go blank：Sometimes my mind goes blank during exams.（有时考试</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>时我的大脑一片空白。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>date of birth：Can you tell me your date of birth?（你能告诉我你的</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>出生日期吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>together with：She, together with her friends, is planning a trip.（她</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>和她的朋友们正在计划一次旅行。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>generate：Fossil fuels generate most of the world's energy.（化石燃</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>料产生了世界上大部分的能源。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>renewable resources：We need to invest more in renewable resources</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>like wind and solar.（我们需要更多投资于风能和太阳能等可再生能源。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>spend ... on：The company spends a lot of money on employee</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>training.（公司花费大量资金用于员工培训。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>average：The average temperature this month is 20 degrees Celsius.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（本月平均气温为20 摄氏度。）            - compared with：Compared with last year, our sales have increased by 20%.（与去年相比，我们的销售额增长了20%。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>oil import bill：The oil import bill has increased due to higher prices.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（由于价格上升，石油进口费用增加了。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>GDP：The country's GDP has grown by 3% this year.（该国今年的</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>GDP 增长了3%。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>escape from：He tried to escape from the difficult situation.（他试图</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>摆脱困境。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>pose a challenge：This task poses a real challenge for us.（这项任务</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>对我们来说是一个真正的挑战。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>shine through：Her talent really shines through in this performance.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（她的才华在这次表演中得到了充分展现。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>draw inferences：We can draw inferences from the data.（我们可以</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>从数据中得出推论。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be relevant to：The lecture was very relevant to our project.（这次讲</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>座与我们的项目非常相关。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>in sympathy with：I am in sympathy with your point of view.（我支</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>持你的观点。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>point of view：Everyone has a different point of view.（每个人都有</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>不同的观点。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be crucial for：This step is crucial for our success.（这一步对我们的   成功至关重要。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>coming of age：The coming of age is an important milestone in one's</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>life.（成年是一个人生命中的重要里程碑。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>post-war baby boom：The post-war baby boom led to a population</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>increase.（战后婴儿潮导致了人口增长。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>male-dominated job market：The tech industry is still a</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>male-dominated job market.（科技行业仍然是一个男性主导的就业市场。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>rigid social ladder：Climbing the rigid social ladder is very</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>challenging.（爬上僵化的社会阶梯非常具有挑战性。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>heavy personal sacrifices：He made heavy personal sacrifices for his</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>career.（他为自己的事业做出了重大的个人牺牲。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>---</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_八_习语_02", "moduleId": "p5_外刊_特殊固定搭配_八_习语"}]}, {"id": "p5_真题长难句精读_进阶选修1_0", "code": "", "title": "真题长难句精读（进阶选修1.0）", "articles": [{"title": "英文原文", "section": "英文原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>When I am confronted with such questions, my mind goes blank, and I can hardly remember my own date of birth, which is quite frustrating.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The manager, together with some workers, is visiting the new company now, which has raised questions about the future of the project.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配及语法点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>While fossil fuels still generate roughly eighty-five percent of the world's energy supply, it's clearer than ever that the future belongs to renewable resources, such as wind and solar.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It is calculated that European railways alone spend approximately twenty billion euros a year on maintenance, including sending maintenance staff often at night to inspect and repair the rail infrastructure.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The OECD estimates in its latest economic outlook that if oil prices average twenty-two dollars a barrel for a full year, compared with thirteen dollars in nineteen ninety-eight, this would increase the oil import bill in rich economies by only zero point two five to zero point five percent of GDP.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It is only through art that we can escape from ourselves and know how another person sees the universe, whose landscapes would otherwise have remained as unknown as any on the moon.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>But if robots are to reach the next stage of labor-saving utility, they will have to operate with less human supervision and be able to make at least a few decisions for themselves—goals that pose a real challenge.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The benefits of print reading particularly shine through when experimenters move from posing simple tasks like identifying the main idea in a reading passage to ones that require mental abstraction, such as drawing inferences from a text.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Your humor must be relevant to the audience and should help to show them that you are one of them or that you understand their situation and are in sympathy with their point of view, which is crucial for effective communication.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The coming of age in the post-war baby boom and an entry of women into the male-dominated job market have limited the opportunities of teenagers who are already questioning the heavy personal sacrifices involved in climbing Japan's rigid social ladder to good schools and jobs.</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_真题长难句精读_进阶选修1_0_01", "moduleId": "p5_真题长难句精读_进阶选修1_0"}, {"title": "搭配总结", "section": "搭配总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. together with：与……一起（作伴随状语，谓语动词与前面主语保</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>真题长难句精读（进阶选修2.0）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>故事精讲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第一段：倒装句的使用</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Basic to any understanding of Canada in the twenty years after the Second World War is the country's impressive population growth.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配及语法点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>倒装句：表系主结构（强调重要性）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>basic to：对……来说是基本的 population growth：人口增长例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-Basic to any understanding of Canada in the twenty years after the Second World War is the country's impressive population growth.（对于理解二战后20 年的加拿大来说，该国令人瞩目的人口增长是关键所在。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>任何人想要理解二战后20 年的加拿大，都得先从他那令人惊叹的人口增长说起。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第二段：定语从句与固定搭配</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>As it was always a collection of dubious repute, one is obliged to reflect upon the standards that the Zoo Federation sets when granting membership.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配及语法点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p><mark>be obliged to</mark>：不得不，有义务 reflect upon：反思 grant membership：授予会员资格定语从句：that the Zoo Federation sets（修饰standards）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-As it was always a collection of dubious repute, one is obliged to reflect upon the standards that the Zoo Federation sets when granting membership.（因为它一直名声不太好，所以人们不得不思考动物园联合会在授予会员资格时所依据的标准到底是什么。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>与悲伤、恐惧和愤怒等所谓的基本情绪不同，愧疚感出现得稍晚一些， 它伴随着孩子对社会道德规范理解的不断加深而产生。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第三段：固定搭配与逻辑关系</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Unlike so-called basic emotions such as sadness, fear, and anger, guilt emerges a little later in conjunction with a child's growing grasp of social and moral norms.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>unlike：与……不同 in conjunction with：与……结合 grasp of：对……的理解 social and moral norms：社会道德规范例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-Unlike so-called basic emotions such as sadness, fear, and anger, guilt emerges a little later in conjunction with a child's growing grasp of social and moral norms.（与悲伤、恐惧和愤怒等所谓的基本情绪不同，愧疚感出现得稍晚一些，它伴随着孩子对社会道德规范理解的不断加深而产生。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>与悲伤、恐惧和愤怒等所谓的基本情绪不同，愧疚感出现得稍晚一些，   它伴随着孩子对社会道德规范理解的不断加深而产生。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第四段：过去分词作状语</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Impressed by the elements' combustibility, several seventeenth-century chemists used it to manufacture fire-lighting devices, but the results were dangerously inflammable.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配及语法点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>过去分词作状语：Impressed by...（被打动）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>combustibility：可燃性 fire-lighting devices：点火装置 dangerously inflammable：极易燃例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-Impressed by the elements' combustibility, several seventeenth-century chemists used it to manufacture fire-lighting devices, but the results were dangerously inflammable.（由于对这种元素的可燃性印象深刻，几位 17 世纪的化学家使用它来制造点火装置，但结果这些装置极其易燃， 非常危险。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>由于对这种元素的可燃性印象深刻，几位17 世纪的化学家使用它来   制造点火装置，但结果这些装置极其易燃，非常危险。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第五段：定语从句与逻辑关系</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Even before the invention of the electric light bulb, the author produced a remarkable work of speculative fiction that would foreshadow many ethical questions to be raised by technologies yet to come.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配语法点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>定语从句：that would foreshadow...（修饰work）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>speculative fiction：推理小说 foreshadow：预示 ethical questions：伦理问题 technologies yet to come：未来的技术例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-Even before the invention of the electric light bulb, the author produced a remarkable work of speculative fiction that would foreshadow many ethical questions to be raised by technologies yet to come.（甚至在电灯泡发明之前，这位作者就创作了一部非凡的推理小说作品，这部作品预示了未来技术将会引发的许多伦理问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>甚至在电灯泡被发明出来之前，这位作者就创作出了一部非凡的推理小说作品，而这部作品也预示着未来的技术将会引发诸多伦理问题。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第六段：同位语从句与逻辑关系</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>As a result, claims that eating a diet consisting entirely of organically grown foods prevents or cures diseases or provides other benefits to health have become widely publicized and form the basis for folklore.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配及语法点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>同位语从句：that...（解释claims）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>consisting entirely of：完全由……组成 organically grown foods：有机种植的食物 prevent or cure diseases：预防或治愈疾病 publicize：宣传 form the basis for：构成……的基础例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-As a result, claims that eating a diet consisting entirely of organically grown foods prevents or cures diseases or provides other benefits to health have become widely publicized and form the basis for folklore.（因此，声称只食用完全由有机种植的食物组成的饮食能够预防或治愈疾病或对健康有其他益处的说法已被广泛宣传，并构成了民间传说的基础。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>因此，声称只食用完全由有机种植的食物组成的饮食能够预防或治愈疾病或对健康有其他益处的说法已被广泛传播，并成为了民间传说的基础内容。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第七段：定语从句与逻辑关系</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Totally without light and subjected to intense pressures hundreds of times greater than at the earth's surface, the deep ocean bottom is a hostile environment to humans, in some ways as forbidden and remote as the void of outer space.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配及语法点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>定语从句：subjected to...（修饰deep ocean bottom）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>subjected to：承受 intense pressures：巨大压力 hundreds of times greater than：比……大几百倍 hostile environment：恶劣环境 forbidden and remote：令人生畏且遥远       void of outer space：外太空的虚空例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-Totally without light and subjected to intense pressures hundreds of times greater than at the earth's surface, the deep ocean bottom is a hostile environment to humans, in some ways as forbidden and remote as the void of outer space.（深海海底完全没有光，并且承受着比地球表面大几百倍的巨大压力，对人类来说是一个充满敌意的环境，在某些方面就如同外太空的虚空一般，既可怕又遥远。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>深海的海底完全没有光，并且承受着比地球表面大几百倍的巨大压力， 对人类而言，它是一个充满敌意的环境，在某些方面就如同外太空的虚空一般，既可怕又遥远。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第八段：定语从句与逻辑关系</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Leaving aside the philosophical question of whether anyone should have to breathe someone else's cigarette smoke, the report <mark>suggests</mark> that the smoke experienced by many people in their daily lives is enough to produce substantial adverse effects on a person's heart and lungs.   固定搭配及语法点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>现在分词作状语：Leaving aside...（搁置一边）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>定语从句：experienced by many people...（修饰smoke）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>leave aside：搁置 adverse effects：不良影响 substantial：重大的 heart and lungs：心脏和肺部例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-Leaving aside the philosophical question of whether anyone should have to breathe someone else's cigarette smoke, the report <mark>suggests</mark> that the smoke experienced by many people in their daily lives is enough to produce substantial adverse effects on a person's heart and lungs.（先不考虑是否有人应该被迫吸别人的二手烟这个哲学问题，该报告表明，许多人在日常生活中所接触到的烟雾足以对人的心脏和肺部产生重大的不良影响。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>先不考虑是否有人应该被迫吸别人的二手烟这个哲学问题，该报告表明，许多人在日常生活中所接触到的烟雾足以对人的心脏和肺部产生重大的不良影响。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第九段：定语从句与逻辑关系</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>This growing concern about intellectual property rights was a feature of        the period—it reflected both the humanist notion of the individual rational scientist who invents and <mark>discovers</mark> through private intellectual labor and the growing connection between original science and commercial exploitation.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配及语法点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>定语从句：who invents and <mark>discovers</mark>...（修饰scientist）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>intellectual property rights：知识产权 humanist notion：人文主义观念 private intellectual labor：私人智力劳动 commercial exploitation：商业开发例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-This growing concern about intellectual property rights was a feature of the period—it reflected both the humanist notion of the individual rational scientist who invents and <mark>discovers</mark> through private intellectual labor and the growing connection between original science and commercial exploitation.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（对知识产权的这种日益增长的关注是这个时期的一个特征，它既反映了人文主义关于个体的理性的科学家通过私人智力劳动进行发明和发现的观念，又反映了原始科学与商业开发之间日益增长的联系。）   翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>对知识产权的这种日益增长的关注是这个时期的一个特征，它既反映了人文主义关于个体的理性的科学家通过私人智力劳动进行发明和发现的观念，又反映了原始科学与商业开发之间日益增长的联系。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>课后练习</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 造句练习：使用今天学到的固定搭配造句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>- basic to：Understanding the basics of science is basic to any scientific</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>research.（理解科学的基础是任何科学研究的基本。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>be obliged to：We are obliged to follow the rules.（我们有义务遵守</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>规则。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>unlike：Unlike summer, winter is cold.（与夏天不同，冬天是寒冷</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>的。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>in conjunction with：He succeeded in conjunction with his team.（他</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>与团队合作取得了成功。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>leave aside：Leave aside the problem, we can discuss other issues.（搁</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>置这个问题，我们可以讨论其他问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>subjected to：He was subjected to a lot of pressure.（他承受了很大</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>的压力。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>reflect：The mirror reflects the sunlight.（镜子反射阳光。）</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>foreshadow：The dark clouds foreshadow a storm.（乌云预示着一场</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>暴风雨。）</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>publicize：The company publicized its new product.（公司宣传了它</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>的新产品。）            - hostile environment：The desert is a hostile environment for humans.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（沙漠对人类来说是一个恶劣的环境。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>---</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_真题长难句精读_进阶选修1_0_02", "moduleId": "p5_真题长难句精读_进阶选修1_0"}]}, {"id": "p5_真题长难句精读_进阶选修2_0", "code": "", "title": "真题长难句精读（进阶选修2.0）", "articles": [{"title": "英文原文", "section": "英文原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>Basic to any understanding of Canada in the twenty years after the Second World War is the country's impressive population growth.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配及语法点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>倒装句：表系主结构（强调重要性）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>basic to：对……来说是基本的 population growth：人口增长例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-Basic to any understanding of Canada in the twenty years after the Second World War is the country's impressive population growth.（对于理解二战后20 年的加拿大来说，该国令人瞩目的人口增长是关键所在。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>任何人想要理解二战后20 年的加拿大，都得先从他那令人惊叹的人口增长说起。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>As it was always a collection of dubious repute, one is obliged to reflect upon the standards that the Zoo Federation sets when granting membership.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配及语法点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>be obliged to：不得不，有义务 reflect upon：反思 grant membership：授予会员资格定语从句：that the Zoo Federation sets（修饰standards）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-As it was always a collection of dubious repute, one is obliged to reflect upon the standards that the Zoo Federation sets when granting membership.（因为它一直名声不太好，所以人们不得不思考动物园联合会在授予会员资格时所依据的标准到底是什么。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>与悲伤、恐惧和愤怒等所谓的基本情绪不同，愧疚感出现得稍晚一些， 它伴随着孩子对社会道德规范理解的不断加深而产生。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Unlike so-called basic emotions such as sadness, fear, and anger, guilt emerges a little later in conjunction with a child's growing grasp of social and moral norms.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Impressed by the elements' combustibility, several seventeenth-century chemists used it to manufacture fire-lighting devices, but the results were dangerously inflammable.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配及语法点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>过去分词作状语：Impressed by...（被打动）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>combustibility：可燃性 fire-lighting devices：点火装置 dangerously inflammable：极易燃例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-Impressed by the elements' combustibility, several seventeenth-century chemists used it to manufacture fire-lighting devices, but the results were dangerously inflammable.（由于对这种元素的可燃性印象深刻，几位 17 世纪的化学家使用它来制造点火装置，但结果这些装置极其易燃， 非常危险。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>由于对这种元素的可燃性印象深刻，几位17 世纪的化学家使用它来   制造点火装置，但结果这些装置极其易燃，非常危险。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Even before the invention of the electric light bulb, the author produced a remarkable work of speculative fiction that would foreshadow many ethical questions to be raised by technologies yet to come.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配语法点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>定语从句：that would foreshadow...（修饰work）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>speculative fiction：推理小说 foreshadow：预示 ethical questions：伦理问题 technologies yet to come：未来的技术例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-Even before the invention of the electric light bulb, the author produced a remarkable work of speculative fiction that would foreshadow many ethical questions to be raised by technologies yet to come.（甚至在电灯泡发明之前，这位作者就创作了一部非凡的推理小说作品，这部作品预示了未来技术将会引发的许多伦理问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>甚至在电灯泡被发明出来之前，这位作者就创作出了一部非凡的推理小说作品，而这部作品也预示着未来的技术将会引发诸多伦理问题。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>As a result, claims that eating a diet consisting entirely of organically grown foods prevents or cures diseases or provides other benefits to health have become widely publicized and form the basis for folklore.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配及语法点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>同位语从句：that...（解释claims）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>consisting entirely of：完全由……组成 organically grown foods：有机种植的食物 prevent or cure diseases：预防或治愈疾病 publicize：宣传 form the basis for：构成……的基础例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-As a result, claims that eating a diet consisting entirely of organically grown foods prevents or cures diseases or provides other benefits to health have become widely publicized and form the basis for folklore.（因此，声称只食用完全由有机种植的食物组成的饮食能够预防或治愈疾病或对健康有其他益处的说法已被广泛宣传，并构成了民间传说的基础。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>因此，声称只食用完全由有机种植的食物组成的饮食能够预防或治愈疾病或对健康有其他益处的说法已被广泛传播，并成为了民间传说的基础内容。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Totally without light and subjected to intense pressures hundreds of times greater than at the earth's surface, the deep ocean bottom is a hostile environment to humans, in some ways as forbidden and remote as the void of outer space.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配及语法点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>定语从句：subjected to...（修饰deep ocean bottom）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>subjected to：承受 intense pressures：巨大压力 hundreds of times greater than：比……大几百倍 hostile environment：恶劣环境 forbidden and remote：令人生畏且遥远       void of outer space：外太空的虚空例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-Totally without light and subjected to intense pressures hundreds of times greater than at the earth's surface, the deep ocean bottom is a hostile environment to humans, in some ways as forbidden and remote as the void of outer space.（深海海底完全没有光，并且承受着比地球表面大几百倍的巨大压力，对人类来说是一个充满敌意的环境，在某些方面就如同外太空的虚空一般，既可怕又遥远。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>深海的海底完全没有光，并且承受着比地球表面大几百倍的巨大压力， 对人类而言，它是一个充满敌意的环境，在某些方面就如同外太空的虚空一般，既可怕又遥远。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Leaving aside the philosophical question of whether anyone should have to breathe someone else's cigarette smoke, the report suggests that the smoke experienced by many people in their daily lives is enough to produce substantial adverse effects on a person's heart and lungs.   固定搭配及语法点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>现在分词作状语：Leaving aside...（搁置一边）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>定语从句：experienced by many people...（修饰smoke）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>leave aside：搁置 adverse effects：不良影响 substantial：重大的 heart and lungs：心脏和肺部例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-Leaving aside the philosophical question of whether anyone should have to breathe someone else's cigarette smoke, the report suggests that the smoke experienced by many people in their daily lives is enough to produce substantial adverse effects on a person's heart and lungs.（先不考虑是否有人应该被迫吸别人的二手烟这个哲学问题，该报告表明，许多人在日常生活中所接触到的烟雾足以对人的心脏和肺部产生重大的不良影响。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>先不考虑是否有人应该被迫吸别人的二手烟这个哲学问题，该报告表明，许多人在日常生活中所接触到的烟雾足以对人的心脏和肺部产生重大的不良影响。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>This growing concern about intellectual property rights was a feature of        the period—it reflected both the humanist notion of the individual rational scientist who invents and discovers through private intellectual labor and the growing connection between original science and commercial exploitation.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">固定搭配及语法点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>定语从句：who invents and discovers...（修饰scientist）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>intellectual property rights：知识产权 humanist notion：人文主义观念 private intellectual labor：私人智力劳动 commercial exploitation：商业开发例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>-This growing concern about intellectual property rights was a feature of the period—it reflected both the humanist notion of the individual rational scientist who invents and discovers through private intellectual labor and the growing connection between original science and commercial exploitation.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（对知识产权的这种日益增长的关注是这个时期的一个特征，它既反映了人文主义关于个体的理性的科学家通过私人智力劳动进行发明和发现的观念，又反映了原始科学与商业开发之间日益增长的联系。）   翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>对知识产权的这种日益增长的关注是这个时期的一个特征，它既反映了人文主义关于个体的理性的科学家通过私人智力劳动进行发明和发现的观念，又反映了原始科学与商业开发之间日益增长的联系。</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_真题长难句精读_进阶选修2_0_01", "moduleId": "p5_真题长难句精读_进阶选修2_0"}, {"title": "搭配总结", "section": "搭配总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>（本篇无独立固定搭配词条）</p>"}], "id": "a_p5_真题长难句精读_进阶选修2_0_02", "moduleId": "p5_真题长难句精读_进阶选修2_0"}]}], "id": "part5", "file": "第五部分_固定搭配_高亮版.md", "title": "第五部分 · 固定搭配", "range": ""}, {"name": "高频句型 · 第六部分", "modules": [{"id": "p6_6_0", "code": "6-0", "title": "前言：什么是高频句型？", "articles": [{"title": "前言：什么是高频句型？", "section": "", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>高频句型定义</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>英语高频句型是语言中常用且稳定的句子结构，常常能以简洁形式表达丰富信息，常用于口语和写作，有助于提升语言表达的准确性和流利性。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>固定句式</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式1：Could you please...? 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Could you please describe the nature of your work?（你能描述一下你的工作性质吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Could you please tell me what the hell?（你能告诉我到底发生了什么吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Could you please give me the address?（你能给我地址吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Could you please play a love song?（你能放一首情歌吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Could you please turn off that light?（你能把那盏灯关掉吗？）    句式2：I'm not used to...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not used to eating in the middle of the night.（我不习惯在半夜吃东西。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not used to talking this much.（我不习惯说这么多。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not used to approaching it from that angle.（我不习惯从那个角度去看待它。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not used to people sticking around with me.（我不习惯有人一直陪着我。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>实践练习</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">造句练习：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Could you please...? Could you please help me with this problem?（你能帮我解决这个问题吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Could you please explain it again?（你能再解释一遍吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not used to...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not used to waking up early.（我不习惯早起。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not used to driving in the city.（我不习惯在城市里开车。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>apple of one's eye：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She is the apple of her father's eye.（她是父亲的掌上明珠。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>as cool as a cucumber：      He remained as cool as a cucumber during the interview.（在面试中，他保持冷静。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>barking up the wrong tree：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>If you think I did it, you are barking up the wrong tree.（如果你认为是我做的，那你就找错对象了。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p6_6_0_01", "moduleId": "p6_6_0"}]}, {"id": "p6_6_1", "code": "6-1", "title": "高频句型一（初级）", "articles": [{"title": "高频句型一（初级）", "section": "", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>固定句式</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式1：Let's do something.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Let's sing together.（让我们一起唱歌吧。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Let's explore new places.（让我们探索新的地方吧。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Let's go to see a movie.（让我们去看电影吧。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Let's face challenges with a positive attitude.（让我们以积极的态度面对挑战吧。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Let's contribute our efforts to create a better world.（让我们为创造更美好的世界贡献自己的力量吧。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式2：I'm a...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm a student.（我是个学生。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm a person who loves traveling.（我是个热爱旅行的人。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm an explorer who is passionate about science.（我是个对科学充满热情的探索者。）       I'm a social activist dedicated to environmental protection.（我是个致力于环保事业的社会活动家。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式3：I hope...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I hope so.（我希望如此。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I hope life is good.（我希望生活美好。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I hope you feel better soon.（我希望你很快感觉好一点儿。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I hope this issue gets resolved quickly.（我希望这个问题能迅速得到解决。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I hope you find what you are looking for.（我希望你找到你正在寻找的东西。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式4：Can you...? 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Can you recommend a good book?（你能推荐一本好书吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Can you help me with my homework?（你能帮我做作业吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Can you operate this machine?（你能操作这台机器吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Can you explain this concept to me?（你能向我解释这个概念吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Can you share your opinion on this matter?（你能分享一下你对这件事情的看法吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式5：Could you...? 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Could you explain that again?（你能再解释一遍吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Could you pass me the salt?（你能把盐递给我吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Could you pass me the box?（你能把那个箱子递给我吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Could you help me carry this box?（你能帮我搬这个箱子吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式6：Shall we...? 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Shall we order pizza for dinner?（我们晚饭点披萨好吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Shall we consider alternative solutions?（我们考虑替代方案好吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Shall we start the project next week?（我们下周开始这个项目好吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式7：May I...? 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>May I make a suggestion?（我可以提个建议吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>May I use your phone?（我可以用一下你的电话吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>May I have a word with you?（我可以和你谈谈吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>May I request a few days off?（我可以请几天假吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>May I have access to the confidential documents?（我可以查看这些机密文件吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式8：You should...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You should study hard for the exam.（你应该为考试努力学习。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You should take advantage of this opportunity.（你应该利用这个机会。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You should consider your options carefully.（你应该仔细考虑你的选择。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You should discuss your concerns with your manager.（你应该和你的经理讨论你的担忧。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式9：If you...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>If you need help, just ask.（如果你需要帮助，尽管问。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>If you don't leave now, you will be late.（如果你现在不离开，你会迟到的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>If you invest wisely, your money can grow.（如果你明智地投资，你的钱可以增值。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式10：I'd like...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'd like to travel.（我想要去旅行。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'd like a cup of tea.（我想要一杯茶。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'd like to learn a new language.（我想要学一门新的语言。）         I'd like to strive for my dream.（我想要为自己的梦想努力奋斗。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式11：I'm into...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm into reading.（我热衷于阅读。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm into learning new knowledge.（我热衷于学习新的知识。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm into painting and often practice it.（我热衷于画画，我经常练习。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式12：I'm gonna...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm gonna go swimming.（我打算去游泳。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm gonna get up early tomorrow.（我打算明天早点起床。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm gonna learn a new language this year.（我打算今年学会一门新的语言。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm gonna have dinner with my friends tonight.（我今天晚上要和朋友一起吃晚饭。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm gonna work hard to achieve my dreams in the next few years.（我打算在未来的几年里努力实现自己的梦想。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式13：I'm sure...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm sure you will enjoy the party.（我确信你会喜欢这个派对的。）       I'm sure we can find a solution.（我确信我们能找到解决的方案。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm sure the meeting will be productive.（我确信会议将会很有成效。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm sure she'll be a great asset to the team.（我确信她将是团队中重要的成员。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式14：I'm afraid...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm afraid I'm running late.（恐怕我要迟到了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm afraid I can't support your proposal.（恐怕我不能支持你的提议。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm afraid I can't make it to the meeting.（恐怕我不能参加会议了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式15：I want to...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I want to eat an apple.（我想要吃个苹果。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I want to learn a new language.（我想要学一门新的语言。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I want to have a glass of water.（我想要一杯水。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I want to go traveling and see the outside world.（我想要去旅行，看看外面的世界。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I want to create more value for myself and others.（我想要为自己和他人创造更多的价值。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p6_6_1_01", "moduleId": "p6_6_1"}]}, {"id": "p6_6_2", "code": "6-2", "title": "高频句型二（初级）", "articles": [{"title": "高频句型二（初级）", "section": "", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>固定句式</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式1：Could you please...? 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Could you please pass the salt?（能请你递一下盐吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Could you please tell me the time?（能请你告诉我时间吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Could you please assist with technical issues?（能请你帮忙解决技术问题吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式2：Go-to...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He is my go-to person for solving this problem.（他是解决这个问题的首选之人。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Apples are my go-to fruit.（苹果是我的首选水果。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>This is my go-to restaurant.（这是我的首选餐厅。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式3：I'm glad...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>例句：       I'm glad you are here.（我很高兴你在这里。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm glad you are feeling better.（我很高兴你感觉好些了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm glad you made it to the party.（我很高兴你来到了派对。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式4：I believe...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I believe in your abilities.（我相信你的能力。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I believe honesty is the best policy.（我相信诚实是最好的政策。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I believe we can achieve our goals.（我相信我们能实现我们的目标。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式5：I need to...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I need to buy some groceries.（我需要买一些杂货。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I need to prepare for the presentation.（我需要为演讲做准备。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I need to finish my report by Friday.（我需要在周五前完成我的报告。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式6：I have to...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I have to finish my homework.（我不得不完成作业。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I have to work hard to support my family.（我不得不努力工作来支持我的家人。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I have to get up early to catch the early bus.（我不得不早点起床去赶上   早班车。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式7：Why not...? 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Why not take a break?（为什么不休息一下？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Why not ask for help?（为什么不寻求帮助？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Why not try something new?（为什么不尝试一些新的事物？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式8：You'd better...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You'd better not stay up too late.（你最好不要熬夜。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You'd better check the weather forecast.（你最好查看一下天气预报。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You'd better save your work frequently to avoid data loss.（你最好经常保存你的工作，避免数据丢失。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式9：Even if...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Even if you fail, don't give up.（即使你失败了，也不要放弃。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Even if it rains, the game will go on.（即使下雨，比赛也会继续。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Even if you don't agree with me, I respect your opinion.（即使你不同意我的看法，我尊重你的意见。）    句式10：What if...? 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>What if we go?（如果我们去会怎么样呢？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>What if you try?（如果你试一试会怎么样？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>What if we take a different approach?（如果我们采取一种不同的方法会怎么样呢？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式11：It's worth...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's worth considering other options.（考虑其他选择是值得的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's worth learning from your mistakes.（从错误中学习是值得的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's worth investing in quality equipment.（投资高质量的设备是值得的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式12：Would you like...? 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Would you like some coffee?（你想要来点咖啡吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Would you like to join us for dinner?（你想要和我们一起吃晚餐吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Would you like to contribute to the charity event?（你想要为这次慈善活动做贡献吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式13：I'd love to...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>例句：         I'd love to go to Italy.（我很想去意大利。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'd love to learn how to play the guitar.（我很想去学弹吉他。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式14：I'm sorry for...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm sorry for being late.（我为迟到感到抱歉。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm sorry for the misunderstanding.（我对误会感到抱歉。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm sorry for any inconvenience I've caused.（我为造成的不便感到抱歉。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式15：If only...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>If only I knew the answer.（要是我知道答案就好了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>If only you could be here.（要是你能在这里就好了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>If only it didn't rain so much.（要是不下雨那么多就好了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>If only I had more time.（要是我有更多的时间就好了。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p6_6_2_01", "moduleId": "p6_6_2"}]}, {"id": "p6_6_3", "code": "6-3", "title": "高频句型三（初级）", "articles": [{"title": "高频句型三（初级）", "section": "", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>固定句式</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式1：I don't think...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I don't think this is a good idea.（我不认为这是个好主意。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I don't think she understands my feelings.（我不认为她明白我的感受。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I don't think this book is worth reading.（我不认为这本书值得一读。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I don't think finishing the project in a week is possible.（我不认为在一周内完成项目是可能的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I don't think you should make such a big decision in a hurry.（我不认为你应该匆忙做出这么大的决定。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式2：I wish...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I wish I were taller.（我希望我能更高一点。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I wish I knew the answer.（我希望我知道答案。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I wish I could play the guitar like you.（我希望我能像你一样弹吉他。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I wish I had more free time.（我希望我有更多的空闲时间。）            I wish I had more time to spend with my family.（我希望我有更多的时间和家人在一起。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式3：Do you want to...? 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Do you want to invest in stocks?（你想要投资股票吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Do you want to watch a movie tonight?（你今晚想要看电影吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Do you want to try this new dessert?（你想要尝试一下这个新的甜点吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Do you want to explore career opportunities abroad?（你想要探索国外的职业机会吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式4：You ought to...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You ought to apologize for your behavior.（你应该为你的行为道歉。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You ought to try the new Italian restaurant.（你应该试试这家新的意大利餐厅。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You ought to take this opportunity to advance your career.（你应该抓住这个机会来推进你的事业。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You ought to consider the environmental impact of your actions.（你应该考虑你的行为对环境的影响。）    句式5：I mean...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I mean, are you sure about this?（我的意思是，你确定要这样吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I mean, can you help with this?（我的意思是，你能帮我做这个吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I mean, I don't think that's a good idea.（我的意思是，我认为那不是个好主意。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式6：I'm considering...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm considering this problem.（我正在考虑这个问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm considering going back to school.（我正在考虑回学校。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm considering starting my own business.（我正在考虑开自己的公司。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm considering moving to a different city.（我正在考虑搬到一个不同的城市。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式7：I'm thinking about...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm thinking about learning a new skill.（我正在考虑学习一门新的技能。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm thinking about whether to get a new job.（我正在考虑是否要换个新工作。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm thinking about how to balance work and life.（我正在考虑如何平衡工作和生活。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式8：It's great that...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's great that you are taking a vacation.（你要去度假，这太棒了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's great that you are so passionate about your work.（你对工作如此热情，这太好了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式9：I was like...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I was like, \"Oh, this is amazing!\"（我当时就说，这太棒了！）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I was like, \"No way!\"（我当时就说，不可能！）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I was like, \"That's insane!\"（我当时就想，这也太疯狂了吧！）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I was like, \"You gotta be kidding me!\"（我当时就说，你一定是在开玩笑吧！）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式10：I appreciate...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I appreciate your help.（我很感激你的帮助。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I appreciate your kindness.（感谢你的善意。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I appreciate your patience with me.（感谢你对我的耐心。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I really appreciate that.（我真的很感谢。）     句式11：Thank you for...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Thank you for your help.（谢谢你的帮助。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Thank you for taking me to the hotel.（谢谢你带我去酒店。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Thank you for sharing your knowledge with me.（感谢你与我分享你的知识。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式12：I'm thinking of...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm thinking of buying a new car.（我正在考虑买一辆新车。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm thinking of taking up painting.（我正在考虑开始学画。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm thinking of going for a run later.（我正在考虑一会儿去跑步。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm thinking of reading a new book this weekend.（我正在考虑这个周末读一本新书。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式13：I'm working on...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm working on finishing my homework.（我正在努力完成作业。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm working on improving my English skills.（我正在努力提高我的英语水平。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式14：Why don't we...?   例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Why don't we go for a walk together?（我们为什么不一起去散步呢？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Why don't we leave early to avoid the traffic jam?（我们为什么不早点出发以避免交通拥堵呢？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Why don't we organize a gathering with friends to spend some good time together?（我们为什么不组织一次朋友聚会，共度美好时光呢？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式15：Do you have...? 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Do you have any questions?（你有什么疑问吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Do you have time for lunch?（你有空吃午饭吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Do you have any objections to the proposal?（你对这个提议有什么反对意见吗？）</p>"}], "id": "a_p6_6_3_01", "moduleId": "p6_6_3"}]}, {"id": "p6_6_4", "code": "6-4", "title": "高频句型四（初级）", "articles": [{"title": "高频句型四（初级）", "section": "", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>固定句式</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式1：I feel like...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I feel like taking a break.（我想要休息一下。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I feel like I'm in a dream.（我觉得自己好像在做梦。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I feel like I can't handle this alone.（我觉得我一个人无法处理这件事。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I feel like eating something sweet; it makes me feel better.（我想要吃点甜的东西，我觉得心情会好一点。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式2：Speaking of...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Speaking of sports, playing basketball is my favorite.（说到运动，打篮球是我的最爱。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Speaking of playing basketball, I was on the school team in junior high school.（说到打篮球，我初中时是校队的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Speaking of traveling, the place I most want to go is the seaside.（说到旅行，我最想去的地方是海边。）       Speaking of health, it is very important to maintain a regular schedule and diet.（说到健康，保持规律的作息和饮食很重要。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式3：It's not just...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's not just a job; it's a career.（这不仅仅是一份工作，这是一份事业。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's not just a hobby; it's a passion.（这不仅仅是一个爱好，这是一种激情。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's not just a house; it's a home.（这不仅仅是一所房子，这是一个家。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's not just about money; it's about experience.（这不仅仅是钱的问题， 这是经验的问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式4：I can't remember...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't remember her name.（我不记得她的名字了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't remember if I locked the door.（我不记得我是否锁了门。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't remember where I put my keys.（我不记得我把钥匙放哪儿了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't remember when was the last time I saw such a beautiful sunset.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（我不记得上一次看到如此美丽的日落是什么时候了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式5：I'm sorry, but...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>例句：       I'm sorry, but I don't agree with you.（对不起，我不同意你的看法。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm sorry, but I can't make it to the party.（对不起，我不能参加派对了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm sorry, but I need to cancel our appointment.（对不起，我必须取消我们的预约。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm sorry, but I have to prioritize my own work.（对不起，但是我必须优先考虑我自己的工作。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式6：I'd be happy to...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'd be happy to have lunch with you.（我很乐意和你一起吃午饭。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'd be happy to introduce you to my colleagues.（我很乐意把你介绍给我的同事。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'd be happy to take on the additional responsibility.（我很乐意承担额外的责任。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式7：I'm not sure...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not sure what to do next.（我不确定接下来该做什么。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not sure how to answer that question.（我不确定如何回答那个问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not sure if I can finish this project on time.（我不确定我是否能按时完成这个项目。）       I'm not sure if it will rain tomorrow.（我不确定明天是否会下雨。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式8：I used to...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I used to run every morning.（我曾经每天早上都去跑步。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I used to love eating ice cream.（我曾经很喜欢吃冰淇淋。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I used to be afraid of speaking in public.（我曾经害怕在公共场合讲话。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I used to dream of becoming an astronaut.（我曾经梦想成为一名宇航员。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式9：It's too... to...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's too noisy to study here.（这里太吵了，无法学习。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's too late to change the plan now.（现在太晚了，无法改变计划了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's too risky to invest in that stock.（投资那只股票风险太大了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's too complicated to explain in a few words.（这太复杂了，无法用几句话解释清楚。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式10：It takes... to...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It takes effort to achieve success.（取得成功需要努力。）           It takes courage to face your fears.（面对恐惧需要勇气。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It takes two months to finish this project.（完成这个项目需要两个月的时间。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It takes patience to deal with children.（处理孩子的事情需要耐心。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式11：You are welcome to...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You are welcome to join us for dinner.（你随时可以和我们一起吃晚餐。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You are welcome to ask me questions if you need help.（如果你需要帮助，欢迎随时问我问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You are welcome to use my computer if you need to.（如果你需要，你随时可以用我的电脑。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式12：I'm worried about...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm worried about your health.（我担心你的健康。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm worried about the outcome of the exam.（我担心考试的结果。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm worried about the weather for the picnic.（我担心我们野餐时的天气。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm worried about the impact of the new policy.（我担心新政策的影响。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式13：I have no idea...   例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I have no idea what she's talking about.（我不知道她在说什么。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I have no idea why he's so late.（我不知道为什么他这么晚。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I have no idea how the meeting went.（我不知道会议进行得如何。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I have no idea how to fix this computer.（我不知道如何修理这台电脑。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式14：I'm dying to...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm dying to know the result.（我迫切地想要知道结果。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm dying to see the new movie.（我非常想要看那部新的电影。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm dying to find a friend to confide in.（我迫切地想要找一个可以倾诉心声的朋友。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式15：I wonder if...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I wonder if it's raining.（我想知道是否下雨了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I wonder if I can borrow your pen.（我想知道是否能借你的笔用一下。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I wonder if you can help me with this project.（我想知道是否你能帮我完成这个项目。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I wonder if everyone has the chance to achieve their dreams.（我想知道是否每个人都有机会实现自己的梦想。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p6_6_4_01", "moduleId": "p6_6_4"}]}, {"id": "p6_6_5", "code": "6-5", "title": "高频句型五（初级）", "articles": [{"title": "高频句型五（初级）", "section": "", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>固定句式</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式1：It depends on...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It depends on you.（这取决于你。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It depends on the time.（这取决于时间。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It depends on my mood.（这取决于我的心情。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It depends on practicing regularly.（这取决于定期的练习。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It depends on how much time you have.（这取决于你有多少时间。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式2：It's hard to do something 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's hard to say no to dessert.（甜点让人难以抗拒。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>As an adult, it's hard to learn a new language.（成年人学新语言很难。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's hard to concentrate with so much noise.（在这么大的噪音中很难集中注意力。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's hard to believe we've been friends for ten years.（很难相信我们已经是10 年的朋友了。）          It's hard to make a decision without all the information.（在没有所有信息的情况下，很难做决定。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式3：I should have done something 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I should have got up earlier.（我本应该早点起床的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I should have told you this news sooner.（我本应该早点告诉你这个消息的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I should have eaten one more bamboo shoot today.（我本应该今天多吃一个笋来着。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I should have passed the CET-4 this time.（我本应该通过这次四级考试的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式4：Have you ever...? 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Have you ever been to Beijing?（你曾经去过北京吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Have you ever tried cooking by yourself?（你有没有曾经尝试自己做过饭？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Have you ever been to the seaside for a holiday?（你有没有曾经去过海边度假？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Have you ever thought about becoming an artist?（你有没有曾经想过成为一名艺术家？）      Have you ever traveled alone to experience different cultures?（你有没有曾经独自一个人去旅行，体验不同的文化？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式5：Would you mind doing something? 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Would you mind repeating that?（你介意重复一遍吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Would you mind closing the door?（你介意关门吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Would you mind if I sat here?（你介意我坐在这儿吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Would you mind if I opened the window?（你介意我打开窗户吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Would you mind turning down the music?（你介意把音乐关小一点儿吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式6：How come...? 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>How come you are late?（你怎么迟到了？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>How come the prices are so high?（价格怎么会这么高？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>How come you are not coming to the party?（你怎么会不来参加派对呢？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>How come the computer won't turn on?（电脑怎么会开不了机呢？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>How come you know so much about history?（你怎么会知道这么多历史？）     句式7：It's a good idea to do something 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's a good idea to start early.（早点开始是个好主意。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's a good idea to save money.（存钱是个好主意。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's a good idea to eat pizza tomorrow.（明天去吃披萨是个好主意。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's a good idea to maintain a healthy lifestyle.（保持健康的生活方式是个好主意。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式8：It's not like...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's not like I had a choice.（并不是我可以选择的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's not like what you imagine.（并不是像你想象的那样。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's not like you are the only one who's busy.（并不是只有你一个人忙。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's not like what I expected.（这并不像我所期待的那样。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's not like him to be late.（迟到可不像他的作风。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式9：It's no use doing something 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's no use waiting here.（在这里等是没有用的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's no use arguing with him.（和他争论是没有用的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's no use complaining about the weather.（抱怨天气是没有用的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's no use dreaming about becoming rich overnight.（梦想一夜暴富是没   有用的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's no use applying for jobs randomly without knowing your own strengths and the requirements of each position.（在不了解自己的优势以及每个职位的要求的情况下，随意申请工作是没有用的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式10：It's up to...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's up to you to choose the color.（由你选择颜色。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's up to us to protect the environment.（保护环境取决于我们。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's up to parents to teach their children good manners.（教孩子们懂礼貌是父母的责任。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's up to students to keep their classroom clean.（保持教室清洁是学生们的责任。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式11：I disagree with...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I disagree with this decision.（我不同意这个决定。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I disagree with the policy.（我不同意这项政策。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I disagree with the way you handled the situation.（我不同意你处理这种情况的方式。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式12：It's not worth doing something   例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's not worth running in the rain.（在雨中跑步不值得。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's not worth cleaning the old bike.（清洗那辆旧自行车不值得。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's not worth sacrificing your health for work.（不值得为了工作牺牲你的健康。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's not worth spending so much money on that fancy restaurant.（在那家高档餐厅花那么多钱不值得。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式13：I've heard that...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I've heard that this movie is worth watching.（我听说这部电影很值得一看。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I've heard that the pizza at that restaurant is delicious.（我听说那家餐厅的披萨很好吃。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I've heard that learning a new language is good for the brain.（我听说学习一门新语言对大脑有好处。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式14：I'm not good at...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not good at playing chess.（我不擅长下棋。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not good at public speaking.（我不擅长公开演讲。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not good at keeping secrets.（我不擅长保守秘密。）       I'm not good at expressing my feelings.（我不擅长表达我的感受。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式15：I'm about to do something 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm about to have dinner.（我要吃晚饭了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm about to start my new project.（我即将开始我的新项目。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm about to go on a trip and explore new scenery.（我即将去旅行，探索新的风景。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm about to finish my studies and start a new phase of life.（我即将完成我的学业，开始新的生活阶段。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p6_6_5_01", "moduleId": "p6_6_5"}]}, {"id": "p6_6_6", "code": "6-6", "title": "高频句型六（中级）", "articles": [{"title": "高频句型六（中级）", "section": "", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>固定句式</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式1：I'm counting on...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm counting on good luck.（我指望有好运。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm counting on you.（我指望你。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm counting on this pen to work.（我指望这支笔能用。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm counting on the rain to stop.（我指望雨能停下来。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm counting on you to finish the project on time.（我指望你按时完成这个项目。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式2：As long as...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>As long as you work hard, you will succeed.（只要你努力工作，你就会成功。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>As long as you are happy, that's all that matters.（只要你快乐，那才是最重要的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>As long as you are prepared, you won't be nervous.（只要你准备好了，   你就不会紧张。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>As long as you are on time, it's okay to take a break.（只要你准时，休息一下是可以的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>As long as you are honest, we can solve this problem.（只要你诚实，我们可以解决这个问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式3：Don't forget to...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Don't forget to call me.（不要忘记给我打电话。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Don't forget to take your keys.（不要忘记带钥匙。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Don't forget to turn off the lights.（不要忘记关灯。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Don't forget to submit your report before the deadline.（不要忘记在截止日期前提交你的报告。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Don't forget to review the terms and conditions carefully.（不要忘记仔细查看条款和条件。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式4：You can never...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You can never learn too much.（你永远学不够。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You can never have too much sadness.（你永远不会有太多的悲伤。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You can never go wrong by being polite.（有礼貌永远不会出错。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You can never predict the future with certainty.（你永远无法确定地预测   未来。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式5：No matter...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>No matter what others say, believe in yourself.（无论别人说什么，相信自己。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>No matter what happens, I'll be there for you.（无论发生什么，我都会在你身边。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>No matter how many times you fail, try again.（无论你失败多少次，再试一次。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>No matter what the result is, we have all tried our best.（无论结果如何， 我们都尽了最大的努力。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式6：I'd rather... than...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'd rather walk than take the bus.（我宁愿走路，也不愿坐公交。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'd rather read a book than watch TV.（我宁愿读书，也不愿看电视。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'd rather work late than leave the work unfinished.（我宁愿工作到很晚， 也不愿留下未完成的工作。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'd rather stay at home than go out in this weather.（我宁愿呆在家里， 也不愿在这种天气外出。）         I'd rather be honest than make a false promise.（我宁愿诚实，也不愿做出虚假的承诺。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式7：I'd rather not...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'd rather not discuss it right now.（我宁愿现在不讨论它。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'd rather not spend the money on something else.（我宁愿不把钱花在别的东西上。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'd rather not get involved in that argument.（我宁愿不卷入那场争论。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'd rather not eat at a restaurant; let's cook at home.（我宁愿不在外面吃饭，我们在家做吧。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式8：Whether you... or not...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Whether you agree or not, we must move on.（无论你是否同意，我们都要继续前进。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Whether you are confident or not, you should try bravely.（无论你是否有信心，都要勇敢尝试。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Whether you like it or not, this matter must be completed.（无论你是否愿意，这件事情都必须完成。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Whether you are ready or not, the exam will take place as scheduled.（无论你是否准备好，考试都将如期进行。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式9：I've been doing something 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I've been working hard.（我一直很努力。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I've been waiting for this opportunity.（我一直在等待这个机会。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I've been dreaming of becoming a doctor.（我一直梦想成为一名医生。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I've been enjoying reading all kinds of books.（我一直喜欢阅读各种类型的书籍。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I've been searching for a place where I can truly relax.（我一直在寻找一个可以让我真正放松的地方。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式10：It seems that...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It seems that it will rain soon.（看起来很快就要下雨了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It seems that he is happy.（看起来他很开心。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It seems that the cat is sleeping.（看起来那只猫正在睡觉。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It seems that the negotiations are going well.（看起来谈判进行得很顺利。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It seems that we need to reevaluate our strategy.（看起来我们需要重新评估我们的策略。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式11：I insist that...   例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I insist that you apologize to her.（我坚持你要向她道歉。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I insist that we stick to the plan.（我坚持我们按照计划行事。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I insist that you reconsider your decision.（我坚持你重新考虑你的决定。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I insist that my children learn to be independent from an early age.（我坚持我的孩子们从小就要学会独立。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I insist that the work be done by tomorrow.（我坚持这项工作必须在明天之前完成。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式12：I can't... because...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't agree with you because I have a different point of view.（我不能同意你，因为我有不同的观点。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't come to the party because I have to study for an exam.（我不能来参加派对，因为我必须为考试而学习。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't attend the meeting because I have other arrangements.（我不能参加会议，因为我有其他的安排。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式13：Could you possibly...? 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Could you possibly lend me twenty dollars?（你能借我20 美元吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Could you possibly explain that again?（你能再解释一遍吗？）       Could you possibly call me back later?（你能稍后再打给我吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Could you possibly hold this for a moment?（你能拿一下这个吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式14：I'm grateful for...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm grateful for my family.（我对我的家人心存感激。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm grateful for a stable job.（我对一份稳定的工作心存感激。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm grateful for the opportunity to work with you.（我对有机会与你合作心存感激。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm grateful to my parents.（我对我的父母非常感激。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm grateful for your assistance.（我对你的帮助心存感激。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p6_6_6_01", "moduleId": "p6_6_6"}]}, {"id": "p6_6_7", "code": "6-7", "title": "高频句型七（中级）", "articles": [{"title": "高频句型七（中级）", "section": "", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>固定句式</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式1：I apologize for...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I apologize for the delay.（我为延误而道歉。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I apologize for being late to the meeting.（我为开会迟到而道歉。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I apologize for losing your book.（我为弄丢了你的书而道歉。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I apologize for the noise I made last night.（我为昨晚制造的噪音而道歉。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I apologize for the delay in delivering the goods.（我为货物交付的延迟而道歉。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式2：Have you considered...? 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Have you considered changing your job?（你有没有考虑过换份工作？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Have you considered buying a new car?（你有没有考虑过买辆新车？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Have you considered going on a vacation?（你有没有考虑过度假？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Have you considered adopting a pet from the animal shelter?（你有没有   考虑过从动物收容所领养一只宠物？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Have you considered painting your room a different color to give it a fresh look?（你有没有考虑过把你的房间漆成不同的颜色，让它焕然一新？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式3：Be sure to...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Be sure to lock the door.（你要确保把门锁好。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Be sure to hand in your homework on time.（务必要按时交作业。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Be sure to tell her the news when you see her.（见到她的时候，一定要告诉她这个消息。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Be sure to bring your passport when you travel abroad.（出国旅行一定要带上护照。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Be sure to follow the instructions carefully.（一定要仔细遵循说明。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式4：You might as well...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You might as well take an umbrella with you.（你不妨带上一把雨伞。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You might as well try on this dress.（你不妨试穿一下这条裙子。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You might as well join us for dinner.（你不妨和我们一起吃晚饭。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You might as well book the tickets early.（你不妨早点预定车票。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You might as well read that classic novel thoroughly since you have        started it.（既然你已经开始读那本经典小说了，这次不妨把它通读一遍。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式5：It's your turn to...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's your turn to speak.（轮到你说话了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's your turn to make a decision.（轮到你做决定了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's your turn to do the dishes.（轮到你洗碗了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's your turn to show your new work.（轮到你展示你的作品了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's your turn to tidy up the conference room.（现在轮到你整理会议室了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式6：I'm disappointed that...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm disappointed that you didn't call me.（你没有打电话给我，这让我感到失望。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm disappointed that the store is closed.（商店关门了，这让我感到失望。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm disappointed that the team lost the game.（球队输了比赛，这让我感到失望。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm disappointed that the concert was cancelled.（我期待已久的音乐会取消了，这让我感到失望。）       I'm disappointed that the project has been postponed indefinitely.（我对这个项目被无限期推迟感到失望。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式7：I don't have time to...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I don't have time to watch TV.（我没有时间看电视。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I don't have time to deal with these trivial matters.（我没有时间处理这些琐事。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I don't have time to analyze those complex data right now.（我现在没时间分析那些复杂的数据。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I don't have time to water the plants.（我没有时间给植物浇水。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I don't have time to update my resume if I'm planning to look for a new job.（如果我打算找新工作，我没有时间更新我的简历。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式8：It's about time to...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's about time to clean up your room.（是时候该打扫你的房间了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's about time to water the plants.（是时候该给植物浇水了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's about time to book the tickets if we want to go on that trip.（如果我们想要在假期去旅行，差不多该订机票了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's about time to update your resume if you are planning to look for a new job.（如果你打算找新工作，差不多该更新你的简历了。）          It's about time to build a snowman when it snows this winter.（冬天快要来了，我迫不及待想要在今年冬天堆雪人。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式9：It's frustrating to...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's frustrating to have to wait for so long.（要等这么长时间真是令人沮丧。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's frustrating to not have a clear answer.（没有一个明确的答案真是令人沮丧。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's frustrating to deal with this computer problem.（处理这个电脑问题真是令人沮丧。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's frustrating to have a flat tire.（车胎瘪了真是太让人沮丧了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's frustrating to get stuck in traffic.（遇上堵车真是令人沮丧。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式10：I can't wait to...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't wait to see you.（我迫不及待想要见到你。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't wait to hear the results.（我迫不及待想听到结果。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't wait to go on vacation.（我迫不及待想去度假。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't wait to try that new restaurant.（我迫不及待想要试试那家新的餐厅。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't wait to build a snowman when it snows this winter.（冬天快要来   了，我迫不及待想要在今年冬天堆雪人。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式11：Are you free to...? 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Are you free to meet tomorrow?（你明天有空见面吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Are you free to assist with this task?（你有空帮忙这个任务吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Are you free to attend a seminar with me this Friday?（这个周五，你有空和我一起参加一个研讨会吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Are you free to come over and play board games with us this weekend? （这个周末你有空过来和我们一起玩桌游吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式12：I didn't mean to...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I didn't mean to hurt your feelings.（我不是故意伤害你的感情。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I didn't mean to disturb you while you were sleeping.（我不是有意在你睡觉的时候打扰你。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I didn't mean to interfere in your personal affairs.（我不是有意干涉你的个人事务。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I didn't mean to criticize you harshly.（我不是故意严厉批评你的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式13：You don't have to...   例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You don't have to worry about it.（你不必为此担心。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You don't have to work overtime tonight.（你今晚不必加班。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You don't have to buy me a gift.（你不必给我买礼物。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You don't have to master all the grammar rules.（你不必掌握所有的语法规则。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You don't have to feel obliged to attend every single event organized by the club.（你不必觉得有义务参加俱乐部组织的每一个活动。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式14：There is no need to...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>There is no need to panic.（没有必要惊慌。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>There is no need to rush.（没有必要这么匆忙。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>There is no need to be so formal.（没有必要这么正式。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>There is no need to worry about the details.（没有必要担心细节。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式15：It's not often that...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's not often that we get such a good opportunity.（我们并不常能得到这么好的机会。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's not often that I meet such friendly colleagues.（我并不常遇到这么友好的同事。）          It's not often that you meet someone who can play multiple musical instruments.（你并不能常遇到一个能够演奏多种乐器的人。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p6_6_7_01", "moduleId": "p6_6_7"}]}, {"id": "p6_6_8", "code": "6-8", "title": "高频句型八（中级）", "articles": [{"title": "高频句型八（中级）", "section": "", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>固定句式</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式1：I'm a big fan of...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm a big fan of music.（我是音乐的忠实粉丝。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm a big fan of basketball.（我是篮球的忠实粉丝。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm a big fan of cooking and delicious food.（我是烹饪和美食的忠实粉丝。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm a big fan of exploring the unknown world.（我是探索未知世界的忠实粉丝。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm a big fan of science fiction movies.（我是科幻电影的忠实粉丝。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式2：I'm afraid I can't...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm afraid I can't support your proposal.（恐怕我不能支持你的提议。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm afraid I can't help you with that.（恐怕我不能帮你做那件事。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm afraid I can't agree with your decision.（恐怕我不能同意你的决定。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm afraid I can't lend you the money.（恐怕我不能借钱给你。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式3：What do you think about...? 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>What do you think about the plan for the trip?（你觉得这次旅行的计划怎么样？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>What do you think about the latest scientific discovery?（你觉得最新的科学发现怎么样？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>What do you think about online learning?（你对在线学习有什么看法？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>What do you think about the recent increase in food delivery fees?（你对最近外卖配送费上涨这件事有什么看法？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式4：It's high time I...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's high time I started exercising.（是我开始锻炼的时候了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's high time I learned a new skill.（是我学习新技能的时候了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's high time I let go of the past and embraced a new life.（是我放下过去，迎接新生活的时候了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's high time I improved my cooking skills.（是我提升一下我的烹饪技能的时候了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式5：I can't stand...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>例句：            I can't stand the noise.（我受不了噪音。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't stand spicy food.（我受不了辣的食物。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't stand arrogant people.（我受不了傲慢的人。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't stand being treated like that.（我受不了被这样对待。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't stand sitting in a stuffy classroom all day.（我受不了整天坐在闷热的教室里。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式6：I'm looking forward to...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm looking forward to the weekend.（我期待着周末。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm looking forward to meeting you.（我期待着见到你。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm looking forward to the opportunity to travel abroad.（我期待着出国旅行的机会。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式7：I'm not interested in...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not interested in watching TV tonight.（我对晚上看电视不感兴趣。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not interested in learning how to play chess.（我对学习下棋不感兴趣。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not interested in gossip.（我对流言蜚语不感兴趣。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not interested in that job offer.（我对那个工作机会不感兴趣。）    句式8：I don't see why...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I don't see why we can't do it.（我不明白我们为什么不能这么做。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I don't see why we shouldn't take the risk.（我不明白我为什么不应该冒险。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I don't see why she got so angry.（我不明白她为什么这么生气。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I don't see why you have to leave so early.（我不明白你为什么必须这么早离开。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I don't see why they're so obsessed with fame and fortune.（我不明白为什么这些人对名利如此痴迷。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式9：It's time for somebody to...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's time for us to take a break.（是我们休息一下的时候了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's time for them to learn responsibility.（是他们学习责任感的时候了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式10：I'm sorry to hear that...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm sorry to hear that you are not feeling well.（听到你不舒服，我很难过。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm sorry to hear that you are having trouble at work.（听到你工作上有麻烦，我很难过。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式11：It's a shame that...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's a shame that we have to say goodbye.（真遗憾我们不得不说再见。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's a shame that you can't come to the party.（真遗憾你不能来参加派对。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's a shame that you missed the deadline.（真遗憾你错过了截止日期。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's a shame that there are still so many children in the world who don't have access to education.（很遗憾世界上仍然有那么多孩子无法接受教育。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式12：You are not supposed to...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You are not supposed to park here.（你不应该在这里停车。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You are not supposed to run in the hallways.（你不应该在走廊里跑。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You are not supposed to eat at your desk.（你不应该在办公桌上吃东西。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式13：I'm not worried about...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not worried about the presentation. I'm well prepared.（我不担心演讲，我准备得很充分。）       I'm not worried about the future. I have a good plan.（我不担心未来， 我有一个好计划。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not worried about the competition. We have a strong team.（我不担心竞争，我们有一个强大的团队。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not worried about my financial situation for now.（我不担心我目前的财务状况。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式14：I can't help but...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't help but worry about you.（我忍不住会担心你。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't help but laugh at that joke.（我禁不住对那个笑话发笑。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't help but feel excited about the new opportunity.（我忍不住对新的机会感到兴奋。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't help but be curious about what happened next.（我禁不住对接下来发生的事感到好奇。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式15：I'm really excited about...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm really excited about the upcoming trip.（我对即将到来的旅行感到非常兴奋。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm really excited about the new video game that's set to release next week.（我对下周即将发布的新的电子游戏感到非常兴奋。）       I'm really excited about the science fair next month.（我对下个月的科技展感到非常兴奋。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p6_6_8_01", "moduleId": "p6_6_8"}]}, {"id": "p6_6_9", "code": "6-9", "title": "高频句型九（中级）", "articles": [{"title": "高频句型九（中级）", "section": "", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>固定句式</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式1：I'm not sure how to do something 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not sure how to write a letter.（我不确定如何写信。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not sure how to open this box.（我不确定如何打开这个盒子。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not sure how to plant a flower.（我不确定如何种花。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not sure how to make a paper airplane.（我不确定如何折一架纸飞机。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not sure how to deal with this problem.（我不确定如何处理这个问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式2：I'd appreciate it if...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'd appreciate it if you could explain that again.（如果你能再解释一遍， 我会非常感激的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'd appreciate it if you could recommend a good book.（如果你能推荐一本好书，我会非常感激的。）         I'd appreciate it if you could cover for me tomorrow.（如果你明天能替我上班，我会非常感激的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'd appreciate it if you could fix my computer.（如果你能修好我的计算机，我会非常感激的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'd appreciate it if you could accompany me to the hospital tomorrow.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（如果你明天能陪我去医院，我会非常感激的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式3：It's a pleasure to do something 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's a pleasure to meet you.（很高兴见到你。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's a pleasure to help you.（我很乐意帮助你。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's a pleasure to see you again.（再次见到你真高兴。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's a pleasure to work with such a talented team.（和这样一个有才华的团队合作是一种乐趣。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式4：I don't know how to do something 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I don't know how to cook.（我不知道如何做饭。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I don't know how to solve this problem.（我不知道如何解决这个问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I don't know how to improve my English level.（我不知道如何提高我的英语水平。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I don't know how to balance work and life.（我不知道如何平衡工作和   生活。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I don't know how to operate this new machine.（我不知道如何操作这台新机器。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式5：I can't believe that...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't believe that the movie is so long.（我真不敢相信电影这么长。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't believe that you're getting married.（我真不敢相信你要结婚了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't believe that it's already December.（我真不敢相信已经是12 月了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't believe that we graduated already.（我真不敢相信我们已经毕业了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式6：I can't believe it's...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't believe it's you.（我真不敢相信是你。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't believe it's snowing in April.（我真不敢相信4 月还在下雪。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't believe it's been ten years since we met.（我真不敢相信我们已经认识10 年了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't believe it's been five months since I started this job.（我真不敢相信我开始这份工作已经5 个月了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式7：I'm afraid I'll have to...   例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm afraid I'll have to ask you to leave.（恐怕我得请你离开。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm afraid I'll have to work overtime tonight.（恐怕我今晚得加班。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm afraid I'll have to decline the invitation.（恐怕我得拒绝这个邀请。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm afraid I'll have to cancel my subscription to that magazine.（恐怕我得取消我对那本杂志的订阅。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式8：I've been planning to do something 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I've been planning to travel.（我一直计划着去旅行。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I've been planning to learn a new language.（我一直计划着学习一门新的语言。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I've been planning to write a book about my life experiences.（我一直计划着写一本关于我人生经历的书。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I've been planning to redecorate my bedroom.（我一直计划着重新装饰我的卧室。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式9：I've had enough of something 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I've had enough of this boring life.（我已经受够了这种无聊的生活。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I've had enough of your excuses.（我已经受够了你的借口。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I've had enough of endless overtime work.（我已经受够了无休止的加   班。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I've had enough of these hot days without air conditioning.（我已经受够了没有空调的炎热天气。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式10：It's apparent that...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's apparent that he's very tired.（很明显他非常累。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's apparent that he loves the gift.（很明显他很喜欢这个礼物。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's apparent that her efforts have paid off.（很明显她的努力得到了回报。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's apparent that we need more help to finish the project.（很明显我们需要更多的帮助来完成这个项目。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式11：I'm fed up with something 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm fed up with the traffic here.（我受够了这里的交通。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm fed up with these constant interruptions.（我受够了这些不断的打扰。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式12：You might want to do something 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You might want to read the instructions carefully.（你可能想要仔细阅读说明。）      You might want to start saving money early.（你可能想要早点开始存钱。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You might want to double-check your work.（你可能想要再次检查一下你的工作。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You might want to consider a different approach.（你可能想要考虑一个不同的方法。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式13：There's no point in doing something 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>There's no point in arguing about it.（争论这个是没有意义的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>There's no point in worrying about something you can't change.（担心你不能改变的事情是没有意义的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式14：There's no way he/she...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>There's no way he will give up on his dreams.（他绝对不可能放弃自己的梦想。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>There's no way he can finish the project on time.（他绝不可能按时完成这个项目。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>There's no way he will make a decision without sufficient evidence.（他绝不可能在没有足够证据的情况下做决定。）     句式15：It's not fair to do something 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's not fair to cut in line.（插队是不公平的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's not fair to keep the cat locked up all day.（整天把猫锁起来是不公平的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's not fair to laugh at someone's mistakes.（嘲笑别人的错误是不公平的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's not fair to treat different people differently just because of their appearance.（仅仅因为外表就区别对待不同的人是不公平的。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p6_6_9_01", "moduleId": "p6_6_9"}]}, {"id": "p6_6_10", "code": "6-10", "title": "高频句型十（中级）", "articles": [{"title": "高频句型十（中级）", "section": "", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>固定句式</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式1：There's something wrong with...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>There's something wrong with my computer.（我的电脑有点问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>There's something wrong with my English.（我的英语好像有点问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>There's something wrong with my mother.（我妈妈好像出了点问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>There's something wrong with the elevator.（这部电梯有问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>There's something wrong with the water heater.（这个热水器有点问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>There's something wrong with the printer.（这个打印机有问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式2：I'm not in the mood for doing something 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not in the mood for going out.（我没有心情出去。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not in the mood for talking right now.（我现在没有心情聊天。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not in the mood for cooking a fancy meal.（我没心情做一顿丰盛的饭菜。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not in the mood for going to the beach this afternoon.（今天下午我   没有心情去海滩。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not in the mood for doing any DIY projects this week.（这周我没心情做任何DIY 项目。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式3：I agree with you that...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I agree with you that the movie was excellent.（我同意这部电影很精彩。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I agree with you that we should study more.（我同意我们应该多学习。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I agree with you that this is a good investment.（我同意这是一项好的投资。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I agree with you that this project has great potential for development.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（我同意你的观点，这个项目有很大的发展潜力。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式4：It's incredible that...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's incredible that you remembered my birthday.（你竟然记得我的生日， 真是不可思议。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's incredible that she climbed the mountain alone.（她一个人爬上了那座山，真是不可思议。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's incredible that you managed to solve the puzzle.（你设法解开了这个谜题，真是不可思议。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's incredible that they built this bridge in just one year.（他们竟然在仅仅一年之内建起了这座桥，真是不可思议。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式5：It's hard to imagine...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's hard to imagine a world without music.（很难想象一个没有音乐的世界。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's hard to imagine life without the Internet.（很难想象没有互联网的生活。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's hard to imagine living on the moon.（很难想象在月球上生活。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's hard to imagine what the sky looks like from the moon.（很难想象从月球上看天空是什么样子。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式6：You don't seem to...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You don't seem to be happy.（你好像不开心。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You don't seem to understand.（你好像不太理解。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You don't seem to be interested.（你似乎不感兴趣。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You don't seem to be in a hurry.（你好像不着急。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You don't seem to attach importance to this problem.（你似乎不重视这个问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式7：I hate it when...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>例句：            I hate it when people are late.（我很讨厌别人迟到。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I hate it when my phone battery dies.（我手机没电的时候，我很生气。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I hate it when it rains.（我讨厌下雨天。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I hate it when people talk loudly in the library.（当人们在图书馆大声说话时，我很生气。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I hate it when someone cuts in line.（有人插队，我很生气。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式8：I'm with you on...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm with you on this project.（我同意这个项目。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm with you on the decision to buy the house.（我同意买房子的决定。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm with you on the idea of going on a vacation.（我同意去度假的想法。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm with you on your view that we should be more environmentally friendly.（我同意你的观点，我们应该更加环保。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式9：That is to say...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He is very clever. That is to say, he learns things quickly.（他很聪明，也就是说他学东西很快。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She is very diligent. That is to say, she always works hard.（她很勤奋，也就是说她总是努力工作。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He is very patient. That is to say, he can wait for a long time without        getting angry.（他很有耐心，也就是说他可以等待很长时间而不生气。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The place is very quiet. That is to say, it is very suitable for relaxation.（这个地方很安静，也就是说它很适合放松。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式10：You don't have to tell me...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You don't have to tell me you were sorry.（你不必告诉我你很抱歉。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You don't have to tell me how busy you are.（你不必告诉我你有多忙。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You don't have to tell me that I made a mistake.（你不必告诉我我犯了一个错误。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You don't have to tell me that you are disappointed with the outcome.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（你不必告诉我你对结果感到失望。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式11：When it comes to...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>When it comes to sports, many people like running.（当提到运动的时候， 很多人喜欢跑步。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>When it comes to traveling, many places are worth visiting.（说到旅游， 很多地方都值得一去。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>When it comes to cooking, some people find it very interesting.（说到做饭，有些人觉得很有趣。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>When it comes to listening to music, everyone's preferences are different.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（说到听音乐，每个人的喜好都不一样。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式12：I'd be lost without...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'd be lost without my glasses.（没有眼镜，我会迷失方向。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'd be lost without maps when traveling to a new place.（到一个新的地方，我没有地图会迷失方向。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'd be lost without my smartphone.（没有我的智能手机，我会不知所措。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式13：Please forgive me for...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Please forgive me for my fault.（请原谅我的过失。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Please forgive me for forgetting your birthday.（请原谅我忘记了你的生日。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Please forgive me for not being able to attend.（请原谅我不能出席。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Please forgive me for any inconvenience my actions may have caused.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（请原谅我的行为给你带来的不便。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式14：I can't get used to doing something 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't get used to working night shift.（我无法习惯上夜班。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't get used to eating spicy food.（我无法习惯吃辛辣的食物。）            I can't get used to wearing glasses.（我不太习惯戴眼镜。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't get used to the cultural nuances of living in a foreign country.（我无法习惯在外国生活时的文化细微差别。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p6_6_10_01", "moduleId": "p6_6_10"}]}, {"id": "p6_6_11", "code": "6-11", "title": "高频句型十一（高级）", "articles": [{"title": "高频句型十一（高级）", "section": "", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>固定句式</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式1：Would it be possible for you to do something? 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Would it be possible for you to open the window?（你能开个窗户吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Would it be possible for you to attend the meeting on Monday?（你周一能参加会议吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Would it be possible for you to introduce me to your manager?（你能把我介绍给你们的经理吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Would it be possible for you to share your experience of studying abroad? （你能否分享一下你的出国留学经历？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Would it be possible for you to finish this report and send it to me by tomorrow?（你明天之前能完成这份报告并发送给我吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式2：I hope you can forgive me for...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I hope you can forgive me for my oversight.（我希望你能原谅我的疏忽。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I hope you can forgive me for not inviting you.（我希望你能原谅我没有   邀请你。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I hope you can forgive me for losing your book.（我希望你能原谅我丢了你的书。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I hope you can forgive me for not replying to your email promptly.（我希望你能原谅我没有及时回复你的邮件。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式3：It was wrong of me to do something.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It was wrong of me to lie.（我撒谎是不对的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It was wrong of me to lose my temper.（我发脾气是不对的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It was wrong of me not to keep my promise.（我没有遵守承诺是不对的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It was wrong of me not to watch the courses last night.（我昨天晚上没有看课程是不对的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式4：I have a feeling that...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I have a feeling that it's going to rain.（我有种感觉会下雨。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I have a feeling that she's not telling the truth.（我有种感觉她没说实话。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I have a feeling that we are being watched.（我有种感觉我们被监视了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I have a feeling that this investment will pay off.（我有种感觉这项投资   会有回报。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式5：I can't say that...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't say that I have a great sense of direction.（我不能说我有很强的方向感。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't say that I approve of their way of doing things.（我还不能说我赞成他们做事的方式。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't say that I'm happy with the current situation.（我还不能说我对目前的情况满意。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't say that I'm proficient in using this new software yet.（我还不能说我已经精通使用这款新的软件了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式6：Have you thought about...? 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Have you thought about the movie we watched last night?（你有没有想过我们昨天晚上看的那部电影？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Have you thought about the impact of social media on our daily lives? （你有没有想过社交媒体对我们日常生活的影响？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Have you thought about the news I just heard about our old friend?（你有没有想过我刚听到的关于我们老朋友的消息？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式7：You will never guess...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You will never guess whom I just ran into.（你永远猜不到我刚刚碰到谁了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You will never guess what happened at work today.（你永远猜不到今天工作中发生了什么。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You will never guess which movie won the Oscar.（你永远猜不到哪部电影赢得了奥斯卡奖。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You will never guess the news I just heard about our old friend.（你永远猜不到我刚听到的关于我们老朋友的消息。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式8：I'm not convinced that...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not convinced that he is telling the truth.（我不信服他在说真话。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not convinced that this policy is beneficial to us.（我不信服这个政策对我们有利。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not convinced that we should invest in this company.（我不相信我们应该投资这家公司。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式9：It's important to remember that...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>例句：          It's important to remember that practice makes perfect.（重要的是要记住熟能生巧。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's important to remember that actions speak louder than words.（重要的是要记住行动胜于言词。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's important to remember that you can't please everyone.（重要的是要记住你不能取悦每个人。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's important to note that the study has limitations.（重要的是要注意研究有局限性。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式10：I owe you one for...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I owe you one for the ticket.（你提供我的票，我欠你一个人情。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I owe you one for giving me such great advice.（你提了这么好的建议， 我欠你一个人情。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I owe you one for introducing me to that amazing client.（你把我介绍给那个很棒的客户，我欠你一个人情。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式11：I find it relaxing to...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I find it relaxing to listen to music.（我发现听音乐很放松。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I find it relaxing to take a hot bath.（我发现泡热水澡很放松。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I find it relaxing to walk in a quiet park.（我发现在安静的公园里散步很   放松。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式12：It seems to me that...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It seems to me that we should take a break.（在我看来，我们应该休息一下。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It seems to me that you are overreacting.（在我看来，你反应过激了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It seems to me that we need to reconsider our strategy.（在我看来，我们需要重新考虑我们的策略。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式13：If I were you, I would...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>If I were you, I would go to bed early.（如果我是你，我会早点休息。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>If I were you, I would read more books.（如果我是你，我会多读书。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>If I were you, I would travel to see the world.（如果我是你，我会去旅行看看世界。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>If I were you, I would apologize to him immediately.（如果我是你，我会立即向他道歉。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p6_6_11_01", "moduleId": "p6_6_11"}]}, {"id": "p6_6_12", "code": "6-12", "title": "高频句型十二（高级）", "articles": [{"title": "高频句型十二（高级）", "section": "", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>固定句式</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式1：I come to realize that...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I come to realize that time is really precious.（我逐渐意识到时间真的很宝贵。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I come to realize that hard work pays off.（我逐渐意识到努力工作是有回报的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I come to realize that many people are suffering from stress in modern society.（我逐渐意识到现代社会中很多人都承受着压力。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I come to realize that making mistakes is a normal part of learning.（我逐渐意识到犯错是学习中正常的一部分。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I come to realize that painting allows me to express my feelings in a unique way.（我逐渐意识到绘画能让我以一种独特的方式表达自己的感情。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式2：I was wondering if you'd like to...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>例句：            I was wondering if you'd like to have a coffee together.（我在想你是否想一起喝杯咖啡。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I was wondering if you'd like to see a movie with me.（我在想你是否想和我一起去看电影。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I was wondering if you'd like to play tennis with me on Sunday.（我在想你是否想在周日和我一起打网球。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I was wondering if you'd like to go to a YOGA class with me.（我在想你是否想和我一起去上瑜伽课。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式3：It's not that I don't want to...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's not that I don't want to learn, I just find it difficult.（并不是我不想学， 我只是觉得有点难。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's not that I don't want to go, I just can't afford it.（并不是我不想去了， 我只是负担不起。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's not that I don't want to trust you, I just need more information.（并不是我不想信任你，我只是需要更多信息。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's not that I don't want to help, I just don't have the time.（并不是我不想帮忙，我只是没有时间。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式4：You wouldn't happen to...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>例句：      You wouldn't happen to know her number, would you?（你不会碰巧知道她的电话号码吧？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You wouldn't happen to be interested in going to the concert, would you? （你不会碰巧对去音乐会感兴趣吧？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You wouldn't happen to have seen a lost dog around here, would you? （你不会碰巧在这附近看到一只走失的狗吧？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式5：It is often argued that...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It is often argued that education is the key to success.（人们经常争论说教育是成功的关键。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It is often argued that technology has changed our lives.（人们经常争论说科技改变了我们的生活。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It is often argued that environmental protection should be everyone's responsibility.（人们经常争论说环保应该是每个人的责任。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It is often argued that globalization has both benefits and challenges for economic development.（人们经常争论说全球化对经济发展既有好处也有挑战。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式6：A common misconception is that...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A common misconception is that eating too many vegetables can cause       weight gain.（一个常见的误解是多吃蔬菜会发胖。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A common misconception is that artificial intelligence will completely replace humans in the workplace.（一个常见的误解是人工智能会完全取代职场中的人类。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A common misconception is that drinking coffee is bad for your health all the time.（一个常见的误解是喝咖啡一直对健康有害。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A common misconception is that eating too much fruit can raise blood sugar levels.（一个常见的误解是多吃水果会导致血糖升高。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式7：It is generally accepted that...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It is generally accepted that water is the source of life.（人们普遍认为水是生命之源。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It is generally accepted that exercise helps to improve physical fitness.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（人们普遍认为锻炼有助于增强身体素质。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It is generally accepted that education is crucial to an individual's growth.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（人们普遍认为教育对个人的成长至关重要。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It is generally accepted that peace and development are the two major themes of today's world.（人们普遍认为和平与发展是当今世界的两大主题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式8：You have my word that...   例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You have my word that I'll keep it a secret.（我保证我会保守秘密。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You have my word that I'll support you.（我保证我会支持你。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You have my word that I'll do my best.（我保证我会尽我最大的努力。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You have my word that I'll complete the project by the deadline.（我保证我会在截止日期前完成项目。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式9：It's not a matter of...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's not a matter of how much, but how well.（这不是多少的问题，而是质量的问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's not a matter of if, but when.（这不是是否的问题，而是何时的问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's not a matter of luck, but preparation.（这不是运气的问题，而是准备的问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's not a matter of winning or losing, but taking part.（这不是输赢的问题，而是参与的问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式10：It's never too late to do something.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's never too late to start exercising.（开始锻炼永远不会太晚。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's never too late to learn a new language.（学习一门新语言永远不会太晚。）          It's never too late to tell someone you love them.（告诉别人你爱他们永远不会太晚。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's never too late to change your career.（改变职业永远不会太晚。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式11：It goes without saying that...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It goes without saying that health is the most important.（不用说，健康是最重要的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It goes without saying that water is the source of life.（不用说，水是生命之源。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It goes without saying that family is our strongest support.（不用说，家庭是我们最坚强的后盾。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式12：I'm not sure if...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not sure if that's what she really wants.（我不确定那是否真的是她想要的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not sure if that's a wise decision.（我不确定那是否是个明智的决定。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not sure if you know that she has moved.（我不确定你是否知道她搬家了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not sure if you know how much this means to me.（我不确定你是否知道这对我来说有多重要。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式13：You don't have to be a genius to do something.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You don't have to be a genius to see she's lying.（你不必是天才也能看出她在撒谎。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You don't have to be a genius to know that's a bad idea.（你不必是天才也知道那是个坏主意。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You don't have to be a genius to enjoy music.（你不必是天才也能欣赏音乐。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You don't have to be a genius to learn a new skill.（学习一项新技能，你不必非得是个天才。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p6_6_12_01", "moduleId": "p6_6_12"}]}, {"id": "p6_6_13", "code": "6-13", "title": "高频句型十三（高级）", "articles": [{"title": "高频句型十三（高级）", "section": "", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>固定句式</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式1：How long does it take to do something? 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>How long does it take to cook this dish?（做这道菜需要多长时间？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>How long does it take to walk there?（走到那里需要多长时间？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>How long does it take to complete this project?（完成这个项目需要多长时间？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>How long does it take to learn a new skill?（学会一门技能需要多长时间？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>How long does it take to knit a scarf?（织一条围巾需要多长时间？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>How long does it take to read a medium-sized novel?（读完一本中等篇幅的小说需要多长时间？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式2：To put it another way...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He's very busy. To put it another way, he doesn't have much free time.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（他非常忙。换句话说，他没有太多空闲时间。）        This problem is very complicated. To put it another way, it is not easy to solve.（这个问题很复杂。换句话说，它不容易解决。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She is very talented. To put it another way, she excels in many ways.（她很有才华。换句话说，她在很多方面都表现出色。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>This place is very beautiful. To put it another way, it is worth visiting.（这个地方很美丽。换句话说，它值得一游。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>He is very brave. To put it another way, he's not afraid to face difficulties.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（他很勇敢。换句话说，他不害怕面对困难。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式3：Is there any chance you could...? 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Is there any chance you could join us for dinner?（你有没有可能和我一起吃个晚餐？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Is there any chance you could finish this work earlier?（你有没有可能早点完成这项工作？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Is there any chance you could take me to the airport?（你有没有可能带我去一下机场？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Is there any chance you could help me carry these bags?（你有没有可能帮我提一下这些包？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式4：This can be attributed to...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>例句：        This can be attributed to his efforts.（这可以归因于他的努力。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>This can be attributed to a positive attitude.（这可以归因于积极的态度。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The popularity of online shopping can be attributed to its convenience.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（网上购物的流行可以归因于它的便利性。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The decline in the stock market can be attributed to the unstable global economic situation.（股市的下跌可以归因于不稳定的全球经济形势。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式5：It is widely accepted that...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It is widely accepted that hard work leads to success.（人们广泛接受努力工作会带来成功。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It is widely accepted that exercise helps keep fit.（人们广泛接受运动有助于保持健康。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It is widely accepted that education is an important way to change one's destiny.（人们广泛接受教育是改变命运的重要途径。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式6：There are several reasons for + 名词/名词短语 There are several reasons why + 完整句子例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>There are several reasons for people's growing focus on health.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（人们越来越重视健康是有原因的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>There are several reasons for high pressure in modern society.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（现代社会压力大是有很多原因的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>There are several reasons why learning English is important.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（学习英语是很重要的，有几个原因。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>There are several reasons why people enjoy traveling.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（很多人喜欢旅行，这是有原因的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式7：To the best of my knowledge...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>To the best of my knowledge, it will be sunny tomorrow.（据我所知，明天是个晴天。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>To the best of my knowledge, the museum is closed on Mondays.（据我所知，这家博物馆每周一都闭馆。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>To the best of my knowledge, they are planning to launch a new product next month.（据我所知，他们正计划下个月推出一款新的产品。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式8：It's worth mentioning that...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's worth mentioning that he performed exceptionally well today.（值得一提的是，他今天表现非常出色。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's worth mentioning that this book offers a lot of practical advice.（值得一提的是，这本书提供了很多实用的建议。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's worth mentioning that this city has a rich historical and cultural    heritage.（值得一提的是，这个城市有着丰富的历史文化遗产。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式9：At the end of the day...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>At the end of the day, health is the most important.（归根结底，健康才是最重要的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>At the end of the day, the support and understanding of my family are my strongest backing.（归根结底，家人的支持和理解是我最坚强的后盾。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>At the end of the day, no matter what difficulties we encounter, we cannot give up on our dreams.（归根结底，无论遇到什么困难，我们都不能放弃梦想。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式10：It's been a while since I did something.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's been a while since I traveled.（自从我旅行已经有一段时间了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's been a while since I saw you.（自从我见到你已经有一段时间了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's been a while since I wrote a letter by hand.（自从我上一次手写一封信已经有一段时间了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's been a while since I was a student.（自从我还是学生已经有一段时间了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式11：I'm not in a position to do something.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not in a position to judge.（我没有资格评判。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not in a position to help you financially.（我没有条件在经济上帮助你。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not in a position to approve your request for a raise at present.（我目前没有条件批准你加薪的请求。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式12：I was wondering if you could...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I was wondering if you could water my plants while I'm away.（我在想你是否能在我外出的时候帮我浇花。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I was wondering if you could help me translate this report into English.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（我在想你是否能帮我把这份报告翻译成英文。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式13：I'm not the kind of person who...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not the kind of person who lies.（我不是那种爱撒谎的人。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not the kind of person who stays up late.（我不是那种熬夜的人。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not the kind of person who gives up easily.（我不是那种轻易放弃的人。）       I'm not the kind of person who procrastinates.（我不是那种爱拖延的人。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p6_6_13_01", "moduleId": "p6_6_13"}]}, {"id": "p6_6_14", "code": "6-14", "title": "高频句型十四（高级）", "articles": [{"title": "高频句型十四（高级）", "section": "", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>固定句式</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式1：It is estimated that...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It is estimated that it will rain today.（据估计，今天会下雨。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It is estimated that the sales of this book have reached five hundred thousand copies.（据估计，这本书的销量已经达到了50 万册。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It is estimated that the project will take three months to complete.（据估计，这个项目需要3 个月才能完成。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It  is estimated that the company's revenue  will increase by fifteen percent next year.（据估计，该公司明年的营收将增长15%。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式2：With the advent of...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>With the advent of a new era, everything comes back to life.（随着新时代的到来，万物复苏。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>With the advent of technology, people's  lives have become more convenient.（随着科技的发展，人们的生活越来越便利。）      With the advent of globalization, exchanges and cooperation between countries have become increasingly frequent.（随着全球化的推进，各国之间的交流与合作日益频繁。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式3：I've come to the conclusion that...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I've come to the conclusion that reading books is helpful to me.（我得出结论，读书对我很有帮助。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I've come to the conclusion that we should cherish every moment.（我得出结论，我们应该珍惜每一刻。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I've come to the conclusion that teamwork  is more effective than working alone.（我得出结论，团队合作比单打独斗更有效果。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式4：There is evidence to suggest that...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>There is evidence to suggest that the strategy worked.（有证据表明这个策略奏效了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>There is evidence to suggest that the climate is changing.（有证据表明气候正在变化。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>There  is evidence  to  suggest  that numerous  wildlife  species  are endangered.（有证据表明许多野生动物物种正面临灭绝的风险。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式5：It has been proven that...   例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It has been proven that listening to music can relax people.（已经证明听音乐可以放松心情。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It has been proven that eating more fruits is good for the body.（已经证明多吃水果对身体有好处。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It has been proven that getting enough sleep is essential for good health.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（已经证明充足睡眠对健康至关重要。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式6：The fact that... cannot be ignored.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The fact that plastic pollution is harming marine life cannot be ignored.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（塑料污染正在危害海洋生物这一事实不容忽视。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The fact that climate change is accelerating glacier melting cannot be ignored.（气候变化正在加速冰川融化这一事实不容忽视。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式7：It is widely acknowledged that...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It is widely acknowledged that the rapid development of technology has greatly changed our way of life.（人们普遍认为科技的快速发展极大地改变了我们的生活方式。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It is widely acknowledged that regular exercise is beneficial to physical and mental health.（人们普遍承认经常锻炼有益于身心健康。）           It  is widely acknowledged that continuous learning enhances one's professional competitiveness.（人们普遍认同持续学习能够提升个人的职业竞争力。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式8：It is often overlooked that...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It is often overlooked that details are important.（人们常常忽视细节的重要性。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It is often overlooked that sleep plays a role in brain recovery.（人们常常忽视睡眠对大脑恢复的作用。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式9：It's only a matter of time before...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's only a matter of time before you master English.（你学会英语只是时间问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's only a matter of time before he learns to drive.（他学会开车只是时间问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's only a matter of time before they find a cure.（他们找到治疗方法只是时间问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式10：This leads to the question of whether...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>This leads to the question of whether the method is reliable.（这引出了   这种方法是否可靠的问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>This leads to the question of whether the choice is wise.（这引出了这个选择是否明智的问题。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p6_6_14_01", "moduleId": "p6_6_14"}]}, {"id": "p6_6_15", "code": "6-15", "title": "精读到底咋做？", "articles": [{"title": "精读到底咋做？", "section": "", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读的重要性</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读是学习英语的必经之路，它不仅可以提高词汇量，还能拓宽知识面，加强英语思维能力。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>步骤1：浏览全文（泛读）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>目标：快速了解文章的主题和关键词，把握文章的大致内容。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">方法：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>逐行阅读，不必查出所有单词。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>遇到不懂的单词，尝试猜测其含义，理解句子的大概意思。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>保持阅读的连贯性，不要纠结于个别单词。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>步骤2：分段精读</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>目标：逐段、逐句深入理解文章内容，掌握词汇和固定搭配。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">方法：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>按段落划分，逐句进行精读。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">断句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>将句子划分清楚，理解句子结构。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>查单词：   查找生词的含义，并标注在单词旁边。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">查固定搭配：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>查找句子中的固定搭配，理解其用法。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">工具：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>可以使用电子词典（如欧陆词典）或卡卡AI 进行查询，尤其是固定搭配，卡卡AI 会提供详细解释和例句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>步骤3：全文泛读（复习）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>目标：巩固理解，加深记忆。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">方法：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>在完成精读后，再次泛读全文。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>遇到不理解的地方，查看标注的内容。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读后的注意事项</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">经常复习：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>定期回顾精读的内容，避免遗忘。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">坚持每天精读：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>通过持续的练习，让单词和表达高频出现，从而加深记忆。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>实操建议</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">文章选择：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>从简单到难，逐步提升难度。   基础薄弱的同学可以从简单的文章开始，逐步查漏补缺。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>基础较好的同学可以从前面的文章开始，激活基础词汇，学习新的知识点。</p>"}], "id": "a_p6_6_15_01", "moduleId": "p6_6_15"}]}, {"id": "p6_6_16", "code": "6-16", "title": "真题原文精析+中文", "articles": [{"title": "真题原文精析+中文", "section": "", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读的重要性</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读是学习英语的必经之路，既可以提高词汇量，又能拓宽知识面， 还能加强英语思维能力。通过系统化的学习，我们不仅能增加词汇量， 还能提高阅读水平和输出能力。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读步骤</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">精读分为三个步骤：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 泛读：快速浏览全文，了解文章主题和关键词。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 分段精读：逐段、逐句分析，查找生词和固定搭配。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 复习：全文再读一遍，巩固理解。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读示例</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>今天我们将通过一篇江苏小学毕业考试的真题文章进行精读练习。文章主题是“生活习惯”，难度适中，但包含一些生词。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>文章精读</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第一段：总论点</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>原文：       Everyone has his or her own living habits.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>每个人都有他或她自己的生活习惯。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>his or her：用于泛指，避免性别歧视。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>living habits：生活习惯。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第二段：保持良好生活习惯的重要性原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Keeping good living habits is important.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>保持良好的生活习惯是重要的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>keeping：动名词形式，表示“保持”。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>be good for：对……有好处。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第三段：为什么一些习惯比其他习惯更好原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Why are some habits better than others? Let's find out.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>为什么一些习惯比其他习惯更好呢？让我们一探究竟。   知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>better than：表示“比……更好”。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>find out：弄清楚，搞明白。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第四段：为什么我们需要吃粗粮</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Why do we need to eat coarse grains? Corn, sweet potato, and soybeans are all coarse grains.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Eating coarse grains is good for your health.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>They have a lot of dietary fiber, which is very good for your digestion.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You can cook them in porridge or make drinks with them.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>为什么我们需要吃粗粮？玉米、红薯和大豆都是粗粮。吃粗粮对健康有好处。它们含有大量的膳食纤维，这对消化非常好。你可以把它们煮在粥里或者做成饮品。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>coarse grains：粗粮。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>dietary fiber：膳食纤维。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>digestion：消化。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>porridge：粥。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>drinks：饮品。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第五段：为什么我们不应该长时间低头   原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Why shouldn't we bend our heads for a long time? Keeping your head bent down for long is not good for your neck.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's because you put too much pressure on your neck.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's like putting four big watermelons, about twenty-seven kilograms, on your neck.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You might have neck and shoulder pain by doing that.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>为什么我们不应该长时间低头？长时间低着头对你的脖子不好。这是因为你给脖子施加了太大的压力，就好像在脖子上放了四个大西瓜， 大约27 公斤。那样做的话，你可能会出现颈部和肩部疼痛。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>bend：弯曲。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>pressure：压力。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>watermelon：西瓜。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>shoulder：肩膀。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>pain：疼痛。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第六段：为什么我们不应该揉眼睛</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Why shouldn't we rub our eyes? Your hands are dirty. When you rub your eyes, the bacteria on your      hands may go into your eyes.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Your eyelashes might also break or fall off.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>If something gets into your eyes, do not rub them. Rinse them with cold water.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>为什么我们不应该揉眼睛？你的手很脏。当你揉眼睛时，手上的细菌可能会进入眼睛。你的睫毛也可能断裂或掉落。如果有什么东西进入眼睛，不要揉它们，用冷水冲洗。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>rub：揉。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>dirty：脏的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>bacteria：细菌。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>eyelash：睫毛。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>break：断裂。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>fall off：掉落。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>rinse：冲洗。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第七段：为什么运动后不能洗冷水澡原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Why is a cold water bath after exercising bad? After exercising, your skin is sweating and your heart is beating fast.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A cold water bath will stimulate them too much.           It might give you cramps or headaches.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You'd better wait for a while until your body cools down.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Then you can take a warm water bath to relax.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>为什么运动后不能洗冷水澡？运动后，你的皮肤在流汗，你的心脏跳动得很快。冷水澡会对它们造成太大的刺激，可能会让你抽筋或头痛。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>你最好等一会儿，直到身体冷却下来，然后你可以洗个温水澡来放松。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>cold water bath：冷水澡。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>sweating：流汗。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>beating fast：快速跳动。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>stimulate：刺激。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>cramps：抽筋。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>headaches：头痛。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>cool down：冷却下来。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>relax：放松。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>总结</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>通过今天的精读练习，我们学习了关于生活习惯的文章，掌握了以下知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>living habits：生活习惯。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>find out：弄清楚。       coarse grains：粗粮。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>dietary fiber：膳食纤维。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>digestion：消化。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>bend：弯曲。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>pressure：压力。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>watermelon：西瓜。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>shoulder：肩膀。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>pain：疼痛。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>rub：揉。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>dirty：脏的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>bacteria：细菌。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>eyelash：睫毛。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>break：断裂。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>fall off：掉落。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>rinse：冲洗。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>cold water bath：冷水澡。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>sweating：流汗。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>beating fast：快速跳动。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>stimulate：刺激。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>cramps：抽筋。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>headaches：头痛。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>cool down：冷却下来。     relax：放松。</p>"}], "id": "a_p6_6_16_01", "moduleId": "p6_6_16"}]}, {"id": "p6_6_17", "code": "6-17", "title": "真题原文精析-小学", "articles": [{"title": "真题原文精析-小学", "section": "", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读文章1：运动对健康的重要性</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>文章来源：上海小升初真题（外刊）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>主题：运动对健康的益处</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>文章精读</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Sports are very important for people's health.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Not only young people but also old people like sports.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>They take an active part in them.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Many old people are retired, so they like to do exercises in the park in the morning.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>They enjoy the exercises very much and also enjoy talking with other people about their families in the park.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Young people go to school or work every day, so they usually play games and sports after school or work.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Many of them enjoy team sports like football, basketball, and volleyball.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>In team games, they can make new friends and learn to work with        others.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读分析</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. Sports are very important for people's health.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：体育运动对人们的健康非常重要。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>be important for：对……很重要。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Sports：运动（复数形式）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. Not only young people but also old people like sports.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：不仅年轻人喜欢运动，老年人也喜欢运动。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>not only... but also...：不仅……而且……（并列连词）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>young people：年轻人。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>old people：老年人。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. They take an active part in them.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：他们积极参与运动。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>take an active part in：积极参与。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>active：积极的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. Many old people are retired, so they like to do exercises in the park in</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>the morning.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：许多老年人已经退休，所以他们喜欢在早晨去公园锻炼身体。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>retired：退休的（动词：retire）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>do exercises：锻炼身体。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>in the park：在公园里（地点状语）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>in the morning：在早晨（时间状语）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. They enjoy the exercises very much and also enjoy talking with other</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>people about their families in the park.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：他们非常喜欢锻炼，并且喜欢在公园里和其他人聊聊家庭情况。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>enjoy doing something：喜欢做某事。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>talk with somebody about something：与某人谈论某事。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. Young people go to school or work every day, so they usually play</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>games and sports after school or work.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：年轻人每天去上学或工作，所以他们通常在放学或下班后玩游戏或进行体育运动。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>知识点：      go to school/work：去上学/工作。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>every day：每天（时间状语）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>play games and sports：玩游戏和进行体育运动。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. Many of them enjoy team sports  like  football,  basketball, and</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>volleyball.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：他们中的许多人喜欢团队运动，比如足球、篮球和排球。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>team sports：团队运动。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>football/basketball/volleyball：足球/篮球/排球。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. In team games, they can make new friends and learn to work with</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>others.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：在团队比赛中，他们可以交到新朋友，并学会与他人合作。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>make new friends：交新朋友。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>learn to do something：学会做某事。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>work with somebody：与某人合作。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>复习要点</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Sports：运动。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>be important for：对……很重要。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>not only... but also...：不仅……而且……。       take an active part in：积极参与。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>retired：退休的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>do exercises：锻炼身体。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>enjoy doing something：喜欢做某事。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>talk with somebody about something：与某人谈论某事。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>go to school/work：去上学/工作。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>team sports：团队运动。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>make new friends：交新朋友。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>learn to do something：学会做某事。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>work with somebody：与某人合作。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读文章2：上海的发展变化</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>文章来源：上海小升初真题（外刊）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>主题：上海的历史与现代发展</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>文章精读</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Shanghai was a small town three hundred years ago.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Not many people lived here.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Many of them were fishermen and farmers.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Today, Shanghai is one of the biggest cities in China.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Many great changes have taken place these years.       There are more and more tall buildings.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>They are beautiful and modern.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The traffic here is also more convenient.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Many bridges have been built.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Many streets have widened.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>So buses and cars can go more quickly than before.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>And people can go around the city by underground.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The government spent much money protecting the environment.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>There are many green areas.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Shanghai is becoming nicer and nicer.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Every year, many foreigners come to Shanghai for a visit.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读分析</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. Shanghai was a small town three hundred years ago.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：300 年前，上海还是一个小城镇。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>three hundred years ago：300 年前。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. Not many people lived here.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：这里没有多少人居住。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>not many people：没有多少人。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. Many of them were fishermen and farmers.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：他们中的许多人是渔民和农民。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>fishermen：渔民。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>farmers：农民。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. Today, Shanghai is one of the biggest cities in China.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：如今，上海是中国最大的城市之一。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>one of the biggest cities：最大的城市之一。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. Many great changes have taken place these years.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：这些年来发生了许多巨大的变化。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>have taken place：已经发生（现在完成时）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>these years：这些年。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. There are more and more tall buildings.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：这里出现了越来越多的高楼大厦。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>more and more：越来越多。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. They are beautiful and modern.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：它们既美观又现代化。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>beautiful：美观的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>modern：现代化的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. The traffic here is also more convenient.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：这里的交通也更加便利。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>traffic：交通。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>more convenient：更加便利。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>9. Many bridges have been built.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：许多桥梁被修建了。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>have been built：被修建（被动语态）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>10. Many streets have widened.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：许多街道拓宽了。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>widen：拓宽。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>11. So buses and cars can go more quickly than before.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：因此，公交车和汽车可以比以前行驶得更快。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>more quickly than before：比以前更快。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>12. And people can go around the city by underground.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：人们可以乘坐地铁在城市里出行。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>go around：四处走动。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>by underground：乘坐地铁。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>13. The government spent much money protecting the environment.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：政府投入了大量资金保护环境。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>spend money doing something：花钱做某事。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>protect the environment：保护环境。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>14. There are many green areas.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：有许多绿化区域。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>green areas：绿化区域。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>15. Shanghai is becoming nicer and nicer.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：上海正变得越来越好。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>nicer and nicer：越来越好。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>16. Every year, many foreigners come to Shanghai for a visit.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：每年，许多外国人来上海参观游览。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>foreigners：外国人。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>for a visit：来参观。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>复习要点</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Shanghai：上海。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>small town：小城镇。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>fishermen and farmers：渔民和农民。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>one of the biggest cities：最大的城市之一。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>have taken place：已经发生。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>more and more：越来越多。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>beautiful and modern：美观且现代化。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>traffic：交通。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>more convenient：更加便利。     bridges：桥梁。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>streets have widened：街道拓宽。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>go more quickly than before：比以前更快。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>go around by underground：乘坐地铁出行。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>spend money protecting the environment：投入资金保护环境。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>green areas：绿化区域。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>becoming nicer and nicer：变得越来越好。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>foreigners：外国人。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>for a visit：来参观。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>学习建议</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 坚持精读：每天进行精读练习，提高词汇量和阅读能力。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 复习巩固：定期复习学过的单词和句型，避免遗忘。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 应用实践：将所学知识应用到实际写作和口语中，加深理解和记</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>忆。</p>"}], "id": "a_p6_6_17_01", "moduleId": "p6_6_17"}]}, {"id": "p6_6_18", "code": "6-18", "title": "真题原文精析", "articles": [{"title": "真题原文精析", "section": "", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读文章</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>文章来源：2024 年安徽中考真题</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>主题：如何应对愤怒情绪</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>文章精读</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>If you get angry many times in a day, it is time for you to think about how to deal with it.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Here are some of my suggestions.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>When you are angry, try to tell yourself through another voice that you are angry and that it is not a bad thing.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It just shows that you have different ideas.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Accept that many things are not one hundred percent right or wrong.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>In our communication with others, the final purpose is not to decide who is right and who is wrong, but to look for something in common.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>If you still feel strong anger, try taking a deep breath and let anger out of your body along with the breath.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Don't say angry words when you are very angry, for you will regret saying      them when you cool down.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Discussing with a third party is helpful.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It is hard for the two parties in anger to understand each other, but the idea of an outsider can help both parties to get mutual understanding.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Anger is just one of the many emotions that make us human, and to well manage it adds to our ability and truly understand the world.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读分析</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. If you get angry many times in a day, it is time for you to think about</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>how to deal with it.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：如果你一天内多次生气，那你应该考虑一下如何应对这种情况。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>get angry：生气。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>it is time for somebody to do something：是某人该做某事的时候了。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>think about：考虑。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>deal with：处理。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. Here are some of my suggestions.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：以下是我的一些建议。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>suggestions：建议（可数名词）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>advice：建议（不可数名词，常用表达为a piece of advice）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. When you are angry, try to tell yourself through another voice that</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>you are angry and that it is not a bad thing.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：当你生气时，试着用另一种声音告诉自己，你正在生气，而且生气并非是一件坏事。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>try to do something：尝试做某事。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>tell yourself：告诉自己。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>through another voice：用另一种声音。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. It just shows that you have different ideas.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：这恰恰表明你有不同的想法。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>it shows that...：表明…… different ideas：不同的想法。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. Accept that many things are not one hundred percent right or wrong.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：接受很多事情并非100%的对或错。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>accept：接受。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>one hundred percent：100%。        6. In our communication with others, the final purpose is not to decide who is right and who is wrong, but to look for something in common.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：在我们与他人的交流中，最终目的并非是判定谁对谁错，而是寻找共同之处。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>communication with somebody：与某人的交流。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>final purpose：最终目的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>look for something in common：寻找共同之处。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. If you still feel strong anger, try taking a deep breath and let anger out</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>of your body along with the breath.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：如果你仍然感到怒火中烧，试着做深呼吸，让愤怒随着气息一起排出体外。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>strong anger：强烈的愤怒。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>take a deep breath：深呼吸。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>let...out of...：让……从……中出来。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. Don't say angry words when you are very angry, for you will regret</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>saying them when you cool down.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：当你非常生气的时候，不要说气话，因为当你冷静下来之后， 你会后悔说出那些话。   知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>angry words：气话。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>regret doing something：后悔做过某事。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>cool down：冷静下来。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>9. Discussing with a third party is helpful.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：与第三方进行讨论是有帮助的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>discuss with somebody：与某人讨论。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>third party：第三方。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>10. It is hard for the two parties in anger to understand each other, but</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>the  idea  of  an  outsider  can  help  both  parties  to  get  mutual understanding.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：处于愤怒中的双方很难相互理解，但局外人的想法能够帮助双方达成相互理解。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>it is hard for somebody to do something：对某人来说做某事很难。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>outsider：局外人。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>mutual understanding：相互理解。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>11. Anger is just one of the many emotions that make us human, and to        well manage it adds to our ability and truly understand the world.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：愤怒只是众多使我们成为人类的情绪之一，而妥善应对愤怒会增强我们真正理解世界的能力。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>one of the many emotions：众多情绪之一。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>make us human：使我们成为人类。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>manage：管理、应对。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>add to：增加、增强。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>复习要点</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>get angry：生气。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>it is time for somebody to do something：是某人该做某事的时候了。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>think about：考虑。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>deal with：处理。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>suggestions/advice：建议（可数/不可数）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>it shows that...：表明…… different ideas：不同的想法。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>accept：接受。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>one hundred percent：100%。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>communication with somebody：与某人的交流。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>final purpose：最终目的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>look for something in common：寻找共同之处。       strong anger：强烈的愤怒。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>take a deep breath：深呼吸。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>let...out of...：让……从……中出来。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>angry words：气话。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>regret doing something：后悔做过某事。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>cool down：冷静下来。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>discuss with somebody：与某人讨论。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>third party：第三方。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>it is hard for somebody to do something：对某人来说做某事很难。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>outsider：局外人。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>mutual understanding：相互理解。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>one of the many emotions：众多情绪之一。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>make us human：使我们成为人类。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>manage：管理、应对。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>add to：增加、增强。</p>"}], "id": "a_p6_6_18_01", "moduleId": "p6_6_18"}]}, {"id": "p6_6_19", "code": "6-19", "title": "真题原文精析-中考", "articles": [{"title": "真题原文精析-中考", "section": "", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读文章</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>文章来源：江苏中考真题</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>主题：中国新能源汽车的发展</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>文章精读</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>China has become the world's largest producer and market of EVs.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>According to a report, 9.59 million Chinese-made EVs were produced and</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>9.49 million were sold in 2023.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Among the total sales, 1.2 million EVs were exported.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The Chinese government has been encouraging EVs as part of its effort for green, high-quality development.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>As a result, China's EV industry develops very quickly.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>At Auto China 2004, BYD was the only company showing EVs.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>At Auto China 2024, there were 278 different EV models on show, including BYD, SAIC, Geely, Li Auto, NIO, XPeng, and other brands.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>China's EV industry is now facing both challenges and chances.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's reported that 71% of EV brands cut prices in 2023.      EV makers without the ability of innovation will face growing risks.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>In order to be both green and smart, Chinese EV makers are trying hard to improve technologies like battery quality and AI support.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>At the same time, the government is adding even more charging points.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>On the other hand, more Chinese people are aware of the environmental problems, and it is encouraging more buyers to choose EVs.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>EVs are the way of the future.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>In an  ideal  world, everyone  benefits from  innovation and green transport.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Some might get there sooner than others and will gain greater rewards.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It is very likely that China will hold the lead.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读分析</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. China has become the world's largest producer and market of EVs.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：中国已经成为全球最大的电动汽车生产国和市场。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>producer：生产者。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>market：市场。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>EVs：Electric Vehicles（电动汽车）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. According to a report, 9.59 million Chinese-made EVs were produced</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>and 9.49 million were sold in 2023.    翻译：根据一份报告，2023 年中国生产了959 万辆电动汽车，销售了949 万辆。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>according to：根据。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>report：报告。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Chinese-made：中国制造的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>were produced/sold：被生产/销售（被动语态）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. Among the total sales, 1.2 million EVs were exported.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：在总销量中，有120 万辆电动汽车用于出口。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>among：在……之中。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>total sales：总销量。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>exported：出口（被动语态）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. The Chinese government has been encouraging EVs as part of its effort</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>for green, high-quality development.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：中国政府一直在鼓励发展电动汽车，作为推动绿色高质量发展努力的一部分。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>encourage：鼓励。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>green, high-quality development：绿色高质量发展。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. As a result, China's EV industry develops very quickly.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：因此，中国的电动汽车产业发展迅速。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>as a result：因此。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>industry：产业。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. At Auto China 2004, BYD was the only company showing EVs.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：在2004 年北京国际汽车展览会上，比亚迪是唯一一家展示电动汽车的公司。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Auto China：北京国际汽车展览会。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>showing：展示（现在分词作定语）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. At Auto China 2024, there were 278 different EV models on show,</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>including BYD, SAIC, Geely, Li Auto, NIO, XPeng, and other brands.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：在2024 年北京国际汽车展览会上，有278 款不同的电动汽车车型展出，包括比亚迪、上汽、吉利、理想汽车、蔚来、小鹏及其他品牌。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>models：车型。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>on show：展出。     brands：品牌。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. China's EV industry is now facing both challenges and chances.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：中国的电动汽车产业如今面临着挑战与机遇并存的局面。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>face：面临。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>challenges and chances：挑战与机遇。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>9. It's reported that 71% of EV brands cut prices in 2023.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：据报道，2023 年有71%的电动汽车品牌下调了价格。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>it is reported that：据报道。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>cut prices：下调价格。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>10. EV makers without the ability of innovation will face growing risks.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：缺乏创新能力的电动汽车制造商将面临日益增大的风险。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>makers：制造商。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>ability of innovation：创新能力。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>growing risks：日益增大的风险。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>11. In order to be both green and smart, Chinese EV makers are trying       hard to improve technologies like battery quality and AI support.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：为了实现既环保又智能的目标，中国的电动汽车制造商正在努力改进诸如电池质量和人工智能支持等技术。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>in order to：为了。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>green and smart：环保且智能。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>improve technologies：改进技术。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>battery quality：电池质量。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>AI support：人工智能支持。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>12. At the same time, the government is adding even more charging</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>points.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：与此同时，政府正在增设更多的充电站。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>charging points：充电站。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>13. On the other hand, more Chinese people are aware  of the</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>environmental problems, and it is encouraging more buyers to choose EVs.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：另一方面，越来越多的中国人意识到环境问题，这促使更多的消费者选择电动汽车。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>知识点：      be aware of：意识到。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>environmental problems：环境问题。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>encourage：促使。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>buyers：消费者。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>14. EVs are the way of the future.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：电动汽车是未来的发展方向。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>way of the future：未来的发展方向。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>15. In an ideal world, everyone benefits from innovation and green</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>transport.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：在理想的世界中，每个人都能从创新和绿色交通中受益。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>benefit from：从……中受益。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>green transport：绿色交通。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>16. Some might get there sooner than others and will gain greater</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>rewards.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：有些企业或许会比其他企业更快地达成目标，并获得更大的回报。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>知识点：       get there：达成目标。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>greater rewards：更大的回报。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>17. It is very likely that China will hold the lead.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：中国很有可能继续保持领先地位。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>it is very likely that：某事非常有可能。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>hold the lead：保持领先地位。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>复习要点</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>producer：生产者。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>market：市场。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>EVs：电动汽车（Electric Vehicles）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>according to：根据。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>report：报告。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Chinese-made：中国制造的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>were produced/sold：被生产/销售（被动语态）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>among：在……之中。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>total sales：总销量。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>exported：出口（被动语态）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>encourage：鼓励。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>green, high-quality development：绿色高质量发展。       as a result：因此。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>industry：产业。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Auto China：北京国际汽车展览会。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>showing：展示（现在分词作定语）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>models：车型。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>on show：展出。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>brands：品牌。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>face：面临。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>challenges and chances：挑战与机遇。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>it is reported that：据报道。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>cut prices：下调价格。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>makers：制造商。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>ability of innovation：创新能力。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>growing risks：日益增大的风险。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>in order to：为了。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>green and smart：环保且智能。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>improve technologies：改进技术。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>battery quality：电池质量。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>AI support：人工智能支持。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>charging points：充电站。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>be aware of：意识到。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>environmental problems：环境问题。     encourage：促使。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>buyers：消费者。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>way of the future：未来的发展方向。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>benefit from：从……中受益。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>green transport：绿色交通。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>get there：达成目标。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>greater rewards：更大的回报。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>it is very likely that：某事非常有可能。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>hold the lead：保持领先地位。</p>"}], "id": "a_p6_6_19_01", "moduleId": "p6_6_19"}]}, {"id": "p6_6_20", "code": "6-20", "title": "真题原文精析-中考", "articles": [{"title": "真题原文精析-中考", "section": "", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读文章</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>文章来源：浙江中考真题</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>主题：伦敦的约翰·索恩爵士博物馆</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>文章精读</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>If you are looking for somewhere special to visit in London, we may have the answer for you: Sir John Soane's Museum.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The museum is one of London's best kept secrets and it's well worth a visit.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Sir John, a great architect, lived in London during the eighteenth century, and the amazing thing is that his house is exactly the same as he left it.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>In fact, visiting the house is just like stepping back in time.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>There are three floors, which are open to the public.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You can start on the first floor, which was Sir John's work area.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You can ask the guards about the paintings on the walls, as they tell you something about his family and life.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>And don't worry about the guards, as they are really nice and helpful.       Next, you can go downstairs to the ground floor, where you can see this rich collection of paintings.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>For  example,  there   is  a  series  of  interesting  paintings  about eighteenth-century life in London.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Now comes the last part: the underground floor.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's full of thousands of valuable objects, such as sculptures and models of famous buildings from all over the world.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Walking around this part of the house is a bit like being on a treasure hunt, as you can find things hidden away in secret corners.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Anyway, you will have to go there yourself to see.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Sir John Soane's Museum is a very small place.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's only about ten minutes' walk from the British Museum.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>There is a free hour-long guided tour every Saturday at 2:30 p.m., but the best thing is just to walk about by yourself.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>So now you know where to go next time you are in London.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>We guarantee that it's an experience you won't forget.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读分析</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. If you are looking for somewhere special to visit in London, we may</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>have the answer for you: Sir John Soane's Museum.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：如果你正在伦敦寻找某个特别的地方去游览，我们可能有一个不错的答案：约翰·索恩爵士博物馆。   知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>somewhere special：某个特别的地方。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>look for：寻找。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>answer：答案。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. The museum is one of London's best kept secrets and it's well worth a</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>visit.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：这座博物馆是伦敦最不为人知的宝藏之一，非常值得一游。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>best kept secrets：保存得最好的秘密（引申为“宝藏”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>worth a visit：值得一游。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. Sir John, a great architect, lived in London during the eighteenth</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>century, and the amazing thing is that his house is exactly the same as he left it.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：约翰爵士是一位伟大的建筑师，他在18 世纪居住在伦敦，令人惊叹的是，他的故居仍保持着他当年离开时的模样。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>architect：建筑师。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>exactly the same as：完全一样。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. In fact, visiting the house is just like stepping back in time.   翻译：事实上，参观这座故居就像时光倒流一般。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>step back in time：时光倒流。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. There are three floors, which are open to the public.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：这里有三层楼，对公众开放。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>open to the public：对公众开放。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>which：引导定语从句，修饰前面的名词。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. You can start on the first floor, which was Sir John's work area.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：你可以从第一层楼开始，这里曾是约翰爵士的工作区。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>work area：工作区。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. You can ask the guards about the paintings on the walls, as they tell</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>you something about his family and life.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：你可以向保安询问墙上的绘画，因为它们会告诉你一些关于他的家庭和生活的事。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>ask somebody about something：询问某人关于某事。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>tell somebody about something：告诉某人关于某事。        8. And don't worry about the guards, as they are really nice and helpful.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：不用担心这些保安，因为他们非常友善且乐于助人。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>don't worry about：不用担心。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>helpful：乐于助人的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>9. Next, you can go downstairs to the ground floor, where you can see</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>this rich collection of paintings.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：接下来，你可以下楼去一楼，那里有丰富的绘画藏品。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>go downstairs：下楼。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>ground floor：一楼。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>rich collection：丰富的藏品。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>10. For example, there  is a  series  of  interesting  paintings about</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>eighteenth-century life in London.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：例如，有一系列关于18 世纪伦敦生活的有趣绘画。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>a series of：一系列。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>paintings：绘画。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>11. Now comes the last part: the underground floor.   翻译：现在来到最后一个部分：地下室。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>underground floor：地下室。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>12.  It's full of thousands of valuable objects, such as sculptures and</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>models of famous buildings from all over the world.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：这里满是成千上万的珍贵物品，比如雕塑以及来自世界各地的著名建筑模型。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>valuable objects：珍贵物品。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>sculptures：雕塑。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>models of famous buildings：著名建筑的模型。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>13. Walking around this part of the house is a bit like being on a treasure</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>hunt, as you can find things hidden away in secret corners.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：在这个部分四处走走有点像在寻宝，因为你能发现藏在隐秘角落里的东西。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>treasure hunt：寻宝。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>hidden away：藏起来。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>secret corners：隐秘的角落。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>14. Anyway, you will have to go there yourself to see.   翻译：不管怎样，你得亲自去那里看看。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>go there yourself：亲自去。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>15. Sir John Soane's Museum is a very small place.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：约翰·索恩爵士博物馆是一个非常小的地方。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>small place：小地方。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>16. It's only about ten minutes' walk from the British Museum.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：它距离大英博物馆步行仅需大约10 分钟。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>ten minutes' walk：步行10 分钟。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>17. There is a free hour-long guided tour every Saturday at 2:30 p.m., but</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>the best thing is just to walk about by yourself.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：每周六下午2:30 有一场时长一小时的免费导览，但最好的方式还是自己随便走走逛逛。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>free hour-long guided tour：免费一小时导览。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>walk about by yourself：自己逛逛。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>18. So now you know where to go next time you are in London.   翻译：所以现在你知道下次去伦敦该去哪里了。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>next time：下次。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>19. We guarantee that it's an experience you won't forget.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：我们保证这一定会是一次让你难以忘怀的体验。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>guarantee：保证。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>experience：体验。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>复习要点</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>somewhere special：某个特别的地方。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>best kept secrets：保存得最好的秘密（引申为“宝藏”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>architect：建筑师。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>exactly the same as：完全一样。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>step back in time：时光倒流。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>open to the public：对公众开放</p>"}], "id": "a_p6_6_20_01", "moduleId": "p6_6_20"}]}, {"id": "p6_6_21", "code": "6-21", "title": "真题原文精析-高考", "articles": [{"title": "真题原文精析-高考", "section": "", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读文章</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>文章来源：2024 年全国高考卷</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>主题：人工智能及其对未来的挑战</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>文章精读</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Given the astonishing potential of AI to transform our lives, we all need to take action to deal with our AI-powered future.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>And  this  is where AI by Design: A Plan  for  Living with  Artificial Intelligence comes in.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>This absorbing new book by Katrina Cabel  is a  practical roadmap addressing the challenges posed by the forthcoming AI revolution.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>In the wrong hands, such a book could prove as complicated to process as the computer code that powers AI.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>But thankfully, Campbell has more than two decades of professional experience translating the heady into the understandable.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She writes from the practical angle of a business person rather than as an academic, making  for a guide which  is  highly  accessible and        informative, and which by the close will make you feel almost as smart as AI.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>As we soon come to learn from AI by Design, AI is already super smart and will become more capable, moving from the current generation of narrow AI to artificial general intelligence.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>From there, Cabel says, will come artificial dominant intelligence.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>This is why Cabel has set out to raise awareness with AI in its future now.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Several decades before these developments are expected to take place, she says it is essential that we keep control of artificial intelligence, or risk being sidelined and perhaps even worse.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读分析</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. Given the astonishing potential of AI to transform our lives, we all</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>need to take action to deal with our AI-powered future.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：鉴于人工智能具有改变我们生活的惊人潜力，我们都需要采取行动来应对由人工智能驱动的未来。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>given：鉴于……（后接名词短语或that 引导的句子）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>astonishing potential：惊人的潜力。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>transform：改变。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>AI-powered future：由人工智能驱动的未来。        2. And this  is where AI by Design: A Plan for Living with  Artificial Intelligence comes in.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：而这就是《人工智能设计：与人工智能共生的计划》这本书能够发挥作用的地方。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>come in：起作用。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>roadmap：路线图。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>address the challenges：应对挑战。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. This absorbing new book by Katrina Cabel  is a practical roadmap</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>addressing the challenges posed by the forthcoming AI revolution.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：卡特里奥娜·坎贝尔所著的这本引人入胜的新书，是一份应对即将到来的人工智能革命所带来的挑战的实用指南。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>absorbing：引人入胜的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>forthcoming：即将到来的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>revolution：革命。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. In the wrong hands, such a book could prove as complicated to</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>process as the computer code that powers AI.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：倘若落入别有用心之人手中，这样一本书可能会像驱动人工智能的计算机代码一样难以理解。   知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>prove：证明为……（表示结果）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>complicated to process：难以处理。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>computer code：计算机代码。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. But thankfully, Campbell has more than two decades of professional</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>experience translating the heady into the understandable.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：幸运的是，坎贝尔拥有超过20 年的专业经验，能把晦涩难懂的内容转化为通俗易懂的表述。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>decades：十年（复数形式）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>translate... into...：将……转化为……。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. She writes from the practical angle of a business person rather than as</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>an academic, making  for a guide which  is  highly  accessible and informative.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：她从商务人士的实用角度而非学者的角度进行写作，使得这本书成为一个极其易懂且信息量丰富的指南。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>practical angle：实用角度。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>business person：商务人士。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>academic：学者。     accessible：易懂的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>informative：信息量丰富的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. And which by the close will make you feel almost as smart as AI.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：读到最后，你甚至会觉得几乎和人工智能一样聪明。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>by the close：到结束时。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>as... as：和……一样……。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. As we soon come to learn from AI by Design, AI is already super smart</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>and will become more capable, moving from the current generation of narrow AI to artificial general intelligence.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：正如我们很快能从《人工智能设计》中了解到的那样，人工智能已经极为智能，而且能力还会不断增强，从当前的狭义人工智能发展到通用人工智能。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>narrow AI：狭义人工智能。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>artificial general intelligence：通用人工智能。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>9. From there, Cabel says, will come artificial dominant intelligence.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：从那里，坎贝尔说，将会出现主宰性人工智能。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>知识点：      dominant intelligence：主宰性智能。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>10. This is why Cabel has set out to raise awareness with AI in its future</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>now.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：这就是为什么坎贝尔现在着手提高人们对人工智能及其未来发展的认知。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>set out to do something：着手做某事。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>raise awareness：提高认知。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>11. Several decades before these developments are expected to take</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>place, she says it is essential that we keep control of artificial intelligence, or risk being sidelined and perhaps even worse.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：在预计这些发展情况出现的几十年前，她表示我们必须掌控人工智能，否则可能会被边缘化，甚至情况可能会更糟。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>be expected to：被期望……。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>take place：发生。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>keep control of：掌控……。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>risk being sidelined：面临被边缘化的风险。   复习要点 AI：人工智能（Artificial Intelligence）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>astonishing potential：惊人的潜力。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>transform：改变。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>AI-powered future：由人工智能驱动的未来。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>roadmap：路线图。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>address the challenges：应对挑战。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>forthcoming：即将到来的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>revolution：革命。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>decades：十年（复数形式）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>translate... into...：将……转化为……。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>practical angle：实用角度。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>business person：商务人士。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>academic：学者。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>accessible：易懂的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>informative：信息量丰富的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>narrow AI：狭义人工智能。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>artificial general intelligence：通用人工智能。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>dominant intelligence：主宰性智能。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>set out to do something：着手做某事。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>raise awareness：提高认知。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>be expected to：被期望……。       take place：发生。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>keep control of：掌控……。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>risk being sidelined：面临被边缘化的风险。</p>"}], "id": "a_p6_6_21_01", "moduleId": "p6_6_21"}]}, {"id": "p6_6_22", "code": "6-22", "title": "真题原文精析-高考", "articles": [{"title": "真题原文精析-高考", "section": "", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读文章</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>文章来源：全国高考卷</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>主题：纸质阅读与数字阅读的差异</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>文章精读</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Is comprehension the same whether a person reads a text on screen or on paper? And are listening to and viewing content as effective as reading the written word when covering the same material? The answer to both questions is often no.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The  reasons  relate  to  a  variety  of  factors,  including  reduced concentration, an entertainment mindset, and a tendency to multitask while consuming digital content.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>When reading texts of several hundred words or more, learning  is generally more successful on paper than on screen.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A large amount of research confirms this finding.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The  benefits  of  print  reading  particularly  shine  through when       experimenters move from posing simple tasks, such as identifying the main idea, to those requiring mental abstraction, such as drawing inferences from a text.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The differences between print and digital reading results are partly related to paper's physical properties.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>With paper, there is a literal laying on of hands, along with the visual geography of distant pages.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>People often link their memory of what they've read to how far into the book it was or where it was on the page.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>But equally important is the mental aspect.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Reading researchers have proposed a theory called the shadowing hypothesis.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>According to this theory, people approach digital texts with a mindset suited to social media, which are often not so serious and devote less mental effort than when they are reading print.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Audio and video can feel more engaging than text, and so university teachers increasingly turn to these technologies, assigning an online talk instead of an article by the same person.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>However, psychologists have demonstrated that when adults read news stories, they remember more of the content than if they listen to or view identical pieces.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Digital texts, audio, and video all have educational roles, especially when       providing resources not available in print.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>However, for maximizing learning where mental focus and reflection are called for, educators shouldn't assume all media are the same, even when they contain identical words.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读分析</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. Is comprehension the same whether a person reads a text on screen</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>or on paper? 翻译：一个人在屏幕上阅读文本和在纸上阅读文本时，理解程度是一样的吗？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>comprehension：理解。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>whether... or：是否……还是……。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. And are listening to and viewing content as effective as reading the</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>written word when covering the same material? 翻译：听和看相关内容与阅读书面文字的效果一样好吗？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>effective：有效的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>written word：书面文字。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>covering the same material：涉及相同内容。        3. The answer to both questions is often no.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：对于这两个问题的答案，往往是否定的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>answer：答案。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>often：经常。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. The  reasons  relate  to a  variety  of  factors,  including reduced</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>concentration, an entertainment mindset, and a tendency to multitask while consuming digital content.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：其原因与多种因素有关，包括注意力难以集中、抱有娱乐心态， 以及在浏览数字内容时存在同时处理多项任务的倾向。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>relate to：与……相关。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>a variety of：多种。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>concentration：注意力。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>entertainment mindset：娱乐心态。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>multitask：同时处理多项任务。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. When reading texts of several hundred words or more, learning is</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>generally more successful on paper than on screen.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：在阅读字数达几百字或更多的文本时，纸质阅读的学习效果往往比屏幕阅读更好。   知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>texts of several hundred words or more：几百字或更多的文本。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>successful：成功的（这里指学习效果）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. A large amount of research confirms this finding.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：大量研究证实了这一发现。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>a large amount of：大量的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>research：研究。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>confirm：证实。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. The  benefits  of  print  reading  particularly  shine through when</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>experimenters move from posing simple tasks, such as identifying the main idea, to those requiring mental abstraction, such as drawing inferences from a text.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：当实验人员从布置简单任务（如找出阅读文章的主旨大意）转向那些需要进行抽象思维的任务（例如从文本中推断含义）时，纸质阅读的优势尤为凸显。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>shine through：显现出来。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>mental abstraction：抽象思维。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>drawing inferences：推断含义。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. The differences between print and digital reading results are partly</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>related to paper's physical properties.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：纸质阅读和数字阅读结果之间的差异部分与纸张的物理特性有关。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>physical properties：物理特性。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>9. With paper, there is a literal laying on of hands, along with the visual</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>geography of distant pages.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：阅读纸质书籍时，人们实实在在地用手触碰翻动书页，同时不同页面有着直观的视觉布局。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>literal：真正的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>visual geography：视觉布局。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>10. People often link their memory of what they've read to how far into</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>the book it was or where it was on the page.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：人们常常会将自己所读内容的记忆与读到书中哪个位置或者内容在页面上哪个地方联系起来。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>知识点：          link... to...：把……和……联系起来。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>memory：记忆。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>11. But equally important is the mental aspect.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：但同样重要的是心理层面的因素。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>mental aspect：心理层面。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>12. Reading researchers have proposed a theory called the shadowing</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>hypothesis.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：阅读研究人员提出了一个名为“浅层化假说”的理论。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>propose：提出。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>theory：理论。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>shadowing hypothesis：浅层化假说。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>13. According to this theory, people approach digital texts with a mindset</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>suited to social media, which are often not so serious and devote less mental effort than when they are reading print.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：根据这一理论，人们在阅读数字文本时，带着一种适用于社交媒体的心态，往往不够严肃，并且投入的脑力比阅读纸质文本时要少。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>approach：处理。     mindset：心态。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>social media：社交媒体。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>devote less mental effort：投入的脑力较少。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>14. Audio and video can feel more engaging than text, and so university</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>teachers increasingly turn to these technologies, assigning an online talk instead of an article by the same person.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：音频和视频比文字更有吸引力，因此大学教师越来越多地借助这些技术，例如布置学生观看线上讲座而非阅读同一人写的文章。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>engaging：有吸引力的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>turn to：借助。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>assign：布置。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>15. However, psychologists have demonstrated that when adults read</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>news stories, they remember more of the content than if they listen to or view identical pieces.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：然而，心理学家已经证实，成年人阅读新闻报道时，相较于听相同内容的音频或看相同内容的视频，他们能记住更多的内容。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>demonstrate：证实。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>remember more：记住更多。        identical pieces：相同的内容。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>16. Digital texts, audio, and video all have educational roles, especially</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>when providing resources not available in print.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：数字文本、音频和视频都具有教育作用，尤其是在提供纸质材料中没有的资源时。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>educational roles：教育作用。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>resources：资源。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>17. However, for maximizing learning where mental focus and reflection</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>are called for, educators shouldn't assume all media are the same, even when they contain identical words.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：然而，在需要精神专注和思考的学习情景中，教育工作者不应</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>假定所有媒体</p>"}], "id": "a_p6_6_22_01", "moduleId": "p6_6_22"}]}, {"id": "p6_6_23", "code": "6-23", "title": "真题原文精析-专升本", "articles": [{"title": "真题原文精析-专升本", "section": "", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读文章</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>文章来源：2022 年吉林专升本真题</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>主题：地铁与城市交通</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>文章精读</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Subways are underground trains which usually operate twenty-four hours a day.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>They are found in larger cities and usually run between the suburbs and the downtown area.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Maps and schedules are available from the ticket office.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>If you take the subway often, you can save money by purchasing a monthly pass.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>City-operated buses run on various routes and are designed to be at certain places at certain times.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Maps and schedules may be posted at certain stops or they may be available at local banks, libraries, the student union, or from the bus drivers.       Buses run mainly during the day.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Fare is paid by exact change in coins or by monthly passes.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Taxis are generally more expensive in Holland than in other countries.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>If you use a taxi, be sure you ask the amount of the fare before you agree to ride.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The driver usually expects a tip of fifteen percent of the fare.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读分析</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. Subways are underground trains which usually operate twenty-four</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>hours a day.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：地铁是地下运行的列车，通常一天24 小时运营。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>subway：地铁（美式英语，英式英语为underground）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>operate：运营。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>twenty-four hours a day：一天24 小时。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. They are found in larger cities and usually run between the suburbs</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>and the downtown area.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：它们多见于大城市，通常往返于郊区和市中心之间。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>be found in：存在于……。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>suburbs：郊区。      downtown area：市中心区域。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. Maps and schedules are available from the ticket office.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：在售票处可以获取地图和时刻表。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>available：可获得的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>ticket office：售票处。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. If you take the subway often, you can save money by purchasing a</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>monthly pass.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：如果你经常乘坐地铁，购买月票可以省钱。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>take the subway：乘坐地铁。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>monthly pass：月票。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>save money：省钱。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. City-operated buses run on various routes and are designed to be at</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>certain places at certain times.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：市政运营的公交车按不同的路线行驶，并且按照计划在特定时间抵达特定地点。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>知识点：     city-operated：市政运营的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>various routes：不同的路线。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>certain places/times：特定地点/时间。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. Maps and schedules may be posted at certain stops or they may be</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>available at local banks, libraries, the student union, or from the bus drivers.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：地图和时刻表可能会张贴在某些公交站点，或者可以在当地银行、图书馆、学生会处获取，还可以向公交司机索取。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>posted at：张贴在……。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>local banks：当地银行。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>student union：学生会。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. Buses run mainly during the day.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：公交车主要在白天运营。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>mainly：主要地。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>during the day：在白天。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. Fare is paid by exact change in coins or by monthly passes.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：车费可以通过投入准确数额的硬币或使用月票支付。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>知识点：    fare：车费。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>exact change：准确数额的零钱。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>coins：硬币。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>9. Taxis are generally more expensive in Holland than in other countries.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：在荷兰，出租车通常比其他国家更贵。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Holland：荷兰。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>more expensive：更贵。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>10. If you use a taxi, be sure you ask the amount of the fare before you</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>agree to ride.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：如果你乘坐出租车，在同意乘车之前，一定要问清楚车费是多少。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>be sure：确保。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>amount of the fare：车费的数额。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>agree to ride：同意乘车。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>11. The driver usually expects a tip of fifteen percent of the fare.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：司机通常期望得到车费15%的小费。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>tip：小费。        fifteen percent：15%。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>复习要点</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>subway：地铁。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>operate：运营。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>available：可获得的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>ticket office：售票处。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>monthly pass：月票。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>various routes：不同的路线。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>certain places/times：特定地点/时间。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>local banks：当地银行。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>student union：学生会。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>fare：车费。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>exact change：准确数额的零钱。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>coins：硬币。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Holland：荷兰。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>more expensive：更贵。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>be sure：确保。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>amount of the fare：车费的数额。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>agree to ride：同意乘车。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>tip：小费。</p>"}], "id": "a_p6_6_23_01", "moduleId": "p6_6_23"}]}, {"id": "p6_6_24", "code": "6-24", "title": "真题原文精析-专升本", "articles": [{"title": "真题原文精析-专升本", "section": "", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读文章</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>文章来源：吉林专升本真题</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>主题：广告的必要性与口口相传的营销方式</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>文章精读</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Is advertising really necessary? Billions of dollars are spent on it every year, so it must be important.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>After all, it's a busy world. You have to advertise to get people's attention to sell products.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Not every company thinks that way, however.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Despite avoiding traditional ways of advertising, the No Ad Company (which stands for \"not advertised\") has seen a steady increase in their profits over the years.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>And because their advertising plan is atypical, they can save money and keep costs down, which makes their products more affordable for consumers.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>No Ad sells its products by word of mouth. Word-of-mouth advertising      happens when one person tells another about a good experience with a product or service.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>That second person then  tells another  friend,  family member, or colleague, and so a chain of information is created.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Typically, advertisers talk about how good their products are. Although they say things like \"Studies show that our product  is the best\" or \"everyone loves this product,\" it can sound insincere or unconvincing.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's much more believable to hear about a product from a family member or friend who has used it and liked it.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Our loved ones' opinions are very important to us, so we often listen to their advice about a product.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Word-of-mouth advertising has other advantages too. It's cost-effective, after all.  It's free, and a company doesn't have to create a complex business plan to do it.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Here  is some  advice  for  small  businesses  about  word-of-mouth advertising:</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Be prepared to talk about your company at any time.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Always carry business cards and only say positive things about your company.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Don't say negative things about your competition.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Help other companies by referring people to them.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The more you help others, the more good fortune will come back to you.        That's good business.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读分析</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. Is advertising really necessary?</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：广告真的有必要吗？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>advertising：广告（动词形式：advertise）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>necessary：必要的（反义词：unnecessary）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. Billions of dollars are spent on it every year, so it must be important.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：每年数十亿美元都花在广告上，所以它肯定是重要的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>billions of：数十亿的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>be spent on：花在……上（被动语态）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>must：表示推测（一定……）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. After  all,  it's a busy world. You have to advertise to get people's</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>attention to sell products.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：毕竟这是一个忙碌的世界，你得做广告才能吸引人们的注意力， 进而去销售产品。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>知识点：        after all：毕竟。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>get people's attention：吸引人们的注意力。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>sell products：销售产品。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. Not every company thinks that way, however.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：然而，并不是每一家公司都这么想的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>think that way：以那样的方式去思考。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. Despite avoiding traditional ways of advertising, the No Ad Company</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>has seen a steady increase in their profits over the years.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：尽管避开了传统的广告方式，这个名为“No Ad”的公司，在过去这些年里，利润一直在稳步增长。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>despite：尽管（后接动名词或名词）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>avoid：避免（用法：avoid doing something）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>steady increase：稳步增长。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>profits：利润（单数形式：profit）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. And because their advertising plan is atypical, they can save money</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>and keep costs down, which makes their products more affordable for consumers.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：因为他们的广告计划是非典型的，他们能省钱，还能降低成本，   这使得他们的产品对消费者来说更能负担得起。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>atypical：非典型的（反义词：typical）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>keep costs down：降低成本。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>affordable：能负担得起的（基础词：afford）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>consumers：消费者（与“customers”区分）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. No Ad sells its products by word of mouth.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：No Ad 公司通过口口相传的方式销售产品。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>word of mouth：口口相传。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. Word-of-mouth advertising happens when one person tells another</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>about a good experience with a product or service.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：当一个人把使用某个产品或服务的好体验告诉另一个人时，这种口口相传的广告就产生了。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>good experience：好的体验。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>service：服务（与“product”并列）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>9. That second person then tells another friend, family member, or</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>colleague, and so a chain of information is created.   翻译：那个得知消息的第二个人，又会接着把这个消息告诉另一个朋友、家庭成员或同事，如此便形成了一条信息链。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>chain of information：信息链。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>family member：家庭成员。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>colleague：同事。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>10. Typically, advertisers talk about how good their products are.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：通常，广告商会谈论他们的产品有多好。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>advertisers：广告商（advertise + er）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>talk about：谈论。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>11. Although they say things like \"Studies show that our product is the</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>best\" or \"everyone loves  this product,\"  it can sound insincere or unconvincing.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：尽管他们会说“研究表明我们的产品是最好的”或“每个人都喜欢这个产品”，但这些话听起来可能会让人觉得不真诚或者没有说服力。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>insincere：不真诚的（反义词：sincere）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>unconvincing：没有说服力的（基础词：convince）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>12. It's much more believable to hear about a product from a family</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>member or friend who has used it and liked it.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：从使用过并且喜欢某个产品的家庭成员或朋友那里听说这个产品，会更可信。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>believable：可信的（基础词：believe）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>who has used it and liked it：定语从句，修饰“family member or friend”。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>13. Our loved ones' opinions are very important to us, so we often listen</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>to their advice about a product.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：我们所爱之人的观点对我们来说非常重要，所以我们经常会听取他们关于某个产品的建议。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>loved ones：亲人或所爱之人。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>opinions：观点。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>advice：建议。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>14.  Word-of-mouth  advertising  has  other  advantages  too.   It's</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>cost-effective, after all. It's free, and a company doesn't have to create a complex business plan to do it.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：口口相传的广告还有其他优点，比如性价比高，毕竟它是免费   的，公司不需要制定一个复杂的商业计划来开展这种广告。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>cost-effective：性价比高的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>complex：复杂的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>business plan：商业计划。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>15. Here  is some advice for small businesses about word-of-mouth</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">advertising:</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：以下是一些关于口口相传广告的小建议，适用于小企业：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>advice：建议。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>word-of-mouth advertising：口口相传的广告。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>16. Be prepared to talk about your company at any time.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：随时准备好谈论你的公司。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>be prepared to do something：准备好做某事。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>at any time：在任何时候。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>17. Always carry business cards and only say positive things about your</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>company.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：随身携带名片，并且只说关于你公司的正面话。   知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>business cards：名片。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>positive：正面的（反义词：negative）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>18. Don't say negative things about your competition.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：不要说竞争对手的坏话。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>competition：竞争对手。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>negative：负面的（反义词：positive）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>19. Help other companies by referring people to them.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：通过向其他公司推荐人才来帮助他们。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>refer somebody to something：把某人推荐给某物或某人。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>20. The more you help others, the more good fortune will come back to</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>you. That's good business.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：你帮助别人越多，回到你身上的好运就越多，这才是生财之道。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>good fortune：好运。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>that's good business：这是好的生意经。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>复习要点      advertising：广告。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>necessary：必要的（反义词：unnecessary）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>billions of：数十亿的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>be spent on：花在……上（被动语态）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>get people's attention：吸引人们的注意力。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>sell products：销售产品。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>despite：尽管（后接动名词或名词）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>avoid：避免（用法：avoid doing something）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>steady increase：稳步增长。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>profits：利润（单数形式：profit）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>atypical：非典型的（反义词：typical）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>keep costs down：降低成本。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>affordable：能负担得起的（基础词：afford）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>consumers：消费者（与“customers”区分）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>word of mouth：口口相传。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>good experience：好的体验。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>service：服务（与“product”并列）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>chain of information：信息链。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>family member：家庭成员。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>colleague：同事。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>advertisers：广告商（advertise + er）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>talk about：谈论。     insincere：不真诚的（反义词：sincere）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>unconvincing：没有说服力的（基础词：convince）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>believable：可信的（基础词：believe）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>loved ones：亲人或所爱之人。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>opinions：观点。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>advice：建议。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>cost-effective：性价比高的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>complex：复杂的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>business plan：商业计划。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>be prepared to do something：准备好做某事。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>at any time：在任何时候。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>business cards：名片。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>positive：正面的（反义词：negative）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>competition：竞争对手。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>refer somebody to something：把某人推荐给某物或某人。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>good fortune：好运。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>that's good business：这是好的生意经。</p>"}], "id": "a_p6_6_24_01", "moduleId": "p6_6_24"}]}, {"id": "p6_6_25", "code": "6-25", "title": "真题原文精析-四六级", "articles": [{"title": "真题原文精析-四六级", "section": "", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读文章</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>文章来源：2020 年12 月六级真题</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>主题：社交媒体对心理健康的影响</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>文章精读</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Why does social media trigger feelings of loneliness and inadequacy? Because instead of being real life,  it is for the most part impression management, a way of marketing  yourself  carefully, choosing and filtering the pictures and words to put your best face forward.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Online friends made through social media do not follow the normal psychological progression of an interpersonal relationship.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You share neither physical time nor emotional conversations over the Internet.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You simply communicate photographs and catchy posts to a diverse group of people whom you have friended or followed based on an accidental interaction.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>This is not to say that your social media friends can't be real friends; they       absolutely can, but the two are not synonymous.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Generally speaking, there are no unfiltered comments or casually taken photos on our social media pages, and rightfully so.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Because it wouldn't feel safe to be completely authentic and vulnerable with some of our friends whom we don't actually know or with whom trust has yet to be built.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Social media can certainly be an escape from the daily grind, but we must be cautioned against the negative effects, such as addiction, on a person's overall psychological well-being.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读分析</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. Why does social media trigger feelings of loneliness and inadequacy?</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：为什么社交媒体会引发孤独感和不足感？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>social media：社交媒体。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>trigger：引发（动词）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>loneliness：孤独感。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>inadequacy：不足感（形容词：inadequate，表示“不足够的”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. Because instead of being real life, it is for the most part impression</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>management, a way of marketing  yourself  carefully, choosing and filtering the pictures and words to put your best face forward.   翻译：因为社交媒体在很大程度上并非真实生活，而是印象管理，是一种通过精心挑选和筛选图片和文字来展示自己最好的一面的自我推销方式。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>impression management：印象管理。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>marketing：推销（名词：market）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>filter：筛选（名词：filter，表示“过滤器”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>put one's best face forward：展示最好的一面。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. Online friends made through social media do not follow the normal</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>psychological progression of an interpersonal relationship.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：通过社交媒体结交的线上朋友并不遵循正常的人际关系心理发展过程。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>interpersonal relationship：人际关系。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>psychological progression：心理发展过程。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. You share neither physical time nor emotional conversations over the</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Internet.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：在互联网上，你既没有实际的相处时间，也没有真正的情感交流。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>知识点：        physical time：实际相处时间。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>emotional conversations：情感交流。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>neither... nor...：既不……也不……。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. You simply communicate photographs and catchy posts to a diverse</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>group of people whom you have friended or followed based on an accidental interaction.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：你只是把照片和吸引人的帖子分享给形形色色的人，这些人是基于偶然的互动而被你添加为好友或关注的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>catchy：吸引人的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>diverse：不同的、多样的（名词：diversity）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>accidental interaction：偶然的互动。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. This is not to say that your social media friends can't be real friends;</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>they absolutely can, but the two are not synonymous.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：这并不是说你的社交媒体朋友不能成为真正的朋友，他们绝对可以，但两者并不等同。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>synonymous：等同的、同义的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>absolutely：绝对地。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. Generally speaking, there are no unfiltered comments or casually       taken photos on our social media pages, and rightfully so.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：一般来说，我们的社交媒体页面上没有未经筛选的评论，也没有随意拍摄的照片，这是理所当然的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>unfiltered：未经筛选的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>casually taken photos：随意拍摄的照片。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>rightfully so：理所当然。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. Because  it wouldn't  feel  safe to be completely authentic and</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>vulnerable with some of our friends whom we don't actually know or with whom trust has yet to be built.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：因为和一些我们实际上并不认识或还没有建立信任的朋友相处时，完全展现真实的、易受伤害的自己会让人感到不安全。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>authentic：真实的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>vulnerable：易受伤害的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>trust has yet to be built：尚未建立信任。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>9. Social media can certainly be an escape from the daily grind, but we</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>must be cautioned against the negative effects, such as addiction, on a person's overall psychological well-being.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：社交媒体当然可以成为逃避日常枯燥生活的一种方式，但我们   必须警惕它可能带来的负面影响，比如成瘾问题，这类负面影响会对一个人的整体心理健康产生不良作用。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>daily grind：日常的枯燥工作。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>cautioned against：警惕……。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>addiction：成瘾。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>psychological well-being：心理健康。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>复习要点</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>social media：社交媒体。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>trigger：引发。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>loneliness：孤独感。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>inadequacy：不足感。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>impression management：印象管理。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>marketing：推销。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>filter：筛选。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>put one's best face forward：展示最好的一面。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>interpersonal relationship：人际关系。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>psychological progression：心理发展过程。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>physical time：实际相处时间。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>emotional conversations：情感交流。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>neither... nor...：既不……也不……。    catchy：吸引人的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>diverse：不同的、多样的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>accidental interaction：偶然的互动。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>synonymous：等同的、同义的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>absolutely：绝对地。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>unfiltered：未经筛选的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>casually taken photos：随意拍摄的照片。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>rightfully so：理所当然。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>authentic：真实的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>vulnerable：易受伤害的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>trust has yet to be built：尚未建立信任。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>daily grind：日常的枯燥工作。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>cautioned against：警惕……。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>addiction：成瘾。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>psychological well-being：心理健康。</p>"}], "id": "a_p6_6_25_01", "moduleId": "p6_6_25"}]}, {"id": "p6_6_26", "code": "6-26", "title": "真题原文精析-四六级", "articles": [{"title": "真题原文精析-四六级", "section": "", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读文章</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>文章来源：四六级真题</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>主题：可口可乐的历史与成分</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>文章精读</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You may have heard that Coca-Cola once contained an ingredient capable of sparking particular devotion in consumers: cocaine.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The Coca in the name referred to the extracts of coca leaf that the drink's originator, chemist John Pemberton, mixed with his sugary syrup.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>At the time, coca leaf extract mixed with wine was a common tonic, and Pemberton's sweet brew was a way to get around local laws prohibiting the sale of alcohol.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>But the other  half of the name presents another  ingredient,  less infamous but strangely potent: the kola nut.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>In West Africa, people have long chewed kola nuts as stimulants because they contain caffeine, which also occurs naturally in tea, coffee, and chocolate.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Historian Paul Lovejoy relates that the cultivation of kola nuts in West        Africa is hundreds of years old.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The  leafy, spreading trees were planted on graves and as part of traditional rituals.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Even though the nuts need to stay moist, traders carried them hundreds of miles through forests and grasslands.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Europeans did not know of them until the fifteen hundreds, when Portuguese ships arrived on the coast of what is now Sierra Leone.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>By sixteen twenty, when English explorer Richard Jobson made his way up the Gambian coast, the nuts were still peculiar to his eyes.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>In its first year, Coca-Cola averaged nine servings a day across all the Atlanta soda fountains where it was sold.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>As it grew more popular, the company sold rights to bottle the soda so it could travel easily.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>These days, the Coca-Cola recipe is a closely guarded secret.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>But it's said to no longer contain kola nut extract, relying instead on artificial imitations to achieve the flavor.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读分析</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. You may have heard that Coca-Cola once contained an ingredient</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>capable of sparking particular devotion in consumers: cocaine.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>你或许听说过，可口可乐曾经含有一种能让消费者特别着迷的成分：   可卡因。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Coca-Cola：可口可乐。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>ingredient：成分。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>capable of：能够……（固定搭配）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>spark：引发、激发。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>devotion：热爱、着迷。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>cocaine：可卡因。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. The Coca in the name referred to the extracts of coca leaf that the</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>drink's originator, chemist John Pemberton, mixed with his sugary syrup.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“Coca”这个名字指的是可卡叶的提取物，这种饮品的发明者、化学家约翰·彭伯顿将其与他的糖浆混合在一起。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>refer to：指……，意味着…… extract：提取物（动词：extract，表示“提取”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>originator：发明者（动词：originate）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>chemist：化学家（学科：chemistry）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>sugary syrup：含糖的糖浆。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. At the time, coca leaf extract mixed with wine was a common tonic,      and Pemberton's sweet brew was a way to get around local laws</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>prohibiting the sale of alcohol.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>当时，可卡叶提取物与葡萄酒混合是一种常见的滋补品，而彭伯顿的甜饮是一种规避当地禁酒法律的方式。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>tonic：滋补品。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>get around：规避。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>prohibit：禁止（过去分词：prohibited）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>sale of alcohol：酒精销售。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. But the other half of the name presents another ingredient, less</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>infamous but strangely potent: the kola nut.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>但这个名字的另一半代表了另一种成分，或许没有那么声名狼藉，却有着奇特的效力：可乐果。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>infamous：声名狼藉的（形容词：famous）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>potent：效力强的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>kola nut：可乐果。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. In West Africa, people have long chewed kola nuts as stimulants       because they contain caffeine, which also occurs naturally in tea, coffee,</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>and chocolate.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>在西非，人们长期以来一直咀嚼可乐果作为兴奋剂，因为它们含有咖啡因，这种物质也天然存在于茶、咖啡和巧克力中。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>stimulant：兴奋剂（动词：stimulate）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>caffeine：咖啡因。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>occur naturally：天然存在。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. Historian Paul Lovejoy relates that the cultivation of kola nuts in West</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Africa is hundreds of years old.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>历史学家保罗·洛夫乔伊指出，西非种植可乐果的历史已有数百年。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>historian：历史学家。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>cultivation：种植（动词：cultivate）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>relate：指出、提到。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. The leafy, spreading trees were planted on graves and as part of</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>traditional rituals.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：   这些枝繁叶茂、向四周伸展的树木被种植在坟墓上，并且是传统仪式的一部分。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>leafy：枝叶繁茂的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>spreading：向四周伸展的（动词：spread）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>traditional rituals：传统仪式。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. Even though the nuts need to stay moist, traders carried them</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>hundreds of miles through forests and grasslands.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>尽管可乐果需要保持湿润，商人们还是带着它们穿越数百英里的森林和草原。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>moist：湿润的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>trader：商人（名词：trade）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>carry：携带。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>9. Europeans did not know of them  until  fifteen hundred, when</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Portuguese ships arrived on the coast of what is now Sierra Leone.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>直到16 世纪，葡萄牙船只抵达如今的塞拉利昂海岸，欧洲人还不知道可乐果。   知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>fifteen hundreds：16 世纪。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Portuguese：葡萄牙的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>coast：海岸。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>10. By sixteen twenty, when English explorer Richard Jobson made his</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>way up the Gambian coast, the nuts were still peculiar to his eyes.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>到了1620 年，英国探险家理查德·乔布森前往冈比亚海岸时，可乐果在他眼中依然十分新奇。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>explorer：探险家（动词：explore）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>make one's way up：费力前往…… peculiar：新奇的、独特的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>11. In its first year, Coca-Cola averaged nine servings a day across all the</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Atlanta soda fountains where it was sold.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>在上市的第一年，可口可乐在亚特兰大所有销售它的汽水摊点平均每天售出9 份。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>average：平均（名词：average）。     servings：份（单份：serving）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>soda fountain：汽水摊点。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>12. As it grew more popular, the company sold rights to bottle the soda</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>so it could travel easily.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>随着它越来越受欢迎，公司出售了瓶装生产权，以便它能够便捷地运往各地。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>grow：增长、变得。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>right：权利。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>bottle：装瓶（名词：bottle）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>travel：运输（这里指物品运输）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>13. These days, the Coca-Cola recipe is a closely guarded secret. But it's</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>said to no longer contain kola nut extract, relying instead on artificial imitations to achieve the flavor.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>如今，可口可乐的配方是一个严格保守的秘密，但据说它不再含有可乐果提取物，而是依靠人工仿制品来获得那种风味。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>recipe：配方。        closely guarded：严格保守的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>imitation：仿制品（动词：imitate）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>flavor：风味、口味。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>复习要点</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Coca-Cola：可口可乐。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>ingredient：成分。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>capable of：能够…… spark：引发、激发。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>devotion：热爱、着迷。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>cocaine：可卡因。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>refer to：指……，意味着…… extract：提取物（动词：extract）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>originator：发明者（动词：originate）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>chemist：化学家（学科：chemistry）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>sugary syrup：含糖的糖浆。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>tonic：滋补品。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>get around：规避。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>prohibit：禁止（过去分词：prohibited）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>sale of alcohol：酒精销售。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>infamous：声名狼藉的（形容词：famous）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>potent：效力强的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>kola nut：可乐果。     stimulant：兴奋剂（动词：stimulate）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>caffeine：咖啡因。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>occur naturally：天然存在。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>historian：历史学家。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>cultivation：种植（动词：cultivate）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>relate：指出、提到。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>leafy：枝叶繁茂的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>spreading：向四周伸展的（动词：spread）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>traditional rituals：传统仪式。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>moist：湿润的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>trader：商人（名词：trade）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>carry：携带。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>fifteen hundreds：16 世纪。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Portuguese：葡萄牙的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>coast：海岸。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>explorer：探险家（动词：explore）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>make one's way up：费力前往…… peculiar：新奇的、独特的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>average：平均（名词：average）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>servings：份（单份：serving）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>soda fountain：汽水摊点。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>grow：增长、变得。     right：权利。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>bottle：装瓶（名词：bottle）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>travel：运输（这里指物品运输）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>recipe：配方。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>closely guarded：严格保守的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>imitation：仿制品（动词：imitate）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>flavor：风味、口味。</p>"}], "id": "a_p6_6_26_01", "moduleId": "p6_6_26"}]}, {"id": "p6_6_27", "code": "6-27", "title": "真题原文精析-考研", "articles": [{"title": "真题原文精析-考研", "section": "", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读文章</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>文章来源：2019 年英语一真题主题：成绩膨胀与高等教育消费时代</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>文章精读</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Grade inflation—the gradual increase in average GPAs over the past few decades — is often considered a product of a consumer era in higher education, in which students are treated like consumers to be pleased.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>But another related force—a policy often buried deep in course catalogs called grade forgiveness—is helping raise GPAs.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Grade forgiveness allows students to retake a course in which they received a low grade, and the most recent or highest grade is the only one that counts in calculating a student's overall GPA.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The use of this little-known practice has accelerated in recent years, as colleges continue to do their utmost to keep students in school and pay tuition and improve their graduation rates.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>When this practice first started decades ago, it was usually limited to freshmen to give them a second chance to take a class in their first year            if they struggled in their transition to college-level courses.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>But now most colleges, save for many selective campuses, allow  all undergraduates and even graduate students to get their low grades forgiven.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>College officials tend to emphasize that the goal of grade forgiveness is less about the grade itself and more about encouraging students to retake courses critical to their degree program without incurring a big penalty.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Ultimately, students achieve more success because they retake a course and do better in subsequent courses or master the content that allows them to graduate on time.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读分析</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. Grade inflation—the gradual increase in average GPAs over the past</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>few decades—is often considered a product of a consumer era in higher education, in which students are treated like consumers to be pleased.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>成绩膨胀——过去几十年中平均绩点逐步上升的现象——常被视为高等教育消费时代的产物，在这个时代中，学生被当作需要取悦的消费者。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>grade inflation：成绩膨胀。       gradual increase：逐步上升。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>GPA：Grade Point Average，平均绩点。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>consumer era：消费时代。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>higher education：高等教育。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>treat...like...：把……当作……对待。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>to be pleased：需要被取悦的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. But another related force — a policy often buried deep in course</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>catalogs called grade forgiveness—is helping raise GPAs.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>但另一个相关因素——一项深藏在课程目录中名为“成绩宽恕”的政策——也在助力提高平均绩点。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>related force：相关因素。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>buried deep in：深藏于……。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>grade forgiveness：成绩宽恕。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>policy：政策。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. Grade forgiveness allows students to retake a course in which they</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>received a low grade, and the most recent or highest grade is the only one that counts in calculating a student's overall GPA.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：   成绩宽恕政策允许学生重修他们曾获得低分的课程，且在计算学生总绩点时，只有最近一次或最高一次的成绩会被计算。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>retake：重修。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>low grade：低分。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>most recent/highest grade：最近一次/最高一次的成绩。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>count：被计算。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>overall GPA：总绩点。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. The use of this little-known practice has accelerated in recent years, as</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>colleges continue to do their utmost to keep students in school and pay tuition and improve their graduation rates.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>近年来，这种鲜为人知的做法越来越多地被采用，因为高校一直在竭尽全力让学生留在学校并缴纳学费，同时提高他们的毕业率。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>little-known practice：鲜为人知的做法。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>accelerate：加速。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>do their utmost：竭尽全力。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>tuition：学费。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>graduation rates：毕业率。        5. When this practice first started decades ago, it was usually limited to freshmen to give them a second chance to take a class in their first year if they struggled in their transition to college-level courses.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>当这种做法在几十年前刚开始实施时，通常只针对大一新生，如果他们在过渡到大学水平课程时遇到困难，可以让他们在第一年有第二次机会上课。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>limit...to...：限制于……。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>freshmen：大一新生。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>struggle in their transition：在过渡中遇到困难。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>college-level courses：大学水平课程。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. But now most colleges, save for many selective campuses, allow all</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>undergraduates and even graduate students to get their low grades forgiven.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>但如今，除了许多精英院校之外，大多数高校允许所有本科生甚至研究生申请消除低分记录。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>save for：除了……。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>selective campuses：精英院校。     undergraduates：本科生。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>graduate students：研究生。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>forgiven：被消除。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. College officials tend to emphasize that the goal of grade forgiveness</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>is less about the grade itself and more about encouraging students to retake courses critical to their degree program without incurring a big penalty.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>高校管理人员倾向于强调，成绩宽恕政策的目的并非主要着眼于成绩本身，而是更多地鼓励学生重修对其学位课程至关重要的课程，且无需承受严重处罚。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>officials：管理人员。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>emphasize：强调。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>critical to：对……至关重要。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>incur a big penalty：承受严重处罚。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. Ultimately, students achieve more success because they retake a</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>course and do better in subsequent courses or master the content that allows them to graduate on time.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>最终，学生取得了更大的成功，因为他们重修课程后，在后续课程中   表现更佳，或者掌握了相应知识内容，从而能够按时毕业。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>ultimately：最终。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>achieve success：取得成功。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>subsequent courses：后续课程。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>master the content：掌握内容。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>graduate on time：按时毕业。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>复习要点</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>grade inflation：成绩膨胀。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>gradual increase：逐步上升。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>GPA：平均绩点。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>consumer era：消费时代。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>higher education：高等教育。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>treat...like...：把……当作……对待。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>retake：重修。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>low grade：低分。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>most recent/highest grade：最近一次/最高一次的成绩。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>count：被计算。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>overall GPA：总绩点。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>little-known practice：鲜为人知的做法。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>accelerate：加速。      do their utmost：竭尽全力。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>tuition：学费。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>graduation rates：毕业率。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>limit...to...：限制于……。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>freshmen：大一新生。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>struggle in their transition：在过渡中遇到困难。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>college-level courses：大学水平课程。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>save for：除了……。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>selective campuses：精英院校。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>undergraduates：本科生。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>graduate students：研究生。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>forgiven：被消除。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>officials：管理人员。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>emphasize：强调。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>critical to：对……至关重要。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>incur a big penalty：承受严重处罚。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>ultimately：最终。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>achieve success：取得成功。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>subsequent courses：后续课程。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>master the content：掌握内容。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>graduate on time：按时毕业。</p>"}], "id": "a_p6_6_27_01", "moduleId": "p6_6_27"}]}, {"id": "p6_6_28", "code": "6-28", "title": "真题原文精析-考研", "articles": [{"title": "真题原文精析-考研", "section": "", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读文章</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>文章来源：2017 年考研英语一</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>主题：美国机场安检与旅客的困境</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>文章精读</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>First two hours, now three hours—this is how far in advance authorities are recommending people show up to catch a domestic flight, at least at some major US airports, with increasingly massive security lines.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Americans are willing to tolerate time-consuming security procedures in return for increased safety.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The crash of EgyptAir Flight 804, which terrorists may have downed over the Mediterranean Sea, provides another tragic reminder of why.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>But demanding too much of air travelers or providing too little security in return undermines public support for the process.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>And  it should be — it is only natural that wasted time  is a drag on Americans' economic and private lives, not to mention infuriating.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Last year, the Transportation Security Administration found in a secret       check that undercover investigators were able to sneak weapons, both fake and real, past airport security nearly every time they tried.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Enhanced security measures since then, combined with the rise in airline travel due to the improving economy and low oil prices, have resulted in long waits at major airports such as Chicago's O'Hare International.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It is not yet clear how much more effective airline security has become, but the lines are obvious.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读分析</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1.  First two hours, now three hours — this  is how far in advance</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>authorities are recommending people show up to catch a domestic flight, at least at some major US airports, with increasingly massive security lines.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>一开始是提前两小时，现在变成了提前三小时，这是当局建议旅客前往机场的时间，至少在美国一些主要机场，安检队伍越来越长。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>in advance：提前。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>authorities：当局、官方。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>recommend sb. to do sth.：建议某人做某事。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>show up：出现、到达。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>domestic flight：国内航班。       massive security lines：大规模的安检队伍。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. Americans are willing to tolerate time-consuming security procedures</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>in return for increased safety.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>美国人愿意忍受耗时的安检程序，以换取更高的安全性。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>tolerate：忍受。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>time-consuming：耗时的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>in return for：作为……的回报，换取。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>safety：安全。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. The crash of EgyptAir Flight 804, which terrorists may have downed</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>over the Mediterranean Sea, provides another tragic reminder of why.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>埃及航空804 航班的坠毁——可能是恐怖分子在地中海上空击落的 ——又一次悲惨地提醒了大家为什么要进行安检。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>crash：坠毁。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>down：击落（动词）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Mediterranean Sea：地中海。        tragic reminder：悲惨的提醒。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. But demanding too much of air travelers or providing too little security</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>in return undermines public support for the process.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>但对航空旅客要求过多，或者提供的安全保障过少，会削弱公众对安检流程的支持。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>demand sth. of sb.：向某人要求某事。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>undermine：削弱、破坏。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>public support：公众支持。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. And it should be — it is only natural that wasted time is a drag on</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Americans' economic and private lives, not to mention infuriating.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>这也是正常的——浪费时间对美国人的经济生活和个人生活是一种拖累，更不用说令人愤怒了。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>drag：拖累、累赘。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>infuriating：令人愤怒的。        6. Last year, the Transportation Security Administration found in a secret check that undercover investigators were able to sneak weapons, both fake and real, past airport security nearly every time they tried.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>去年，美国运输安全管理局在一次秘密检查中发现，卧底调查人员几乎每次都能将真假武器偷偷带过机场安检。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Transportation Security Administration (TSA)：美国运输安全管理局。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>undercover：卧底的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>sneak：偷偷地携带。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>airport security：机场安检。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. Enhanced security measures since then, combined with the rise in</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>airline travel due to the improving economy and low oil prices, have resulted  in long waits at major airports such as Chicago's O'Hare International.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>从那以后，加强的安全措施，加上经济好转和油价降低导致航空旅行人数增加，使得像芝加哥奥黑尔国际机场这样的主要机场出现了长时间的等待。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>enhanced security measures：加强的安全措施。        rise in airline travel：航空旅行人数增加。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>due to：由于。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>result in：导致。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. It is not yet clear how much more effective airline security has become,</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>but the lines are obvious.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>目前还不清楚航空安检变得有多有效，但排队的队伍是显而易见的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>not yet clear：尚未明确。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>effective：有效的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>lines：队伍（这里指排队）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>复习要点</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>in advance：提前。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>authorities：当局、官方。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>recommend sb. to do sth.：建议某人做某事。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>show up：出现、到达。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>domestic flight：国内航班。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>massive security lines：大规模的安检队伍。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>tolerate：忍受。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>time-consuming：耗时的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>in return for：作为……的回报，换取。     safety：安全。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>crash：坠毁。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>down：击落（动词）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Mediterranean Sea：地中海。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>tragic reminder：悲惨的提醒。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>demand sth. of sb.：向某人要求某事。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>undermine：削弱、破坏。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>public support：公众支持。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>drag：拖累、累赘。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>infuriating：令人愤怒的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Transportation Security Administration (TSA)：美国运输安全管理局。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>undercover：卧底的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>sneak：偷偷地携带。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>airport security：机场安检。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>enhanced security measures：加强的安全措施。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>rise in airline travel：航空旅行人数增加。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>due to：由于。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>result in：导致。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>not yet clear：尚未明确。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>effective：有效的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>lines：队伍（这里指排队）。</p>"}], "id": "a_p6_6_28_01", "moduleId": "p6_6_28"}]}, {"id": "p6_6_29", "code": "6-29", "title": "真题原文精析-雅思", "articles": [{"title": "真题原文精析-雅思", "section": "", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读文章</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>文章来源：雅思真题</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>主题：湿地的全球重要性</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>文章精读</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Wetlands are areas where water covers the soil, or is present either at or near the surface of the soil, for all or part of the year.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>These are complex ecosystems rich in unique plant and animal life.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>But according to the Worldwide Fund for Nature, half of the world's wetlands have disappeared since 1990, converted or destroyed for commercial development, drainage schemes, and the extraction of minerals and peat.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Many of those that remain have been damaged by agricultural pesticides and fertilizers, industrial pollutants, and construction works.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Throughout history, humans have gathered around wetlands, and their fertile  ecosystems  have  played  an  important  part   in  human development.       Consequently,  they  are  of  considerable  religious,  historical,  and archaeological value to many communities around the world.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Wetlands directly support the livelihoods and well-being of millions of people.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>They also serve a crucial environmental purpose.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Wetlands are one of the key tools in mitigating climate change across the planet, protecting coastal areas from sea-level rise and extreme weather events such as hurricanes and flooding.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Wetland coastal forests provide food and water, as well as shelter from storms.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Wetlands International and other agencies are working to restore those forests which have been lost.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It can be as simple as planting a few trees per hectare to create shade and substantially change a microclimate.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Implementing climate change projects isn't so much about money.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读分析</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. Wetlands are areas where water covers the soil, or is present either at</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>or near the surface of the soil, for all or part of the year.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>湿地是一些区域，在一年中的全部或部分时间里，水会覆盖土壤，或者存在于土壤表面或接近土壤表面的地方。   知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>wetlands：湿地（复数形式，表示一类区域）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>soil：土壤。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>surface：表面。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>present：存在（形容词）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>either... or...：要么……要么……。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. These are complex ecosystems rich in unique plant and animal life.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>这些湿地是复杂的生态系统，拥有丰富独特的动植物生命。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>complex ecosystems：复杂的生态系统。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>rich in：在……方面丰富。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>unique：独特的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. But according to the Worldwide Fund for Nature, half of the world's</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>wetlands have disappeared since 1990, converted or destroyed for commercial development, drainage schemes, and the extraction of minerals and peat.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>但根据世界自然基金会的数据，自1990 年以来，全球一半的湿地已经消失，它们因商业开发、排水工程以及矿产和泥炭的开采而被改造   或破坏。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Worldwide Fund for Nature：世界自然基金会。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>disappear：消失。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>commercial development：商业开发。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>drainage schemes：排水工程。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>extraction：开采。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. Many of those that remain have been damaged by agricultural</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>pesticides and fertilizers, industrial pollutants, and construction works.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>许多留存下来的湿地也受到了农业农药、化肥、工业污染物以及建筑工程的损害。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>pesticides：农药。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>fertilizers：化肥。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>pollutants：污染物。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>construction works：建筑工程。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. Throughout history, humans have gathered around wetlands, and</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>their  fertile ecosystems have played an important part  in human development.   翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>在整个历史长河中，人类一直聚居在湿地周围，湿地肥沃的生态系统在人类发展中发挥了重要作用。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>throughout history：在整个历史中。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>gather around：聚集在……周围。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>play an important part in：在……中发挥重要作用。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. Consequently, they are of considerable  religious,  historical, and</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>archaeological value to many communities around the world.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>因此，湿地对世界各地的许多群体具有重要的宗教、历史和考古价值。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>religious：宗教的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>historical：历史的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>archaeological：考古的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>value：价值。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. Wetlands directly support the livelihoods and well-being of millions of</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>people.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>湿地直接维系着数百万人的生计和福祉。   知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>livelihoods：生计。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>well-being：福祉。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>support：支持（这里译为“维系”更通顺）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. They also serve a crucial environmental purpose.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>湿地也发挥着至关重要的环境作用。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>serve：发挥……的作用。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>crucial：至关重要的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>9. Wetlands are one of the key tools in mitigating climate change across</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>the planet, protecting coastal areas from sea-level rise and extreme weather events such as hurricanes and flooding.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>湿地是缓解全球气候变化的关键手段之一，能够保护沿海地区免受海平面上升和飓风、洪水等极端天气事件的影响。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>mitigate：缓解。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>climate change：气候变化。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>sea-level rise：海平面上升。      extreme weather events：极端天气事件。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>10. Wetland coastal forests provide food and water, as well as shelter</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>from storms.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>湿地沿海森林提供食物和水，并且可以作为躲避风暴的庇护所。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>coastal forests：沿海森林。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>shelter：庇护所。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>storms：风暴。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>11. Wetlands International and other agencies are working to restore</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>those forests which have been lost.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>湿地国际及其他机构正在努力恢复那些已经消失的森林。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>restore：恢复。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>agencies：机构。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>12. It can be as simple as planting a few trees per hectare to create</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>shade and substantially change a microclimate.   翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>这可以简单到每公顷种植几棵树，创造树荫并显著改变小气候。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>hectare：公顷。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>shade：树荫。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>microclimate：小气候。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>13. Implementing climate change projects isn't so much about money.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>实施气候变化项目并非主要取决于资金。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>implement：实施。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>so much about：并非主要取决于……。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>复习要点</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>wetlands：湿地。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>soil：土壤。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>surface：表面。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>present：存在（形容词）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>complex ecosystems：复杂的生态系统。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>rich in：在……方面丰富。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>unique：独特的。      Worldwide Fund for Nature：世界自然基金会。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>disappear：消失。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>commercial development：商业开发。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>drainage schemes：排水工程。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>extraction：开采。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>pesticides：农药。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>fertilizers：化肥。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>pollutants：污染物。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>construction works：建筑工程。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>throughout history：在整个历史中。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>gather around：聚集在……周围。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>play an important part in：在……中发挥重要作用。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>religious：宗教的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>historical：历史的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>archaeological：考古的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>value：价值。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>livelihoods：生计。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>well-being：福祉。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>support：支持（维系）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>serve：发挥……的作用。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>crucial：至关重要的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>mitigate：缓解。       climate change：气候变化。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>sea-level rise：海平面上升。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>extreme weather events：极端天气事件。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>coastal forests：沿海森林。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>shelter：庇护所。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>storms：风暴。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>restore：恢复。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>agencies：机构。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>hectare：公顷。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>shade：树荫。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>microclimate：小气候。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>implement：实施。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>so much about：并非主要取决于……。</p>"}], "id": "a_p6_6_29_01", "moduleId": "p6_6_29"}]}, {"id": "p6_6_30", "code": "6-30", "title": "真题原文精析-雅思", "articles": [{"title": "真题原文精析-雅思", "section": "", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读文章</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>文章来源：雅思真题</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>主题：错误信息的持久性和危害性</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>文章精读</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">原文：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The persistence and peril of misinformation Misinformation both deliberately promoted and accidentally shared is perhaps an inevitable part of the world in which we live, but it is not a new problem.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>People likely have lied to one another for roughly as long as verbal communication has existed.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Deceiving others can offer an apparent opportunity to gain strategic advantage, motivate others to action, and even protect interpersonal bonds.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Moreover,  people  inadvertently  have  been  sharing  inaccurate information with one another for thousands of years.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>However, we currently  live in an era in which technology enables information to reach large audiences distributed across the globe.       Thus,  the  potential  for  immediate and  widespread  effects  from misinformation now looms larger than in the past.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Yet the means to correct misinformation might over time be found in those same patterns of mass communication and of the facilitated spread of information.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The main worry regarding misinformation  is  its potential to unduly influence  attitudes and behavior, leading people to think and  act differently than they would if they were correctly informed, as suggested by the research teams of Bristol University and Duke University, among others.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>In other words, we worry that misinformation might lead people to hold misperceptions or false beliefs, and that these misperceptions, especially when they occur among large groups of people, may have detrimental downstream consequences for health,  social harmony, and  political climate.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>精读分析</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. Misinformation both deliberately promoted and accidentally shared is</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>perhaps an inevitable part of the world in which we live, but it is not a new problem.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>错误信息无论是蓄意传播的还是无意分享的，或许是我们所生活的世   界中不可避免的一部分，但这并非新问题。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>misinformation：错误信息。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>deliberately：故意地。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>promote：推广。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>accidentally：无意地。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>inevitable：不可避免的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>in which we live：定语从句，修饰“the world”。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. People likely have lied to one another for roughly as long as verbal</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>communication has existed.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>人们彼此说谎的时间几乎与语言交流存在的时间一样长。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>lie to one another：相互说谎。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>verbal communication：语言交流。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>for roughly as long as：与……时间一样长。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. Deceiving others can offer an apparent opportunity to gain strategic</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>advantage, motivate others to action, and even protect interpersonal bonds.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：   欺骗他人表面上可能带来获取战略优势、促使他人采取行动甚至维系人际关系的机会。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>deceive：欺骗。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>apparent：表面上的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>strategic advantage：战略优势。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>motivate：促使……采取行动。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>interpersonal bonds：人际关系。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4.  Moreover,  people  inadvertently  have been  sharing  inaccurate</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>information with one another for thousands of years.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>此外，几千年来人们一直在无意中分享不准确的信息。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>inadvertently：无意地。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>inaccurate：不准确的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>share with one another：彼此分享。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. However, we currently live in an era in which technology enables</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>information to reach large audiences distributed across the globe.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>然而，我们如今生活在这样一个时代，科技使得信息能够触达分布在   全球各地的大量受众。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>era：时代。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>enable...to reach：使……能够触达。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>audiences：受众。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>distributed across the globe：分布在全球各地。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. Thus, the potential for immediate and widespread effects from</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>misinformation now looms larger than in the past.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>因此，相较于过去，错误信息可能瞬间引发广泛影响的潜在威胁如今愈发凸显。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>potential：潜在威胁。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>immediate：即刻的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>widespread：广泛的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>loom larger than in the past：比过去更凸显。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. Yet the means to correct misinformation might over time be found in</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>those same patterns of mass communication and of the facilitated spread of information.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>翻译：   不过，随着时间的推移，纠正错误信息的方法或许可以在大众传播模式和便捷的信息传播模式中找到。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>means：方法。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>correct misinformation：纠正错误信息。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>mass communication：大众传播。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>facilitated spread of information：便捷的信息传播。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. The main worry regarding misinformation is its potential to unduly</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>influence  attitudes and behavior, leading people to think and  act differently than they would if they were correctly informed, as suggested by the research teams of Bristol University and Duke University, among others.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>关于错误信息的主要担忧在于，它可能过度影响人们的态度和行为， 导致人们在思考和行动上与获取正确信息时的情况有所不同。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>unduly：过度地。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>influence：影响。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>attitudes and behavior：态度和行为。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>lead people to...：导致人们…… correctly informed：获取正确信息。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>9. In other words, we worry that misinformation might lead people to</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>hold misperceptions or false beliefs, and that these misperceptions, especially when they occur among large groups of people, may have detrimental downstream consequences for health, social harmony, and political climate.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">翻译：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>换句话说，我们担心错误信息可能导致人们产生误解或错误认知，尤其是当这些误解在大量人群中出现时，可能对健康、社会和谐和政治氛围产生负面的连锁反应。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">知识点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>misperceptions：误解。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>false beliefs：错误认知。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>detrimental：有害的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>downstream consequences：连锁反应。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>social harmony：社会和谐。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>political climate：政治氛围。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>复习要点</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>misinformation：错误信息。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>persistence：持久性（动词：persist）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>peril：危险性。     deliberately：故意地。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>accidentally：无意地。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>inevitable：不可避免的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>verbal communication：语言交流。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>deceive：欺骗（固定搭配：deceive sb. into doing sth.）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>apparent：表面上的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>strategic advantage：战略优势。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>motivate：促使……采取行动。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>interpersonal bonds：人际关系。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>inadvertently：无意地。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>inaccurate：不准确的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>audiences：受众。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>distributed across the globe：分布在全球各地。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>potential：潜在威胁。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>immediate：即刻的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>widespread：广泛的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>loom larger than in the past：比过去更凸显。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>means：方法。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>mass communication：大众传播。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>facilitated spread of information：便捷的信息传播。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>unduly：过度地。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>influence：影响。        attitudes and behavior：态度和行为。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>lead people to...：导致人们…… correctly informed：获取正确信息。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>misperceptions：误解。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>false beliefs：错误认知。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>detrimental：有害的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>downstream consequences：连锁反应。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>social harmony：社会和谐。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>political climate：政治氛围。</p>"}], "id": "a_p6_6_30_01", "moduleId": "p6_6_30"}]}], "id": "part6", "file": "第六部分_高频句型.md", "title": "第六部分 · 高频句型", "range": "6-0 ～ 6-30"}, {"name": "高频句型 · 第七部分", "single": true, "modules": [{"id": "p7_all", "code": "第七部分", "title": "高频句型与实用表达", "articles": [{"id": "a_p7_all_01", "moduleId": "p7_all", "title": "全文", "section": "", "blocks": [{"type": "h", "html": "<h2 class=\"part-h\">7-2 基础语法——造句公式</h2>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>英语句子核心成分</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>成分定义           例句主语句子主体（名词/代词）      The boy reads. / She sings.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>谓语动作（动词）                  Birds fly. / I like apples.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>宾语动作对象（名词/代词）     He drinks water.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>a beautiful flower / the man in 定语修饰名词（形容词/短语/从句）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>the car 描述动作细节（时间/地点/方 She runs  quickly.  / We study</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>状语</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>式）                          every day.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>系动 连接主语与表语（be/感官动 The soup tastes delicious.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>词  词）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>说明主语状态（形容词/名词/ He  is a  teacher.  / She  looks</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>表语</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>短语）                       happy.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>五大基础造句公式</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">1. 主语+ 谓语（不及物动词）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>结构：S + V</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Time passes.（时间流逝）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Flowers bloom.（花儿绽放）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">2. 主语+ 谓语+ 宾语（及物动词）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>结构：S + V + O</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Students read books.（学生读书）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She writes letters.（她写信）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">3. 主语+ 系动词+ 表语</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>结构：S + LV + P 例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I am tired.（我很累）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The book is interesting.（这本书有趣）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">4. 主语+ 谓语+ 宾语+ 宾补</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>结构：S + V + O + OC（宾补补充宾语状态/动作）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">宾补形式：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>形容词：Keep your hands warm.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>名词：They elected him president.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>不定式：Mom asks me to study hard.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>分词：I saw her dancing.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>例句：We made the classroom clean.（我们让教室变干净）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">5. There be 句型</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>结构：There be + 主语+ 地点（表示“存在”）   要点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">be 动词随主语单复数变化：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>There is a pen on the desk.（单数）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>There are two books here.（复数）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>就近原则：靠近be 的名词决定单复数 There is a pen and two books.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>There are two books and a pen.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">否定/疑问：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>There isn't any water.（否定）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Is there a hospital?（疑问）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>特殊句型：形式主语It 结构：It + be + adj. + ( for sb ) + to do sth (表达评价）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">例句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It is easy for him to solve problems.（他解题很容易）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It is necessary to sleep well.（充足睡眠很必要）</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h2 class=\"part-h\">7-3 万能宝典-朋友见面</h2>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">一、核心词汇</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>兴趣爱好类：hobby（爱好）、oil painting（油画）、science fiction movie （科幻电影）、exhibition（展览）、art museum（美术馆）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>生活状态类：busy（忙碌的）、discover（发现）、watch（观看）、 suggest（建议）、join（加入）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>情感描述类：excited（激动的）、happy（开心的）、cool（酷的）、 favorite（最喜欢的）</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">二、高频句型</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">1. 打招呼与询问近况</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Long time no see.（好久不见。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>How have you been?（最近怎么样？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>How are things going?（近况如何？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>How is everything?（一切还好吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>What's going on?（有什么新情况吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">2. 描述忙碌状态</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I've been [形容词] with something.（我一直因为…… 而忙碌。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I've been doing something lately.（我最近一直在做某事。）          I've been really busy lately with my work.（我最近因为工作很忙。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">3. 表达兴趣爱好</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I have discovered a new hobby —— [爱好].（我发现了一个新爱好 —— …… 。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm really into [事物].（我真的很喜欢/ 对…… 很感兴趣。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm really into science fiction movies because they always have such amazing ideas.（我真的很喜欢科幻电影，因为它们总是有如此奇妙的想法。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">4. 提出建议与邀请</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You should do something.（你应该做某事。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You should watch [电影名].（你应该看看…… 这部电影。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>What do you suggest?（你有什么建议吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I was thinking of going to [地点], do you wanna join me?（我在想要去……，你想和我一起去吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">5. 表达意愿与计划</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'll definitely check it out.（我一定会去看看。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not sure what to do [时间].（我不确定……（时间）要做什么。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">6. 描述好久未做某事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I haven't done something in ages.（我好久没做某事了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I haven't watched a good movie in ages.（我好久没看好电影了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I haven't been to [地点] for a long time.（我好久没去…… 这个地方了。）</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">三、情景对话示例</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A：（激动地）Long time no see! How have you been? 好久不见！你最近怎么样？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B：（开心地）It's so good to see you! I've been really busy lately with my work. There's a big project at the company. What about you? 见到你真好！我最近一直忙着工作。公司有个大项目。你呢？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A：I've been busy painting recently. I've discovered a new hobby - oil painting. It's really interesting.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我一直在忙着画画。最近，我发现了一个新爱好——油画。真的很有趣。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B：Wow, that sounds cool. I've always wanted to try painting, but I never got the chance. What kind of movies do you like? I haven't watched a good movie in ages.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>哇，听起来很酷。我一直想试试画画，但一直没机会。你喜欢什么样的电影？我好久没看一部好电影了。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A：I'm really into science - fiction movies. They always have such amazing ideas. You should watch \"Interstellar\". It's one of my favorites.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我真的很喜欢科幻电影。它们总是有很奇妙的想法。你应该看看《星际穿越》。这是我最喜欢的电影之一。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B：I'll definitely check it out. I'm not sure what to do this weekend. What do you suggest?   我一定会去看的。我不确定这个周末做什么。你有什么建议？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A：Well, the art museum in the city center is having a special exhibition. I was thinking of going. Do you want to join me? 嗯，市中心的美术馆正在举办一个特别展览。我在考虑去看看。你想和我一起吗？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B：That sounds like a great idea! I haven't been to the art museum for a long time.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>听起来是个好主意！我好久没去美术馆了。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h2 class=\"part-h\">7-4 万能宝典-接打电话</h2>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">一、核心词汇</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 工作相关类：project（项目）、schedule（日程安排）、task（任</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>务）、meeting（会议）、office（办公室）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 电话沟通类：voicemail（语音信箱）、call（电话）、arrange（安</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>排）、discuss（讨论）、handle（处理）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 时间安排类：reschedule（重新安排）、leave（离开）、busy（忙</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>碌的）、urgent（紧急的）、soon（很快）</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">二、高频句型</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">1. 电话开头自我介绍</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>This is [你的名字].（我是…… 。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">2. 询问打电话原因</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>What's up?（怎么了？有什么事吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">3. 表达一直想打电话的意愿</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I've been meaning to call you.（我一直想给你打电话。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">4. 提出安排见面提议</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm thinking of arranging an appointment with you.（我在考虑和你约个时间。）        5. 询问对方是否有空 Are you available [时间]?（你…… 时间有空吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">6. 表达自己不确定是否有空及原因</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not sure. I'm quite busy with my current schedule.（我不太确定。我最近的日程安排很满。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>There are a lot of tasks to handle.（有很多任务要处理。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">7. 提出重新安排时间建议</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Maybe we can reschedule.（也许我们可以重新安排时间。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>What about [时间]?（…… 时间怎么样？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">8. 表示某个时间可能可行但有其他安排</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>[时间] might work, but I have a [安排] in the morning.（…… 时间应该可以，但我早上有个…… 安排。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">9. 提出具体见面时间并确认</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>How about [具体时间]?（…… 时间怎么样？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>[具体时间] is fine with me.（…… 时间对我来说没问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">10. 询问见面地点</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Where do you want to meet?（你想在哪里见面？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">11. 提出见面地点建议并说明原因</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>How about [地点]? It's quiet and we can talk comfortably.（…… 地点怎么样？那里很安静，我们可以舒服地聊天。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">12. 询问项目紧急程度</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>By the way, is this project very urgent?（顺便问一下，这个项目很紧急   吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">13. 表示有重要细节需要尽快讨论</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>There are some important details we need to go over as soon as possible.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（有一些重要的细节我们需要尽快讨论。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">14. 保证按时到达并告知可能变动</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'll make sure to be there on time. If anything comes up, I'll let you know.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（我会确保按时到达。如果有什么变故，我会通知你。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">15. 请求留言及说明可能忙碌状态</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>And if I'm not available when you call later, could you leave a voicemail? I might be in the middle of something.（如果你之后打电话我没空，你能留言吗？我可能正忙着呢。）</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">三、情景对话示例</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A:（电话铃响，接听）Hello? 喂？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B: Hi, [A 的名字]! This is B (我是B)。How are you doing? 你最近咋样？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A: Oh, B! I'm good. What's up? 哦，B！我挺好的。怎么啦？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B:  I've been meaning  to  call  you.  I'm  thinking  of  arranging an appointment with you. I want to discuss a new project I'm working on.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Are you available this Wednesday?   我一直想给你打电话呢。我在考虑和你约个时间，我想跟你聊聊我正在做的一个新项目。你这周三有空吗？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A: Hmm, I'm not sure. I'm quite busy with my current schedule. There are a lot of tasks to handle. Maybe we can reschedule. What about next Monday? 嗯，我不太确定。我这几天日程排得挺满的，有好多任务要处理。要不我们重新安排个时间？下周一怎么样？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B: Next Monday I might work. But I have a meeting in the morning. How about 2 p.m.? 下周一应该行。但我上午有个会，下午两点怎么样？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A: 2 p.m. is fine with me. Where do you want to meet? 下午两点我可以。你想在哪儿见面？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B: How about the café near your office?  It's quiet, and we can talk comfortably.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>你办公室附近的那家咖啡馆怎么样？那儿很安静，我们可以舒服地聊聊。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A: Sounds good. By the way, is this project very urgent? 听起来不错。顺便问下，这个项目很紧急吗？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B: Well, kind of. There are some important details we need to go over as soon as possible.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>嗯，有点吧。有些重要细节我们得尽快过一遍。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A: Got it. I'll make sure to be there on time. If anything comes up, I'll let      you know.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>明白了。我会确保按时到。要是有什么变故，我会告诉你。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B: Great. Oh, and if I'm not available when you call later, could you leave a voice - mail? I might be in the middle of something.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>好的。哦，要是你之后给我打电话我不在，你能留个语音信息吗？我可能在忙别的事。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A: No problem. I will. So, see you next Monday at 2 p.m. at the café.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>没问题，我会的。那下周一两点咖啡馆见。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B: See you then.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>到时候见。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h2 class=\"part-h\">7-5 万能宝典-酒店入住</h2>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">一、核心词汇</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 酒店相关类：hotel（酒店）、reception（前台）、room（房间）、</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>reservation（预定）、key（钥匙）、check in（入住）、check out（退房）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 房间类型及设施类：single（单人房）、double（双人房）、deluxe</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（豪华的）、comfortable（舒适的）、air conditioning（空调系统）、 TV（电视）、mini fridge（小冰箱）、free wifi（免费无线网络）、buffet breakfast（自助早餐）、elevator（电梯）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 其他重要词汇：credit card（信用卡）、identification（身份证件）、</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>amenity（设施服务）、request（要求提供）、provide（提供）、deposit （押金）</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">二、高频句型</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">1. 表明有预定</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I have a reservation.（我有预定。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">2. 询问客人姓名</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>May I have your name, please?（可以告诉我您的名字吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 确认预定信息     We have your reservation for a [房间类型] room for [数量] nights. Is</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>that correct?（我们为您预定了一间[房间类型]房，住[数量]晚，对吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">4. 要求提供证件和信用卡</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Could you please provide some identification and a credit card for the deposit?（请提供一些身份证件和信用卡作为押金，好吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">5. 确认信息无误</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Everything seems to be in order.（一切似乎都井然有序。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">6. 询问房间设施</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>What amenities does the room have?（房间有什么设施？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">7. 回答房间设施</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The room is equipped with [设施1]、[设施2]、[设施3]...（房间配备了[设施1]、[设施2]、[设施3]……）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">8. 询问是否包含早餐</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Is there breakfast included?（包含早餐吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">9. 确认早餐信息</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Yes, a buffet breakfast is included in the room rate. It is served from [开始时间] to [结束时间] in the restaurant on the [楼层] floor.（是的，自助早餐包含在房费中。早餐供应时间从[开始时间]到[结束时间]，地点在[楼层]楼的餐厅。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">10. 请求指引房间位置</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Can you show me how to get to my room?（你能告诉我怎么去我的房间吗？）       11. 指引房间位置 The elevators are over there. Take the elevator to the [楼层] floor. When you get out, turn [方向], and your room will be on the [方位] hand side.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（电梯在那边。乘坐电梯到[楼层]楼。当你出来时，向[方向]转，你的房间就在[方位]边。）</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">三、情景对话示例</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Guest: （走进酒店，来到前台）Hi. I have a reservation.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>嗨，我有预订。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Receptionist: Good day, sir/madam. May I have your name, please? 您好，先生/ 女士。请问您贵姓？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Guest: It's [Guest's name].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我是[客人姓名]。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Receptionist: Just a moment, please. Let me check.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>请稍等，我查一下。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（在电脑上查询）Ah, yes, Mr./Ms. [Guest's name]. We have your reservation for a double room for three nights. Is that correct? 啊，是的，[客人姓名] 先生/ 女士。我们查到您预订了一间双人房， 住三晚，对吗？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Guest: Yes, that's right. （对，没错。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Receptionist: Could you please provide some identification and a credit card for the deposit? （您能提供一下身份证明和信用卡用于押金支付   吗？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Guest: Sure. Here's my ID and credit card.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>当然。这是我的身份证和信用卡。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Receptionist: Thank you.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>接过证件和卡，操作）Everything seems to be in order. Here's your room key. You're in room 508.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>谢谢。一切都没问题。这是您的房间钥匙。您在508 房间。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Guest: Thank you. What amenities does the room have? 谢谢。房间里有哪些设施？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Receptionist: The room is equipped with air - conditioning, a TV, a mini - fridge, and free Wi - Fi. If you need anything else, you can always request it at the reception.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>房间配备有空调、电视、小冰箱和免费无线网络。如果您还需要其他任何东西，可以随时向前台提出要求。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Guest: Sounds good. Is there breakfast included? 听起来不错。含早餐吗？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Receptionist: Yes, a buffet breakfast is included in the room rate. It's served from 7:00 a.m. to 10:00 a.m. in the restaurant on the first floor.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>是的，房价包含自助早餐。早餐时间是早上7 点到10 点，在一楼餐厅供应。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Guest: Great. Can you show me how to get to my room? 很好。你能告诉我怎么去我的房间吗？        Receptionist: Of course. The elevators are over there. Take the elevator to the fifth floor. When you get out, turn right, and your room will be on the left-hand side.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>当然可以。电梯在那边。乘坐电梯到五楼。出电梯后右转，您的房间就在左手边。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Guest: Thank you very much.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>非常感谢。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Receptionist: You're welcome. I hope you enjoy your stay with us.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>不客气。希望您在我们酒店住得愉快。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h2 class=\"part-h\">7-6 万能宝典-超市购物</h2>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">一、核心词汇</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 食品杂货类：groceries（食品杂货）、low fat milk（低脂牛奶）、</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>whole wheat bread（全麦面包）、laundry pods（洗衣凝珠）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 超市场所类：aisle（过道）、household essentials（家庭必需品）、</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>clothing section（服装区）、upper floor（楼上）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 购物相关类：locate（找到）、suggest（建议）、remove（去除）、</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>ring up（为……要价）、process（处理）、freshly baked（新鲜烘焙的）、organic（有机的）、tough（顽固的）、high quality（高质量的）、 inventory（库存）、discount（折扣）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 其他物品类：denim（牛仔布）、straight leg casual jeans（直筒休</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>闲牛仔裤）</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">二、高频句型</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">1. 询问商品位置</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm searching for some basic groceries like [商品1], [商品2]... Where can I locate them?（我在找一些基本的食品杂货，像[商品1]、[商品 2]……它们在哪儿呢？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 告知商品位置      The [商品] are in the [区域名称] on the left side.（[商品]在左侧的[区域</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>名称]。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">3. 询问服装区位置</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Is there a clothing section in this supermarket?（这家超市有服装区吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">4. 告知服装区位置及商品选择</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Yes, the clothing section is on the upper floor. You can take the elevator over there. They offer a good selection of [服装类型] in different styles.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（有，服装区在楼上。你可以坐那边的电梯。他们有不同款式的[服装类型]可供选择。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">5. 表达商品看起来不错并购买</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>This [商品] seems freshly baked. I'll take [数量].（这个[商品]看起来是新鲜烘焙出来的。我打算买[数量]。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">6. 请求帮助寻找商品</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I can't find the [商品]. Could you help me?（我找不到[商品]了。你能帮我吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">7. 推荐商品品牌</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>This brand is highly recommended. It works great on [用途] and has a pleasant fragrance. Plus, it's on special offer now.（这个品牌非常值得推荐。它在[用途]方面效果很好，而且香味宜人。此外，它现在正在搞特价呢。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">8. 表达购买意愿并感谢建议</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Okay, I'll take it. Thanks for the advice.（好的，我买了。谢谢你的建议。）        9. 询问是否有货 Do you have any [商品] in stock?（你们有[商品]的货吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">10. 告知商品材质及舒适度</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>They are made of high quality [材质]. They feel quite comfortable.（它们是由高质量的[材质]制成的。摸起来很舒服。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">11. 询问价格及付款方式</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>How much are they?（它们多少钱？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Your total comes to [金额] after the discount. How would you like to pay? （折后总计[金额]。你想要怎么付款？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'll pay with my credit card.（我打算用信用卡支付。）</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">三、情景对话示例</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Customer: Excuse me. I'm searching for some basic groceries like low-fat milk, whole wheat bread, and also need a pack of laundry pods. Where can I locate them? 打扰一下。我在找一些基本的食品杂货，比如低脂牛奶、全麦面包， 还需要一包洗衣凝珠。我在哪里可以找到它们呢？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Shop Assistant: The low-fat milk and whole wheat bread are in the grocery section on the left side. As for the laundry pods, they are in the household essentials aisle, close to the dishwashing liquid area.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>低脂牛奶和全麦面包在左边的食品杂货区。至于洗衣凝珠，它们在家庭必需品过道，靠近洗碗液区域。       Customer: Thanks a lot. Oh, I also plan to buy a pair of casual jeans. Is there a clothing section in this supermarket? 非常感谢。哦，我还打算买一条休闲牛仔裤。这家超市有服装区吗？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Shop Assistant: Yes, indeed. The clothing section is on the upper floor.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You can take the elevator over there. They offer a good selection of jeans in different styles.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>是的，确实有。服装区在楼上。你可以乘坐那边的电梯上去。他们有很多不同款式的牛仔裤可供选择。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（顾客先前往食品杂货区和家庭必需品区）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Customer: This whole wheat bread seems freshly baked.  I'll take two loaves. And I can't find the organic low-fat milk. Could you help me? 这个全麦面包看起来是新鲜烘焙的。我要两条。而且我找不到有机低脂牛奶。你能帮我一下吗？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Shop Assistant: Sure. It's right beside the regular low-fat milk. Here it is.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>当然。它就在普通低脂牛奶的旁边。在这儿呢。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Customer: Got it. Now, I need a large pack of laundry pods. Which brand would you suggest for removing tough stains? 明白了。现在，我需要一大包洗衣凝珠。你建议用哪个品牌来去除顽固污渍呢？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Shop Assistant: This brand is highly recommended.  It works great on stains and has a pleasant fragrance. Plus, it's on special offer now.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>这个品牌非常值得推荐。它对污渍的清洁效果很好，而且香味宜人。   另外，它现在正在特价促销。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Customer: Okay, I'll take it. Thanks for the advice. I'm off to the clothing section now.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>好的，我要这个。谢谢你的建议。我现在去服装区了。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（顾客来到服装区）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Customer: Hi. I'm looking for a pair of straight-leg casual jeans in size 30.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Do you have any in stock? 嗨。我在找一条30 码的直筒休闲牛仔裤。你们有货吗？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Shop Assistant: Let me check our inventory. Yes, we do have a few pairs available. Here you are. They are made of high-quality denim.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>让我查一下库存。是的，我们确实有几条。给你。它们是由优质牛仔布制成的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Customer: They feel quite comfortable. How much are they? 它们摸起来很舒服。多少钱呢？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Shop Assistant: They are $35 per pair. And if you buy it today, you can get a 10% discount.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>每条35 美元。而且如果你今天购买，可以享受九折优惠。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Customer: That's a good deal. I'll take them.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>这很划算。我要了。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（顾客来到收银台）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Cashier: Your total comes to $62.50 after the discount. How would you like to pay?    打完折后，你的总计是62.50 美元。你想怎么付款呢？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Customer: I'll pay with my credit card. Here you go.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我用信用卡付款。给你。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Cashier: Thank you.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>谢谢</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h2 class=\"part-h\">7-7 万能宝典-医院看病</h2>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">一、核心词汇</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 疾病症状类：headache（头疼）、throat（喉咙）、fever（发烧）、</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>infection（感染）、symptom（症状）、inflamed（发炎的、上火的）、 viral（病毒性的）、spicy（辛辣的）、oily（油腻的）、sweet（甜的）、 light（清淡的）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 医生诊断及治疗建议类：patient（病人）、doctor（医生）、medicine</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（药）、diet（饮食）、prescribe（开处方）、reduce（减少）、soothe （舒缓）、avoid（避免）、recover（康复）、immediately（立即）、 diagnose（诊断）、prescription（处方）、thermometer（体温计）、 Celsius（摄氏度）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 其他相关词汇：weather（天气）、bit（有点儿）、scared（害怕</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>的）、serious（严重的）、symptom（症状）、advice（建议）</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">二、高频句型</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">1. 表达身体不适</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm really not feeling well.（我感觉很不舒服。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm under the weather.（我感觉不舒服。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 描述病症         I've had a headache for days.（我头疼好几天了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>My throat is so sore that it hurts when I talk.（我喉咙很疼，说话的时候都会疼。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I also feel feverish.（我感觉有点发烧。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">3. 医生检查与诊断</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Don't worry, let me check.（别担心，我来检查一下。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Open your mouth and say \"Ah\".（张开嘴，说\"啊\"。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Your throat is quite inflamed.（你的喉咙相当上火。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Let me take your temperature.（我来量一下你的体温。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You have a fever of [温度] degrees Celsius.（你有[温度]摄氏度的发烧。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">4. 询问病情严重程度</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Is it serious?（严重吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">5. 表达害怕</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm a bit scared.（我有点害怕。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">6. 医生给出诊断结果与治疗建议</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's likely a viral infection.（这可能是一种病毒感染。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'll prescribe some medicine.（我会给你开一些药。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>This is for reducing the fever, and these are for soothing your throat.（这是退烧药，这些是缓解喉咙疼痛的药。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Take the fever medicine every four to six hours if needed, and the throat medicine three times a day after meals.（退烧药根据需要每四到六小时吃一次，喉咙药饭后每天吃三次。）        7. 询问饮食注意事项 Do I need to pay attention to my diet?（我需要注意饮食吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">8. 医生给出饮食建议</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Avoid spicy, oily and sweet foods.（避免吃辛辣、油腻和甜食。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Drink more warm water and have light food like porridge.（多喝温水， 吃些清淡的食物，比如粥。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Also, get plenty of rest.（同时，要保证充足的休息。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">9. 询问康复时间</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>How long will it take to get better?（需要多久才能好转？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">10. 医生告知大概康复时间及复查条件</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Usually you will start feeling better in three days or so.（通常情况下，大概三天左右你就会开始好转。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>But   if  your symptoms  don't improve  or  get  worse, come  back immediately.（但如果症状没有改善或者加重了，立即回来复诊。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">11. 表达感谢与遵循建议</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Thank you, doctor. I'll follow your advice.（谢谢你，医生。我会按照你的建议去做。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">12. 医生表达祝福</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You're welcome. Take care and get well soon.（不客气。保重，早日康复。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>三、情景对话示例        Patient (P): Good morning, doctor. I'm really not feeling well. I've had a headache for days, and my throat is so sore that it hurts when I talk. I also feel feverish.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>病人：早上好，医生。我真的很不舒服。我头疼好几天了，喉咙疼得厉害，说话都疼。我还感觉有点发烧。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Doctor (D): Good morning. Don't worry. Let me check. Open your mouth and say \"Ah\". (Checks the patient's throat) Your throat is quite inflamed.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Now, let me take your temperature. (Uses a thermometer) You have a fever of 38.3 degrees Celsius.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>医生：早上好。别担心。我检查一下。张开嘴说“啊”。（检查病人的喉咙）你的喉咙炎症很严重。现在，我量一下你的体温。（用体温计）你发烧了，38.3 摄氏度。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>P: Doctor, is it serious? I'm a bit scared.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>病人：医生，这严重吗？我有点害怕。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>D: It's likely a viral infection.  I'll prescribe some medicine. This is for reducing the fever, and these are for soothing your throat. Take the fever medicine every four to six hours  if needed, and the throat medicine three times a day after meals.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>医生：很可能是病毒感染。我给你开点药。这个是退烧药，如果需要的话每四到六小时吃一次，这些是舒缓喉咙的药，一天三次，饭后服用。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>P: Okay. Do I need to pay attention to my diet?   病人：好的。我需要注意饮食吗？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>D: Yes. Avoid spicy, oily, and sweet foods. Drink more warm water and have light food like porridge. Also, get plenty of rest. That will help you recover faster.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>医生：是的。避免吃辛辣、油腻和甜食。多喝温水，吃些清淡的食物， 比如粥。另外，保证充足的休息。这会帮助你更快康复。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>P: I see. How long will it take to get better? 病人：我明白了。多久能好呢？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>D: Usually, you'll start feeling better in three days or so. But  if your symptoms don't improve or get worse, come back immediately.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>医生：通常情况下，大概三天左右你就会开始好转。但如果症状没有改善或者加重，马上回来。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>P: Thank you, doctor. I'll follow your advice.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>病人：谢谢你，医生。我会照您说的做。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>D: You're welcome. Take care and get well soon.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>医生：不客气。照顾好自己，早日康复。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h2 class=\"part-h\">7-8 万能宝典-谈论天气</h2>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">一、核心词汇</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 天气状况类：weather（天气）、sunny（阳光明媚的）、cloudy</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（多云的）、windy（有风的）、cold（寒冷的）、cool（凉爽的）、 comfortable（舒适的）、warm（温暖的）、drizzle（细雨霏霏）、downpour （倾盆大雨）、overcast（阴天的）、foggy（有雾的）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 相关事物及描述类：temperature（温度）、forecast（预报）、</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>museum（博物馆）、season（季节）、autumn（秋天）、spring（春天）、charm（魅力）、prefer（更喜欢）、thick（厚的）</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">二、高频句型</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">1. 表达对好天气的赞美</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>What a beautiful day, isn't it?（今天天气真好，不是吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">2. 附和并描述阳光感受</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Yeah, it's really sunny. The sunshine makes me feel so good.（是啊，阳光明媚。阳光让我感觉真好。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">3. 表达温度适宜</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Exactly, the temperature is just right, not too hot and not too cold.（没错， 温度刚刚好，不热也不冷。）        4. 询问天气预报 Do you know what the weather forecast says for the next few days?（你知道接下来几天的天气预报怎么说吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">5. 预报多云及下午可能下雨</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I heard it's going to be cloudy tomorrow, and there might be a bit of rain in the afternoon.（我听说明天会多云，下午可能还会下点雨。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">6. 表达因天气改变计划</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>That's too bad. I was planning to go for a picnic.（真糟糕。我本来打算去野餐。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">7. 建议改变计划去博物馆</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Well, you could change your plan and go to the museum instead. It's a good place to go on a rainy day.（你可以改变计划，去博物馆instead。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>雨天去那儿不错。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">8. 认同建议并确定时间</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>That's a good idea. How about the day after tomorrow?（好主意。后天怎么样？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">9. 预报将有风且温度下降</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The forecast says it will be windy with the temperature dropping a bit.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（预报说会有风，气温还会降一点。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">10. 表达听起来冷及需穿厚外套</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It sounds cold. I'll need to wear a thicker coat.（听起来很冷。我得穿件厚外套。）       11. 强调做好准备及询问最喜欢季节 Yeah, it's better to be prepared. Which season do you like the most?（是呀，最好做好准备。你最喜欢哪个季节？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">12. 表达对秋天的喜爱及原因</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I really like autumn. The weather is usually cool and comfortable, and the leaves change into beautiful colors.（我真的很喜欢秋天。天气通常凉爽舒适，树叶还会变成美丽的颜色。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">13. 表达更喜欢春天及原因</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Autumn is nice, but I prefer spring. It's warm and everything comes back to life.（秋天不错，但我更喜欢春天。春天暖和，万物复苏。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">14. 总结每个季节都有独特魅力</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>True, each season has its own charm.（确实，每个季节都有自己的魅力。）</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">三、情景对话示例</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A: （两人在路上相遇）Hey! What a beautiful day, isn't it? 嘿！今天天气真好，不是吗？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B: Yeah, it's really sunny. The sunshine makes me feel so good.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>是啊，阳光明媚。这阳光让我感觉特别好。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A: Exactly. The temperature is just right, not too hot and not too cold.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>没错。温度刚刚好，既不太热也不太冷。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B: Do you know what the weather forecast says for the next few days? 你知道接下来几天的天气预报怎么说吗？       A: I heard it's going to be cloudy tomorrow, and there might be a bit of rain in the afternoon.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我听说明天会是多云天气，下午可能会下点雨。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B: Oh, that's too bad. I was planning to go for a picnic.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>哦，那太糟糕了。我本来打算去野餐呢。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A: Well, you could change your plan and go to the museum instead. It's a good place to go on a rainy day. 嗯，你可以改变计划，去博物馆。下雨天去那儿不错。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B: That's a good idea. How about the day after tomorrow? 这主意不错。后天天气怎么样？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A: The forecast says it will be windy, with the temperature dropping a bit.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>预报说会有风，气温会稍微下降一点。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B: sounds cold. I'll need to wear a thicker coat.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>听起来挺冷的。我得穿件厚点的外套。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A: Yeah, it's better to be prepared. Which season do you like the most? 是啊，最好做好准备。你最喜欢哪个季节？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B: I really like autumn. The weather is usually cool and comfortable, and the leaves change into beautiful colors.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我很喜欢秋天。天气通常凉爽舒适，树叶也会变成漂亮的颜色。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A: Autumn is nice. But I prefer spring. It's warm, and everything comes back to life.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>秋天确实不错。但我更喜欢春天。天气暖和，万物复苏。        B: True. Each season has its own charm.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>没错。每个季节都有它独特的魅力。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h2 class=\"part-h\">7-9 万能宝典-机场问路</h2>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">一、核心词汇</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 机场设施与流程类：check in counter（值机柜台）、sign（标志）、</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>boarding pass（登机牌）、security check（安检）、tray（托盘）、checkpoint （检查点）、boarding gate（登机口）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 物品及相关要求类：liquid（液体）、laptop（笔记本电脑）、ID</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（身份证件）、flight ticket（机票）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 人员及其他相关词汇：staff（工作人员）、flight（航班）</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">二、高频句型</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">1. 请求帮助</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Excuse me, can you help me?（打扰一下，你能帮我吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Could you please give me a hand?（你能帮我一把吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Could you do me a favor?（你能帮我个忙吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">2. 表达需求</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I want to fly to China.（我想坐飞机回中国。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm flying to China.（我要飞往中国。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I don't know what to do first.（我不知道首先该做什么。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 提供指引      You need to go to the check in counter.（你需要去值机柜台。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>See the signs that say check in and follow them.（看到写着“值机”的标志牌并跟着走。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You will need your ID and flight ticket to get your boarding pass.（你需要用身份证和机票获取登机牌。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">4. 询问后续步骤</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>After getting the boarding pass, what's next?（拿到登机牌之后，接下来该做什么？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">5. 安检流程指引</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You have to go through the security check.（你得通过安检。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Just follow the signs that say security.（跟着写着“安检”的标志牌走。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You have to take out your liquids, laptop and put them in the trays.（你必须把液体、笔记本电脑拿出来，放在托盘里。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Show your boarding pass and ID at the checkpoint.（在检查点出示登机牌和身份证。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">6. 询问登机口位置</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>How can I find my boarding gate?（我怎么找到我的登机口？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">7. 指引登机口位置</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>After the security check, look for the signs with gate numbers.（过了安检， 寻找带有登机口号码的标志牌。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Yours is gate eight.（你的登机口是8 号。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Follow the signs for gates one to ten.（跟着1-10 号登机口的标志牌走。）           If you are not sure, you can always ask the airport staff.（如果你不确定， 随时可以问机场工作人员。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">8. 表达感谢</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Thank you very much.（非常感谢。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You have been really helpful.（你帮了我大忙了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I was so worried just now.（我刚才可担心了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">9. 回应感谢并给予建议</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You are welcome. Have a nice flight.（不客气，祝你旅途愉快。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You should go now in case you're late.（你该走了，以防迟到。）</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">三、情景对话示例</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（在机场大厅，A 一脸困惑，走向站着的B）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A: Excuse me. I'm flying to China. I don't know what to do first. Can you help me? 打扰一下。我要坐飞机去厦门，我不知道首先该做什么。你能帮帮我吗？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（B 友好地微笑着）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B: Sure! First, you need to go to the check-in counter. See those signs that say \"Check-in\"? Follow them. You'll need your ID and flight ticket to get your boarding pass.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>当然可以！首先，你需要去值机柜台。看到那些写着“值机”的指示牌了吗？跟着它们走。你需要用身份证和机票来换取登机牌。    （A 有点紧张地问）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A: After getting the boarding pass, what's next? 拿到登机牌之后，接下来做什么呢？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（B 耐心地解释）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B: Then you have to go through the security check. Just follow the signs that say \"Security\". You'll have to take out your liquids, laptop, and put them  in the  trays. And show your boarding pass and ID  at the checkpoint.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>然后你得通过安检。跟着写有“安检”的指示牌走就行。你得把液体、 笔记本电脑拿出来放在托盘里。在安检处出示你的登机牌和身份证。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（A 又问）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A: I see. And how can I find my boarding gate? My gate number is 8.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我明白了。那我怎么找到我的登机口呢？我的登机口是8 号。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（B 指了指方向）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B: After the security check, look for the signs with gate numbers. Yours is Gate 8, so follow the signs for gates 1-10. If you're not sure, you can always ask the airport staff.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>过了安检后，找标有登机口号码的指示牌。你的是8 号登机口，所以跟着1 到10 号登机口的指示牌走。要是你不确定，随时可以问机场工作人员。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（A 感激地说）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A: Thank you so much. You've been really helpful. I was so worried.   非常感谢你。你帮了我大忙了。我刚才可担心了。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（B 摆摆手）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B: You're welcome. Have a nice flight. You should go now, in case you're late.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>不客气。祝你旅途愉快。你现在该走了，以防迟到。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（A 拖着行李箱，向B 挥手）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A: Okay, I will. Thanks again! 好的，我会的。再次感谢！</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h2 class=\"part-h\">7-10 万能宝典-餐厅用餐</h2>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">一、核心词汇</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 餐厅相关类：ketchup（番茄酱）、allergy（过敏）、request（要</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>求）、menu（菜单）、bill（账单）、order（点餐）、serve（上菜）、 extra（额外的）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 食物饮品类：grilled chicken（烤鸡）、tomato soup（番茄汤）、</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>braised pork in soy sauce（红烧肉）、coke（可口可乐）、rice（米饭）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3.。其他词汇类：table（桌子）、change（找零）、spicy（辛辣的）</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">二、高频句型</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">1. 迎接客人</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Good evening, welcome. Table for one or more?（晚上好，欢迎光临。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>请问是一位还是多位用餐？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">2. 回答用餐人数</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Table for two, please.（两位用餐。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">3. 提供菜单并询问需求</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Here is the menu. Are there any food allergies or special requests?（这是菜单。请问有食物过敏或者特殊要求吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 表示先看一下菜单       No, thanks. We'll take a look at the menu first.（不用了，谢谢。我们先</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>看一下菜单。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">5. 稍后点餐</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>All right, I'll be back in a few minutes to take your order.（好的，我几分钟后回来为您点餐。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">6. 准备点餐</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Are you ready to order now?（现在准备好点餐了吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">7. 点餐</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Yes, I'd like the grilled chicken and a bowl of tomato soup. My friend wants the braised pork in soy sauce and a coke for each of us.（是的，我要一份烤鸡和一碗番茄汤。我的朋友想要红烧肉和可口可乐，我们每人一杯。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">8. 确认是否需要更多东西</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Got it. Anything else?（好的。还需要别的吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">9. 表示目前就这些</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>No, that's all for now.（不，目前就这些。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">10. 上菜通知</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Your order will be served soon.（您点的菜马上就会端上来。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">11. 请求额外物品</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Excuse me, could we have some extra ketchup?（打扰一下，能给我们一些额外的番茄酱吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>12. 回应请求        Sure, here you are.（当然可以，给您。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">13. 请求账单</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The bill, please.（账单，请。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">14. 告知总金额并询问付款方式</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Here's your bill. It totals forty dollars. How would you like to pay?（这是您的账单。总计40 美元。您想怎么付款？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">15. 现金付款</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'll pay in cash.（我用现金支付。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">16. 找零与告别</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Thank you. Here's your change. Have a nice day.（谢谢您。这是您的找零。祝您度过愉快的一天。）Thanks, you too.（谢谢，您也是。）</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">三、情景对话示例</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（顾客A 走进餐厅，服务员B 迎接）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B: Good evening. Welcome! Table for one or more? 晚上好，欢迎光临！一位还是多位用餐呢？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A: Table for two, please.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>两位用餐，谢谢。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B: Sure. This way, please. Here's the menu. Are there any food allergies or special requests? 好的，这边请。这是菜单。请问有食物过敏或者特殊要求吗？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A: No, thanks. We'll take a look at the menu first.   没有，谢谢。我们先看一下菜单。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B: Alright. I'll be back in a few minutes to take your order.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>好的。我几分钟后再来为你们点餐。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（几分钟后）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B: Are you ready to order now? 你们现在准备好点餐了吗？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A: Yes. I'd like the grilled chicken and a bowl of tomato soup.My friend wants the braised pork in soy sauce, and a Coke for each of us.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>是的。我要一份烤鸡和一碗番茄汤。我的朋友要一份炸鱼薯条，我们俩各要一杯可乐。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B: Got it. Anything else? 了解了。还要别的吗？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A: No, that's all for now.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>不用了，目前就这些。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B: Your order will be served soon.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>你们点的餐很快就会上。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（用餐时）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A: Excuse me, could we have some extra ketchup? 打扰一下，能再给我们一些番茄酱吗？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B: Sure. Here you are.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>当然可以。给你们。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（用餐结束）       A: The bill, please.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>请结账。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B: Here's your bill. It totals $40. How would you like to pay? 这是您的账单。总共40 美元。您想怎么付款呢？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A: I'll pay in cash. Here you go.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我用现金付。给你。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B: Thank you. Here's your change. Have a nice day! 谢谢。这是找零。祝您度过愉快的一天！</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A: Thanks. You too.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>谢谢。你也是。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h2 class=\"part-h\">7.11 面无不胜-求职篇</h2>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">一、开场与自我介绍</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>开场问候与表达荣幸</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Good morning/afternoon, it's a great honor to be here for this interview.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Let me briefly introduce myself.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>上午好/下午好，很荣幸能来参加这次面试。让我简单介绍一下自己。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>基本信息介绍</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>My name is [Your Name]. I'm really excited about the opportunity to apply for the [Position Name] at your company.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我叫[你的名字]。我非常期待能有机会应聘贵公司的[职位名称]。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">二、教育背景介绍</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>学校与学位</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I graduated from [University Name] with a [Degree Name].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我从[大学名称]毕业，获得了[学位名称]。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>不同学位的英文表达</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>解释不同学位的英文表达，如Bachelor of Arts (B.A.)、Bachelor of Science (B.S.) 等。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>解释不同学位的英文表达，例如文学学士（B.A.）、理学学士（B.S.）   等。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>专业与课程</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>In my [Major], during my academic years, I developed a solid foundation in [Related Subjects], which I believe are highly relevant to this [Position Name].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>在我的[专业]学习期间，我扎实掌握了[相关科目]的知识，我认为这些知识与[职位名称]紧密相关。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>课程示例</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>For example, courses  like [Course Names] equipped me with the necessary knowledge and skills.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>例如，[课程名称]等课程使我具备了必要的知识和技能。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">三、工作项目经验分享</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>工作年限与领域</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I have [X] years of experience in the [Industry/Field].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我在[行业/领域]拥有[X]年的工作经验。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>当前工作情况</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Currently, I work at [Company Name] as a [Position Name].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>目前，我在[公司名称]担任[职位名称]。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>以往工作情况</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Previously, I worked at [Company Name] as a [Position Name].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>之前，我在[公司名称]担任[职位名称]。   工作职责与成就 In this role,  I was responsible for [Job Responsibilities]. One of my significant achievements was [Achievement], which not only [Impact] but also enhanced my [Skills].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>在这个职位上，我负责[工作职责]。我的一项重要成就是[成就]，这不仅[影响]，还提升了我的[技能]。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">四、个人优势与动机阐述</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>个人优势</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I believe my key strengths include [Strengths].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我认为我的主要优势包括[优势]。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>职位兴趣与公司吸引点</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm particularly drawn to this position because of [Reasons].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我之所以对这个职位特别感兴趣是因为[原因]。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>贡献与信心</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm confident that my  skills and enthusiasm can contribute to the continued success of your team.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我相信我的技能和热情能够为贵团队的持续成功做出贡献。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">五、结尾与感谢</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Thank you for giving me this chance to introduce myself. I'm looking forward to answering any further questions you may have.   感谢您给我这个机会介绍自己。我期待着回答您可能提出的任何进一步问题。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">六、常见面试问题及回答思路</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（一）你为什么对这个职位感兴趣？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>行业契合与职业目标</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I've been closely following the development of the [Industry] and I'm truly impressed by the innovative approaches your company has been taking. The [Position] role here aligns perfectly with my long-term career goals in this field.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我一直在密切关注[行业]的发展，贵公司采取的创新方法给我留下了深刻印象。这里的[职位]与我在这一领域的长期职业目标完美契合。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>公司吸引点</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Your company has a great reputation for its top-notch products and good teamwork. I'm really eager to work for a firm that values innovation and customer focus.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>贵公司以其一流的产品和良好的团队合作而享有盛誉。我非常希望能为重视创新和客户关注的公司工作。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>个人技能与职位匹配</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>From the job description, I believe my skills in [Skills] and my experience in [Experience] make me suitable for this position. I'm confident I can use them to contribute to relevant tasks and bring value to the company.   从职位描述来看，我认为我在[技能]方面的技能和在[经验]方面的经验使我适合这个职位。我相信我能够利用它们为相关任务做出贡献， 并为公司带来价值。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（二）你的优点和缺点分别是什么？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>优点示例</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. Strong communication skills ：I possess strong communication skills</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>which help me convey complex ideas clearly to both team members and clients.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我具备较强的沟通能力，能够清晰地向团队成员和客户传达复杂的想法。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. Highly organized : I'm highly organized and can manage multiple tasks</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>and deadlines effectively.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我条理性强，能够有效地管理多项任务和截止日期。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. Quick learner  : I'm a quick learner and can master new skills and</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>knowledge in a short time.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我学习能力强，能在短时间内掌握新技能和知识。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. Good problem-solving ability ：My strong problem-solving ability</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>allows me to find effective solutions when facing difficulties.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我有良好的解决问题的能力，遇到困难时能够找到有效的解决方案。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. Team player ：I am a team player and can collaborate well with</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>colleagues from different backgrounds.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我具有团队合作精神，能够与不同背景的同事很好地合作。        6. Detail-oriented ：Being detail-oriented, I can ensure the accuracy of my work and avoid small mistakes.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我注重细节，能够保证工作的准确性，避免小错误。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>缺点示例</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. Lack of experience in certain areas : I lack experience in [Specific Area],</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>but I'm eager to learn and improve.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我在[特定领域]缺乏经验，但我渴望学习和提高。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. Tend to be perfectionist : I tend to be a perfectionist, which sometimes</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>causes me to spend too much time on details.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我有完美主义倾向，这有时会导致我在细节上花费太多时间。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. Slow at making decisions ：I'm aware that I'm slow at making</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>decisions, especially when facing complex situations, but I'm working on improving my decision-making ability.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我意识到我在做决定时比较慢，尤其是在面对复杂情况时，但我正在努力提高我的决策能力。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. Poor at public speaking : I'm poor at public speaking and my voice</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>sometimes shakes when I'm in front of a large audience. However, I'm taking courses to improve my speaking skills.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我不擅长公开演讲，当我在大型观众面前时，我的声音有时会颤抖。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>然而，我正在参加课程来提高我的演讲技巧。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（三）你能举例说明一次你解决问题的经历吗？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>使用STAR 法则        1. 情境（Situation）：Describe the context or background of the problem or challenge you faced.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>描述你所面临的问题或挑战的背景或情境。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 任务（Task）：Explain your task or objective in that situation.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>解释你在那种情况下的任务或目标。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 行动（Action）：Detail the specific actions you took to address the</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>problem.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>详细说明你为解决问题所采取的具体行动。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 结果（Result）：Summarize the positive outcome of your actions.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>总结你的行动所带来的积极结果。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（四）你为什么要离开上一份工作？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>积极原因</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm looking for new challenges and opportunities for growth.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我在寻找新的挑战和成长机会。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>客观原因</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The company underwent a restructuring which affected my position.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>公司进行了重组，影响了我的职位。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（五）你对我们公司有什么了解？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>公司背景与成就</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I've done quite a bit of research on your company. I know that [Company Name] was founded in [Year] and has since become a leading player in the [Industry]. Your company is renowned for its [Products/Services].   我对贵公司做了一些研究。我知道[公司名称]成立于[年份]，自那以后已成为[行业]的领先者。贵公司因其[产品/服务]而闻名。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>公司价值观与前景</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Moreover, I'm deeply attracted to your company's value of [Values].  I believe these values are not only the keys to your company's success but also resonate with my own professional principles. I'm excited about the company's future prospects, especially in light of [Future Plans/Trends].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>此外，我非常认同贵公司的[价值观]。我相信这些价值观不仅是贵公司成功的关键，也与我自己的职业原则相契合。我对公司的未来前景感到兴奋，特别是考虑到[未来计划/趋势]。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h2 class=\"part-h\">7.12 面无不胜-考研篇</h2>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">一、自我介绍</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>开场</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>问候与表达荣幸：Good morning/afternoon, dear professors. I'm truly honored to be here for this interview. 上午好/ 下午好，亲爱的教授们。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我非常荣幸能来参加这次面试。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>基本信息介绍：My name is [Your Name], and I come from [Place]. 我叫[你的名字]，我来自[地方]。可适当补充家乡特色，如It's a beautiful city famous for its [特色]，which has always been a source of pride for me. 这是一个以[特色]而闻名的美丽城市，一直是我引以为傲的地方。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>教育背景</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I graduated from [University Name] majoring in [Major]. During my undergraduate years,  I dedicated myself to building a solid academic foundation. I excelled in courses such as [Course Names], which not only deepened my understanding of the subject but also equipped me with essential theoretical knowledge. 我毕业于[大学名称]，主修[专业]。在本科期间，我致力于打下坚实的学术基础。我在[课程名称]等课程中表现出色，这些课程不仅加深了我对该学科的理解，还使我具备了必</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>要的理论知识。   实践活动</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>参与经历  ：I've also actively participated in various academic and practical activities. For instance, I took part in [Project Name]. Through this experience, I enhanced my problem-solving skills and developed a strong sense of innovation. 我还积极参加了各种学术和实践活动。例如，我参加了[项目名称]。通过这次经历，我提高了解决问题的能力， 培养了强烈的创新能力。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>实习、志愿工作等：Additionally, I was involved in [实习或志愿工作等].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>This broadened my horizons and enhanced my overall capabilities. 此外， 我还参与了[实习或志愿工作等]。这拓宽了我的视野，提升了我的综合能力。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>学术热情</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>My enthusiasm for [Major] has been growing steadily. I'm particularly interested in [研究方向] and have been constantly exploring relevant literature and research findings. I believe that further study in this field will enable me to delve deeper into my areas of interest and contribute to academic research. 我对[专业]的热情一直在稳步增长。我对[研究方向]特别感兴趣，并一直在不断探索相关文献和研究成果。我相信在这一领域进一步学习将使我能够深入钻研我的兴趣领域，并为学术研究做出贡献。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>结尾</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>表明感谢与渴望：I'm really looking forward to the opportunity to study        at your esteemed university. I'm confident that with my efforts and the guidance of professors here,  I can make significant progress in my academic pursuits. Thank you. 我非常期待能有机会在贵校学习。我相信，在我的努力和这里教授们的指导下，我能在学术追求上取得显著进步。谢谢。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">二、为什么选择我们学校/ 专业</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>总述：There are several reasons why I'm eager to study [Major] at your university. 我渴望在贵校学习[专业]的原因有几点。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>学校声誉与资源  ：First and foremost, your university enjoys an outstanding reputation in the academic world, especially in [专业领域].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The  high-quality  teaching  resources,  experienced  professors,  and excellent research facilities here are highly appealing to me.  I believe they will provide me with an ideal environment for in-depth study and research. 首先，贵校在学术界享有卓越的声誉，特别是在[专业领域]。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>这里高质量的教学资源、经验丰富的教授和优秀的研究设施对我极具吸引力。我相信，它们将为我深入学习和研究提供理想环境。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>课程设计：Secondly, the curriculum of [专业] in your university is well-designed. It not only covers fundamental theories but also keeps up with the latest industry trends. Courses like [Course Names] are exactly what I'm interested in, and I'm convinced that they will help me develop a comprehensive understanding of the field. 其次，贵校[专业]的课程设   计非常合理。它不仅涵盖基础理论，还紧跟行业最新趋势。像[课程名称]这样的课程正是我感兴趣的，我相信它们将帮助我全面了解该领域。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>研究成果与导师：Moreover, I'm deeply attracted by the research achievements of your university. The research projects in [研究领域] are closely aligned with my research interests. I'm eager to participate in such cutting-edge research under the guidance of renowned professors.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>此外，贵校的研究成果深深吸引了我。[研究领域]中的研究项目与我的研究兴趣高度一致。我渴望在知名教授的指导下参与这样的前沿研究。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>地理位置：Finally, the location of your university also plays a role. [城市名称]  is a  vibrant metropolis with abundant internship and job opportunities.  It also hosts numerous international conferences and academic exchange activities related to my major, which can enrich my learning experience and broaden my horizons. 最后，贵校的地理位置也是一个重要因素。[城市名称]是一个充满活力的大都市，拥有丰富的实习和就业机会。这里还举办了许多与我的专业相关的国际会议和学术交流活动，可以丰富我的学习经历，拓宽我的视野。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>总结：All these factors combined make your university and this major my top choice. 综合以上所有因素，贵校及该专业成为了我的首选。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>三、介绍一个做过的项目或研究    背景介绍：During my undergraduate study, I was involved in [Project Name]. The main objective of this project was to [项目目标]. 在本科期间，我参与了[项目名称]。这个项目的主要目标是[项目目标]。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>任务与职责：I was responsible for [你的职责]. To achieve the goal, I first conducted in-depth literature reviews to understand the current research status. 我负责[你的职责]。为了实现目标，我首先进行了深入的文献综述，以了解当前的研究现状。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>方法与行动：Then I designed and carried out [方法或实验步骤].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>During the process, we encountered some challenges, such as [遇到的困难]. To overcome this, I [解决办法]. 然后我设计并进行了[方法或实验步骤]。在过程中，我们遇到了一些挑战，比如[遇到的困难]。为了克服这一点，我[解决办法]。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>结果与收获：Through continuous efforts, we finally achieved [结果].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>This experience has been extremely valuable to me. It not only enhanced my knowledge and skills in [领域], but also taught me the importance of perseverance and teamwork in research. I believe these experiences will be beneficial for my postgraduate study. 通过不断努力，我们最终取得了[结果]。这段经历对我来说极其宝贵。它不仅提高了我在[领域]的知识和技能，还让我学会了在研究中坚持不懈和团队合作的重要性。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我相信这些经验将对我的研究生学习大有裨益。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>四、优点和缺点   优点：My strengths mainly lie in several aspects. Firstly, I have a strong learning ability. I'm always eager to acquire new knowledge and skills.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>For example, when I was faced with a complex course in [课程名称], I quickly adapted to the learning requirements and achieved excellent grades through self-study and active participation in class discussions.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Secondly, I'm highly self-motivated and responsible. In any project or task, I always set high standards for myself and strive to complete it to the best of my ability. For instance, during [ 项目名称],  I took the initiative to take on additional responsibilities to ensure the project's success. 我的优点主要体现在几个方面。首先，我有很强的学习能力。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我总是渴望获取新知识和技能。例如，当我面对[课程名称]这门复杂课程时，我通过自学和积极参加课堂讨论，迅速适应了学习要求并取得了优异成绩。其次，我非常有内驱力和责任心。在任何项目或任务中，我总是为自己设定高标准，并努力尽我所能完成它。例如，在[项目名称]期间，我主动承担额外责任，以确保项目成功。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>缺点  ：However, I'm also aware of my weaknesses. One of my weaknesses is that I can be a bit perfectionist at times. This may lead to spending too much time on details, which could potentially delay the overall progress. To address this, I've started to learn to balance the pursuit of perfection with time management. I set clear time limits for each task and regularly review my progress to ensure that I'm on the right track. 然而，我也意识到我的缺点。我的一个缺点是有时我有点   完美主义。这可能导致我在细节上花费太多时间，可能会延迟整体进度。为了解决这个问题，我开始学会在追求完美和时间管理之间取得平衡。我为每个任务设定明确的时间限制，并定期审查我的进展，以确保我走在正确的轨道上。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">五、对专业前沿研究的了解</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>前沿研究介绍：I have been closely following the cutting-edge research trends in [专业]. For example, a recent research paper titled [论文标题] proposed a new theory / method called [ 理论  / 方法名称]. This research focuses on [研究重点], aiming to solve [问题]. 我一直在密切关注[专业]的前沿研究趋势。例如，最近一篇题为[论文标题]的研究论文提出了一种名为[理论/ 方法名称]的新理论/ 方法。这项研究重点关注[研究重点]，旨在解决[问题]。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>个人见解与兴趣 ：I find this research extremely interesting and inspiring. It has opened up new avenues for [研究领域]. I'm particularly interested in its potential applications in [应用领域], as I believe it could bring significant advancements and innovations. I'm eager to explore this research direction further during my graduate studies and contribute to the development of the field. 我觉得这项研究非常有趣且启发性十足。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>它为[研究领域]开辟了新的途径。我对它在[应用领域]的潜在应用特别感兴趣，因为我相信它能带来重大进展和创新。我渴望在研究生学习期间进一步探索这一研究方向，并为该领域的发展做出贡献。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h2 class=\"part-h\">7.13 面无不胜-留学篇</h2>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">一、自我介绍</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>问候与引入：Hello, my name is [Your Name]. 大家好，我叫[你的名字]。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>目前学习状况：I'm currently studying at [University Name], majoring in [Major]. 我目前在[大学名称]学习，主修[专业]。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>专业热情：I'm really passionate about [相关学术或职业兴趣]. 我对 [相关学术或职业兴趣]充满热情。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>业余爱好及技能：In my spare time, I like to [爱好或课外活动]. Which not only help me relax but also develop some important skills like [技能].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>For example, when I participate in [活动], I learned how to [学到的内容].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>在业余时间，我喜欢[爱好或课外活动]。这不仅帮助我放松，还培养了一些重要技能，如[技能]。例如，当我参加[活动]时，我学会了如何[学到的内容]。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>与未来的联系：I believe these experiences have prepared me well for my future study in your university. 我相信这些经历为我在贵校的未来学习做好了充分准备。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">二、为什么选择我们的学校和专业</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>学校声誉与师资：I choose your university because it has an excellent       reputation in  [ 相关领域]. The faculty here  is renowned for their expertise and research achievements. 我选择贵校是因为它在[相关领域]享有卓越声誉。这里的教师因其专业知识和研究成果而闻名。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>具体吸引点：I'm particularly interested in [具体课程或研究领域] offered by [某系]. 我对[某系]提供的[具体课程或研究领域]特别感兴趣。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>专业契合度：As for my major, I've been fascinated by [专业] since [时间点]. I think this major aligns perfectly with my career goals, which is to [长期职业抱负]. 至于我的专业，自[时间点]起，我就对[专业]着迷。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我认为这个专业与我的职业目标完美契合，即[长期职业抱负]。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>对未来发展的信心 ：And I'm confident that the comprehensive curriculum and practical opportunities in your university will help me achieve these goals. 我相信贵校全面的课程设置和实践机会将帮助我实现这些目标。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">三、学术优势和劣势</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>优势</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>In terms of my academic strengths, I'm a highly motivated learner. I'm eager to excel in my studies and unafraid of challenging courses. For example, in [难课程], I spent extra time studying and finally got a [好成绩]. Also, I'm skilled at critical thinking. When dealing with academic problems,  I can view them from different angles and offer creative        solutions. Furthermore,  I have great self-discipline, which helps me manage my time well and keep up with my study schedule.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>在学术优势方面，我是一个highly motivated learner（highly motivated learner）。我对学习充满热情，勇于挑战难题。例如，在[难课程]中， 我额外花费时间学习，最终取得了[好成绩]。此外，我擅长critical thinking（critical thinking）。在处理学术问题时，我能从不同角度审视并提出创造性解决方案。而且，我具有great self-discipline（great self-discipline），这有助于我合理安排时间，按时完成学习任务。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>劣势</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>As for my weaknesses,  I used to be a  bit shy when  it came to participating in group discussions. I was worried about making mistakes or not  expressing  myself  clearly. However,  I've been working on improving this. I joined some study groups and actively participated in discussions. Through these experiences, I've become more confident in expressing my ideas. Now, though I'm still not as outspoken as some of my peers, I can make significant contributions to group activities.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>至于劣势，我过去在团队讨论中有些shy（shy）。我担心犯错或表达不清楚。然而，我一直在努力改进。我加入了一些学习小组，积极参与讨论。通过这些经历，我变得更加自信。现在，尽管我仍未像某些同学那样健谈，但我能为小组活动做出重要贡献。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">四、职业规划   普通职业规划</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>短期目标：After graduation, I plan to start my career in a [目标行业] company. I hope to begin as an entry-level position where I can apply the knowledge and skills I've learned during my study. In the short term, I aim to gain practical experience, learn from my colleagues, and improve my professional skills. 毕业后，我计划在[目标行业]公司开始我的职业生涯。我希望从基础职位做起，运用所学知识和技能。短期内，我打算积累实践经验，向同事学习，提升专业技能。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>中期目标：In the medium term, I want to take on more responsibilities and contribute to the growth of the team. Eventually, I hope to become a [理想职位] and lead some important projects. 中期，我想承担更多责任，为团队发展做贡献。最终，我希望成为[理想职位]并领导重要项目。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>长期目标：In the long run, I may consider further education or research to  stay updated with the  latest  industry  trends and make more significant contributions to the field. 长期来看，我可能会考虑继续深造或进行研究，以紧跟行业最新趋势，为领域做出更大贡献。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>创业职业规划</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Well, after graduation, I plan to start my own business in the [目标行业] industry. I'm  fascinated by  its  potential and  opportunities.  In the beginning,  I'll focus on understanding customers and building a great       team. My long-term goal is to not only succeed in business but also use our products or services to make a positive impact on society and the world.  I believe the education here will help me achieve these plans.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Thank you.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>毕业后，我计划在[目标行业]创业。我对其潜力和机会着迷。起初， 我将专注于了解客户和组建优秀团队。我的长期目标是不仅在商业上取得成功，还利用我们的产品或服务对社会和世界产生积极影响。我相信这里的教育将助我实现这些计划。谢谢。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h2 class=\"part-h\">7.14 滔滔不绝-演讲篇</h2>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">一、演讲比赛简介</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>国内比赛</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 21 世纪杯全国英语演讲比赛：由21 世纪报社主办，是国际公</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>众演讲比赛的中国区官方唯一选拔赛，设四级赛制，旨在提高中国青年讲好中国故事的能力等。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 外研社杯全国英语演讲大赛：全国参赛人数最多、规模最大、水</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>平最高的英语演讲赛事之一，面向全国高校在校大学生，提供展示综合能力的平台。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 全国中学生演讲与辩论联赛：原名全国中学生学术辩论与演讲联</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>赛，由创新人才教育研究会和NSDA 中国主办，选手有机会晋级 NSDA 全美总决赛。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>国际比赛</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 国际公众演讲比赛（IPSC）：21 世纪杯全国英语演讲比赛的国际</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>赛，吸引全球众多优秀选手参赛。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. TED 演讲大会：非传统意义上的比赛，邀请各界人士分享思想和</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>创新成果，受众遍布全球。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 模拟联合国（MUN）：学术交流活动，学生扮演各国外交官，培   养全球视野等多种能力，在一线城市较为火热。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">二、英文演讲流程及准备</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>比赛流程</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>初赛：多为命题演讲，围绕给定主题准备演讲稿，按抽签顺序上台， 演讲时长一般3 - 5 分钟。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>复赛：形式不定，可能是更具挑战性的命题演讲或即兴演讲，现场出题，准备时间3 - 5 分钟，考验临场反应和表达流畅度。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>决赛：包含定题演讲和即兴问答或即兴演讲环节，定题演讲要求内容丰富、有感染力，问答环节需快速回应，评委综合多方面评分。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>定题演讲准备</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>明确主题与题目：深入了解主题，确定吸引人的题目，确保内容对听众有价值。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>确定演讲目的：明确是传递知识、说服听众接受观点、鼓励行动还是阐述重要性，可提供具体建议。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>收集资料：从多渠道获取可靠信息，如书籍、学术期刊、新闻网站等，支撑观点。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">撰写演讲稿：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>开头：迅速抓住听众注意力，可通过讲故事、讲脱口秀、提出引人深思的问题、引用名言或展示惊人事实等方式。   主体：详细阐述观点，逻辑清晰，可分点论述，每个观点提供充足证据和例子。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>结尾：简洁有力，总结内容，强调重点，可使用呼吁行动的句子。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>提高英文演讲水平的技巧</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>发音准确清晰：跟读模仿标准发音材料，注意重音、连读、弱读等规则。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>语调有起伏变化：强调重点时升高语调，疑问句上扬，陈述事实平稳。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>词汇丰富多样：避免重复使用相同单词或短语，适当使用同义词或近义词。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>语法正确规范：确保句子结构完整，主谓一致，时态正确。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>肢体语言得当：保持良好姿势，多进行眼神交流，适当运用手势辅助表达。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h2 class=\"part-h\">7.15 滔滔不绝-辩论篇</h2>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">一、英辩赛简介</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>国内主要赛事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 外研社国才杯全国大学生英语辩论赛：全国规模最大、水平最高</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>的英语辩论赛事之一。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 中国大学生英语辩论赛（CUDC）：由全国翻译专业学位研究生教</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>育指导委员会指导，中国外文局卡特项目管理中心主办。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 中国高中生美式辩论联赛：中国最具影响力和规模的综合性英文</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>演讲与辩论赛事之一，面向小学、初中、高中生。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>赛制</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>最常见的赛制是英国议会制（BP 赛制），由四支队伍参赛，分别是正方上院（OG）、反方上院（OO）、正方下院（CG）、反方下院（CO）， 每队两名辩手，有开篇立论、中间段反驳观点加强立场和自由辩论、 总结陈词三大阶段。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">二、打好辩论赛的关键</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>赛前准备</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>分析辩题：仔细分析关键词含义，明确核心争议点。例如辩题“Will Artificial Intelligence Replace Most of Human Jobs”，需理解“Artificial      Intelligence”“replace”“most of human jobs” 等关键词，确定辩题是事实类、价值类还是政策类。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>收集资料和论据：从书籍、学术论文、新闻报道、统计数据等渠道收集真实可靠、相关且具说服力的论据。如论证人工智能是否会取代人类大部分工作时，收集行业报告中人工智能在各领域替代人工岗位的数据，设置多个分论点，预判对方可能的反驳并写进准备内容。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>辩论技巧</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>语言表达：尽可能简单准确表达，避免模糊歧义和绝对化表述。使用通俗易懂的词汇和结构，语速语调适中，可抑扬顿挫强调重点，增强感染力和说服力。注重肢体语言，保持自信专注的眼神交流和适中的手势。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>逻辑论证：论点明确、证据充分，运用演绎推理、归纳推理、类比推理等合理逻辑推理方法，自然结合论点与论据，避免逻辑漏洞和错误。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>反驳：仔细听对方发言，抓住语言漏洞，针对观点、论据问题直接反驳，可用归谬法，把握恰当反驳时机，不打断对方发言，尊重规则和礼仪。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">三、辩论团队协作与心态调整</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>团队协作：明确各自分工和职责，根据优势特点分工合作，加强沟通协调，保持团队一致性和灵活性。   心态调整：保持平常心，将辩论视为锻炼思辨能力、批判性思维和语言组织能力的机会，遇突发情况或激烈反驳时，保持平静、理性客观，克制情绪。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">四、英文辩论稿框架</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>开篇陈词</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>问候和自我介绍：Honorable judges, distinguished opponents, and dear audience, good afternoon. I am [Your Name], and on behalf of my team, we firmly stand for the proposition that [团队立场].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>定义关键概念：Before we proceed, it is essential to define some key terms. Term one refers to [定义1], and term two means [定义2].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>简述观点：In this debate, we will present several compelling arguments to support our stance. Firstly, [第一个论点]. Secondly, [第二个论点].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>And finally, [第三个论点].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>主体论证</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>每个论点提出证据，解释论据与论点关联。如Our first argument is that [论点1]. According to a recent study conducted by [研究机构], [相关事实或数据], this clearly demonstrates that [阐述论据与论点关联].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>自由辩论环节反驳</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>总结对方观点后逐一反驳，指出漏洞并提供证据或逻辑推理支持己方立场。如Our opponents have presented some interesting arguments,       mainly arguing that [对方主要观点]. However, their first argument [对方论证1] is flawed. In fact, [己方论据], which shows that [己方观点优势].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>总结陈词</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>总结观点：In conclusion, we have presented three strong arguments to support our position. Firstly, [第一个论点]. Secondly, [第二个论点]. And finally, [第三个论点].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>强调立场重要性：Therefore, based on the above analysis, we sincerely hope that you will support our team and our position. Thank you.</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h2 class=\"part-h\">7.16 职场赢家-商务基础</h2>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">一、商务基础词汇</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>部门词汇</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>销售部：Sales Department 市场部：Marketing Department 人力资源部：Human Resources Department（HR）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>财务部：Finance Department 研发部：Research and Development Department 法务部：Legal Department 客服部：Customer Service Department</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>职位职称词汇</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">高级管理决策层：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>董事长：Chairman of the Board 首席执行官（CEO）：Chief Executive Officer 首席运营官（COO）：Chief Operating Officer 首席财务官（CFO）：Chief Financial Officer 首席技术官（CTO）：Chief Technology Officer   股东层面：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>控股股东：Controlling Shareholder 中层管理职位：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>总监：Director（如质量总监：Director of Quality）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>经理：Manager（如财务经理：Finance Manager）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>主管：Supervisor 或Team Leader 基础职位：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>专员：Specialist（如市场专员：Marketing Specialist）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>助理：Assistant（如行政助理：Administrative Assistant）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>职员：Clerk（如办公室职员：Office Clerk）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>秘书：Secretary（如秘书长：Secretary General）</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">二、常用固定搭配及例句</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>常用固定搭配</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>起草拟定：draw up 提出：put forward 赶上截止日期：meet the deadline 记录、跟踪：keep track of 达成协议：reach an agreement 盈利：make a profit    削减成本：cut costs 逐步建立：build up 达成妥协：come to terms with 实施：put into practice</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>例句</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I have to work overtime to meet the deadline of this task.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The small business made a profit last month.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's time to put our new marketing strategy into practice.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>After a long discussion, we finally reached an agreement.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>She put forward a good idea at the team meeting.</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">三、常用商务句型及例句</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>常用句型</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>表达兴趣：We are interested in [产品/ 服务] and would like to know more about its [特点/ 优势].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>请求信息：Could you please provide us with information regarding [特</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>定事项]?</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>表达感谢：Thank you for your cooperation / support in [活动/ 项目].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>感谢答复：We appreciate your prompt response to our request.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>邀请提问：Please let us know if you have any questions / concerns about [事项].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>例句</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>We are interested in your new software product and would like to know more about its features.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Thank you for your support in our marketing campaign last month.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Please let us know if you have any questions about the new company policy.</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h2 class=\"part-h\">7.17 职场赢家-邮件写作</h2>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">一、邮件基本结构与排版规范</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>邮件头部信息</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>收件人（To）：填写相关联系人的邮件地址，多个收件人用逗号或分号隔开，有职位高低之分时，按职位由高到低排列。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>抄送（CC）：发送给需要知晓邮件内容但非直接处理人的部门或人员。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>密送（BCC）：隐藏抄送，用于不想让收件人和抄送人知道还发给了其他人时使用。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>主题（Subject）：简洁明了概括邮件主要内容，避免无意义、笼统主题及特殊符号，非紧急情况少用“urgent” 等字样，回复邮件时根据需要更改标题。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>称呼（Salutation）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>正式场合：用“Dear Mr./Ms./Mrs./Miss [姓氏]”，如“Dear Mr. Smith”；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>不知对方婚姻状况时用“Ms.”，已婚女性用“Mrs.”；若不知姓名，只知头衔，可用“Dear [头衔]”，如“Dear Manager”。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>非正式场合：熟悉的人可用“Hi/Hello + 名字”，给群体发邮件可用“Dear all” 或“Dear team”。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>正文</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>开头：用简单问候，如“Hope this email finds you well”，或直接表明写信目的，如“I'm writing to inquire about...”“I'm writing to follow up on...” 等。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>中间：内容较多时分点叙述，用1、2、3 编号，语言表达用简单句， 保持简洁、准确、清晰，语气委婉，多用虚拟语气和委婉语气，如 “Could you please...”“Would it be possible to...”；正文左对齐，内容多时段落间空一行，重要内容可加粗或用不同颜色字体突出，但字体颜色不超过三种。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>结尾与署名</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>结尾：常用“Best regards”“Sincerely”“Kind regards”“Warm regards”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>等，期待回复时可加“Looking forward to your response”。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>署名：另起一行写姓名，代表公司发送时加上职位、公司名称及联系方式。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">二、邮件写作注意事项</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>附件：有附件在标题写完后马上上传，正文提醒收件人查收附件， 如“Please find the attached file for your reference”，附件个数不超过4 个，多则打包压缩，特殊格式需告知收件人打开方式。   字数与排版：考试中字数超过要求50 字以上，但避免冗长无重点， 尽量分段，层层递进，环环相扣。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">三、常用邮件句型</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>开头</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">问候与直接表明目的：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Hope this email finds you well. 希望这封邮件找到你时，你一切安好。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm writing to inquire about... 我写这封邮件是为了询问关于…… I'm writing to follow up on your previous conversation or meeting. 我写这封邮件是为了跟进我们之前的对话或会议。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>We are interested in your products and would like to know more about it.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我们对您的产品感兴趣，想了解更多有关它的信息。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">介绍公司与产品：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Our company is [公司情况]，we believe that your [产品] could bring [好处]。我们的公司是[公司情况]，我们认为您的[产品] 能够带来[好处]。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>正文</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>请求信息：Could you please provide us with [信息] by [时间点]。请问您能在[时间点] 之前为我们提供[信息] 吗？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>道歉与说明问题：We apologize for the inconvenience caused by [问题].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>We are working on a solution and we'll keep you updated. 我们为[问     题] 给您带来的不便深表歉意。我们正在努力寻找解决方案，并会及时向您通报进展。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>结尾</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>感谢：Thank you for your time and consideration. 感谢您抽出时间和关注。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>期待回复：We look forward to hearing from you soon. 我们期待很快收到您的回复。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>表明可联系：If you have any questions or concerns, please do not hesitate to contact me. 如果您有任何问题或顾虑，请随时与我联系。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>再次感谢合作：Once again, thank you for your cooperation. 再次感谢您的合作。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h2 class=\"part-h\">7.18 职场赢家-电话沟通</h2>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">一、电话沟通基本结构</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>开头</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">自我介绍：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>拨打电话时，常用“This is [Your Name] from [Company Name]”，如 “This is Lily from ABC Trading Company”。若对方较熟悉，也可说“Hi, it's [Your Name]”。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">确认对方身份：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>接听电话时，礼貌询问对方身份，如“May I ask who is calling?” 或 “Who is speaking, please?”。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">表明来电目的：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>使用“I'm calling to...” 开门见山说明目的，如“I'm calling to inquire about your new software product”或“I'm calling to discuss the details of our upcoming meeting”。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>中间交流</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">表达意见或想法：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“I think we should...” 表示建议，如“I think we should launch the product earlier to catch the market trend”。     “In my opinion...”“From my perspective...”“From my point of view...”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>表示个人看法，如“In my opinion, the price is a bit too high”。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">请求对方做某事：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“Could you please...”如“Could you please send me the report by the end of today?”。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“Would you mind...” 或“Would you mind if I...” 如“Would you mind looking up some information?”“Would you mind if I take a few more minutes of your time to discuss this issue?”。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">确认信息：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“Just to confirm...”“Let me confirm...” 如“Just to confirm the meeting is scheduled for 3 p.m. tomorrow”“Let me confirm you have ordered fifty units of Product A”。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“Let me make sure...”“Am I right in saying that...”“I'd like to double check...” 如“Let me make sure I understand you correctly. You mean we need to increase the budget?”“I'd like to double check the budget figures we discussed earlier”。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">处理异议和问题：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“I understand your concern about..., but...” 如“I understand your concern about the delivery time, but we will do our best to speed it up”。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“We're working on a solution for...” 如“We're working on a solution for the quality issue”。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“I really appreciate your point of view. However,...”“I see what you are        saying. However,...”如“I really appreciate your point of view, however, we need to consider the current market situation”。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“Rest assured that...” 如“Rest assured that we will keep you updated on the progress of solving this problem”。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>结尾</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">表达感谢或期待：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“Thank you for your time”“Thanks for your help”。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“Looking forward to hearing from you”“We look forward to doing business with you”。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>表达美好祝愿：“Have a nice day”。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>直接道别：“Goodbye”。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">二、电话沟通注意事项</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 语速适中：清晰表达每个单词，减少连读和吞音。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. 保持礼貌和专业：无论对方态度如何，都要以礼相待。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. 记录重要信息：通话时记录关键信息，如日期、时间、数字和决</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>定。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. 复杂沟通后发送邮件确认：确保信息准确无误。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h2 class=\"part-h\">7.19 职场赢家-会议英语</h2>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">一、会议开头</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>点名与问候</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">点名：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Let's take a roll call to see who's here. 我们来点名看看都有谁到了。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">问候与开场：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Good morning / afternoon / evening, everyone. Thank you all for taking the time out of your busy schedules to attend this meeting today. We're gathered here to discuss some important matters that  will have a significant impact on our company's future. First of all, let me briefly introduce the agenda for today's meeting. 大家早上好/ 下午好/ 晚上好。感谢大家从繁忙的日程中抽出时间参加今天的会议。我们聚集在这里讨论一些对公司未来有重大影响的重要事项。首先，让我简要介绍一下今天会议的议程。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">开始会议：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Let's get started. 让我们开始吧。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Could everyone please introduce themselves briefly? 大家能否简要介绍一下自己？   介绍会议目的和议程说明会议主题：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Today's meeting is mainly to discuss [会议主题]. 今天的会议主要是讨论[会议主题]。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">介绍议程：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Our agenda today includes [X] main parts. First, we will [第一部分任务], second, we will [第二部分任务], and finally, we'll have [最后一部分任务]. 今天的议程包括[X] 个主要部分。首先，我们将[第一部分任务]， 其次，我们将[第二部分任务]，最后，我们将进行[最后一部分任务]。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">二、会议中间环节</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>引导发言</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">邀请发言：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Now, I'd like to open the floor to everyone. Please feel free to share your ideas, opinions, or suggestions regarding the topics we just discussed.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Let's start with [参会者名字]. 现在，我想让大家自由发言。请大家就我们刚刚讨论的话题分享想法、观点或建议。我们从[参会者名字] 开始。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">发言者结束发言后可说：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Thank you, [ 名字], for your insightful comments. Your perspective is really valuable to us. 感谢[名字]，你的观点对我们来说非常有价值。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>询问补充：Does anyone else have anything to add? 还有其他人要补   充吗？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>回归主题</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">提醒回归主题：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I think we've got a bit sidetracked here. Let's bring the focus back to the main topic we were discussing. Please share your thoughts related to [主题]. 我觉得我们有点跑题了。让我们把焦点拉回到我们之前讨论的主要话题上。请分享一下与[主题] 相关的想法。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>或直接说：Let's get back to the point. 让我们回归主题。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>了解他人看法</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">询问看法：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>What do you think about this, [名字]? 你对这件事有什么看法吗，[名字]？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Any thoughts on this matter? 大家对这件事有什么想法吗？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>How do you feel about our plan? 你觉得我们的计划怎么样？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>同意与不同意</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">同意：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I couldn't agree more. 我完全同意。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>That's a great point. I'm on the same page with you. 这个观点真不错， 我和你意见一致。   不同意：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I see your point, but  I think we should consider the cost factor more carefully. 我明白你的观点，但我认为我们应该更仔细地考虑成本因素。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm afraid I have a different opinion. 恐怕我有不同的意见。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>总结要点</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">总结观点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>To sum up, our main points are [...]. 总结一下，我们的主要观点是[...] Let's summarize what we've discussed so far. We need to [...]. 让我总结一下到目前为止我们讨论的内容，我们需要做[...] It's important to note that [...]. 需要注意的是[...]。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">三、会议结尾</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>总结会议</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">总结内容：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>In conclusion, we've discussed [讨论内容] and decided to [决定内容].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>总之，我们讨论了[讨论内容] 并决定[决定内容]。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>To wrap up, we've agreed on [达成一致的内容] and we'll take the following actions [...]. 最后总结一下，我们就[达成一致的内容] 达成一致，并将采取以下行动[...]。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">安排后续   安排任务与会议：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>[名字] will be responsible for [任务], and report back to us by [日期]. [名字] 将负责[任务]，并于[日期] 前向我们汇报。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>We'll have another meeting next week to review the progress. 我们将在下周再开一次会来审查进展情况。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>结束会议</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">礼貌结束：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Thank you all for your participation and valuable input. The meeting is adjourned. 感谢大家的参与和宝贵意见。会议到此结束。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>That's all for today's meeting. Have a great day! 今天的会议就到这里。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>祝大家度过愉快的一天！</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">四、注意事项</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. 注意发言顺序和节奏：不要打断别人说话，等他人发言结束后再</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>表达自己的观点。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>9. 保持积极态度：尊重他人不同的意见和想法。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>10. 做好会议记录：记录重要决策、任务和时间节点等信息，尽管</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>有AI 记录，也要记录自己认为重要的内容。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h2 class=\"part-h\">7.20 职场赢家-谈判话术</h2>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">一、谈判开场</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>表明目的与问候</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">1. 问候并表明目的：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>Good morning / afternoon, it's great to meet you today. We're here</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>to discuss our potential cooperation.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>上午好/ 下午好，很高兴今天见到你们。我们今天来这里是为了讨论我们潜在的合作事宜。</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>Thank you for coming. Our goal today is to reach an agreement on</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>[具体话题], like the terms of our partnership.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>感谢你们前来。我们今天的目标是就在[具体话题] 达成一致，比如我们的合作条款。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">2. 建立共识，强调合作意愿：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>We believe that both of our companies can benefit from this</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>cooperation. Let's work together to find a solution that works for everyone.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我们相信我们两家公司都能从这次合作中获益。让我们共同努力，找到一个对大家都有利的解决方案。</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>We are looking forward to a mutually beneficial partnership. I'm sure     we can find common ground through open communication.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我们期待着建立一种互利共赢的伙伴关系。我相信通过坦诚的沟通， 我们能够找到共同点。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">二、提出我方观点和条件</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">1. 提出条件：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>We propose that the price for this order should be [ 具体价格],</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>considering the quality of our products.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我们提议这批订单的价格应为[具体价格]，考虑到我们产品的质量。</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>Our suggestion is that the delivery time should be within [具体时间</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>段] to meet our market demand.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我们建议交货时间应在[具体时间段] 内，以满足我们的市场需求。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">2. 询问对方意见和需求：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>What's your opinion on our proposal? Do you have any specific</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>requirements? 你对我们提出的方案有什么看法？你有什么具体的要求吗？</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>Could you please share your thoughts on the payment terms? We'd</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>like to find a solution that works for both sides.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>能否分享一下你对付款条款的看法？我们希望找到一个对双方都适用的解决方案。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>三、回应对方观点        1. 表示异议或理解：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>If you agree：</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>That's a reasonable point. We can consider that.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>这是一个合理的观点，我们会考虑的。</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>If you disagree：</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Well, we understand your position. We think that [理由], maybe we can find a compromise.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我们理解你的立场，但我们认为[理由]，也许我们可以找到一个折中的办法。</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>Your idea has some merit, but we are concerned about [具体问题].</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Can we discuss it further? 你的想法有一定的价值，但我们对[具体问题] 有所担忧。我们可以进一步讨论吗？</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">四、做出让步和寻求妥协</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">1. 做出让步：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>To show our sincerity in cooperation, we are willing to reduce the</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>price by [百分比]%, but in return, we hope you can [条件].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>为了表示我们合作的诚意，我们愿意将价格降低[百分比]%，但作为回报，我们希望你们能[条件]。</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>How about we meet halfway? We can adjust the delivery time a bit if</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>you can consider our proposed payment terms.   我们各让一步如何？如果你们能考虑我们提出的付款条款，我们可以稍微调整一下交货时间。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">五、谈判结尾</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>总结谈判结果</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">1. 总结结果：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>To summarize, we've agreed on the price of [具体价格], the delivery</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>time of [具体时间], and the payment terms of [条款描述].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>总结一下，我们已在价格[具体价格]、交货时间[具体时间] 和付款条款[条款描述] 上达成一致。</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>Let me go over what we've discussed. We all [列出要点], and start</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>the cooperation as soon as possible.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>让我回顾一下我们讨论的内容。我们都[列出要点]，并尽快开始合作。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>确认下一步行动</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">1. 安排下一步：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>We'll prepare the contract and send it to you for review by [时间].</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我们会准备合同，并在[时间] 前发送给您审核。</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>Both sides will need to finalize the details within [具体时间], then</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>we can sign the agreement.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>双方需要在[具体时间] 内敲定细节，然后我们就可以签署协议。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>结束谈判，表示期待</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 礼貌结束：             - Thank you for your cooperation and understanding during the</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>negotiation. We look forward to a successful partnership.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>感谢你们在谈判中的合作与理解。我们期待着一次成功的合作。</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>That concludes our negotiation. I'm confident that our cooperation</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>will bring great benefits to both sides. Have a nice day.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>谈判到此结束。我相信我们的合作将为双方带来巨大的利益。祝您有美好的一天。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">六、注意事项</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 保持冷静和礼貌：即使遇到分歧，也要以理服人，不要情绪化。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 认真倾听：理解对方立场和需求，不要急于辩驳。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 做好准备：了解自己和对方的底线及可能的谈判策略。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h2 class=\"part-h\">7.21 职场赢家-跨文化交际</h2>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">一、文化差异点讲解</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>肢体语言差异</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 手势差异：如OK 手势在巴西、德国等国可能有不礼貌含义；竖</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>大拇指在伊朗等西方国家有侮辱性。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 眼神交流：在一些亚洲国家，长时间直视对方眼睛可能被认为不</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>尊重，而在欧美文化中，眼神交流表示专注和尊重。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 鞠躬与点头：在日本，不同鞠躬幅度和时长有不同含义；在保加</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>利亚和希腊部分地区，点头表示否定，摇头表示肯定。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 坐姿差异：美国商务会议中坐姿较放松，身体微微前倾表积极参</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>与；北欧国家坐姿端正，身体前倾程度小；阿拉伯国家坐姿靠近对方表亲和热情。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>社交距离差异</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 北欧国家：人们倾向于保持一定距离，交谈时若对方往后退，需</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>适当调整距离。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 拉丁美洲国家：如巴西、墨西哥等，商务交流中手势幅度大、频</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>率高，喜欢用丰富手势辅助表达。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 德国、瑞士等欧洲国家：商务场合手势少且幅度小，注重言语表</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>达，过多夸张手势可能被认为不专业。   价值观差异</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 中国：受儒家思想影响，集体主义占主导，企业决策综合多方意</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>见，强调整体和谐与团队协作。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 美国：移民国家，强调个人权利和自由，个人主义盛行，员工积</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>极展现个人才能，决策依赖个人判断。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 德国：历史进程造就强烈秩序感和时间观念，商务活动严格守时，</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>合同条款细致严谨。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 日本：受封建时代等级制度影响，尊重权威，强调集体主义和团</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>队力量，注重长期合作关系与集体声誉。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">二、处理文化冲突的方法</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>积极沟通</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. I notice that we have different views on this and I think it might be</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>because of our cultural differences. Let's talk about it.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我注意到我们在这个问题上有不同看法，可能是因为文化差异，我们来讨论一下吧。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>寻求共同点</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. Although we come from different cultural backgrounds, we all want to</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>achieve success in this project. Let's focus on our common goal.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>尽管我们来自不同文化背景，但我们都希望在这个项目中取得成功， 让我们专注于共同目标。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>尊重和包容        1. I may not fully understand your cultural perspective, but I respect your opinion and the way you do things.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我或许不能完全理解你的文化观念，但我尊重你的意见和做事方式。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">三、跨文化交际固定搭配</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">1. 表达理解：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>I understand that your culture has different customs and values, and</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I respect that.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我理解你的文化有不同的风俗和价值观，我尊重这一点。</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>I know that in your culture this might be the norm, and I'm trying to</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>adapt.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我知道在你们文化中这可能是常态，我正在努力适应。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">2. 委婉提出建议：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>Perhaps we could consider a compromise that takes into account</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>both our cultural backgrounds.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>也许我们可以考虑一个兼顾双方文化背景的折中方案。</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>It might be worth exploring a different approach that respects our</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>cultural differences.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>探索一种尊重文化差异的不同方法或许是值得的。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">3. 化解尴尬：</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>Sorry if I offended you. I'm still learning about your culture.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>如果我冒犯到你了，很抱歉，我还在学习你们的文化。             -  I didn't mean to cause any misunderstanding.  It's just that our cultures are different in this regard.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我不是故意引起误解，只是我们在这方面文化不同。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">四、案例分析</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>案例一</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 场景一 ：I understand that in French work culture, individual</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>responsibility  is  highly  valued, and   i  respect your  preference  for independent work. However, I think in this project, team collaboration might bring better results. Perhaps we could consider a combination of both approaches, where each person has their own tasks but also works closely with the team.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我理解在法国工作文化中，高度注重个人责任，我尊重你对独立工作的偏好。然而，我认为在这个项目中，团队协作可能会带来更好的结果。也许我们可以考虑将这两种方法结合起来，每个人都有自己的任务，同时也与团队紧密合作。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 场景二：I'm truly sorry. I should have been more aware of your</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>religious dietary restrictions. Please let me know what kind of food you can have, and I'll make sure to arrange something suitable for you right away.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>真的很抱歉。我本应该更加留意你的宗教饮食限制。请告诉我你可以吃的食物，我会马上为你安排合适的餐食。        3. 场景三：I know that in Australian work style, being flexible and open to new ideas is important, and i really appreciate your creativity. But i'm a bit concerned that these frequent changes might disrupt our original plan. Maybe we could set some specific times for discussing new ideas so that we can balance flexibility and the stability of the plan.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我知道在澳大利亚的工作风格中，灵活且乐于接受新想法很重要，我真的很欣赏你的创造力。但我有点担心这些频繁的改变可能会打乱我们原来的计划。也许我们可以设定一些特定时间来讨论新想法，这样我们就能在灵活性和计划的稳定性之间取得平衡。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h2 class=\"part-h\">7.22 旅游英语-行前准备</h2>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">一、出行前准备</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（一）签证办理</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>签证visa 文件documents 护照passport 照片photos 银行存款证明bank statement 签证申请visa application 签证要求visa requirements 签证面试visa interview 签证处理时间visa processing time 签证批准visa approval 拒签deny a visa 签证费用visa fee 入境签证entry visa 出境签证exit visa 实用句型：I need to prepare my documents for the visa application. 我需要准备签证申请的文件。   （二）预订机票预订book a flight 航班flight 价格price 起飞时间departure time 到达时间arrival time 目的地destination 实用句型：What's the best flight to New York? 去纽约最好的航班是哪一趟？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'd like to book a round trip flight to London. 我想预订一张去伦敦的往返机票。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（三）预订酒店</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>预订酒店book a hotel 公寓apartment 单人房single room 大床房queen room 特大床房king room 双人房double room 三人房triple room 豪华房deluxe room 标准房standard room 海景房sea view room     山景房mountain view room 入住时间check in time 退房时间check out time 押金deposit 便利设施amenity 健身房gym 游泳池swimming pool 早餐breakfast 实用句型：I'd like to book a single room with mountain view. 我想预订一间山景单人房。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">二、机场流程</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（一）值机托运</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>值机check in 登机柜台check in counter 托运行李checked luggage 随身行李carry on bag 登机牌boarding pass 登机口boarding gate 超重overweight 额外费用extra charge 规定regulations     液体liquids 尖锐物品sharp objects 托盘tray 实用句型：I'd like to check in for my flight to France. 我想办理去法国的航班登机手续。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>How much is the extra charge for overweight luggage? 超重行李的额外费用是多少？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（二）过安检候机</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>过安检go through security check 金属物品metal objects 手表watch 皮带belt 电脑laptop 广播announcement 航班延误flight delay 登机口变更boarding gate change 商店shops 餐厅restaurants 实用句型：Please take off your watch and put it in the tray. 请把你的手表拿下来放到托盘里。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Attention passengers, the flight to Paris is delayed for one hour. 请注意， 飞往巴黎的航班延误一小时。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h2 class=\"part-h\">7.23 旅游英语-旅途用语</h2>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">一、交通出行</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（一）乘坐出租车</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>打车take a taxi 挥手示意wave your hand 招手拦出租车hail a taxi 打电话叫出租车call a taxi 上出租车get in a taxi 下出租车get out of a taxi 目的地destination 支付车费pay the fare 小费give a tip 不用找零keep the change 要发票Could you please give me the receipt? 下车地点drop off point 上车地点pick up point 行李箱trunk 前排座位front seat 后排座位back seat   （二）租车租赁rent 租车公司car rental company 租车租期rent a car for...days 车辆统称vehicle 轿车sedan SUV Sports utility vehicle 小型货车minivan 卡车truck 敞篷车convertible 手动挡manual transmission 自动挡automatic transmission 车牌license plate 燃料fuel 汽油gasoline（美式）/Petrol（英式）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>油箱tank 驾照driver's license 保险insurance 有效的valid 车辆注意事项things to know about the car 加油站gas station 还车时间return time     油箱加满fill up the tank</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（三）乘坐公交</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>公交站bus stop 公交线路图bus route map 向司机买票buy a ticket from the driver 单程票one way ticket 往返票round trip ticket 询问站点Is this the stop for...?</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（四）乘坐地铁</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>地铁subway/underground/Metro 地铁站subway station 购买地铁票buy a subway ticket 售票机ticket vending machine 刷卡过闸机swipe the card through the turnstile 跟随指示牌follow the signs 站台platform 查看线路和方向check the subway map 下一站Which is the next station?</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">二、酒店入住与退房</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（一）酒店入住</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>办理入住手续check in at the hotel     前台reception desk 出示身份证/护照show your ID card/Passport 房间号room number 早餐时间breakfast time 酒店设施hotel facilities 询问早餐时间What time is breakfast served? 询问设施使用Can you tell me how to use the gym facilities?</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（二）房间问题反馈</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>房间不干净The room is not clean.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>空调不工作The air conditioner doesn't work.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>没有热水There is no hot water.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>联系前台解决问题Hello, this is room..., could you send someone to fix...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>派人修理send someone to fix 维修人员maintenance person</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（三）酒店退房</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>办理退房I'd like to check out now 检查房间物品check for any damages in the room 结算费用settle the bill 总费用Your total bill is...dollars 支付方式How would you like to pay? 付现金I'll pay in cash.    刷卡I'd like to pay by credit card.</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h2 class=\"part-h\">7.24 旅游英语-参观购物</h2>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">一、购物相关</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（一）商店类型</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>商店store 百货商店department store 便利店convenience store 杂货店grocery store 大型购物中心mall/shopping mall 精品店Boutique</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（二）商品与价格</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>商品item 价格price 高价格high price 低价low price 折扣discount 给予折扣give a discount 8 折优惠a twenty percent discount 品牌brand 询问品牌：What brand is this/Which brand does this belong to/What's       the brand of this item？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>材质made of 常见材质：cotton（棉质）、silk（丝绸）、wool（羊毛）、linen（亚麻）、leather（皮革）、polyester（聚酯纤维）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>尺寸size 询问尺寸：Do you have this in a larger/smaller size？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>颜色color 询问颜色：What color is this/Do you have any other colors？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>款式style</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（三）砍价与支付</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>砍价bargain 砍价表达：It's a bit too expensive, can you give me a discount/I'll take two, if you can make it cheaper 支付方式payment options 常见支付方式：cash（现金）、credit card（信用卡）、Mobile payment （移动支付）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>支付表达：I'd like to pay by credit card/I'll pay in cash/I'd like to pay by Mobile payment</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">二、餐厅用餐</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（一）点餐</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>服务员waiter/waitress    询问人数：How many people are there in your party？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>菜单menu 索要菜单：May I have a menu please？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>开胃菜appetizer 主菜main courses 牛排steak、意大利面pasta、鸡肉chicken、鱼fish 牛排熟度：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>一分熟rare（内部鲜红色）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>三分熟medium rare（内部红色）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>五分熟medium（内部粉红色，暖热多汁）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>七分熟medium well（内部浅灰棕褐色，少量粉红色）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>全熟well done（口感坚实）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>特殊要求special request 例如：No onions/Could you make sure there are no onions in the salad？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（二）描述食物</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>嫩的tender、多汁的juicy、太咸too salty、美味的tasty/delicious、 味道浓郁flavorful、脆的crunchy、耐嚼的chewy、酸的tangy、温和的mild</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（三）结账</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>账单bill 索要账单：Could I have the bill please/Check please/Can I have the bill please？    询问是否包含小费：Is the tip included in the bill？</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">三、参观景点</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（一）问路</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>景点scenic spot 迷路lose my way 路人passerby 问路表达：Excuse me, how can I get to some place？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">指路相关表达：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>直走go straight 向左转turn left 向右转turn right 在第几个路口转弯take the first/second turning on the left/right 经过某地go past 上坡/下坡go up/down 沿着…… 走walk along 穿过…… cross 在拐角处around the corner 在…… 对面opposite 在…… 前面in front of 在…… 后面behind 穿过隧道等go through    你不会错过it's just around the corner 感谢：Thank you so much for your help</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（二）了解历史文化</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>导游tour guide 语音导览Audio guide 询问历史：Could you tell me something about the history of this place/Tell me about it/Could you please tell me something about this place？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（三）拍照留念</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>拍照留念take photos for memory 角度angle 请求拍照：Excuse me, could you please take a photo of me/Could you please take it from this angle？</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h2 class=\"part-h\">7.25 世界门票-雅思听力</h2>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">一、听力考试结构</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 考试时长：30 分钟听力音频播放，另附10 分钟答题卡誊写时</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>间，唯听力环节专享此誊写时段，阅读则无，需边作答边填卡。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 题型划分：共40 题，分四部分，每部分10 题，难度递增。Part1</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>为生活场景对话填空；Part2 是独白，题型多样；Part3 为学术场景对话，学术词汇增多；Part4 是学术讲座独白，以填空题为主。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">二、各部分题型详解</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（一）Part1：生活场景对话填空</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 场景举例：租房交流、旅游咨询等，侧重填人物信息、事物名称</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>等，名词、数字、形容词出现频率高。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 作答要求：通常一空填一单词或数字，注意题目对单词数量的特</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>殊限定。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（二）Part2：独白多样题型</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 常见主题：活动介绍、场所说明、服务讲解等。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 题型：选择题（含双选、多选）、配对题、地图题、表格填空题</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>等。</p>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>选择题：依靠同义替换解题，留意选项印象，避免听到即选。             - 配对题：考理解与反应能力，关注选项特征描述。</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>地图题：确定起点，可圈画地图文字辅助。</li></ul>"}, {"type": "ul", "html": "<ul><li>表格填空题：保持高准确率，控制失误在两题内。</li></ul>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（三）Part3：学术场景对话</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 场景范畴：学生讨论课程作业、项目研究，或师生交流学习问题、</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>探讨思路等，涉及学术词汇。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 题型：单选、多选、配对、填空题均有，需抓关键词，理解成块</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>意思，关注同义替换。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（四）Part4：学术讲座独白</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 内容领域：涵盖环境科学、历史文化等多学科，多为讲座或报告</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>节选。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 题型特质：填空题占比80% - 90%，答案多为名词，留意题目对</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>填词数量的要求。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">三、听力技巧提升</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 预先读题预测：快速扫题，标记关键词，预判答案类型，建立听</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>觉期待。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 聚焦关键信息：着重捕捉名词、动词、限定词（如the best、a large</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>number of 等），缩小答案范围。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 把握顺序原则：答案在听力原文中按题目顺序出现，错过一题不</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>纠结，紧跟节奏。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 精听与总结：听完一套题，反复精听，分析错因，积累同义替换，   提升听力敏感度。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. 关注逻辑词：如“but” 后常有转折观点，助于把握关键信息。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. 简要记录：记录关键数字、时间等，用简洁笔记辅助理解与记忆。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h2 class=\"part-h\">7.26 世界门票-雅思阅读</h2>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">一、考试结构</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 考试时长：60 分钟。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 题量：3 篇文章，共40 题。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 文章长度：每篇约1000 - 1500 字。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 题材与体裁：涵盖人文、科技、自然、社会等领域，包括说明文、</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>议论文、记叙文等。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">二、题型与技巧</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（一）题型</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 选择题：包括单选、多选。先浏览文章标题、副标题和首段，了</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>解大意；再看题干，依关键词定位信息；仔细分析选项，关注同义替换及偷换概念等问题。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 填空题：有摘要填空、句子填空。抓关键词定位答案范围，分析</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>词性和语法；多数情况填原词，少数需改变词形态。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 判断题：选项为true、false、not given（或yes、no、not given）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>true 表文章内容相符，false 表相悖，not given 表未提及；注意审题， 避免混淆字母。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 配对题：包括段落与标题配对、人物与观点配对、信息与段落配   对。依题型确定顺序，如段落与标题配对先读标题再匹配；人物与观</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>点配对则依人名定位观点。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. 流程图题：考察事物发展或操作步骤理解，留意文章连接词和顺</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>序词。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（二）技巧</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 阅读文章时多圈画关键词、句子，辅助定位和理解。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 平行阅读法：快速浏览所有题型题目，找出关键词；确定易定位</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>题目作起始点，带其关键词定位答案时，留意其他题型关键词是否出现在附近，依顺序原则推进，解答多题。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">三、时间分配建议</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 若能分辨难易程度，可先难后易做试卷。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 若无法分辨，按正常顺序做题，第一篇用时10 - 15 分钟，第二篇</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>20 分钟左右，第三篇约半个小时。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h2 class=\"part-h\">7.27 世界门票-雅思写作</h2>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">一、考试基本情况</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 考试时长：60 分钟。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 作文字数：小作文不少于150 字，大作文不少于250 字。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">二、小作文</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（一）结构与内容</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 3 - 4 段结构：第一段改写题目（paraphrase），第二段概括图表</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>主要数据或趋势，主体段描述图表重要信息，可1 - 2 段。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 要点：只描述，不主观创造观点；突出关键信息，如柱状图的最</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>高、最低、差距大柱子；进行数据对比和关联分析；控制时间在20 - 25 分钟，字体清晰、正确使用标点符号。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（二）常见题型</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 柱状图：描述极值、中间数值、变化显著数值，分析背后意义。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 折线图：改写题目，总括趋势，比较不同折线趋势。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 饼图：指出占比最大最小部分，按比例描述，可适当比较分类。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 表格：点明主题，总括数据特征，分类对比数据，描述趋势。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. 流程图：改写题目，按步骤描述，用连接词，明确动作执行者，</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>复杂流程可分段，结尾总结。        6. 地图题：介绍地图内容，静态图描述位置功能，动态图对比不同时期变化，结尾总结。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">三、大作文</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（一）结构与内容</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 4 段结构：开头段引出话题、表明观点，主体段1 阐述观点1 并</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>论证，主体段2 阐述观点2 并论证，结尾段总结全文、重申论点。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 字数：建议写300 - 350 字。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（二）技巧与要点</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 审题：明确题目类型（观点类、讨论类等），把握关键词。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 论点：明确、围绕中心，每段专注一个论点。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 词汇与句式：避免重复词汇，多用复杂句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 写作思维：按英文表达方式，避免中式英语，可借助范文形成模</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>板。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. 检查：检查单词拼写、标点错误。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h2 class=\"part-h\">7.28 世界门票-雅思口语</h2>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">一、考试形式与时长</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>时长：11 - 14 分钟，一般不超过15 分钟。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>形式：面对面交流或线上视频考试。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">二、考试部分及内容</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（一）Part One：日常问答个人信息类：如全名、籍贯、兄弟姐妹等，直接简答。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>兴趣爱好类：如空闲活动、音乐喜好、电影类型等，用1 - 2 句话回答并适当补充。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>日常生活类：如实住处、购物频率、早餐内容等，据实2 - 3 句回答。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>学习工作类：区分学生或工作者身份，回答专业或工作相关问题。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>是非题：不能仅yes/no，需2 - 3 句解释原因，用长难句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>描述题：描述事件或事物，提供足够细节，如学校不喜欢的事、上次做饭等。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>态度立场题：先表明观点，再阐述理由，如对学第二语言的看法。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（二）Part Two：话题陈述流程：考官给话题卡片，含话题及提示问题，1 分钟准备并记录要   点，之后进行1 - 2 分钟陈述。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>示例：描述钦佩的人，需说清楚人物、认识方式、事迹及钦佩原因。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（三）Part Three：深入讨论内容：考官依Part Two 话题提深入抽象问题，讨论时长约4 - 5 分钟，考察分析论证和逻辑思维能力。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>示例：针对Part Two 钦佩的人，问现代社会令人钦佩的品质。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">三、评分标准</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 流利度与连贯性：表达流畅，少停顿、重复、犹豫；句子、段落</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>逻辑清晰，用连接词。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 词汇资源：词汇准确丰富，用高级词汇、短语，避免重复，用同、</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>近义词。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 语法范围与准确性：多样语法结构，如不同时态、语态、从句，</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>且语法正确。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 发音：单词发音准，重音、音调自然流畅，巧用连读、弱读等助</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>表达。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">四、答题技巧</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 利用准备时间：Part Two 的1 分钟内快速浏览话题，记录关键</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>词要点。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 用连接词和过渡语：如firstly、secondly、moreover、however 等，    卡顿时可用well actually、you know、let me think 等自然过渡。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 扩展回答：回答包含“是什么、为什么、怎么样”，如喜读书，</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>要阐述原因、举例等。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 注意语音语调与语速：语速适中，保持自然流畅。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. 与考官互动：保持眼神交流，态度自信积极，听不清问题礼貌请</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>求重复。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h2 class=\"part-h\">7.29 世界门票-雅思综合</h2>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">一、雅思考试相关细节</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（一）考试难度及费用</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>费用：2170 元/ 次。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>难度：总分6 分为基本交流水平，7 分以上为优秀，8 分以上为母语水平。中国大陆考生平均总分5.9，听力5.9，阅读6.2，写作5.8， 口语5.5。阅读较易提分。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（二）雅思与四六级对比</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>考查内容：雅思涵盖听说读写，强调全面运用，生活化；四六级主要考察文字表达与词汇量，更学术化。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>词汇量：雅思要求6000 - 8000 +，四六级4000 - 6000。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（三）报名与有效期</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>纸笔考试：提前12 个工作日报名，机考提前一周。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>分数有效期：2 年，备考需3 个月- 1 年。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（四）国内外考试区别</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>国内：竞争压力大，听力阅读客观，作文较公平，口语受主观影响。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>国外：要求略低，口语表达流畅准确易获高分。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（五）考试地点与准备</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>地点选择：优先大城市考点，设施完善。   考前准备：准考证、身份证，考场提供文具，禁带纸笔、食物、电子设备等。考试时严格听从指令。</p>"}, {"type": "h", "html": "<h3 class=\"sub-h\">二、备考材料</h3>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>真题系列：剑4 - 剑19，基础薄弱从剑12 开始，基础好做15 - 19。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>学习策略：精听、精读、模拟口语练习，以真题为中心，总结分析提升。</p>"}]}]}], "id": "part7", "file": "第七部分_高频句型与实用表达.md", "title": "第七部分 · 高频句型与实用表达", "range": "7-2 ～ 7-29"}, {"name": "场景课 · 前言与造句公式（7.1–7.2）", "modules": [{"id": "p1_7_1", "code": "7.1", "title": "前言", "articles": [{"title": "全文", "section": "", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"empty-note\">原始资料中本章节暂无正文内容。</p>"}], "id": "a_p1_7_1_01", "moduleId": "p1_7_1"}]}, {"id": "p1_7_2", "code": "7.2", "title": "基础语法- 造句公式", "articles": [{"title": "一、句子成分介绍", "section": "一、句子成分介绍", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>要掌握造句公式，需先明确句子的核心成分，常用成分为主语、谓语、宾语、定语、状语、系动词和表语，具体解析如下：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 主语（Subject）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>定义：句子描述的主体（对象），表明“谁” 或“什么”，通常为名词或代词（名词指人、物、 地点，代词指你、我、他）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>示例：The boy is reading.（句中“The boy” 是主语，描述对象为“男孩”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 谓语（Predicate）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>定义：说明主语的动作或状态，本质是动词，分两类：</p>"}], "id": "a_p1_7_2_01", "moduleId": "p1_7_2"}, {"title": "2.2 不及物动词：无需接宾语，或需借助介词接宾语，如“look”（不可说“look something”，", "section": "一、句子成分介绍", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>需说“look at something”）、“run”（I run every morning. 无需接宾语）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>示例：He runs fast.（句中“runs” 是谓语，说明主语“他” 的动作）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 宾语（Object）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>定义：动作的承受对象，仅跟在及物动词后，通常为名词或代词，回答“动作作用于谁/ 什么”。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>示例：I like apples.（句中“apples” 是宾语，是“like” 动作的承受对象）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 定语（Attribute）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>定义：修饰名词或代词，使描述更精确，常见充当形式及示例如下：</p>"}], "id": "a_p1_7_2_02", "moduleId": "p1_7_2"}, {"title": "4.1 形容词作定语：用形容词修饰名词，明确名词特征。示例：a beautiful flower（“beautiful” 修", "section": "一、句子成分介绍", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>饰“flower”，说明花的特征）；</p>"}], "id": "a_p1_7_2_03", "moduleId": "p1_7_2"}, {"title": "4.2 介词短语作定语：用介词短语修饰名词，明确名词位置、所属等。示例：the man in the car", "section": "一、句子成分介绍", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>（“in the car” 修饰“man”，说明男人的位置）；</p>"}], "id": "a_p1_7_2_04", "moduleId": "p1_7_2"}, {"title": "4.3 分词作定语：用动词的分词形式（现在分词/ 过去分词）修饰名词，明确名词动作状态。", "section": "一、句子成分介绍", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>示例：a running boy（“running” 修饰“boy”，说明男孩的动作状态）；</p>"}], "id": "a_p1_7_2_05", "moduleId": "p1_7_2"}, {"title": "4.4 定语从句作定语：用完整句子（定语从句）修饰名词（即先行词），补充详细信息。示例：", "section": "一、句子成分介绍", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>The girl who has long hair is my classmate.（“who has long hair” 是定语从句，修饰先行词 “the girl”；“先行词” 指被定语从句修饰的名词）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. 状语（Adverbial）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>定义：修饰动词、形容词、副词或整个句子，说明动作的时间、地点、方式、原因、目的等， 无需背诵术语，理解基本含义即可。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>示例：He runs fast in the morning.（句中“in the morning” 是状语，说明“runs” 的时间）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. 系动词（Linking Verb）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>定义：无实际动作意义，仅连接主语和表语，分两类：</p>"}], "id": "a_p1_7_2_06", "moduleId": "p1_7_2"}, {"title": "6.1 be 动词：包括am、is、are 及过去式was、were，用于连接主语和表语。示例：She is", "section": "一、句子成分介绍", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>happy.（“is” 连接主语“she” 和表语“happy”）；</p>"}], "id": "a_p1_7_2_07", "moduleId": "p1_7_2"}, {"title": "6.2 感官动词：包括look（看起来）、sound（听起来）、smell（闻起来）、taste（尝起来）、", "section": "一、句子成分介绍", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>feel（摸起来），通过感官感受连接主语和表语。示例：The soup tastes delicious.（“tastes” 连接主语“the soup” 和表语“delicious”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. 表语（Predicative）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>定义：跟在系动词后，说明主语的身份、性质或状态，仅与主语相关。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>示例：He is a student.（“a student” 是表语，说明主语“he” 的身份）；I am at home.（“at home”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>是介词短语作表语，说明主语“我” 的位置）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句子成分总结表</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>成分名称   英文缩写        核心定义            示例</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句子描述的主体，表明“谁” 或</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>主语     Subject（S）                             He runs fast.（He）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“什么”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>说明主语的动作、状态，展现</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>谓语     Predicate（V）                            He runs fast.（runs）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“做什么”“怎么样”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>及物动词的动作对象，回答</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>宾语     Object（O）                                                                  I love music.（music）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“作用于谁/ 什么”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>修饰动作的时间、地点、方式  He runs fast in the morning.（in 状语         Adverbial 等                                     the morning）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Linking Verb  连接主语和表语，无实际动作系动词                                              She is happy.（is）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（Link-V）  意义成分名称   英文缩写        核心定义            示例</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>跟在系动词后，说明主语身份、</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>表语    Predicative（P）                             She is happy.（happy）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>状态</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>修饰名词/ 代词，使描述更精</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>定语          Attribute                                a beautiful flower（beautiful）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>确</p>"}], "id": "a_p1_7_2_08", "moduleId": "p1_7_2"}, {"title": "二、造句公式", "section": "二、造句公式", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>明确句子成分后，可通过以下6 种基础公式快速造句：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 主谓（S + V）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>结构：主语+ 不及物动词（无需接宾语，句子即可完整）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>示例：The birds fly.（鸟儿飞翔）；Children play.（孩子们玩耍）；Time passes.（时间流逝， “time” 是第三人称单数，动词“pass” 变“passes”）；Hope remains.（希望犹存）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 主谓宾（S + V + O）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>结构：主语+ 及物动词+ 宾语（及物动词必须接宾语，句子才完整）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>示例：I eat an apple.（我吃一个苹果）；Students read books.（学生们读书）；He writes letters.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（他写信）；We play games.（我们玩游戏）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 主系表（S + Link-V + P）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>结构：主语+ 系动词+ 表语（表语说明主语的身份、性质或状态）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>示例：He is tall.（他很高，表语“tall” 说明主语的性质）；I am tired.（我很累，表语“tired” 说明主语的状态）；She is a teacher.（她是一名教师，表语“a teacher” 说明主语的身份）；The book is interesting.（这本书很有趣，表语“interesting” 说明主语的性质）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 主谓宾宾补（S + V + O + OC）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>结构：主语+ 及物动词+ 宾语+ 宾语补足语（OC，即“宾补”，补充说明宾语，使句子意义完整）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">宾补常见类型及示例：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>形容词作宾补：用形容词补充说明宾语的状态。示例：We made the classroom clean.（“clean”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>补充说明“classroom” 的状态，意为“我们使教室干净了”）；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>名词作宾补：用名词补充说明宾语的身份、名称等。示例1：They elected him president.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（“president” 补充说明“him” 的身份，意为“他们选他当总统”）；示例2：We call the dog Lucky.（“Lucky” 补充说明“the dog” 的名字，意为“我们叫这只狗Lucky”）；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>动词不定式作宾补：用“to do” 结构补充说明宾语要执行的动作。示例1：My mother asks me to study hard.（“to study hard” 补充说明“me” 要做的动作，意为“我妈妈让我努力学习”）；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>示例2：The teacher told us to be quiet.（“to be quiet” 补充说明“us” 要做的动作，意为“老师叫我们安静”）；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>现在分词作宾补：用“doing” 结构补充说明宾语正在进行的动作。示例1：I saw her dancing in the room.（“dancing in the room” 补充说明“her” 正在进行的动作，意为“我看到她在房间里跳舞”）；示例2：We heard him singing a song.（“singing a song” 补充说明“him” 正在进行的动作，意为“我们听到他在唱歌”）；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>过去分词作宾补：用“done” 结构补充说明宾语的被动状态。示例：You should keep the door locked.（“locked” 补充说明“the door” 的被动状态，意为“你应该让门保持锁着的状态”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. There be 句型（There be + S + 状语）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>结构：表示“某处有某人/ 某物”，“be” 动词的形式由后面名词的单复数决定，常搭配地点/ 时间状语。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">关键规则及示例：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>单复数规则：名词为单数时用“there is”，复数时用“there are”。示例1：There is a book on the desk.（桌子上有一本书）；示例2：There are some flowers in the garden.（花园里有一些花）；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>否定句规则：在“be” 动词后加“not”，且肯定句中的“some” 需改为“any”。示例1：There isn't a pen in the box.（盒子里没有一支钢笔）；示例2：There aren't any students in the classroom.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（教室里没有学生）；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>一般疑问句规则：将“be” 动词提到句首，其余部分不变；回答用“yes, there be” 或“no, there be not”。示例：问句：Is there a hospital near here？（这附近有一家医院吗？）；回答1：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Yes, there is.（是，有。）；回答2：No, there isn't.（不，没有。）；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>时态变化规则：描述过去场景用“there was/were”（单数用was，复数用were）；描述将来场景用“there will be” 或“there is going to be”。示例1（过去时）：There was a party in the school last night.（昨天晚上学校有一场派对）；示例2（过去时）：There were many people at the concert yesterday.（昨天音乐会上有很多人）；示例3（将来时）：There will be a football match tomorrow.（明天将有一场足球比赛）；示例4（将来时）：There is going to be a new supermarket in our neighborhood.（我们小区将有一家新的超市）；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>与情态动词连用规则：结构为“there + 情态动词（may/should 等）+ be + 名词+ 状语”。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>示例1：There may be a lot of traffic on the road.（路上可能交通拥堵）；示例2：There should be some water in the bottle.（瓶子里应该有一些水）；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>就近原则：当“be” 动词后接两个及以上并列名词时，“be” 的单复数由离它最近的名词决定。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>示例1：There is a pen and two books on the desk.（桌上有一只钢笔和两本书，“a pen” 离 “be” 更近，用“is”）；示例2：There are two books and a pen on the desk.（桌上有两本书和一只钢笔，“two books” 离“be” 更近，用“are”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6.  It 作形式主语（It is + adj. + (for sb.) + to do sth.）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>结构：“it” 无实际意义，仅作形式主语（避免句子“头重脚轻”），真实主语是后面的“to do sth.”， 常用于评价事情的性质（难易、重要性等）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">示例：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>基本用法（无特定对象）：It is difficult to learn a foreign language well.（学好一门外语很难）；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>基本用法（有特定对象）：It is easy for him to solve this math problem.（对他来说解决这套数学题很容易）；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>表达重要性：It is important for us to protect the environment.（对我们来说保护环境很重要）；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>表达必要性：It is necessary to get enough sleep every day.（每天获得充足的睡眠是必要的）。</p>"}], "id": "a_p1_7_2_09", "moduleId": "p1_7_2"}]}], "id": "p1", "file": "场景实战课_前言与造句公式_7,1_7,2.md", "title": "场景实战课 · 前言与造句公式", "range": "7.1 – 7.2"}, {"name": "场景课 · 日常场景（7.3–7.10）", "modules": [{"id": "p2_7_3", "code": "7.3", "title": "万能宝典- 朋友见面", "articles": [{"title": "1.1 重点名词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. café：咖啡馆</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. project：项目</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. hobby：爱好</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. oil painting：油画</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. movie：电影</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. science-fiction movie：科幻电影</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. exhibition：展览</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. art museum：美术馆</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_3_01", "moduleId": "p2_7_3"}, {"title": "1.2 重点动词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. be busy with：忙于</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. discover：发现</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. like：喜欢</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. watch：观看</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. suggest：建议</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. join：加入</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_3_02", "moduleId": "p2_7_3"}, {"title": "1.3 重点形容词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. excited：激动的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. happy：开心的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. cool：酷的；很棒的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. favorite：最喜欢的</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_3_03", "moduleId": "p2_7_3"}, {"title": "2.1 问候与询问近况", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 问候句型：Long time no see!（好久不见！）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 询问近况句型：How have you been?（你最近怎么样？），类似表达：How are things going?</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>/ How's everything? / What's going on?</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">3. 回应近况句型：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I've been + 形容词+ with sth（最近忙于某事），示例：I've been really busy lately with my work.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（我最近一直忙着工作。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I've been doing sth（最近一直在做某事），示例：I've been busy painting.（我最近一直在画画。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>反问对方：What about you?（你呢？）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_3_04", "moduleId": "p2_7_3"}, {"title": "2.2 分享爱好与回应", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 分享爱好句型：I've discovered a new hobby - 具体爱好. It's really interesting.（我发现了</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>一个新爱好——XX。真的很有趣。），示例：I've discovered a new hobby - oil painting. It's really interesting.（我发现了一个新爱好—— 油画。真的很有趣。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">2. 回应爱好句型：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>赞美：That sounds cool!（听起来很酷！）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>表达愿望与遗憾：I've always wanted to do sth, but never got the chance.（我一直想做某事， 但一直没机会。），示例：I've always wanted to try painting, but never got the chance.（我一直想试试画画，但一直没机会。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_3_05", "moduleId": "p2_7_3"}, {"title": "2.3 谈论喜好与推荐", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 询问喜好句型：What kind of... do you like?（你喜欢什么样的……？），示例：What kind of</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>movies do you like?（你喜欢什么样的电影？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 表达许久未做某事：I haven't done sth in ages /for a long time.（我好久没做某事了），示</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>例：I haven't watched a good movie in ages.（我好久没看一部好电影了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">3. 表达喜爱与推荐：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>喜爱：I'm really into...（我真的很喜欢……），示例：I'm really into science-fiction movies.（我真的很喜欢科幻电影。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>推荐电影：You should watch + 电影名.（你应该看看XX 电影。），示例：You should watch \"Interstellar\".（你应该看看《星际穿越》。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>表达“最喜爱之一”：It's one of my favorites /favorite + 复数名词（这是我最喜欢的…… 之一）， 示例：It's one of my favorite movies.（这是我最喜欢的电影之一。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>回应推荐：I'll definitely check it out!（我一定会去看看的！）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_3_06", "moduleId": "p2_7_3"}, {"title": "2.4 寻求建议与发出邀请", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">1. 表达不确定与寻求建议：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>不确定做什么：I'm not sure what to do + 时间（我不确定…… 做什么），示例：I'm not sure what to do this weekend.（我不确定这个周末做什么。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>不确定选择：I'm not sure which + 名词+ to do（我不确定该选哪一个…… 做），示例：I'm not sure which dress to buy.（我不确定该买哪条裙子。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>寻求建议：What do you suggest? / What's your suggestion?（你有什么建议？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 发出邀请句型：The... is having a... I was thinking of going. Do you want to join me?（某地</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>正在举办……，我正考虑去，你想和我一起吗？），示例：The art museum in the city center is having a special exhibition. I was thinking of going. Do you want to join me?（市中心的美术馆正在举办一个特别展览。我正考虑去，你想和我一起吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 回应邀请：That sounds like a great idea!（听起来是个好主意！）；补充“许久未去某地”：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I haven't been to + 地点+ for a long time.（我好久没去XX 地点了），示例：I haven't been to the art museum for a long time.（我好久没去美术馆了。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_3_07", "moduleId": "p2_7_3"}, {"title": "三、对话原文", "section": "三、对话原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>A：Long time no see! How have you been?（好久不见！你最近怎么样？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B：It's so good to see you! I've been really busy lately with my work. There's a big project at the company. What about you?（见到你真好！我最近一直忙着工作。公司有个大项目。你呢？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A：I've been busy painting. Recently, I've discovered a new hobby - oil painting. It's really interesting.（我一直在忙着画画。最近，我发现了一个新爱好—— 油画。真的很有趣。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B：Wow, that sounds cool. I've always wanted to try painting, but never got the chance. What kind of movies do you like? I haven't watched a good movie in ages.（哇，听起来很酷。我一直想试试画画，但一直没机会。你喜欢什么样的电影？我好久没看一部好电影了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A：I'm really into science-fiction movies. They always have such amazing ideas. You should watch \"Interstellar\". It's one of my favorites.（我真的很喜欢科幻电影。它们总是有很奇妙的想法。你应该看看《星际穿越》。这是我最喜欢的电影之一。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B：I'll definitely check it out. I'm not sure what to do this weekend. What do you suggest?（我一定会去看的。我不确定这个周末做什么。你有什么建议？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A：Well, the art museum in the city center is having a special exhibition. I was thinking of going. Do you want to join me?（嗯，市中心的美术馆正在举办一个特别展览。我正考虑去看看。你想和我一起吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B：That sounds like a great idea! I haven't been to the art museum for a long time.（听起来是个好主意！我好久没去美术馆了。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_3_08", "moduleId": "p2_7_3"}, {"title": "4.1 重点单词", "section": "四、单词句型固搭总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. lately [ˈleɪtli]：副词，最近</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. project [ˈprɒdʒekt]：名词，项目</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. hobby [ˈhɒbi]：名词，爱好</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. amazing [əˈmeɪzɪŋ]：形容词，令人惊叹的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. science fiction [ˈsaɪəns fɪkʃn]：名词短语，科幻（作品，如小说、电影等）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. definitely [ˈdefɪnətli]：副词，肯定地</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. suggest [səˈdʒest]：动词，建议</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. suggestion [səˈdʒestʃən]：名词，建议</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>9. exhibition [ˌeksɪˈbɪʃn]：名词，展览</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_3_09", "moduleId": "p2_7_3"}, {"title": "4.2 重点句型与固定搭配", "section": "四、单词句型固搭总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 问候与询问：Long time no see! / How have you been? / What about you?</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 描述近期活动：I've been + 形容词+ with sth / I've been doing sth / I'm really into... these</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>days</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 表达愿望与遗憾：I've always wanted to do sth, but never got the chance.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 询问喜好：What kind of... do you like?</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. 表达许久未做：I haven't done sth in ages /for a long time.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. 喜爱与推荐：I'm really into.../ You should.../ It's one of my favorites /favorite + 复数名词</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. 不确定与求助：I'm not sure what to do + 时间/ I'm not sure which + 名词+ to do / What</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>do you suggest?</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. 邀请与回应：The... is having a... I was thinking of going. Do you want to join me? / That</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>sounds like a great idea!</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>9. 日常回应：That sounds cool! / I'll definitely check it out!</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_3_10", "moduleId": "p2_7_3"}, {"title": "5.1 课后练习", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>单词及短语填空</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. I'm really ______ (热衷于) science fiction movies because they are full of imagination.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. There is a big ______ (项目) at my company, so I've been very busy recently.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3.  I haven't watched a good movie ______ (好久). I miss going to the cinema.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. She said she ______ (一直想) to try painting but never got the chance.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. The art museum is having a special ______ (展览). You should go and see it.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>用所给句型造句</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. I've been + 形容词+ with sth</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. I've been doing sth</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. I've always wanted to do sth</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4.  I haven't done something in ages</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. I'm not sure what/which to do...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句型转换</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 将“I haven't played basketball in ages.” 改为用“for a long time” 表达。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 将“I'm really into reading books.” 改为同义句，使用其他表达“喜欢” 的短语。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>根据情境完成对话</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 你的朋友问你“How have you been?”，你最近一直忙着学习英语，用所学句型回答。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 你想邀请朋友一起去看一场音乐会，你知道朋友喜欢音乐，用所学表达说明音乐会信息</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>并发出邀请。</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_3_11", "moduleId": "p2_7_3"}, {"title": "5.2 答案", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>单词及短语填空</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. into</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. project</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. in ages</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. had always wanted</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. exhibition</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>用所给句型造句</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. I've been really busy with my schoolwork these days.（我这些天一直忙着我的功课。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. I've been learning to play the guitar recently.（我最近一直在学弹吉他。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. I've always wanted to travel around the world.（我一直以来都想环游世界。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4.  I haven't gone swimming in ages.（我好久没有去游泳了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. I'm not sure which restaurant to choose for our dinner tonight.（我不确定今晚选哪家餐</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>厅吃晚餐。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句型转换</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1.  I haven't played basketball for a long time.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2.  I really like reading books. / I'm fond of reading books.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>根据情境完成对话</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. I've been really busy with learning English. There are so many new words and</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>grammar points to study. How about you?（我一直忙着学英语。有好多新单词和语法点要学。你呢？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. There is a really great concert in the City Theater this weekend. It's a performance by</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>a famous band. I was thinking of going. Do you want to join me? I know you like music.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（这个周末在城市剧院有一场非常棒的音乐会。是一个著名乐队的演出。我在考虑去看。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>你想和我一起吗？我知道你喜欢音乐。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_3_12", "moduleId": "p2_7_3"}]}, {"id": "p2_7_4", "code": "7.4", "title": "万能宝典- 接打电话", "articles": [{"title": "1.1 名词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. project（项目）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. schedule（日程）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. task（任务）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. meeting（会议）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. café（咖啡馆）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. office（办公室）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. detail（细节）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. voice-mail（语音邮件）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_4_01", "moduleId": "p2_7_4"}, {"title": "1.2 动词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. call（打电话）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. arrange（安排）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. discuss（讨论）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. work（工作；从事）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. handle（处理）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. reschedule（重新安排）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. leave（留下）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_4_02", "moduleId": "p2_7_4"}, {"title": "1.3 形容词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. busy（忙碌的）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. urgent（紧急的）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. quiet（安静的）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. comfortable（舒适的）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_4_03", "moduleId": "p2_7_4"}, {"title": "1.4 副词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. quite（相当）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. soon（很快）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_4_04", "moduleId": "p2_7_4"}, {"title": "二、情景对话拆解", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>围绕“接打电话约见讨论项目” 场景，提炼核心句型与用法，便于直接套用：</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_4_05", "moduleId": "p2_7_4"}, {"title": "2.1 电话开头自我介绍与问候", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 自我介绍句型：接/ 打电话时用“This is + 姓名” 表明身份，如“This is Tom.”（我是汤姆。）；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>可补充问候，如“Hello guys, this is Veronica. How are you?”（大家好，我是维罗妮卡。你们好吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 询问近况句型：用“What's up?”（怎么了？/ 有啥事吗？）回应或开启话题，如“Oh, Tom!</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm good. What's up?”（哦，汤姆！我挺好的。怎么了？）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_4_06", "moduleId": "p2_7_4"}, {"title": "2.2 表达约见目的与持续意愿", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 持续意愿句型：“I've been meaning to do sth”（从过去持续到现在想做某事），如“I've been</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>meaning to call you.”（我一直想给你打电话。）；拓展：I've been meaning to take a trip to the north.（我一直想去北方游玩。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">2. 约见相关句型：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>◦ 考虑约见：“I'm thinking of arranging an appointment with sb”（和某人约时间），如“I'm thinking of arranging an appointment with you.”（我在考虑和你约个时间。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>◦ 说明目的：“I want to discuss + 事物+ I'm working on”（聊正在做的事），如“I want to discuss a new project I'm working on.”（我想跟你聊聊我正在做的一个新项目。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 询问时间句型：“Are you available + 时间？”（XX 时间有空吗？），如“Are you available</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>this Wednesday?”（你这周三有空吗？）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_4_07", "moduleId": "p2_7_4"}, {"title": "2.3 沟通时间是否合适", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">1. 回应“时间不合适”：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>说明原因：“I'm quite busy with my current schedule. There are a lot of tasks to handle.”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（我最近日程满，有很多任务要处理。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>提议重排：“Maybe we can reschedule. What about + 时间？”（重新安排时间？XX 时间怎么样？），如“What about next Monday?”（下周一怎么样？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">2. 回应“时间可行”：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>初步确认：“+ 时间+ might work”（XX 时间应该可以），如“Next Monday might work.”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（下周一应该行。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>调整时间：“How about + 具体时间？”（XX 具体时间怎么样？），如“How about 2 p.m.?”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（下午两点怎么样？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>最终确认：“+ 时间+ is fine with me”（XX 时间我可以），如“2 p.m. is fine with me.”（下午两点我可以。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_4_08", "moduleId": "p2_7_4"}, {"title": "2.4 讨论见面地点与细节", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 询问地点：“Where do you want to meet?”（你想在哪里见面？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 提议地点：“How about + 地点？It's + 形容词，and we can + 动作+ 副词.”（XX 地点怎</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>么样？那里XX，我们能XX 地聊。），如“How about the café near your office? It's quiet, and we can talk comfortably.”（你办公室附近的咖啡馆怎么样？那儿安静，我们能舒服地聊。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 回应地点：“Sounds good. / Sounds great.”（听起来不错/ 很棒。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 询问细节：“By the way, is + 事物+ very urgent?”（顺便问下，XX 事紧急吗？），如“By</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>the way, is this project very urgent?”（顺便问下，这个项目紧急吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. 回应细节：“Well, kind of. There are some important details we need to go over as soon as</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>possible.”（有点。有些重要细节我们得尽快过一遍。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_4_09", "moduleId": "p2_7_4"}, {"title": "2.5 后续安排与承诺", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 承诺按时到：“Got it. I'll make sure to be there on time. If anything comes up, I'll let you</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>know.”（明白了。我会按时到，有变故会告诉你。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 请求留言：“If I'm not available when you call later, could you leave a voice-mail? I might be</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>in the middle of something.”（之后打电话我不在的话，能留个语音吗？我可能在忙。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 确认见面：“No problem. I will. So, see you + 时间+ at + 地点.”（没问题。那XX 时间XX</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>地点见。），回应“See you then.”（到时候见。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_4_10", "moduleId": "p2_7_4"}, {"title": "三、对话原文", "section": "三、对话原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>A：（电话铃响，接听）Hello?（喂？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B：Hi, Jerry! This is Tom. How are you doing?（嗨，杰瑞！我是汤姆。你最近咋样？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A：Oh, Tom! I'm good. What's up?（哦，汤姆！我挺好的。怎么了？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B：I've been meaning to call you. I'm thinking of arranging an appointment with you. I want to discuss a new project I'm working on. Are you available this Wednesday?（我一直想给你打电话。我在考虑和你约个时间，想跟你聊聊我正在做的一个新项目。你这周三有空吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A：Hmm, I'm not sure. I'm quite busy with my current schedule. There are a lot of tasks to handle. Maybe we can reschedule. What about next Monday?（嗯，我不太确定。我最近日程排得挺满，有好多任务要处理。要不我们重新安排个时间？下周一怎么样？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B：Next Monday might work. But I have a meeting in the morning. How about 2 p.m.?（下周一应该行。但我上午有个会，下午两点怎么样？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A：2 p.m. is fine with me. Where do you want to meet?（下午两点我可以。你想在哪儿见面？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B：How about the café near your office? It's quiet, and we can talk comfortably.（你办公室附近的咖啡馆怎么样？那儿很安静，我们能舒服地聊聊。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A：Sounds good. By the way, is this project very urgent?（听起来不错。顺便问下，这个项目很紧急吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B：Well, kind of. There are some important details we need to go over as soon as possible.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（嗯，有点吧。有些重要细节我们得尽快过一遍。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A：Got it. I'll make sure to be there on time. If anything comes up, I'll let you know.（明白了。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我会确保按时到。要是有什么变故，我会告诉你。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B：Great. Oh, and if I'm not available when you call later, could you leave a voice-mail? I might be in the middle of something.（好的。哦，要是你之后给我打电话我不在，能留个语音信息吗？我可能在忙别的事。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A：No problem. I will. So, see you next Monday at 2 p.m. at the café.（没问题，我会的。那下周一两点咖啡馆见。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B：See you then.（到时候见。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_4_11", "moduleId": "p2_7_4"}, {"title": "4.1 重点词汇", "section": "四、单词句型固搭总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. available：adj. 可获得的；有空的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. current：adj. 当前的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. urgent：adj. 紧急的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. mean：v. 意图；打算</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. handle：v. 处理</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. reschedule：v. 重新安排</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. voice-mail：n. 语音邮件</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. message：n. 信息</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_4_12", "moduleId": "p2_7_4"}, {"title": "4.2 高频句型与固定搭配", "section": "四、单词句型固搭总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. I've been meaning to do something：一直想做某事（现在完成进行时，表从过去持续到现</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>在的想法）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. take a trip to...：去…… 游玩</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. think of doing something：考虑做某事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. arrange an appointment with somebody：和某人约个时间</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. be busy with something：忙于某事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. There be...to do：有…… 要做</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. What about...?：…… 怎么样？（用于提建议）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. How about...?：…… 怎么样？（功能同What about...?）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>9. 某个时间点+ might work：某个时间应该可以</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>10.  ...is fine with me：…… 对我来说没问题</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>11. by the way (BETW)：顺便说/ 问下</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>12. as soon as possible：尽快</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>13. go over：浏览；过一遍</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>14. make sure to do：确保做某事</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>15. leave a voice-mail：留语音信息</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>16. leave a message：留言</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>17. in the middle of something：忙于某事</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_4_13", "moduleId": "p2_7_4"}, {"title": "4.3 实用句子", "section": "四、单词句型固搭总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. I've been meaning to call you.：我一直想给你打电话。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. Are you available this Wednesday?：你这周三有空吗？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 2 p.m. is fine with me.：下午两点我可以。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. Where do you want to meet?：你想在哪里见面？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. Sounds good /great.：听起来不错/ 很棒。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. Got it. I'll make sure to be there on time. If anything comes up, I'll let you know.：明白了。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我会按时到，有变故会告诉你。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. See you then.：到时候见。</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_4_14", "moduleId": "p2_7_4"}, {"title": "5.1 课后练习", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>一、单词及短语填空</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. I've been meaning to ______ (打电话) you about the party.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. Are you ______ (有空) tomorrow for a cup of coffee?</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. There are some important ______ (细节) we need to discuss.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. I'm quite busy with my ______ (当前的) project and have many tasks to handle.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5.  If anything ______ (出现)，let me know immediately.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>二、用所给句型造句</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. I'm thinking of doing sth</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. What/How about...?</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. sth is fine with me</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>三、根据情境完成对话</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>你和朋友约好见面讨论工作项目，你突然有事不能按时赴约，需重新安排时间。用所学表达完成以下对话：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You: Hi! I'm really sorry, but I have something urgent come up. I'm afraid I can't make it at the scheduled time. ______________? Friend: Oh, that's okay. But I'm quite busy next week. ______________ the week after next? You: ______________. That works for me. And where do you want to meet? Friend: ______________ the library near your home? It's quiet there.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You: Sounds good. I'll make sure to be there on time.</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_4_15", "moduleId": "p2_7_4"}, {"title": "5.2 答案", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>一、单词及短语填空</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. call</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. available</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. details</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. current</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. comes up</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>二、用所给句型造句</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. I'm thinking of taking a cooking class next month.（我在考虑下个月上一门烹饪课。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. How about going for a walk in the park this afternoon?（今天下午去公园散步怎么样？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. Watching a basketball game on TV tonight is fine with me.（今晚在电视上看篮球比赛我没</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>问题。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>三、根据情境完成对话</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You: Hi! I'm really sorry, but I have something urgent come up. I'm afraid I can't make it at the scheduled time. Maybe we can reschedule. What about next Friday? Friend: Oh, that's okay. But I'm quite busy next week. How about the week after next? You: That's fine with me. That works for me. And where do you want to meet? Friend: What about the library near your home? It's quiet there.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You: Sounds good. I'll make sure to be there on time.</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_4_16", "moduleId": "p2_7_4"}]}, {"id": "p2_7_5", "code": "7.5", "title": "万能宝典- 酒店入住", "articles": [{"title": "1.1 重点名词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. hotel：酒店</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. reception：前台</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. room：房间</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. reservation：预订</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. key：钥匙</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. credit card：信用卡</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. identification：身份证明（可缩写为ID）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. amenity：设施；便利设施</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>9. check-in：入住登记</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>10. check-out：退房</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_5_01", "moduleId": "p2_7_5"}, {"title": "1.2 重点动词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. book：预订</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. provide：提供</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. require：需要</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. request：请求；要求</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. offer：提供；提议</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. show：展示；指引</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_5_02", "moduleId": "p2_7_5"}, {"title": "1.3 重点形容词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. available：可获得的；有空的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. single：单人的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. double：双人的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. deluxe：豪华的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. comfortable：舒适的</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_5_03", "moduleId": "p2_7_5"}, {"title": "二、情景对话拆解", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>围绕“酒店入住” 流程，提炼核心句型与用法，便于直接套用：</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_5_04", "moduleId": "p2_7_5"}, {"title": "2.1 入住开头（确认预订）", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 客人表明预订：“Hi, I have a reservation.”（嗨，我有预订。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 前台询问姓名：“May I have your name, please?”（请问您贵姓？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 客人回应姓名：“It's [Guest's name].”（我是[客人姓名]。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 前台查询确认：“Just a moment, please. Let me check.”（请稍等，我查一下。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_5_05", "moduleId": "p2_7_5"}, {"title": "2.2 确认房间信息", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 前台确认预订详情：“We have your reservation for a double room for three nights. Is that</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>correct?”（我们查到您预订了一间双人房，住三晚，对吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">2. 客人确认/ 更正：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>确认：“Yes, that's right. / Exactly.”（对，没错。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>更正：“No, I actually want a king-sized bed room for 2 nights instead of a double room.”（不， 我其实想要一间特大号床房住两晚，不是双人房。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 前台询问吸烟偏好：“Would you like a smoking or non-smoking room?”（您想要吸烟房还</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>是无烟房？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 客人回应：“I'd prefer a non-smoking room, please.”（我想要一间无烟房，谢谢。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_5_06", "moduleId": "p2_7_5"}, {"title": "2.3 提供证件与押金", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 前台要求证件和信用卡：“Could you please provide some identification and a credit card for</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>the deposit?”（您能提供一下身份证明和信用卡用于押金支付吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 客人提供材料：“Sure. Here's my ID and credit card.”（当然。这是我的身份证和信用卡。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 客人询问现金支付：“Sorry, I didn't bring my credit card. Can I pay the deposit in cash?”（抱</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>歉，我没带信用卡。我能用现金付押金吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 前台确认并交钥匙：“Everything seems to be in order. Here's your room key. You're in room</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>[房间号].”（一切都没问题。这是您的房间钥匙，您在[房间号] 房。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_5_07", "moduleId": "p2_7_5"}, {"title": "2.4 询问房间设施", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 客人询问设施：“What amenities does the room have?”（房间里有哪些设施？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 前台回应：“The room is equipped with air conditioning, a TV, a mini-fridge, and free Wi-Fi.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>If you need anything else, you can always request it at the reception.”（房间配备有空调、 电视、小冰箱和免费无线网络。如果还需要其他东西，可随时向前台提出。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 客人回应：“Sounds good.”（听起来不错。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_5_08", "moduleId": "p2_7_5"}, {"title": "2.5 确认早餐信息", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 客人询问早餐：“Is there a breakfast included?”（含早餐吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 前台回应：“Yes, a buffet breakfast is included in the room rate. It's served from 7:00 a.m. to</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>10:00 a.m. in the restaurant on the first floor.”（是的，房价包含自助早餐，早上7 点到10 点在一楼餐厅供应。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_5_09", "moduleId": "p2_7_5"}, {"title": "2.6 询问房间位置", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 客人询问路线：“Can you show me how to get to my room?”（你能告诉我怎么去我的房间</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 前台指引：“The elevators are over there. Take the elevator to the fifth floor. When you get</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>out, turn right, and your room will be on the left-hand side.”（电梯在那边。乘电梯到五楼， 出电梯后右转，您的房间就在左手边。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 客人感谢与前台回应：“Thank you very much.”（非常感谢。）/ “You're welcome. I hope you</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>enjoy your stay with us.”（不客气，希望您住得愉快。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_5_10", "moduleId": "p2_7_5"}, {"title": "三、对话原文", "section": "三、对话原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>Guest：Hi. I have a reservation.（嗨，我有预订。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Receptionist：Good day, sir/madam. May I have your name, please?（您好，先生/ 女士。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>请问您贵姓？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Guest：It's [Guest's name].（我是[客人姓名]。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Receptionist：Just a moment, please. Let me check.（请稍等，我查一下。）（电脑查询）Ah, yes, Mr./Ms. [Guest's name]. We have your reservation for a double room for three nights. Is that correct?（啊，是的，[客人姓名] 先生/ 女士。我们查到您预订了一间双人房，住三晚， 对吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Guest：Yes, that's right.（对，没错。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Receptionist：Could you please provide some identification and a credit card for the deposit? （您能提供一下身份证明和信用卡用于押金支付吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Guest：Sure. Here's my ID and credit card.（当然。这是我的身份证和信用卡。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Receptionist：Thank you.（接过证件操作）Everything seems to be in order. Here's your room key. You're in room 508.（谢谢。一切都没问题。这是您的房间钥匙，您在508 房。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Guest：Thank you. What amenities does the room have?（谢谢。房间里有哪些设施？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Receptionist：The room is equipped with air-conditioning, a TV, a mini-fridge, and free Wi-Fi.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>If you need anything else, you can always request it at the reception.（房间配备有空调、电视、 小冰箱和免费无线网络。如果还需要其他任何东西，可随时向前台提出。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Guest：Sounds good. Is there a breakfast included?（听起来不错。含早餐吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Receptionist：Yes, a buffet breakfast is included in the room rate. It's served from 7:00 a.m. to 10:00 a.m. in the restaurant on the first floor.（是的，房价包含自助早餐。早餐时间是早上7 点到10 点，在一楼餐厅供应。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Guest：Great. Can you show me how to get to my room?（很好。你能告诉我怎么去我的房间吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Receptionist：Of course. The elevators are over there. Take the elevator to the fifth floor.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>When you get out, turn right, and your room will be on the left-hand side.（当然可以。电梯在那边。乘电梯到五楼，出电梯后右转，您的房间就在左手边。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Guest：Thank you very much.（非常感谢。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Receptionist：You're welcome. I hope you enjoy your stay with us.（不客气。希望您在我们酒店住得愉快。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_5_11", "moduleId": "p2_7_5"}, {"title": "四、单词句型固搭总结", "section": "四、单词句型固搭总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>词汇</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. receptionist：接待员；前台工作人员</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. guest：客人；旅客</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. reservation：预订（例：I have a reservation.）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. double room：双人房</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. queen-sized bed room：大号床房（适合情侣或单人）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. king-sized bed room：特大号床房（空间更宽敞）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. suite：套房（presidential suite：总统套房；deluxe suite：豪华套房）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. smoking room：吸烟房；non-smoking room：无烟房</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>9. identification（ID）：身份证明</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>10. credit card：信用卡；debit card：借记卡</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>11. deposit：押金</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>12. amenities：设施（四六级高频词）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>13. air conditioning：空调（不可数）；air conditioner：空调机（可数）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>14. buffet：自助餐（buffet breakfast：自助早餐）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>15. rate：价格；费用（room rate：房价）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>16. elevator：电梯（升降电梯）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>17. subway station：地铁站；parking lot：停车场</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>短语和固定搭配</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. be my guest：请自便</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. pay in cash：用现金支付</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. be equipped with：配备有……</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. in the room rate：包含在房费中</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. turn right：向右转；turn left：向左转</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. on the left-hand side：在左手边</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句型和表达</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. May I have your name, please?：请问您贵姓？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. Just a moment, please. Let me check.：请稍等，我查一下。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. We have your reservation for... Is that correct?：我们有您预订…… 的记录，对吗？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. Would you like a smoking or non-smoking room?：您想要吸烟房还是无烟房？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. I'd prefer a... room, please.：我想要一间…… 房，谢谢。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. Could you please provide... for the deposit?：您能提供…… 用于押金支付吗？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. Everything seems to be in order.：一切都没问题。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. What amenities does the room have?：房间有哪些设施？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>9. Is there... included?：…… 包含在内吗？（例：Is there a breakfast included?）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>10. Can you show me how to get to...?：你能告诉我怎么去…… 吗？</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_5_12", "moduleId": "p2_7_5"}, {"title": "五、课后练习及答案", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>单词填空</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. The ________ (客人) asked the receptionist about the hotel's amenities.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2.  I made a ________ (预订) for a room online yesterday.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. We need to pay a ________ (押金) when we check in at the hotel.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. The room is ________ (配备) with a TV and a fridge.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. There is a ________ (自助餐) breakfast in the hotel restaurant.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>短语翻译</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 无烟房</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 请稍等</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 向右转</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 包含在房费里</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句型运用</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 用“I have a reservation for...” 造句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 将“Is there a welcome drink included?” 改为陈述句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 用“Could you show me how to get to...” 写一句询问“去酒店附近公园” 的句子。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>情景对话补全</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A: Hi! I have a reservation.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B: Good day, sir. May I have your name please? A: My name is John.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B: Just a moment, please. Let me check. We have your reservation for a double room for two nights. Is that correct? A: Yes, ________. By the way, ________ (请问房间有空调吗)? B: Yes, the room is equipped with air conditioning.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A: Great. And ________ (我能用现金支付押金吗)? B: Sure, you can pay the deposit in cash.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A: Thank you. ________ (早餐包含在房费里吗)? B: Yes, a buffet breakfast is included in the room rate. It's served from 7 am to 10 am.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A: Sounds good. ________ (你能告诉我怎么去我的房间吗)? B: Of course. The elevators are over there. Take the elevator to the fourth floor. When you get out, turn left and your room will be on the right.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A: Thank you very much.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B: You're welcome. I hope you enjoy your stay with us.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>答案</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>单词填空</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. guest</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. reservation</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. deposit</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. equipped</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. buffet</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>短语翻译</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. non-smoking room</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. just a moment</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. turn right</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. in the room rate</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句型运用</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1.  I have a reservation for a single room for three nights.（我预订了一间单人房，住三晚。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. There is a welcome drink included.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. Could you show me how to get to the park near the hotel?（你能告诉我怎么去酒店附近的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>公园吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>情景对话补全</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. that's correct</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. does the room have air conditioning</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. can I pay the deposit in cash</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. is breakfast included in the room rate</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. could you show me how to get to my room</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_5_13", "moduleId": "p2_7_5"}]}, {"id": "p2_7_6", "code": "7.6", "title": "万能宝典- 超市购物", "articles": [{"title": "1.1 名词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. groceries：食品杂货</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. laundry pods：洗衣凝珠</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. household essentials：家庭必需品</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. aisle：过道</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. inventory：库存</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. denim：牛仔布</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. cashier：收银员</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. discount：折扣</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>9. fragrance：香味</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>10. stain：污渍</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_6_01", "moduleId": "p2_7_6"}, {"title": "1.2 动词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. locate：找出…… 的准确位置，定位</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. suggest：建议</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. remove：去除，移除</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. ring up：结账（把费用记入收银机）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. process：处理</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. search for：搜索，搜寻</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. offer：提供</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_6_02", "moduleId": "p2_7_6"}, {"title": "1.3 形容词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. upper：上面的，上部的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. freshly baked：新鲜烘焙的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. organic：有机的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. tough：顽固的（形容污渍）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. high-quality：高质量的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. casual：休闲的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. available：可获得的；有库存的</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_6_03", "moduleId": "p2_7_6"}, {"title": "1.4 副词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. indeed：的确，确实</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_6_04", "moduleId": "p2_7_6"}, {"title": "1.5 介词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. as for：至于</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_6_05", "moduleId": "p2_7_6"}, {"title": "二、情景对话拆解", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>围绕“超市购物” 流程，提炼核心句型与用法，便于直接套用：</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_6_06", "moduleId": "p2_7_6"}, {"title": "2.1 询问商品位置", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 开口求助：“Excuse me. I'm searching for... Where can I locate them?”（打扰一下，我在</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>找……，我在哪里可以找到它们？），示例：“Excuse me. I'm searching for low-fat milk and whole wheat bread. Where can I locate them?”（打扰一下，我在找低脂牛奶和全麦面包， 在哪里可以找到它们？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 店员指引：“... are in the + 区域/ 过道+ 位置描述. As for..., they are in the + 区域/ 过</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>道+ 位置补充.”（…… 在…… 区的…… 位置。至于……，它们在…… 过道的…… 位置）， 示例：“The low-fat milk is in the grocery section on the left. As for laundry pods, they are in the household essentials aisle.”（低脂牛奶在左边的食品杂货区。至于洗衣凝珠，它们在家庭必需品过道。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_6_07", "moduleId": "p2_7_6"}, {"title": "2.2 确认商品与购买", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 评价商品：“This... seems freshly baked/organic/comfortable.”（这个…… 看起来是新鲜烘</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>焙的/ 有机的/ 舒服的），示例：“This whole wheat bread seems freshly baked.”（这个全麦面包看起来是新鲜烘焙的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 确定购买：“I'll take + 数量+ 商品.”（我要……），示例：“I'll take two loaves of bread.”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（我要两条面包。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 询问品牌建议：“Which brand would you suggest for...?”（你建议哪个品牌用于……？），</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>示例：“Which brand would you suggest for removing tough stains?”（你建议哪个品牌去除顽固污渍？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 店员推荐：“This brand is highly recommended. It works great on... Plus, it's on special offer</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>now.”（这个品牌很值得推荐，它在…… 方面效果很好，而且现在在特价。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_6_08", "moduleId": "p2_7_6"}, {"title": "2.3 询问服装区与购买服装", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 询问服装区：“Is there a clothing section in this supermarket? Where is it?”（这家超市有服</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>装区吗？在哪里？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 店员回应：“Yes, indeed. The clothing section is on the upper floor. You can take the</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>elevator over there.”（是的，服装区在楼上，你可以坐那边的电梯。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 询问服装库存：“I'm looking for a pair of... in size + 尺码. Do you have any in stock?”（我</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>在找一条…… 码的……，有库存吗？），示例：“I'm looking for a pair of straight-leg jeans in size 30. Do you have any in stock?”（我在找一条30 码的直筒牛仔裤，有库存吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 询问价格：“They feel quite comfortable. How much are they?”（它们摸起来很舒服，多少</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>钱？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. 回应折扣与决定购买：“That's a good deal. I'll take them.”（这很划算，我要了。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_6_09", "moduleId": "p2_7_6"}, {"title": "2.4 结账付款", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 收银员告知金额：“Your total comes to + 金额after the discount. How would you like to</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>pay?”（打完折后总计……，你想怎么付款？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 选择付款方式：“I'll pay with my credit card/cash. Here you go.”（我用信用卡/ 现金付款，</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>给你。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_6_10", "moduleId": "p2_7_6"}, {"title": "三、对话原文", "section": "三、对话原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>Customer：Excuse me. I'm searching for some basic groceries like low-fat milk, whole wheat bread, and also need a pack of laundry pods. Where can I locate them?（打扰一下。我在找一些基本的食品杂货，比如低脂牛奶、全麦面包，还需要一包洗衣凝珠。我在哪里可以找到它们呢？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Shop Assistant：The low-fat milk and whole wheat bread are in the grocery section on the left side. As for the laundry pods, they are in the household essentials aisle, close to the dishwashing liquid area.（低脂牛奶和全麦面包在左边的食品杂货区。至于洗衣凝珠，它们在家庭必需品过道，靠近洗碗液区域。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Customer：Thanks a lot. Oh, I also plan to buy a pair of casual jeans. Is there a clothing section in this supermarket?（非常感谢。哦，我还打算买一条休闲牛仔裤。这家超市有服装区吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Shop Assistant：Yes, indeed. The clothing section is on the upper floor. You can take the elevator over there. They offer a good selection of jeans in different styles.（是的，确实有。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>服装区在楼上。你可以乘坐那边的电梯上去。他们有很多不同款式的牛仔裤可供选择。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（顾客前往食品杂货区）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Customer：This whole wheat bread seems freshly baked. I'll take two loaves. And I can't find the organic low-fat milk. Could you help me?（这个全麦面包看起来是新鲜烘焙的。我要两条。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>而且我找不到有机低脂牛奶。你能帮我一下吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Shop Assistant：Sure. It's right beside the regular low-fat milk. Here it is.（当然。它就在普通低脂牛奶的旁边。在这儿呢。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Customer：Got it. Now, I need a large pack of laundry pods. Which brand would you suggest for removing tough stains?（明白了。现在，我需要一大包洗衣凝珠。你建议用哪个品牌来去除顽固污渍呢？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Shop Assistant：This brand is highly recommended. It works great on stains and has a pleasant fragrance. Plus, it's on special offer now.（这个品牌非常值得推荐。它对污渍的清洁效果很好，而且香味宜人。另外，它现在正在特价促销。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Customer：Okay, I'll take it. Thanks for the advice. I'm off to the clothing section now.（好的， 我要这个。谢谢你的建议。我现在去服装区了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（顾客来到服装区）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Customer：Hi. I'm looking for a pair of straight-leg casual jeans in size 30. Do you have any in stock?（嗨。我在找一条30 码的直筒休闲牛仔裤。你们有货吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Shop Assistant：Let me check our inventory. Yes, we do have a few pairs available. Here you are. They are made of high-quality denim.（让我查一下库存。是的，我们确实有几条。给你。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>它们是由优质牛仔布制成的。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Customer：They feel quite comfortable. How much are they?（它们摸起来很舒服。多少钱呢？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Shop Assistant：They are $35 per pair. And if you buy today, you can get a 10% discount.（每条35 美元。而且如果你今天购买，可以享受九折优惠。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Customer：That's a good deal. I'll take them.（这很划算。我要了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（顾客来到收银台）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Cashier：Your total comes to $62.50 after the discount. How would you like to pay?（打完折后，你的总计是62.50 美元。你想怎么付款呢？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Customer：I'll pay with my credit card. Here you go.（我用信用卡付款。给你。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Cashier：Thank you.（谢谢。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_6_11", "moduleId": "p2_7_6"}, {"title": "4.1 核心词汇", "section": "四、单词句型固搭总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 食品杂货相关：groceries（食品杂货）、low-fat milk（低脂牛奶）、whole wheat bread（全</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>麦面包）、organic（有机的）、freshly baked（新鲜烘焙的）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 日用品相关：laundry pods（洗衣凝珠）、household essentials（家庭必需品）、dishwashing</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>liquid（洗碗液）、hand sanitizer（洗手液）、facial cleanser（洗面奶）、toilet paper（卫生纸）、body wash（沐浴露）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 服装相关：casual jeans（休闲牛仔裤）、straight-leg jeans（直筒牛仔裤）、denim（牛仔</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>布）、size 30（30 码）、high-quality（高质量的）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 购物流程相关：aisle（过道）、inventory（库存）、in stock（有库存）、cashier（收银员）、</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>discount（折扣）、on special offer（特价促销）、total（总计）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_6_12", "moduleId": "p2_7_6"}, {"title": "4.2 固定搭配", "section": "四、单词句型固搭总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. search for：搜索，搜寻（例：I'm searching for low-fat milk.）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. a pack of：一包……（例：a pack of laundry pods）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. in the + 区域+ section：在…… 区（例：in the grocery section）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. as for：至于（例：As for laundry pods, they are in the household essentials aisle.）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. in stock：有库存（例：Do you have any jeans in stock?）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. on special offer：特价促销（例：It's on special offer now.）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. pay with：用…… 付款（例：pay with credit card）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. pay in cash：用现金付款（例：I'll pay in cash.）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>9. a good deal：很划算（例：That's a good deal.）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_6_13", "moduleId": "p2_7_6"}, {"title": "4.3 高频句型", "section": "四、单词句型固搭总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. Excuse me. I'm searching for... Where can I locate them?（打扰一下，我在找……，在哪</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>里可以找到它们？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2.  ... are in the + 区域+ on the left/right.（…… 在…… 区的左边/ 右边。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. This... seems + 形容词. I'll take + 数量.（这个…… 看起来……，我要……。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. Which brand would you suggest for...?（你建议哪个品牌用于……？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. This brand is highly recommended. It works great on...（这个品牌很值得推荐，它在…… 方</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>面效果很好。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. I'm looking for a pair of... in size + 尺码. Do you have any in stock?（我在找…… 码</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>的……，有库存吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. How much are they?（它们多少钱？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. Your total comes to + 金额. How would you like to pay?（总计……，你想怎么付款？）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_6_14", "moduleId": "p2_7_6"}, {"title": "5.1 课后练习", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>一、单词填空</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1.  I need to buy some new ______ (食品杂货) this weekend, like eggs and tomatoes.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. My mother uses that brand of ______ (洗衣凝珠) because it removes tough stains well.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. The ______ (牛仔布) jeans feel comfortable and are durable.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. We don't have this item ______ (有库存) now; you can come back next week.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. The cashier said my ______ (总计) was $50 after the discount.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>二、用所给固定搭配造句</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. search for</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. a pack of</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. on special offer</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. pay with</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. in stock</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>三、句型仿写</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 仿照“Excuse me. I'm searching for low-fat milk. Where can I locate it?” ，描述“寻找笔记</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>本和钢笔”。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 仿照“This brand is highly recommended. It works great on stains.” ，推荐“一款洗发水</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（shampoo），说它让头发柔顺”。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 仿照“I'm looking for a pair of shoes in size 38. Do you have any in stock?” ，询问“32 码</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>的休闲鞋” 库存。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 仿照“Your total comes to $45. How would you like to pay?” ，描述“总计80 元，询问付</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>款方式”。</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_6_15", "moduleId": "p2_7_6"}, {"title": "5.2 答案", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>一、单词填空</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. groceries</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. laundry pods</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. denim</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. in stock</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. total</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>二、用所给固定搭配造句</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. She is searching for her lost phone in the living room.（她在客厅里找丢失的手机。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. He bought a pack of cookies for his little sister.（他给妹妹买了一包饼干。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. These apples are on special offer; they are only $2 per kilo.（这些苹果在特价，每公斤只</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>要2 美元。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. Most people pay with their phones when shopping now.（现在大多数人购物时用手机付</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>款。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. The store has this type of water bottle in stock.（这家店有这种水瓶的库存。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>三、句型仿写</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. Excuse me. I'm searching for notebooks and pens. Where can I locate them?（打扰一下，</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我在找笔记本和钢笔，在哪里可以找到它们？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. This shampoo is highly recommended. It works great on making hair smooth.（这款洗发水</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>很值得推荐，它在让头发柔顺方面效果很好。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. I'm looking for a pair of casual shoes in size 32. Do you have any in stock?（我在找32 码</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>的休闲鞋，你们有库存吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. Your total comes to 80 yuan. How would you like to pay?（你的总计是80 元，你想怎么</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>付款？）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_6_16", "moduleId": "p2_7_6"}]}, {"id": "p2_7_7", "code": "7.7", "title": "万能宝典- 医院看病", "articles": [{"title": "1.1 名词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. Patient /ˈpeɪʃnt/（病人）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. Doctor /ˈdɒktə(r)/（医生）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. Headache /ˈhedeɪk/（头痛）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. Throat /θrəʊt/（喉咙）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. Fever /ˈfiːvə(r)/（发烧）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. Infection /ɪnˈfekʃn/（感染）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. Medicine /ˈmedsn; ˈmedɪsn/（药）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. Diet /ˈdaɪət/（饮食）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>9. Porridge /ˈpɒrɪdʒ/（粥）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>10. Symptom /ˈsɪmptəm/（症状）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>11. Thermometer /θəˈmɒmɪtə(r)/（体温计）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>12. Prescription /prɪˈskrɪpʃn/（处方）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>13. Rash /ræʃ/（皮疹）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>14. Nausea /ˈnɔːziə/（恶心）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>15. Dizziness /ˈdɪzinəs/（头晕）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>16. Antibiotic /ˌæntibaɪˈɒtɪk/（抗生素）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>17. Ointment /ˈɔɪntmənt/（药膏）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>18. Drip /drɪp/（输液）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>19. Fracture /ˈfræktʃə(r)/（骨折）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>20. Swelling /ˈswelɪŋ/（肿胀）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_7_01", "moduleId": "p2_7_7"}, {"title": "1.2 动词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. Check /tʃek/（检查）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. Prescribe /prɪˈskraɪb/（开（药））</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. Reduce /rɪˈdjuːs; rɪˈduːs/（降低，减少）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. Soothe /suːð/（舒缓，减轻）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. Avoid /əˈvɔɪd/（避免）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. Recover /rɪˈkʌvə(r)/（恢复）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. Improve /ɪmˈpruːv/（改善）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. Itch /ɪtʃ/（发痒）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>9. Apply /əˈplaɪ/（涂抹）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>10. Relieve /rɪˈliːv/（缓解）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_7_02", "moduleId": "p2_7_7"}, {"title": "1.3 形容词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. Inflamed /ɪnˈfleɪmd/（发炎的）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. Viral /ˈvaɪrəl/（病毒的）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. Spicy /ˈspaɪsi/（辛辣的）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. Oily /ˈɔɪli/（油腻的）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. Sweet /swiːt/（甜的）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. Light /laɪt/（清淡的）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. Feverish /ˈfiːvərɪʃ/（发烧的）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. Sore /sɔː(r)/（疼痛的）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>9. Allergic /əˈlɜːdʒɪk/（过敏的）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_7_03", "moduleId": "p2_7_7"}, {"title": "1.4 副词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. Immediately /ɪˈmiːdiətli/（立即，马上）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. Slightly /ˈslaɪtli/（轻微地）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_7_04", "moduleId": "p2_7_7"}, {"title": "二、情景对话拆解", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>围绕“医院看病” 流程，提炼核心句型与用法，便于直接套用：</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_7_05", "moduleId": "p2_7_7"}, {"title": "2.1 表达身体不适", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">1. 常用句型：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm really not feeling well.（我真的很不舒服。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm not feeling myself.（我感觉不对劲。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I feel sick.（我觉得难受。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm under the weather.（我身体不舒服。）（口语常用）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_7_06", "moduleId": "p2_7_7"}, {"title": "2.2 描述症状", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">1. 基础病症描述：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>头疼：I've had a headache for days.（我头疼好几天了。）（现在完成时，表持续状态）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>喉咙疼：My throat is so sore that it hurts when I talk.（我喉咙疼得厉害，说话都疼。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>发烧：I also feel feverish.（我还感觉有点发烧。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>其他症状：I've had a stomachache for hours.（我肚子疼好几个小时了。）/ I have a rash on my arm.（我胳膊上有皮疹。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_7_07", "moduleId": "p2_7_7"}, {"title": "2.3 医生检查与诊断", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">1. 医生检查：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Let me check. Open your mouth and say \"Ah\".（我检查一下。张开嘴说“啊”。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Let me take your temperature.（我量一下你的体温。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Your throat is quite inflamed.（你的喉咙炎症很严重。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You have a fever of 38.3 degrees Celsius.（你发烧了，38.3 摄氏度。）（华氏度：degrees Fahrenheit）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">2. 病情诊断：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It's likely a viral infection.（很可能是病毒感染。）（It's likely + 名词/ 从句，表推测）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>If you feel pain in your leg after exercise, it's likely a muscle strain.（运动后腿疼，很可能是肌肉拉伤。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_7_08", "moduleId": "p2_7_7"}, {"title": "2.4 医嘱与治疗", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">1. 开药与用药：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'll prescribe some medicine. This is for reducing the fever, and these are for soothing your throat.（我给你开点药。这个是退烧药，这些是舒缓喉咙的药。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Take the fever medicine every four to six hours if needed.（退烧药如果需要的话每4-6 小时吃一次。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Take the throat medicine three times a day after meals.（喉咙药一天三次，饭后服用。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">2. 饮食与休息建议：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Avoid spicy, oily, and sweet foods.（避免吃辛辣、油腻和甜食。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Drink more warm water and have light food like porridge.（多喝温水，吃粥这类清淡的食物。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Get plenty of rest. That will help you recover faster.（保证充足的休息，这能帮你更快康复。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">3. 其他治疗建议：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Apply the ointment to the wound three times a day.（药膏每天涂在伤口上三次。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You need to get a drip to replenish fluids.（你需要打点滴补充体液。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Take an antibiotic for your infection.（感染需要服用抗生素。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_7_09", "moduleId": "p2_7_7"}, {"title": "2.5 询问与回应恢复情况", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">1. 询问恢复时间：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>How long will it take to get better?（多久能好呢？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>How long will it take to recover from the operation?（手术后多久能恢复？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">2. 医生回应：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Usually, you'll start feeling better in three days or so.（通常大概3 天左右你就会开始好转。）（in + 时间，表“多久后”；or so 表“左右”）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">3. 异常情况处理：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>If your symptoms don't improve or get worse, come back immediately.（如果症状没有改善或加重，马上回来。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>If you're allergic to this medicine, tell me immediately.（如果对这种药过敏，立刻告诉我。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_7_10", "moduleId": "p2_7_7"}, {"title": "三、对话原文", "section": "三、对话原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>Patient (P): Good morning, doctor. I'm really not feeling well. I've had a headache for days, and my throat is so sore that it hurts when I talk. I also feel feverish.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（病人：早上好，医生。我真的很不舒服。我头疼好几天了，喉咙疼得厉害，说话都疼。我还感觉有点发烧。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Doctor (D): Good morning. Don't worry. Let me check. Open your mouth and say \"Ah\".</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>(Checks the patient's throat) Your throat is quite inflamed. Now, let me take your temperature.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>(Uses a thermometer) You have a fever of 38.3 degrees Celsius.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（医生：早上好。别担心。我检查一下。张开嘴说“啊”。（检查喉咙）你的喉咙炎症很严重。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>现在我量一下你的体温。（用体温计）你发烧了，38.3 摄氏度。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>P: Doctor, is it serious? I'm a bit scared.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（病人：医生，这严重吗？我有点害怕。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>D: It's likely a viral infection. I'll prescribe some medicine. This is for reducing the fever, and these are for soothing your throat. Take the fever medicine every four to six hours if needed, and the throat medicine three times a day after meals.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（医生：很可能是病毒感染。我给你开点药。这个是退烧药，需要的话每4-6 小时吃一次；这些是舒缓喉咙的药，一天三次，饭后服用。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>P: Okay. Do I need to pay attention to my diet? （病人：好的。我需要注意饮食吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>D: Yes. Avoid spicy, oily, and sweet foods. Drink more warm water and have light food like porridge. Also, get plenty of rest. That will help you recover faster.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（医生：是的。避免辛辣、油腻和甜食。多喝温水，吃粥这类清淡的食物。另外保证充足的休息，这能帮你更快康复。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>P: I see. How long will it take to get better? （病人：我明白了。多久能好呢？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>D: Usually, you'll start feeling better in three days or so. But if your symptoms don't improve or get worse, come back immediately.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（医生：通常大概3 天左右你就会开始好转。但如果症状没有改善或加重，马上回来。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>P: Thank you, doctor. I'll follow your advice.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（病人：谢谢你，医生。我会照您说的做。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>D: You're welcome. Take care and get well soon.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（医生：不客气。照顾好自己，早日康复。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_7_11", "moduleId": "p2_7_7"}, {"title": "4.1 常用词汇", "section": "四、单词句型固搭总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 病症类：headache（头痛）、stomachache（腹痛）、sore throat（喉咙痛）、fever（发</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>烧）、rash（皮疹）、nausea（恶心）、dizziness（头晕）、viral infection（病毒感染）、 muscle strain（肌肉拉伤）、fracture（骨折）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 治疗类：medicine（药）、antibiotic（抗生素）、ointment（药膏）、drip（输液）、prescription</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（处方）、thermometer（体温计）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 状态类：inflamed（发炎的）、feverish（发烧的）、sore（疼痛的）、allergic（过敏的）、</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>light（清淡的）、spicy（辛辣的）、oily（油腻的）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_7_12", "moduleId": "p2_7_7"}, {"title": "4.2 高频搭配", "section": "四、单词句型固搭总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 描述病症：have a headache/stomachache/cold（患头痛/ 腹痛/ 感冒）、have a rash on...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（…… 部位有皮疹）、feel feverish/sick/dizzy（感觉发烧/ 难受/ 头晕）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 医生操作：take one's temperature（量体温）、prescribe medicine（开药）、apply ointment</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>to...（在…… 涂药膏）、get a drip（打点滴）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 医嘱建议：avoid spicy/oily/sweet foods（避免辛辣/ 油腻/ 甜食）、have light food（吃</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>清淡食物）、get plenty of rest（保证充足休息）、follow the advice（遵医嘱）、relieve pain （缓解疼痛）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 时间表达：for days/hours（持续几天/ 几小时）、in three days or so（大概3 天后）、</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>every four to six hours（每4-6 小时）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_7_13", "moduleId": "p2_7_7"}, {"title": "4.3 核心句型", "section": "四、单词句型固搭总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 表达不适：I'm not feeling well. / I'm under the weather.（我身体不舒服。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 描述持续症状：I've had a [病症] for [时间].（我[病症] 持续[时间] 了。）（现在完成时）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 表推测：It's likely a [诊断结果].（很可能是[诊断结果]。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 询问时间：How long will it take to [恢复/ 康复]?（[恢复/ 康复] 需要多久？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. 医嘱：Avoid [事物]. / Do more/less of [事物].（避免[事物]。/ 多/ 少做[事物]。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. 异常处理：If [情况], do [动作] immediately.（如果[情况]，立刻做[动作]。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_7_14", "moduleId": "p2_7_7"}, {"title": "4.4 补充实用表达", "section": "四、单词句型固搭总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 缓解不适：Is there anything I can do to relieve the itch/pain?（有什么能缓解瘙痒/ 疼痛</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 过敏提示：I'm allergic to this kind of medicine.（我对这种药过敏。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 检查请求：I think I might have a fracture. Can you take a look?（我可能骨折了，能帮我看</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>看吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 康复祝愿：Take care and get well soon.（照顾好自己，早日康复。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_7_15", "moduleId": "p2_7_7"}, {"title": "5.1 单词填空", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. I've been feeling ______ (不舒服的) for two days—I think I have a cold.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. The doctor said my throat is ______ (发炎的) and told me to drink more warm water.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. You should ______ (涂抹) this ointment to your wound three times a day.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. She has a ______ (皮疹) on her arm after using the new lotion.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. The nurse will ______ (量) your temperature before the doctor sees you.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6.  If you're ______ (过敏的) to seafood, you must avoid eating it.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. The doctor ______ (开) some antibiotics for my bacterial infection.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. You need to get plenty of rest to ______ (恢复) from the fever.</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_7_16", "moduleId": "p2_7_7"}, {"title": "5.2 固定搭配造句", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. have a headache</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. take one's temperature</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. apply ointment to</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. get plenty of rest</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. in three days or so</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. avoid doing sth.</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_7_17", "moduleId": "p2_7_7"}, {"title": "5.3 句型仿写", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 仿照“I've had a headache for days and my throat is sore.”，用“I've had... and...” 描述两</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>种持续症状。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 仿照“It's likely a viral infection.”，用“It's likely...” 推测“运动后膝盖疼” 的原因。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 仿照“How long will it take to get better?”，询问“骨折康复” 需要多久。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 仿照“Avoid spicy foods and have more warm water.”，给“咳嗽患者” 提一条饮食建议。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>答案</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_7_18", "moduleId": "p2_7_7"}, {"title": "5.1 单词填空", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. uncomfortable / under the weather</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. inflamed</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. apply</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. rash</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. take</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. allergic</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. prescribed</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. recover</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_7_19", "moduleId": "p2_7_7"}, {"title": "5.2 固定搭配造句（示例）", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1.  I have a headache, so I plan to lie down for 30 minutes.（我头疼，打算躺30 分钟。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. The doctor asked the nurse to take my temperature first.（医生让护士先给我量体温。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. You should apply this ointment to the rash gently.（你要轻轻把药膏涂在皮疹上。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. My mom told me to get plenty of rest after the fever.（妈妈让我发烧后多休息。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. The doctor said I'll be able to go to work in three days or so.（医生说我大概3 天后能上</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>班。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. You should avoid staying up late when you're sick.（生病时要避免熬夜。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_7_20", "moduleId": "p2_7_7"}, {"title": "5.3 句型仿写（示例）", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. I've had a cough for a week and my nose is always stuffy.（我咳嗽一周了，而且鼻子总不</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>通气。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2.  It's likely a knee strain if you feel pain after running.（跑步后膝盖疼，很可能是膝盖拉伤。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. How long will it take to recover from a fracture?（骨折康复需要多久？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. Avoid cold drinks and have more hot soup when you have a cough.（咳嗽时避免喝冷饮，</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>多喝热汤。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_7_21", "moduleId": "p2_7_7"}]}, {"id": "p2_7_8", "code": "7.8", "title": "万能宝典- 谈论天气", "articles": [{"title": "1.1 名词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. weather（天气）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. temperature（温度）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. forecast（预报）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. picnic（野餐）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. museum（博物馆）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. wind（风）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. season（季节）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. autumn（秋天）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>9. spring（春天）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>10. charm（魅力）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_8_01", "moduleId": "p2_7_8"}, {"title": "1.2 动词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. prefer（更喜欢）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. forecast（预报）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. drop（下降；掉落）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. change（改变）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. plan（计划）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_8_02", "moduleId": "p2_7_8"}, {"title": "1.3 形容词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. beautiful（美丽的）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. sunny（阳光明媚的）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. cloudy（多云的）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. windy（有风的）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. cold（寒冷的）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. thicker（更厚的，thick 的比较级）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. cool（凉爽的）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. comfortable（舒适的）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>9. warm（温暖的）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>10. overcast（阴天的）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>11. foggy（有雾的）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>12. snowy（下雪的）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>13. hot（炎热的）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_8_03", "moduleId": "p2_7_8"}, {"title": "1.4 副词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. exactly（确实地，确切地）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. instead（代替，反而）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. a bit（一点儿）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_8_04", "moduleId": "p2_7_8"}, {"title": "1.5 词组/ 短语", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. weather forecast（天气预报）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. go for a picnic（去野餐）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. study abroad/go abroad（出国留学/ 出国）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. come back to life（复苏，恢复生机）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. change into（变成）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_8_05", "moduleId": "p2_7_8"}, {"title": "二、情景对话拆解", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>围绕“谈论天气” 的日常场景，提炼核心句型与用法，便于直接套用：</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_8_06", "moduleId": "p2_7_8"}, {"title": "2.1 开启天气话题（赞美/ 描述天气）", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 感叹天气好：What a beautiful day, isn't it?（今天天气真好，不是吗？）（What a + 形容</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>词+ 名词，表感叹）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 描述天气状态：It's really sunny.（阳光真明媚。）/ The temperature is just right, not too hot</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>and not too cold.（温度刚刚好，既不太热也不太冷。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 回应赞同：Exactly.（没错。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_8_07", "moduleId": "p2_7_8"}, {"title": "2.2 询问与回应天气预报", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 询问未来天气：Do you know what the weather forecast says for the next few days?（你知</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>道接下来几天的天气预报怎么说吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">2. 回应未来天气：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>多云/ 下雨：I heard it's going to be cloudy tomorrow, and there might be a bit of rain in the afternoon.（我听说明天多云，下午可能下点雨。）（It's going to be + 天气形容词，表未来天气）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>有风/ 降温：The forecast says it will be windy, with the temperature dropping a bit.（预报说会有风，气温会稍降。）（with + 宾语+ 现在分词，表伴随状态）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_8_08", "moduleId": "p2_7_8"}, {"title": "2.3 应对坏天气（调整计划/ 提建议）", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 表达计划受阻：Oh, that's too bad. I was planning to go for a picnic.（哦，太糟糕了。我本</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>来打算去野餐的。）（I was planning to do sth，表过去计划未实现）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 提替代建议：You could change your plan and go to the museum instead. It's a good place</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>to go on a rainy day.（你可以改计划去博物馆，下雨天去那儿不错。）（on + 天气类名词， 表“在…… 天气”）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 准备应对降温：Sounds cold. I'll need to wear a thicker coat.（听起来挺冷的，我得穿件厚</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>外套。）/ It's better to be prepared.（最好做好准备。）（It's better to do sth，表建议）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_8_09", "moduleId": "p2_7_8"}, {"title": "2.4 讨论季节偏好", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 询问喜好：Which season do you like the most?（你最喜欢哪个季节？）（Which + 事物+</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>do you like the most?，询问偏好）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">2. 描述喜欢的季节：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>喜欢秋天：I really like autumn. The weather is usually cool and comfortable, and the leaves change into beautiful colors.（我很喜欢秋天，天气凉爽舒适，树叶会变成漂亮的颜色。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>喜欢春天：I prefer spring. It's warm, and everything comes back to life.（我更喜欢春天，天气暖和，万物复苏。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 总结观点：Each season has its own charm.（每个季节都有独特的魅力。）（Each + 事物</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>+ has its own + 名词，表“每个…… 都有自己的……”）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_8_10", "moduleId": "p2_7_8"}, {"title": "三、对话原文", "section": "三、对话原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>A：（两人路上相遇）Hey! What a beautiful day, isn't it?（嘿！今天天气真好，不是吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B：Yeah, it's really sunny. The sunshine makes me feel so good.（是啊，阳光明媚。这阳光让我感觉特别好。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A：Exactly. The temperature is just right, not too hot and not too cold.（没错。温度刚刚好， 既不太热也不太冷。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B：Do you know what the weather forecast says for the next few days?（你知道接下来几天的天气预报怎么说吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A：I heard it's going to be cloudy tomorrow, and there might be a bit of rain in the afternoon.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（我听说明天会是多云天气，下午可能会下点雨。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B：Oh, that's too bad. I was planning to go for a picnic.（哦，那太糟糕了。我本来打算去野餐呢。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A：Well, you could change your plan and go to the museum instead. It's a good place to go on a rainy day.（嗯，你可以改变计划，去博物馆。下雨天去那儿不错。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B：That's a good idea. How about the day after tomorrow?（这主意不错。后天天气怎么样？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A：The forecast says it will be windy, with the temperature dropping a bit.（预报说会有风，气温会稍微下降一点。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B：Sounds cold. I'll need to wear a thicker coat.（听起来挺冷的。我得穿件厚点的外套。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A：Yeah, it's better to be prepared. Which season do you like the most?（是啊，最好做好准备。你最喜欢哪个季节？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B：I really like autumn. The weather is usually cool and comfortable, and the leaves change into beautiful colors.（我很喜欢秋天。天气通常凉爽舒适，树叶也会变成漂亮的颜色。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A：Autumn is nice. But I prefer spring. It's warm, and everything comes back to life.（秋天确实不错。但我更喜欢春天。天气暖和，万物复苏。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B：True. Each season has its own charm.（没错。每个季节都有它独特的魅力。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_8_11", "moduleId": "p2_7_8"}, {"title": "4.1 常用词汇", "section": "四、单词句型固搭总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 天气类：sunny（阳光明媚的）、cloudy（多云的）、windy（有风的）、rainy（下雨的）、</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>snowy（下雪的）、foggy（有雾的）、cool（凉爽的）、warm（温暖的）、cold（寒冷的）、 overcast（阴天的）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 动作/ 状态类：drop（下降）、change（改变）、plan（计划）、prefer（更喜欢）、forecast</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（预报）、prepare（准备）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 名词类：temperature（温度）、season（季节）、picnic（野餐）、museum（博物馆）、</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>charm（魅力）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_8_12", "moduleId": "p2_7_8"}, {"title": "4.2 高频搭配", "section": "四、单词句型固搭总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. go for a picnic：去野餐（例：We will go for a picnic in the countryside next Saturday. 我</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>们下周六要去郊外野餐。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. study abroad/go abroad：出国留学/ 出国（例：He wants to study abroad to experience</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>different cultures. 他想出国留学，体验不同文化。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. change into：变成（例：The leaves change into red and yellow in autumn. 秋天树叶变成</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>红色和黄色。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. come back to life：复苏，恢复生机（例：The garden comes back to life in spring with all the</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>flowers blooming. 春天花开了，花园恢复了生机。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_8_13", "moduleId": "p2_7_8"}, {"title": "4.3 核心句型", "section": "四、单词句型固搭总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 感叹天气：What a + 形容词+ 名词+, isn't it?（例：What a lovely day, isn't it? 今天天气</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>真宜人，不是吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 表建议：It's + 形容词+ to do sth（例：It's important to check the weather forecast before</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>going out. 出门前查天气预报很重要。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 过去计划：I was planning to do sth（例：I was planning to visit my friend, but I got busy. 我</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>本来打算去看朋友，但是太忙了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 询问预报：Do you know what the weather forecast says for...?（例：Do you know what the</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>weather forecast says for the weekend? 你知道周末的天气预报怎么说吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. 未来天气：It's going to be + 天气形容词（例：It's going to be rainy this evening. 今晚要下</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>雨。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. 伴随状态：with + 宾语+ 现在分词（例：She walked home with the rain falling. 她冒雨走</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>回了家。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. 询问偏好：Which + 事物+ do you like the most?（例：Which season do you like the most,</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>spring or autumn? 你最喜欢哪个季节，春天还是秋天？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. 总结观点：Each + 事物+ has its own + 名词（例：Each city has its own history. 每个城</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>市都有自己的历史。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_8_14", "moduleId": "p2_7_8"}, {"title": "4.4 天气相关介词搭配", "section": "四、单词句型固搭总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. on a sunny day（在晴天）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. on a snowy day（在下雪天）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. on a windy day（在刮风天）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. on a cloudy/overcast day（在多云/ 阴天）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. on a foggy day（在雾天）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. on a cold/hot day（在寒冷/ 炎热的日子）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. on a rainy night（在下雨的晚上）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_8_15", "moduleId": "p2_7_8"}, {"title": "5.1 填词练习", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. What a ______ (美妙的) day! The sun is shining brightly.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. The weather forecast says it will be ______ (有风的) tomorrow. Remember to wear warm</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>clothes.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3.  I was ______ (计划) to go for a picnic, but the upcoming rain ruins my plan.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. The ______ (温度) is just right today, neither too hot nor too cold.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. Each season has its own ______ (魅力). I really love the colorful leaves in autumn.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. You should go to the ______ (博物馆) on a rainy day. It's a great place to kill time.</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_8_16", "moduleId": "p2_7_8"}, {"title": "5.2 用固定搭配造句", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. go for a picnic</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. study abroad/go abroad</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. change into</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. come back to life</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_8_17", "moduleId": "p2_7_8"}, {"title": "5.3 用句型造句", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. What a + 形容词+ 名词+, isn't it?</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2.  It's + 形容词+ to do something</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3.  I was planning to do something</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. Do you know what the weather forecast says for...?</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5.  It's going to be + 表示天气的形容词</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. with + 宾语+ 宾语补足语（现在分词）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. Which + 事物+ do you like best/the most?</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. Each + 事物+ has its own + 名词</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>答案</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_8_18", "moduleId": "p2_7_8"}, {"title": "5.1 填词练习", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. wonderful</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. windy</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. planning</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. temperature</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. charm</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. museum</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_8_19", "moduleId": "p2_7_8"}, {"title": "5.2 用固定搭配造句（示例）", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. We plan to go for a picnic with our classmates next Sunday.（我们计划下周日和同学去野</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>餐。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. Her dream is to study abroad and learn advanced technology.（她的梦想是出国留学，学</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>习先进技术。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. The caterpillar will change into a butterfly after a few weeks.（毛毛虫几周后会变成蝴蝶。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. After the heavy rain, the park comes back to life with green grass and blooming flowers.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（大雨过后，公园里绿草开花，恢复了生机。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_8_20", "moduleId": "p2_7_8"}, {"title": "5.3 用句型造句（示例）", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. What a cute cat, isn't it?（这只猫真可爱，不是吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2.  It's easy to learn basic weather expressions.（学习基础的天气表达很简单。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3.  I was planning to buy a new umbrella, but I forgot yesterday.（我本来打算买把新伞，但是</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>昨天忘了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. Do you know what the weather forecast says for next Monday?（你知道下周一的天气预报</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>怎么说吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5.  It's going to be cloudy this afternoon.（今天下午会是多云天气。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. He sat by the window with the wind blowing gently.（他坐在窗边，风轻轻吹着。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. Which drink do you like the most, tea or coffee?（你最喜欢哪种饮品，茶还是咖啡？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. Each student has his own learning method.（每个学生都有自己的学习方法。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_8_21", "moduleId": "p2_7_8"}]}, {"id": "p2_7_9", "code": "7.9", "title": "万能宝典- 机场问路", "articles": [{"title": "1.1 名词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. check-in [ˈtʃek ɪn]：（机场）办理登机手续；（酒店）登记入住</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. counter [ˈkaʊntə(r)]：柜台（值机柜台：check-in counter）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. sign [saɪn]：指示牌；标志（机场/ 地铁站通用，如“Boarding Gate”“Platform” 标识）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. boarding pass [ˈbɔːdɪŋ pæs]：登机牌</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. security [sɪˈkjʊərəti]：安全检查；安保（安检：security check）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. liquid [ˈlɪkwɪd]：液体（安检需单独取出）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. laptop [ˈlæptɒp]：笔记本电脑（安检需单独取出）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. tray [treɪ]：托盘（安检放置随身物品用）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>9. checkpoint [ˈtʃekpɔɪnt]：检查点；关卡（安检处常用）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>10. boarding gate [ˈbɔːdɪŋ ɡeɪt]：登机口</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>11. staff [stɑːf]：工作人员（机场staff / 地铁站staff 通用）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>12. flight [flaɪt]：航班</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>13. ticket [ˈtɪkɪt]：机票；票（机场flight ticket / 地铁站subway ticket）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_9_01", "moduleId": "p2_7_9"}, {"title": "1.2 动词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. follow [ˈfɒləʊ]：跟随；遵循（follow the signs：跟随指示牌，机场/ 地铁站通用）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. take out [teɪk aʊt]：拿出（安检时取出液体、电脑）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. go through [ɡəʊ θruː]：通过（go through security check：通过安检）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. look for [lʊk fɔː(r)]：寻找（look for gate numbers：寻找登机口编号）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_9_02", "moduleId": "p2_7_9"}, {"title": "二、情景对话拆解", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>围绕“机场问路” 核心流程，提炼通用句型（部分可迁移至地铁站问路），便于直接套用：</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_9_03", "moduleId": "p2_7_9"}, {"title": "2.1 请求帮助", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 开头礼貌用语：Excuse me.（打扰一下，机场/ 地铁站问路通用）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">2. 说明需求+ 请求帮助：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I'm flying to [目的地]. I don't know what to do first. Can you help me?（我要飞[目的地]，不知道第一步该做什么，能帮我吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>迁移至地铁站：I'm going to [地铁站名]. I don't know which platform to take. Could you do me a favor?（我要去[地铁站名]，不知道该坐哪个站台，能帮我吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 同义请求句式：Could you give me a hand? / Could you do me a favor?（能帮我一下吗？）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_9_04", "moduleId": "p2_7_9"}, {"title": "2.2 值机流程指引", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 指引值机柜台：You need to go to the check-in counter. Follow the signs that say</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>\"Check-in\".（你需要去值机柜台，跟着写“值机” 的指示牌走。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 所需材料：You'll need your ID and flight ticket to get your boarding pass.（你需要用身份证</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>和机票换登机牌。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_9_05", "moduleId": "p2_7_9"}, {"title": "2.3 安检流程指引", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 指引安检：Then you have to go through the security check. Follow the signs that say</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>\"Security\".（然后你得通过安检，跟着写“安检” 的指示牌走。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 安检要求：You have to take out your liquids and laptop, put them in the trays, and show</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>your boarding pass and ID at the checkpoint.（你得拿出液体和电脑，放在托盘里，在安检处出示登机牌和身份证。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_9_06", "moduleId": "p2_7_9"}, {"title": "2.4 寻找登机口（可迁移至地铁站找站台）", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 询问登机口：How can I find my boarding gate? My gate number is [数字].（我怎么找我的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>登机口？我的登机口是[数字] 号。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>迁移至地铁站：How can I find Platform [数字]?（我怎么找[数字] 号站台？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 指引方向：After security check, look for the signs with gate numbers. Follow the signs for</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>gates [范围].（过安检后，找标有登机口编号的指示牌，跟着[范围] 号登机口的指示牌走。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 备用方案：If you're not sure, ask the airport staff.（不确定的话，问机场工作人员。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_9_07", "moduleId": "p2_7_9"}, {"title": "2.5 感谢与祝福", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 感谢：Thank you so much. You've been really helpful.（非常感谢，你帮了我大忙了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 祝福与提醒：Have a nice flight. You should go now, in case you're late.（祝你旅途愉快，</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>现在该走了，以防迟到。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>迁移至地铁站：Have a nice trip.（祝你旅途愉快。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_9_08", "moduleId": "p2_7_9"}, {"title": "三、对话原文", "section": "三、对话原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>A：Excuse me. I'm flying to China. I don't know what to do first. Can you help me?（打扰一下， 我要坐飞机去中国，不知道第一步该做什么，能帮我吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B：Sure! First, you need to go to the check-in counter. See those signs that say \"Check-in\"? Follow them. You'll need your ID and flight ticket to get your boarding pass.（当然可以！首先你要去值机柜台，看到那些写“值机” 的指示牌了吗？跟着走。你需要用身份证和机票换登机牌。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A：After getting the boarding pass, what's next?（拿到登机牌之后，接下来做什么？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B：Then you have to go through the security check. Just follow the signs that say \"Security\".</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You'll have to take out your liquids, laptop, and put them in the trays. And show your boarding pass and ID at the checkpoint.（然后你得通过安检，跟着写“安检” 的指示牌走就行。你要拿出液体和电脑，放在托盘里，在安检处出示登机牌和身份证。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A：I see. And how can I find my boarding gate? My gate number is 8.（我明白了，那我怎么找我的登机口？我的登机口是8 号。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B：After the security check, look for the signs with gate numbers. Yours is Gate 8, so follow the signs for gates 1-10. If you're not sure, you can always ask the airport staff.（过安检后， 找标有登机口编号的指示牌，你的是8 号口，跟着1-10 号登机口的指示牌走。不确定的话， 随时问机场工作人员。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A：Thank you so much. You've been really helpful. I was so worried.（非常感谢，你帮了我大忙了，我刚才可担心了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>B：You're welcome. Have a nice flight. You should go now, in case you're late.（不客气，祝你旅途愉快。现在该走了，以防迟到。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A：Okay, I will. Thanks again!（好的，我会的，再次感谢！）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_9_09", "moduleId": "p2_7_9"}, {"title": "4.1 固定搭配", "section": "四、单词句型固搭总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 请求帮助类：give me a hand（帮我一下）、do me a favor（帮我个忙）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 流程指引类（机场/ 地铁站通用）：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>check-in counter（值机柜台）、security check（安检）、boarding gate（登机口）、flight ticket（机票）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>go through security check（通过安检）、follow the signs（跟随指示牌）、take out（拿出）、look for（寻找）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>in case（以防万一，如：take an umbrella in case it rains）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 感谢祝福类：thank you so much（非常感谢）、have a nice flight/trip（祝你旅途愉快）、</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>you're welcome（不客气）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_9_10", "moduleId": "p2_7_9"}, {"title": "4.2 核心句型", "section": "四、单词句型固搭总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 请求帮助：Excuse me. I'm [目的] . I don't know what to do first. Can you help me?（打扰</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>一下，我要[目的]，不知道第一步该做什么，能帮我吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 指引方向：You need to go to [地点]. Follow the signs that say \"[标识]\".（你需要去[地点]，</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>跟着写“[标识]” 的指示牌走。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 询问方式：How can I find [目标，如boarding gate/platform]?（我怎么找[目标]？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 安检要求：You have to take out [物品] and put them in [容器].（你得拿出[物品]，放在[容</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>器] 里。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. 备用建议：If you're not sure, ask the [工作人员，如airport/subway staff].（不确定的话，</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>问[工作人员]。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_9_11", "moduleId": "p2_7_9"}, {"title": "5.1 填空题", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. You need to show your ID and flight ticket at the __________ (值机柜台) to get a boarding</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>pass.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. When going through the security check, please __________ (拿出) your laptop and</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>liquids.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3.  If you can't find Platform 3 in the subway station, you can ask the __________ (地铁站工</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>作人员) for help.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. Take a jacket with you __________ (以防万一) the plane gets cold.</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_9_12", "moduleId": "p2_7_9"}, {"title": "5.2 固定搭配造句", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. give me a hand</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. go through the security check</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. follow the signs</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. in case</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_9_13", "moduleId": "p2_7_9"}, {"title": "5.3 高频句型造句", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. I'm [目的，如flying to Shanghai] . I don't know what to do first.（用“目的+ 不知做什么”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>结构）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. How can I find [目标，如the check-in counter]?（用“how can I find” 询问位置）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. You need to [动作，如go to the boarding gate] before 8:00.（用“you need to” 提要求）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>答案</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_9_14", "moduleId": "p2_7_9"}, {"title": "5.1 填空题", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. check-in counter</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. take out</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. subway staff</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. in case</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_9_15", "moduleId": "p2_7_9"}, {"title": "5.2 固定搭配造句", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. Could you give me a hand with my luggage?（能帮我拿一下行李吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. All passengers must go through the security check before boarding.（所有乘客登机前必须</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>通过安检。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. Follow the signs that say \"Exit\" to leave the airport.（跟着写“出口” 的指示牌离开机场。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4.  I'll call you in case I miss the train.（我会给你打电话，以防错过火车。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_9_16", "moduleId": "p2_7_9"}, {"title": "5.3 高频句型造句", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. I'm taking the subway to the mall. I don't know what to do first.（我要坐地铁去商场，不知</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>道第一步该做什么。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. How can I find the nearest subway station?（我怎么找最近的地铁站？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. You need to arrive at the airport an hour early.（你需要提前一小时到机场。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_9_17", "moduleId": "p2_7_9"}]}, {"id": "p2_7_10", "code": "7.10", "title": "万能宝典- 餐厅用餐", "articles": [{"title": "1.1 名词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. ketchup [ˈketʃəp]：番茄酱</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. allergy [ˈælədʒi]：过敏症</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. request [rɪˈkwest]：要求</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. menu [ˈmenjuː]：菜单</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5.  bill [bɪl]：账单</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. change [tʃeɪndʒ]：零钱（结账场景）；改变（日常场景）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. grilled chicken [ˈɡrɪld ˈtʃɪkɪn]：烤鸡</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. tomato soup [təˈmeɪtoʊ suːp]：番茄汤</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>9. braised pork in soy sauce：红烧肉</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_10_01", "moduleId": "p2_7_10"}, {"title": "1.2 动词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. order [ˈɔːrdə(r)]：点餐（例：order food）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. serve [sɜːrv]：上菜；提供服务（例：The food will be served soon.）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_10_02", "moduleId": "p2_7_10"}, {"title": "1.3 形容词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. extra [ˈekstrə]：额外的（例：extra ketchup）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. ready [ˈredi]：准备好的（例：be ready to order）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_10_03", "moduleId": "p2_7_10"}, {"title": "二、情景对话拆解", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>围绕“餐厅用餐” 全流程，提炼核心表达，便于直接套用：</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_10_04", "moduleId": "p2_7_10"}, {"title": "2.1 入座问候与菜单", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 服务员询问人数：“Table for one or more?”（一位还是多位用餐？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 客人回应：“Table for two, please.”（两位用餐，谢谢。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 服务员递菜单与询问需求：“Here's the menu. Are there any food allergies or special</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>requests?”（这是菜单。有食物过敏或特殊要求吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 客人回应：“No, thanks. We'll take a look at the menu first.”（没有，谢谢。我们先看一下菜</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>单。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_10_05", "moduleId": "p2_7_10"}, {"title": "2.2 点餐环节", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 服务员询问是否点餐：“Are you ready to order now?”（现在准备好点餐了吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 客人点餐句型：“I'd like + 菜品，and my friend wants + 菜品. We need + 饮品for each of</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>us.”（我要XX，我朋友要XX。我们每人要XX 饮品。），例：“I'd like the grilled chicken and a bowl of tomato soup. My friend wants the braised pork in soy sauce, and a Coke for each of us.”（我要一份烤鸡和一碗番茄汤，我朋友要一份红烧肉，我们每人一杯可乐。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 服务员确认：“Got it. Anything else?”（了解了。还要别的吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 客人确认：“No, that's all for now.”（不用了，目前就这些。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. 服务员回应：“Your order will be served soon.”（点的餐很快就会上。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_10_06", "moduleId": "p2_7_10"}, {"title": "2.3 用餐中需求", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 客人请求额外物品：“Excuse me, could we have some extra ketchup?”（打扰一下，能再给</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我们一些番茄酱吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 服务员回应：“Sure. Here you are.”（当然可以，给你们。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_10_07", "moduleId": "p2_7_10"}, {"title": "2.4 结账环节", "section": "二、情景对话拆解", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 客人要求结账：“The bill, please.”（请结账。）（也可用“May I have the bill, please?” 更</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>委婉）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 服务员告知金额与付款方式：“Here's your bill. It totals $40. How would you like to pay?”（这</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>是账单，总共40 美元。您想怎么付款？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 客人选择付款方式：“I'll pay in cash. Here you go.”（我用现金付，给你。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 服务员找零与道别：“Thank you. Here's your change. Have a nice day!”（谢谢，这是找零。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>祝您度过愉快的一天！）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. 客人回应：“Thanks. You too.”（谢谢，你也是。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_10_08", "moduleId": "p2_7_10"}, {"title": "三、对话原文", "section": "三、对话原文", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>Waiter (W)：Good evening. Welcome! Table for one or more?（晚上好，欢迎光临！一位还是多位用餐呢？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Guest (G)：Table for two, please.（两位用餐，谢谢。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>W：Sure. This way, please. Here's the menu. Are there any food allergies or special requests? （好的，这边请。这是菜单。有食物过敏或特殊要求吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>G：No, thanks. We'll take a look at the menu first.（没有，谢谢。我们先看一下菜单。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>W：Alright. I'll be back in a few minutes to take your order.（好的，我几分钟后再来为你们点餐。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（几分钟后）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>W：Are you ready to order now?（你们现在准备好点餐了吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>G：Yes. I'd like the grilled chicken and a bowl of tomato soup. My friend wants the braised pork in soy sauce, and a Coke for each of us.（是的。我要一份烤鸡和一碗番茄汤，我朋友要一份红烧肉，我们每人一杯可乐。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>W：Got it. Anything else?（了解了。还要别的吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>G：No, that's all for now.（不用了，目前就这些。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>W：Your order will be served soon.（你们点的餐很快就会上。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（用餐时）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>G：Excuse me, could we have some extra ketchup?（打扰一下，能再给我们一些番茄酱吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>W：Sure. Here you are.（当然可以，给你们。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（用餐结束）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>G：The bill, please.（请结账。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>W：Here's your bill. It totals $40. How would you like to pay?（这是账单，总共40 美元。您想怎么付款？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>G：I'll pay in cash. Here you go.（我用现金付，给你。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>W：Thank you. Here's your change. Have a nice day!（谢谢，这是找零。祝您度过愉快的一天！）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>G：Thanks. You too.（谢谢，你也是。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_10_09", "moduleId": "p2_7_10"}, {"title": "4.1 固定搭配", "section": "四、单词句型固搭总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. table for + 数字：…… 位用餐（例：table for three 三位用餐）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. take a look at the menu：看菜单</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. take one's order：为某人点餐（例：The waiter will take our order.）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. in a few minutes：几分钟后</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. be allergic to + 食物：对某食物过敏（例：be allergic to milk 对牛奶过敏）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. extra + 物品：额外的……（例：extra napkins 额外的餐巾纸）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. for each of us：我们每人（例：a drink for each of us 我们每人一杯饮品）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. pay in cash：用现金付款（对应“pay by credit card 用信用卡付款”）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>9. totals + 金额：总共…… 钱（例：It totals $50 总共50 美元）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_10_10", "moduleId": "p2_7_10"}, {"title": "4.2 核心句型", "section": "四、单词句型固搭总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 询问人数：Table for one or more?（一位还是多位用餐？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 询问过敏/ 需求：Are there any food allergies or special requests?（有食物过敏或特殊要</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>求吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 询问是否点餐：Are you ready to order now?（现在准备好点餐了吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 点餐表达：I'd like + 菜品. / My friend wants + 菜品.（我要XX。/ 我朋友要XX。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. 确认是否加单：Got it. Anything else?（了解了。还要别的吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. 请求物品：Excuse me, could we have some + 物品？（打扰一下，能给我们一些XX 吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. 要求结账：The bill, please. / May I have the bill, please?（请结账。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. 询问付款方式：How would you like to pay?（您想怎么付款？）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_10_11", "moduleId": "p2_7_10"}, {"title": "4.3 补充：常见菜品英文", "section": "四、单词句型固搭总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 中式菜品：宫保鸡丁（Kung Pao chicken）、鱼香肉丝（Yu-Shiang Shredded Pork）、麻</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>婆豆腐（Mapo Tofu）、饺子（dumplings）、西红柿炒鸡蛋（Stir-Fried Tomatoes with Eggs）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 西餐菜品：牛排（steak）、意大利面（spaghetti）、披萨（pizza）、汉堡（hamburger）、</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>薯条（French fries）、沙拉（salad）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_10_12", "moduleId": "p2_7_10"}, {"title": "5.1 填词题", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. When we entered the restaurant, the waiter asked, “Table for one or ______ (更多的)?”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2.  If you have a food ______ (过敏症), you must tell the waiter before ordering.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. We are not ______ (准备好的) to order yet. Please give us 5 more minutes.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. The waiter said he would come back ______ (几分钟后) to take our order.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5.  I want to ______ (点餐) a plate of dumplings and a cup of hot tea.</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_10_13", "moduleId": "p2_7_10"}, {"title": "5.2 固定搭配造句", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. take a look at the menu（围绕“点餐前置准备” 造句）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. be allergic to（围绕“芒果过敏” 造句）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. for each of us（围绕“冰淇淋” 造句）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. pay in cash（围绕“结账场景” 造句）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_10_14", "moduleId": "p2_7_10"}, {"title": "5.3 句型仿写", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 仿照“Are you ready to order now?”，用“go to the cinema” 造句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 仿照“I'd like the grilled chicken.”，用“a bowl of noodles” 造句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 仿照“Excuse me, could we have some extra ketchup?”，用“napkins” 造句。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>答案</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_10_15", "moduleId": "p2_7_10"}, {"title": "5.1 填词题", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. more</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. allergy</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. ready</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. in a few minutes</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. order</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_10_16", "moduleId": "p2_7_10"}, {"title": "5.2 固定搭配造句", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. Before we order, let's take a look at the menu to choose our favorite dishes.（点餐之前，</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我们先看菜单选喜欢的菜吧。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. My little sister is allergic to mangoes, so she can't eat them.（我妹妹对芒果过敏，所以不</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>能吃。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. The waiter brought a vanilla ice cream for each of us after dinner.（晚饭后服务员给我们每</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>人端了一份香草冰淇淋。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4.  I don't have a credit card, so I'll pay in cash for the meal.（我没有信用卡，所以这顿饭我用</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>现金付。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_10_17", "moduleId": "p2_7_10"}, {"title": "5.3 句型仿写", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. Are you ready to go to the cinema with me this weekend?（你准备好这周末和我去看电影</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>了吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. I'd like a bowl of beef noodles with chili oil.（我要一碗加辣椒油的牛肉面。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. Excuse me, could we have some napkins? We need to wipe our hands.（打扰一下，能给</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我们一些餐巾纸吗？我们需要擦手。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p2_7_10_18", "moduleId": "p2_7_10"}]}], "id": "p2", "file": "场景实战课_日常场景万能宝典_7,3_7,10.md", "title": "场景实战课 · 日常场景万能宝典", "range": "7.3 – 7.10"}, {"name": "场景课 · 面试与演讲（7.11–7.15）", "modules": [{"id": "p3_7_11", "code": "7.11", "title": "面无不胜- 求职篇", "articles": [{"title": "1.1 名词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. position [pəˈzɪʃn]：职位（例：apply for the marketing position 申请市场岗位）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. resume [ˈrezəmeɪ]：简历（例：submit a resume 提交简历）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. interview [ˈɪntəvjuː]：面试（例：job interview 求职面试）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. degree [dɪˈɡriː]：学位（例：bachelor's degree 学士学位）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. major [ˈmeɪdʒə(r)]：专业（例：major in Computer Science 主修计算机科学）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. industry [ˈɪndəstri]：行业（例：IT industry 信息技术行业）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. achievement [əˈtʃiːvmənt]：成就（例：work achievement 工作成就）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. strength [streŋθ]：优势（例：professional strength 专业优势）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>9. weakness [ˈwiːknəs]：缺点（例：improve a weakness 改进缺点）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>10. value [ˈvæljuː]：价值观（例：company values 公司价值观）</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_11_01", "moduleId": "p3_7_11"}, {"title": "1.2 动词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. apply [əˈplaɪ]：申请（例：apply for a job 申请工作）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. graduate [ˈɡrædʒueɪt]：毕业（例：graduate from university 大学毕业）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. develop [dɪˈveləp]：培养；发展（例：develop skills 培养技能）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. responsible [rɪˈspɒnsəbl]（adj.）→take responsibility for：负责（例：take responsibility for</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>projects 负责项目）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. contribute [kənˈtrɪbjuːt]：贡献（例：contribute to the team 为团队做贡献）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. resolve [rɪˈzɒlv]：解决（例：resolve problems 解决问题）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. pursue [pəˈsjuː]：追求（例：pursue career goals 追求职业目标）</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_11_02", "moduleId": "p3_7_11"}, {"title": "1.3 形容词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. solid [ˈsɒlɪd]：坚实的（例：solid foundation 坚实的基础）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. relevant [ˈreləvənt]：相关的（例：relevant experience 相关经验）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. innovative [ˈɪnəveɪtɪv]：创新的（例：innovative approaches 创新方法）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. efficient [ɪˈfɪʃnt]：高效的（例：efficient work 高效工作）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. customer-centric [ˈkʌstəmə ˈsentrɪk]：以客户为中心的（例：customer-centric service 以</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>客户为中心的服务）</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_11_03", "moduleId": "p3_7_11"}, {"title": "2.1 自我介绍（Self-introduction）", "section": "二、面试核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>框架：开头语→教育背景→工作/ 项目经验→个人优势与动机→</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>结尾</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">1. 开头语：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“Good morning/afternoon. It's a great honor to be here for this interview. Let me briefly introduce myself. My name is [Your Name], and I'm excited to apply for the [Position Name] at your company.”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（早上好/ 下午好。很荣幸参加此次面试。请允许我简要介绍自己：我叫[你的名字]，非常荣幸申请贵公司[职位名称] 岗位。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">2. 教育背景（含学位表达）：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“I graduated from [University Name] with a [Degree Name] in [Major Name]. During my studies, I built a solid foundation in [Relevant Subjects, e.g., data analysis, marketing strategy], which matches this position. For example, courses like [Course Name 1, e.g., Market Research] and [Course Name 2, e.g., Data Mining] helped me master [Skills, e.g., Excel and SPSS].”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（我毕业于[大学名称]，获得[学位名称，如Bachelor of Science]，主修[专业名称]。在校期间，我在[相关学科，如数据分析、营销策略] 方面打下坚实基础，与岗位需求匹配。例如， 《[课程1，如市场调研]》和《[课程2，如数据挖掘]》让我掌握了[技能，如Excel 和SPSS]。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">常见学位：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>学士：Bachelor of Arts (B.A.，文科)、Bachelor of Science (B.S.，理科)、Bachelor of Engineering (B.Eng.，工科)</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>硕士：Master of Arts (M.A.)、Master of Science (M.S.)、Master of Business Administration (M.B.A.，工商管理)</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>博士：Doctor of Philosophy (Ph.D.，通用博士)、Doctor of Medicine (M.D.，医学博士)</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">3. 工作/ 项目经验：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“I have [X] years of experience in [Industry, e.g., digital marketing]. Previously, I worked at [Company Name] as a [Previous Position, e.g., Marketing Executive]. My main responsibilities included [Task 1, e.g., managing social media accounts] and [Task 2, e.g., organizing promotional activities]. One key achievement was [Achievement, e.g., increasing brand followers by 60% in 3 months]—this improved our brand awareness and polished my [Skill, e.g., content creation].”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（我在[行业，如数字营销] 有[X] 年经验。此前，我在[公司名称] 担任[之前职位，如市场专员]，主要负责[任务1，如管理社交媒体账号] 和[任务2，如组织推广活动]。核心成就为[成就，如3 个月内品牌粉丝增长60%]—— 这不仅提升了品牌知名度，还精进了我的[技能， 如内容创作]。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">4. 个人优势与动机：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“My strengths include [Strength 1, e.g., strong communication skills] and [Strength 2, e.g., problem-solving ability]. I'm drawn to this position because [Reason, e.g., your company leads in innovative marketing, which aligns with my career goal of becoming a marketing strategist]. I’m confident my skills can contribute to your team.”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（我的优势包括[优势1，如沟通能力强] 和[优势2，如解决问题能力]。我关注此岗位，是因为[原因，如贵公司在创新营销领域领先，与我成为营销strategist 的职业目标契合]。我相信我的技能能为团队创造价值。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">5. 结尾：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“Thank you for this chance to introduce myself. I’m ready to answer your further questions.”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（感谢您给予自我介绍的机会，我已准备好回答后续问题。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_11_04", "moduleId": "p3_7_11"}, {"title": "2.2 为什么对这个职位感兴趣？（Why are you interested in this", "section": "二、面试核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>position?）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“First, I’ve followed the [Industry, e.g., AI] industry for years, and your company’s [Advantage, e.g., AI-driven products] deeply impress me. This [Position Name, e.g., AI Product Manager] role matches my long-term goal of working in AI product development. Second, my [Skills, e.g., product design experience and AI knowledge] fits the job requirements—for example, I once led a small product optimization project that improved user retention by 20%. I’m eager to apply these skills here and grow with your team.”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（首先，我关注[行业，如人工智能] 多年，贵公司的[优势，如AI 驱动产品] 让我印象深刻。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>此[职位名称，如AI 产品经理] 岗位与我在AI 产品开发领域的长期目标契合。其次，我的[技能，如产品设计经验和AI 知识] 符合岗位需求—— 例如，我曾主导小型产品优化项目，将用户留存率提升20%。我渴望在此应用这些技能，与团队共同成长。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_11_05", "moduleId": "p3_7_11"}, {"title": "2.3 你的优点和缺点是什么？（What are your strengths and", "section": "二、面试核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>weaknesses?）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">优点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“My biggest strength is my attention to detail. In my last job, I was responsible for checking project reports—once I found a data error that almost led to a wrong decision, and corrected it in time. This avoided potential losses and won praise from my manager. Another strength is teamwork: I often coordinate with design and tech teams to ensure smooth project progress.”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（我最大的优点是注重细节。上一份工作中，我负责审核项目报告—— 曾发现一处差点导致决策失误的数据错误，并及时修正，避免了潜在损失，获得经理认可。另一个优点是团队协作：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我常协调设计和技术团队，确保项目顺利推进。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">缺点：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“One area I need to improve is public speaking. Previously, I felt nervous when presenting to large teams. To fix this, I’ve joined a toastmasters club and practice giving short speeches every week. Now I’m more confident, and I believe I’ll keep improving.”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（我需要改进的是公开演讲能力。此前，面对大型团队汇报时我会紧张。为改进，我加入了演讲俱乐部，每周练习短演讲。现在我更自信了，相信会持续进步。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_11_06", "moduleId": "p3_7_11"}, {"title": "2.4 举例说明解决问题的经历（Can you give an example of", "section": "二、面试核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>solving a problem?）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“Situation: At my previous company, our team’s marketing campaign wasn’t driving enough sales—user clicks were high, but conversion rate was only 2%.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Task: I was assigned to find the cause and improve the conversion rate.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Action: First, I analyzed user behavior data and found most users left at the payment page.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Then I interviewed 10 customers and learned the payment process was too complicated. I proposed simplifying the process (e.g., adding a ‘one-click payment’ option) and tested it with a small group.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Result: The conversion rate rose to 8% in a month, and the solution was promoted to all campaigns. This taught me the importance of data analysis and user feedback.”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（情境：上一家公司，团队营销活动销量不佳—— 用户点击量高，但转化率仅2%。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>任务：我负责找出原因并提升转化率。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>行动：首先分析用户行为数据，发现多数用户在支付页面流失；然后访谈10 位客户，了解到支付流程复杂。我提议简化流程（如增加“一键支付”），并小范围测试。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>结果：一个月内转化率升至8%，方案在所有活动中推广。这次经历让我明白数据分析和用户反馈的重要性。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_11_07", "moduleId": "p3_7_11"}, {"title": "2.5 为什么离开上一份工作？（Why did you leave your previous", "section": "二、面试核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>job?）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“I left to pursue more growth opportunities. My last company was small, so I had limited chances to work on large-scale projects. Your company’s [Advantage, e.g., diverse and large projects in the e-commerce field] aligns with my goal of expanding my project management experience. I’m eager to take on more challenges here and develop my professional skills further.”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（我离职是为了寻求更多成长机会。上一家公司规模较小，我参与大型项目的机会有限。贵公司在[优势，如电商领域多样的大型项目] 与我拓展项目管理经验的目标契合。我渴望在此迎接更多挑战，进一步提升专业能力。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_11_08", "moduleId": "p3_7_11"}, {"title": "2.6 对我们公司有什么了解？（What do you know about our", "section": "二、面试核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>company?）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“I’ve researched your company thoroughly. Founded in [Year], you’re a leader in the [Industry, e.g., smart home] industry, with core products like [Product Name, e.g., smart thermostats] known for [Feature, e.g., energy-saving technology]. I also noticed you launched a new product line last quarter, which shows your focus on innovation. Your company values of ‘customer-first’ and ‘sustainable development’ resonate with me—I believe such values drive long-term success, and I’m eager to be part of it.”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（我深入了解过贵公司：成立于[年份]，是[行业，如智能家居] 领域的领导者，核心产品如[产品名称，如智能恒温器] 以[特点，如节能技术] 闻名。我还注意到贵公司上季度推出新产品线， 体现了对创新的重视。贵公司“客户至上” 和“可持续发展” 的价值观与我契合—— 我相信这样的价值观驱动长期成功，渴望成为其中一员。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_11_09", "moduleId": "p3_7_11"}, {"title": "三、模拟面试对话", "section": "三、模拟面试对话", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>Interviewer (I)：Good morning. It's nice to meet you. Could you start with a brief self-introduction? （面试官：早上好，很高兴见到你。能先做个简要自我介绍吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Candidate (C)：Good morning. It's a great honor to be here. My name is Li Ming, and I'm applying for the Marketing Specialist position. I graduated from Peking University with a Bachelor of Arts in Marketing. I have 2 years of experience at ABC Marketing Agency, where I managed social media accounts for 5 clients. One achievement was increasing a client’s WeChat followers by 80% in 4 months. My strengths are data analysis and content creation, and I’m drawn to your company’s innovative marketing strategies. Thank you.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（候选人：早上好，很荣幸在此。我叫李明，申请市场专员岗位。我毕业于北京大学，获得市场营销文学学士学位，有2 年ABC 营销机构的工作经验，负责5 个客户的社交媒体账号。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>其中一项成就是4 个月内将某客户的微信粉丝量提升80%。我的优势是数据分析和内容创作，贵公司创新的营销策略吸引了我。谢谢。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I：That’s impressive. Why are you interested in this Marketing Specialist role? （面试官：很出色。你为什么对这个市场专员岗位感兴趣？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>C：I’ve followed your company’s marketing campaigns—your recent “Green Life” campaign was very creative and focused on sustainability, which I admire. This role requires managing social media and analyzing campaign data, which matches my experience. For example, I once used Excel to analyze campaign data and adjusted content, leading to a 30% increase in engagement. I believe I can bring similar value here.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（候选人：我关注过贵公司的营销活动—— 最近的“绿色生活” 活动很有创意，且聚焦可持续发展，我很欣赏。此岗位需要管理社交媒体和分析活动数据，与我的经验匹配。例如，我曾用Excel 分析活动数据并调整内容，使互动率提升30%。我相信能在此创造类似价值。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I：Great. Finally, what are your strengths and weaknesses? （面试官：很好。最后，你的优点和缺点是什么？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>C：My strength is my ability to work under pressure. Last year, I handled 3 campaigns at the same time, and I prioritized tasks with a to-do list, finishing all on time. My weakness is public speaking—I used to be nervous, but I now practice with my colleagues every month, and I’m getting better.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（候选人：我的优点是抗压能力强。去年，我同时负责3 个活动，通过待办清单梳理优先级， 全部按时完成。缺点是公开演讲—— 我以前会紧张，但现在每月和同事练习，正在进步。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I：Thank you for your answers. We’ll contact you soon.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（面试官：感谢你的回答，我们会尽快联系你。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>C：Thank you for your time.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（候选人：感谢您的时间。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_11_10", "moduleId": "p3_7_11"}, {"title": "4.1 高频搭配", "section": "四、单词句型固搭总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. apply for the [Position Name]：申请[职位名称]</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. graduate from [University Name] with a [Degree]：毕业于[大学名称]，获得[学位]</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. build a solid foundation in [Subject/Skill]：在[学科/ 技能] 方面打下坚实基础</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. take responsibility for [Task/Project]：负责[任务/ 项目]</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. contribute to the team/company：为团队/ 公司做贡献</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. align with career goals：与职业目标契合</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. resolve/solve problems：解决问题</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. conduct research on the company：对公司做调研</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_11_11", "moduleId": "p3_7_11"}, {"title": "4.2 核心句型", "section": "四、单词句型固搭总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 自我介绍开头：It's a great honor to be here for this interview. Let me briefly introduce</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>myself.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 描述经验：I have [X] years of experience in [Industry], and I once [Achievement].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 回答兴趣：I'm interested in this position because [Reason 1] and my [Skill] fits the</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>requirements.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 说明优点：My biggest strength is [Strength], and I once [Example to prove it].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. 说明缺点：I need to improve [Weakness], and I'm addressing it by [Action].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. 描述问题解决：In [Situation], I was tasked with [Task], so I [Action], and finally [Result].</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_11_12", "moduleId": "p3_7_11"}, {"title": "5.1 填词题", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1.  I graduated from Tsinghua University with a ________ (学士学位) in Electrical</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Engineering.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. She has 3 years of experience in the finance ________ (行业) and used to work at a bank.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. My biggest ________ (优势) is time management—I can finish multiple tasks on time.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. We need to ________ (解决) this problem before the project deadline.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. Your company’s values ________ (契合) with my professional principles.</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_11_13", "moduleId": "p3_7_11"}, {"title": "5.2 句型仿写", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 仿照“我毕业于[大学]，获得[学位]，主修[专业]” 造句（用“Fudan University, Bachelor of</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Science, Mathematics”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 仿照“我关注此岗位，是因为[公司优势] 与我的[职业目标] 契合” 造句（用“贵公司在新</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>能源领域的布局，成为新能源产品经理的目标”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 仿照“在[情境] 中，我通过[行动] 解决问题，最终[结果]” 造句（用“项目延期，调整任</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>务优先级，按时交付”）。</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_11_14", "moduleId": "p3_7_11"}, {"title": "5.3 情景模拟", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">根据自身情况，补全自我介绍模板：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“Good afternoon. It's a great honor to be here. My name is ________. I graduated from ________ with a ________ in ________. I have ________ years of experience in ________, and my main achievement was ________. My strengths are ________, and I’m interested in this position because ________. Thank you.”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>答案</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_11_15", "moduleId": "p3_7_11"}, {"title": "5.1 填词题", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. Bachelor of Science</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. industry</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. strength</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. resolve/solve</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. align</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_11_16", "moduleId": "p3_7_11"}, {"title": "5.2 句型仿写", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1.  I graduated from Fudan University with a Bachelor of Science in Mathematics.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. I’m interested in this position because your company’s layout in the new energy field aligns</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>with my career goal of becoming a new energy product manager.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. In the situation where the project was delayed, I solved the problem by adjusting task</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>priorities, and finally delivered it on time.</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_11_17", "moduleId": "p3_7_11"}, {"title": "5.3 情景模拟（示例）", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>“Good afternoon. It's a great honor to be here. My name is Wang Hua. I graduated from Zhejiang University with a Bachelor of Arts in English. I have 1 year of experience in international trade, and my main achievement was helping the company sign 3 new overseas clients. My strengths are cross-cultural communication and document translation, and I’m interested in this position because your company’s international business matches my experience. Thank you.”</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_11_18", "moduleId": "p3_7_11"}]}, {"id": "p3_7_12", "code": "7.12", "title": "面无不胜- 考研篇", "articles": [{"title": "1.1 名词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. postgraduate entrance examination [ˌpəʊstˈɡrædʒuət ˈentrəns ɪɡˌzæmɪˈneɪʃn]：考研（例：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>prepare for the postgraduate entrance examination 备考考研）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. academic foundation [ˌækəˈdemɪk faʊnˈdeɪʃn]：学术基础（例：build a solid academic</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>foundation 打下坚实学术基础）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. research methodology [rɪˈsɜːtʃ ˌmeθəˈdɒlədʒi]：研究方法（例：learn research methodology</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>学习研究方法）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. curriculum [kəˈrɪkjələm]：课程设置（例：well-designed curriculum 精心设计的课程设置）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. research institute [rɪˈsɜːtʃ ˈɪnstɪtjuːt]：研究所（例：join a research institute 加入研究所）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. literature review [ˈlɪtrətʃə rɪˈvjuː]：文献综述（例：write a literature review 撰写文献综述）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. cutting-edge research [ˌkʌtɪŋ ˈedʒ rɪˈsɜːtʃ]：前沿研究（例：engage in cutting-edge research</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>参与前沿研究）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. postgraduate study [ˌpəʊstˈɡrædʒuət ˈstʌdi]：研究生学习（例：pursue postgraduate study</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>攻读研究生）</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_12_01", "moduleId": "p3_7_12"}, {"title": "1.2 动词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. dedicate [ˈdedɪkeɪt]：致力于（例：dedicate to academic research 致力于学术研究）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. excel [ɪkˈsel]：擅长；表现优异（例：excel in professional courses 专业课程表现优异）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. participate [pɑːˈtɪsɪpeɪt]：参与（例：participate in research projects 参与研究项目）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. explore [ɪkˈsplɔː(r)]：探索（例：explore academic literature 探索学术文献）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. conduct [kənˈdʌkt]：开展；进行（例：conduct experiments 开展实验）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. overcome [ˌəʊvəˈkʌm]：克服（例：overcome research challenges 克服研究挑战）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. align [əˈlaɪn]：契合（例：align with research interests 与研究兴趣契合）</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_12_02", "moduleId": "p3_7_12"}, {"title": "1.3 形容词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. solid [ˈsɒlɪd]：坚实的（例：solid theoretical knowledge 扎实的理论知识）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. academic [ˌækəˈdemɪk]：学术的（例：academic atmosphere 学术氛围）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. innovative [ˈɪnəveɪtɪv]：创新的（例：innovative research methods 创新的研究方法）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. well-designed [ˌwel dɪˈzaɪnd]：精心设计的（例：well-designed courses 精心设计的课程）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. cutting-edge [ˌkʌtɪŋ ˈedʒ]：前沿的（例：cutting-edge technologies 前沿技术）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. comprehensive [ˌkɒmprɪˈhensɪv]：全面的（例：comprehensive understanding 全面的理</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>解）</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_12_03", "moduleId": "p3_7_12"}, {"title": "2.1 自我介绍（Self-introduction）", "section": "二、考研面试核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>框架：开场问候→教育背景→实践/ 研究经历→专业热情→结尾</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>展望</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">1. 开场问候：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“Good morning/afternoon, respected professors. I’m truly honored to attend this postgraduate interview. My name is [Your Name], and I’m from [Your Hometown]—a city famous for [Local Feature, e.g., its long history of traditional culture]. It’s a great pleasure to share my academic journey with you today.”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（早上好/ 下午好，尊敬的教授们。非常荣幸参加这次研究生面试。我叫[你的名字]，来自[你的家乡]—— 一座以[地方特色，如“悠久的传统文化”] 闻名的城市。今天很开心能和各位分享我的学术经历。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">2. 教育背景：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“I graduated from [Your Undergraduate University] with a major in [Your Undergraduate Major]. During my undergraduate studies, I focused on building a solid academic foundation. I excelled in courses like [Course 1, e.g., ‘Advanced Mathematics’] and [Course 2, e.g., ‘Introduction to Computer Science’]—these courses not only deepened my understanding of [Related Field] but also taught me [Skill, e.g., ‘how to apply theoretical knowledge to practical problems’].”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（我毕业于[本科院校]，本科专业是[本科专业]。本科期间，我专注于打下坚实的学术基础。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我在《[课程1，如“高等数学”]》和《[课程2，如“计算机科学导论”]》等课程中表现优异—— 这些课程不仅加深了我对[相关领域] 的理解，还让我学会了[技能，如“如何将理论知识应用于实际问题”]。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">3. 实践/ 研究经历：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“I also actively participated in academic and practical activities. For example, I joined a research project titled [Project Name, e.g., ‘Study on Urban Traffic Optimization’] led by Professor [Professor’s Name]. My responsibility was to [Your Task, e.g., ‘collect and analyze traffic data using Python’]. During the project, we faced [Challenge, e.g., ‘data inconsistency’], and I proposed [Solution, e.g., ‘a data cleaning method based on Excel macros’] to solve it.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Finally, our project was selected as [Achievement, e.g., ‘the excellent undergraduate research project of the university’].”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（我还积极参与学术和实践活动。例如，我加入了由[教授姓名] 教授带领的[项目名称，如“城市交通优化研究”] 项目。我的职责是[你的任务，如“用Python 收集和分析交通数据”]。项目期间，我们遇到了[挑战，如“数据不一致”] 的问题，我提出了[解决方案，如“基于Excel 宏的数据清洗方法”] 来解决。最终，我们的项目被评为[成果，如“校级优秀本科科研项目”]。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">4. 专业热情：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“My enthusiasm for [Your Intended Postgraduate Major] grew gradually through these experiences. I’m particularly interested in [Specific Research Area, e.g., ‘machine learning in medical image recognition’]—I’ve read over 20 related papers, including [Paper Title, e.g., ‘Deep Learning for Lung Cancer Detection’] published in [Journal Name]. These papers inspired me to [Idea, e.g., ‘explore how to improve the accuracy of small tumor recognition’], and I hope to deepen this research during my postgraduate study.”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（通过这些经历，我对[报考的研究生专业] 的热情逐渐加深。我尤其关注[具体研究方向，如 “机器学习在医学图像识别中的应用”]—— 我已阅读了20 多篇相关论文，包括发表在[期刊名称] 上的《[论文标题，如“深度学习用于肺癌检测”]》。这些论文启发我[想法，如“探索如何提高小肿瘤识别的准确率”]，希望能在研究生阶段深入研究这一方向。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">5. 结尾展望：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“I’m eager to pursue postgraduate study at your university because of its strong academic atmosphere and outstanding research resources in [Your Intended Major]. I believe with your guidance and my efforts, I can make progress in [Research Area] and contribute to academic development. Thank you for your time!”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（我渴望在贵校攻读研究生，因为贵校在[报考专业] 领域有着浓厚的学术氛围和优秀的研究资源。我相信在各位教授的指导和我的努力下，我能在[研究方向] 取得进步，为学术发展贡献力量。感谢各位的时间！）</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_12_04", "moduleId": "p3_7_12"}, {"title": "2.2 为什么选择我们学校/ 这个专业（Why choose our", "section": "二、考研面试核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>university/major?）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“I choose your university and this major for three key reasons.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>First, your university has an excellent reputation in [Your Intended Major]—your [Research Institute/Laboratory, e.g., ‘AI Research Institute’] has made remarkable achievements, such as [Achievement, e.g., ‘developing a new AI model for weather prediction’]. The experienced professors here, like Professor [Professor’s Name] who specializes in [Professor’s Field], are also a major attraction for me.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Second, the curriculum of [Your Intended Major] is well-designed. It covers both fundamental theories (e.g., [Course, e.g., ‘Basic Machine Learning’]) and cutting-edge topics (e.g., [Course, e.g., ‘Advanced Deep Learning’]), which perfectly matches my desire to ‘learn the basics and explore the new’.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Third, the location of your university in [City Name] provides unique advantages—this city is a hub for [Related Industry, e.g., ‘high-tech companies’], offering more opportunities for internships and academic exchanges. All these factors make your university my top choice.”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（我选择贵校和这个专业主要有三个原因：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第一，贵校在[报考专业] 领域声誉卓越—— 贵校的[研究所/ 实验室，如“人工智能研究所”] 取得了显著成果，例如[成果，如“开发了用于天气预报的新型AI 模型”]。这里经验丰富的教授，如专注于[教授研究领域] 的[教授姓名] 教授，也是吸引我的重要原因。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第二，[报考专业] 的课程设置精心。既涵盖基础理论（如《[课程，如“机器学习基础”]》）， 也包含前沿主题（如《[课程，如“高级深度学习”]》），这与我“打好基础、探索新知” 的需求高度契合。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第三，贵校位于[城市名称]，地理位置独具优势—— 这座城市是[相关行业，如“高科技企业”] 的聚集地，能提供更多实习和学术交流机会。这些因素让贵校成为我的首选。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_12_05", "moduleId": "p3_7_12"}, {"title": "2.3 介绍一项项目/ 研究（Introduce a project/research）", "section": "二、考研面试核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>“During my undergraduate studies, I participated in a research project titled [Project Name, e.g., ‘Analysis of User Behavior on E-commerce Platforms’]. The main goal was to [Goal, e.g., ‘identify factors influencing user purchase decisions’].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>My responsibility was to [Task, e.g., ‘collect user data from [Platform Name] and conduct statistical analysis’]. First, I did a literature review to understand existing research on user behavior. Then, I used [Tool/Method, e.g., ‘SQL to extract data and SPSS to analyze correlations’].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>We faced a challenge: [Challenge, e.g., ‘some user data was missing’]. To solve this, I proposed [Solution, e.g., ‘using a data imputation method based on similar user groups’], which reduced data loss by 30%.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Finally, our project concluded that [Result, e.g., ‘product reviews and price are the top two factors affecting purchases’]. This experience taught me [Lesson, e.g., ‘the importance of rigorous data analysis and flexible problem-solving’]—skills I believe will help my postgraduate research.”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（本科期间，我参与了一个名为[项目名称，如“电商平台用户行为分析”] 的研究项目。项目的主要目标是[目标，如“找出影响用户购买决策的因素”]。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我的职责是[任务，如“从[平台名称] 收集用户数据并进行统计分析”]。首先，我通过文献综述了解了用户行为研究的现有成果；然后，我使用[工具/ 方法，如“SQL 提取数据，SPSS 分析相关性”] 开展工作。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我们遇到了一个挑战：[挑战，如“部分用户数据缺失”]。为解决这个问题，我提出了[解决方案， 如“基于相似用户群体的数据填补方法”]，将数据损失率降低了30%。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>最终，我们的项目得出结论：[结果，如“商品评价和价格是影响购买的前两大因素”]。这次经历让我学会了[收获，如“严谨的数据分析和灵活的问题解决能力”]—— 我相信这些技能对研究生阶段的研究很有帮助。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_12_06", "moduleId": "p3_7_12"}, {"title": "2.4 你的优点和缺点是什么（Strengths and weaknesses）", "section": "二、考研面试核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>“My strengths are closely related to academic research. First, I have strong self-learning ability—when I first 接触ed [New Field, e.g., ‘machine learning’], I taught myself through online courses and textbooks, and finally got an A in the related course. Second, I’m detail-oriented: in the [Previous Project], I noticed a [Detail, e.g., ‘calculation error in data analysis’] that others missed, which helped avoid wrong conclusions.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>As for weaknesses, I used to be ‘too focused on perfection’—I would spend too much time polishing small parts of a report, which sometimes delayed progress. To improve, I now set clear timelines for each task (e.g., ‘finish data analysis in 3 days, write the report in 2 days’)</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>and review my progress daily. This way, I balance quality and efficiency better.”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（我的优点与学术研究密切相关。首先，我有较强的自学能力—— 初次接触[新领域，如“机器学习”] 时，我通过在线课程和教材自学，最终在相关课程中取得了A 的成绩。其次，我注重细节：在[之前的项目] 中，我发现了一个别人忽略的[细节，如“数据分析中的计算错误”]， 避免了得出错误结论。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>至于缺点，我以前“过于追求完美”—— 会花太多时间打磨报告的小部分内容，有时会延误进度。为改进，我现在为每个任务设定明确的时间节点（如“3 天完成数据分析，2 天撰写报告”）， 并每天复盘进度。这样，我能更好地平衡质量和效率。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_12_07", "moduleId": "p3_7_12"}, {"title": "2.5 对本专业前沿研究的了解（Understanding of cutting-edge", "section": "二、考研面试核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>research）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“I’ve been following the cutting-edge trends in [Your Intended Major] closely. There are two key trends that stand out to me.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>First, [Trend 1, e.g., ‘the integration of AI and traditional industries’]—in the field of [Sub-field, e.g., ‘manufacturing’], researchers are using [Technology, e.g., ‘AI-driven predictive maintenance’] to reduce equipment failure rates. For example, a team from [University/Company] developed [System Name], which improved maintenance efficiency by 40%. This trend is driven by [Reason, e.g., ‘the need for cost reduction and efficiency improvement in industries’].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Second, [Trend 2, e.g., ‘the development of low-power AI models’]—with the popularity of [Device, e.g., ‘portable medical devices’], there’s an urgent need for AI models that consume less energy. I recently read a paper in [Journal Name] that proposed [Model Name]—this model cuts energy consumption by 50% while maintaining accuracy.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I’m most interested in [Your Focus, e.g., ‘how low-power AI models can be applied to remote medical diagnosis’]. I believe this direction can help solve [Problem, e.g., ‘the lack of medical resources in rural areas’], and I hope to explore it further during my postgraduate study.”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（我一直密切关注[报考专业] 的前沿趋势，有两个趋势尤为突出：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第一，[趋势1，如“人工智能与传统行业的融合”]—— 在[子领域，如“制造业”]，研究人员正使用[技术，如“AI 驱动的预测性维护”] 降低设备故障率。例如，[大学/ 公司] 的团队开发了 [系统名称]，将维护效率提高了40%。这一趋势的驱动力是[原因，如“行业降本增效的需求”]。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>第二，[趋势2，如“低功耗AI 模型的发展”]—— 随着[设备，如“便携式医疗设备”] 的普及， 对低能耗AI 模型的需求日益迫切。我最近在[期刊名称] 上读到一篇论文，提出了[模型名称]—— 该模型在保持准确率的同时，将能耗降低了50%。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我最关注的是[你的研究重点，如“低功耗AI 模型如何应用于远程医疗诊断”]。我相信这个方向能帮助解决[问题，如“农村地区医疗资源匮乏”] 的问题，希望在研究生阶段深入探索。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_12_08", "moduleId": "p3_7_12"}, {"title": "三、模拟面试对话", "section": "三、模拟面试对话", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>Professor 1 (P1)：Good morning. Could you start by introducing yourself briefly? （教授1：早上好。能先简要介绍一下自己吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Candidate (C)：Good morning, respected professors. I’m Li Hua, from Xi’an—a city with a long history. I graduated from Shaanxi Normal University with a major in Computer Science.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>During my undergraduate studies, I excelled in ‘Data Structures’ and ‘Machine Learning’, and joined a project on ‘AI-based Text Classification’. My task was to clean text data and train models; finally, our model achieved 89% accuracy. I’m eager to study ‘AI in Education’ at your university, as your AI Research Institute has done outstanding work in this area. Thank you.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（考生：早上好，尊敬的教授们。我叫李华，来自西安—— 一座历史悠久的城市。我毕业于陕西师范大学，本科专业是计算机科学。本科期间，我在《数据结构》和《机器学习》课程中表现优异，并加入了“基于AI 的文本分类” 项目。我的任务是清洗文本数据和训练模型，最终我们的模型准确率达到了89%。我渴望在贵校学习“人工智能在教育中的应用” 方向，因为贵校的人工智能研究所在这一领域成果卓越。谢谢。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Professor 2 (P2)：Interesting. Why do you want to study ‘AI in Education’ specifically? （教授2：很有意思。你为什么特别想研究“人工智能在教育中的应用”？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>C：Because I noticed [Problem, e.g., ‘many rural students lack personalized tutoring’]. AI can solve this by [Solution, e.g., ‘developing adaptive learning systems’]. Your university’s Professor Wang published a paper on this last year—his idea of ‘using AI to analyze students’ learning habits’ really inspired me. I hope to work with him to explore how to make such systems more suitable for rural students.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（考生：因为我发现[问题，如“许多农村学生缺乏个性化辅导”]。人工智能可以通过[解决方案，如“开发自适应学习系统”] 来解决这个问题。贵校王教授去年发表了相关论文—— 他提出的“用AI 分析学生学习习惯” 的想法给了我很大启发。我希望能和他一起探索如何让这类系统更适合农村学生。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>P1：You mentioned a project earlier. What was the biggest challenge you faced there? （教授1：你之前提到了一个项目。项目中你遇到的最大挑战是什么？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>C：The biggest challenge was ‘noisy text data’—many collected texts had typos or irrelevant content. At first, I tried manual cleaning, but it was too slow. Then I learned about [Method, e.g., ‘a rule-based text filtering tool’] online and modified it to fit our data. Finally, the cleaning efficiency improved by 60%. This taught me to ‘look for existing tools and adapt them’ instead of starting from scratch.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（考生：最大的挑战是“文本数据嘈杂”—— 许多收集到的文本有拼写错误或无关内容。起初我尝试人工清洗，但速度太慢。后来我在网上了解到[方法，如“基于规则的文本过滤工具”]， 并对其进行修改以适配我们的数据。最终，清洗效率提高了60%。这让我学会了“寻找现有工具并改造”，而不是从零开始。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>P2：Thank you. We’ll let you know the result soon.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（教授2：谢谢。我们会尽快通知你结果。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>C：Thank you for your time and guidance! （考生：感谢各位的时间和指导！）</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_12_09", "moduleId": "p3_7_12"}, {"title": "4.1 高频搭配", "section": "四、单词句型固搭总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. build a solid academic foundation：打下坚实的学术基础</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. participate in research projects：参与研究项目</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. conduct literature review：开展文献综述</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. solve research challenges：解决研究挑战</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. cutting-edge research/trends：前沿研究/ 趋势</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. align with research interests：与研究兴趣契合</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. well-designed curriculum：精心设计的课程设置</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. adaptive learning systems：自适应学习系统</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_12_10", "moduleId": "p3_7_12"}, {"title": "4.2 核心句型", "section": "四、单词句型固搭总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 自我介绍框架：I graduated from... with a major in... During my studies, I... I’m interested in...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>because...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 描述项目：I participated in... My responsibility was to... We faced... and solved it by...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Finally, we...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 阐述选校理由：I choose your university because of its... (reputation/resources/curriculum)</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 谈论前沿趋势：One key trend in [Field] is... It is driven by... I’m interested in... because...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. 说明优点：My strength is... For example, I...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. 说明缺点：My weakness was... To improve, I now...</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_12_11", "moduleId": "p3_7_12"}, {"title": "5.1 填词题", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1.  I spent 6 months preparing for the ________ (考研) and focused on improving my</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>professional knowledge.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. The ________ (学术氛围) of your university is very attractive to students who love</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>research.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. We need to ________ (开展) a literature review before starting the research project.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. The ________ (前沿技术) in AI has changed the way we live and work.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. My research interests ________ (契合) with the work of Professor Li in your university.</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_12_12", "moduleId": "p3_7_12"}, {"title": "5.2 句型仿写", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 仿照“我毕业于[院校]，本科专业是[专业]，本科期间参与了[项目]” 造句（用“Nanjing</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>University, Environmental Science, ‘Study on River Pollution’”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 仿照“选校理由：贵校在[领域] 的声誉+ 研究资源+ 课程设置” 造句（用“environmental</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>engineering, pollution control laboratory, ‘Eco-friendly Materials’ course”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 仿照“项目挑战：遇到[问题]，通过[方法] 解决，结果[成果]” 造句（用“sample shortage,</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>cooperating with local farms, collected 200 more samples”）。</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_12_13", "moduleId": "p3_7_12"}, {"title": "5.3 情景模拟", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>根据自身情况，补全“对专业前沿的了解” 模板：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“I’ve followed the cutting-edge trends in [你的专业] closely. One key trend is ________ (趋势 1), which focuses on ________ (趋势内容). For example, ________ (相关案例). Another trend is ________ (趋势2), driven by ________ (趋势原因). I’m most interested in ________ (你的研究重点) because ________ (选择原因). I hope to explore this during my postgraduate study.”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>答案</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_12_14", "moduleId": "p3_7_12"}, {"title": "5.1 填词题", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. postgraduate entrance examination</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. academic atmosphere</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. conduct</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. cutting-edge technology</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. align</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_12_15", "moduleId": "p3_7_12"}, {"title": "5.2 句型仿写", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1.  I graduated from Nanjing University with a major in Environmental Science. During my</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>undergraduate studies, I participated in a project titled “Study on River Pollution”.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2.  I choose your university because of its excellent reputation in environmental engineering,</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>the advanced pollution control laboratory, and the well-designed “Eco-friendly Materials”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>course.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. During the project, we faced sample shortage. We solved it by cooperating with local</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>farms, and finally collected 200 more samples.</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_12_16", "moduleId": "p3_7_12"}, {"title": "5.3 情景模拟（示例）", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>“I’ve followed the cutting-edge trends in ‘Environmental Science’ closely. One key trend is ‘carbon neutrality-oriented waste treatment’, which focuses on ‘developing low-carbon technologies to reduce waste emissions’. For example, a team in Beijing developed a ‘biogas production system from kitchen waste’ that cuts carbon emissions by 30%. Another trend is ‘smart environmental monitoring’, driven by ‘the need for real-time pollution tracking’. I’m most interested in ‘how to apply smart monitoring to rural areas’ because ‘rural environmental pollution is often ignored’. I hope to explore this during my postgraduate study.”</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_12_17", "moduleId": "p3_7_12"}]}, {"id": "p3_7_13", "code": "7.13", "title": "面无不胜- 留学篇", "articles": [{"title": "1.1 名词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. study abroad [ˈstʌdi əˈbrɔːd]：留学（例：prepare for study abroad 准备留学）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. academic transcript [ˌækəˈdemɪk ˈtrænskrɪpt]：成绩单（例：submit academic transcript 提</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>交成绩单）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. research interest [rɪˈsɜːtʃ ˈɪntrəst]：研究兴趣（例：talk about research interest 谈论研究兴</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>趣）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. faculty [ˈfæklti]：教职工；院系（例：renowned faculty 知名师资）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. curriculum [kəˈrɪkjələm]：课程设置（例：comprehensive curriculum 全面的课程设置）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. career aspiration [kəˈrɪə ˌæspəˈreɪʃn]：职业抱负（例：share career aspirations 分享职业</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>抱负）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. entry-level position [ˈentri ˈlevl pəˈzɪʃn]：入门级职位（例：apply for an entry-level position</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>申请入门级职位）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. industry trend [ˈɪndəstri trend]：行业趋势（例：follow industry trends 关注行业趋势）</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_13_01", "moduleId": "p3_7_13"}, {"title": "1.2 动词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. pursue [pəˈsjuː]：攻读；追求（例：pursue a master’s degree 攻读硕士学位）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. specialize [ˈspeʃəlaɪz]：专攻（例：specialize in artificial intelligence 专攻人工智能）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. align [əˈlaɪn]：契合（例：align with career goals 与职业目标契合）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. contribute [kənˈtrɪbjuːt]：贡献（例：contribute to team projects 为团队项目做贡献）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. acquire [əˈkwaɪə]：获得（例：acquire professional skills 获得专业技能）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. update [ˌʌpˈdeɪt]：更新（例：update knowledge of industry trends 更新行业趋势知识）</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_13_02", "moduleId": "p3_7_13"}, {"title": "1.3 形容词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. renowned [rɪˈnaʊnd]：知名的（例：renowned university 知名大学）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. comprehensive [ˌkɒmprɪˈhensɪv]：全面的（例：comprehensive training 全面的培训）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. motivated [ˈməʊtɪveɪtɪd]：积极的；有动力的（例：highly motivated learner 学习积极性高</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>的学生）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. critical [ˈkrɪtɪkl]：批判性的（例：critical thinking 批判性思维）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. practical [ˈpræktɪkl]：实用的（例：practical experience 实践经验）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. outspoken [aʊtˈspəʊkən]：坦率的；敢于表达的（例：outspoken in discussions 讨论中敢</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>于表达）</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_13_03", "moduleId": "p3_7_13"}, {"title": "2.1 自我介绍（Please introduce yourself.）", "section": "二、留学面试核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>框架：基础信息→学术背景+ 兴趣→课外/ 实践经历→与目标院</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>校的关联</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">1. 模板回答：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“Hello, my name is [Your Name]. I’m currently a senior at [Your Undergraduate University], majoring in [Your Major]. I’ve always been passionate about [Academic Interest, e.g., ‘sustainable urban design’]—during my studies, I excelled in courses like [Course 1, e.g., ‘Urban Planning Theory’] and [Course 2, e.g., ‘Eco-friendly Architecture’], which deepened my understanding of this field.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>In my spare time, I joined a student research team focused on [Project Theme, e.g., ‘green space planning in small cities’]. My role was to [Your Task, e.g., ‘collect data on local green areas and analyze residents’ needs’]. Through this project, I learned to [Skill, e.g., ‘collaborate with cross-disciplinary teammates’] and developed a stronger interest in applying theory to real-world issues.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I believe these academic and practical experiences have prepared me well for the [Target Program, e.g., ‘Master of Urban Planning’] at your university. I’m eager to learn from your faculty’s expertise and contribute to your research community. Thank you.”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（您好，我叫[你的名字]。目前我是[本科院校] 的大四学生，主修[专业名称]。我一直对[学术兴趣，如“可持续城市设计”] 充满热情—— 学习期间，我在《[课程1，如“城市规划理论”]》 和《[课程2，如“生态友好型建筑”]》等课程中表现优异，加深了对该领域的理解。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>课余时间，我加入了一个专注于[项目主题，如“小城市绿地规划”] 的学生研究团队。我的职责是[你的任务，如“收集当地绿地数据并分析居民需求”]。通过这个项目，我学会了[技能， 如“与跨学科队友协作”]，也更渴望将理论应用于实际问题。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我相信这些学术和实践经历，能让我更好地适应贵校[目标项目，如“城市规划硕士”] 的学习。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我期待向贵校师资学习，并为研究社区贡献力量。谢谢。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">2. 讲解：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>开篇简洁报出姓名、当前院校和专业，快速建立基础认知；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>结合具体课程和研究项目，体现学术热情和实践能力，避免空泛描述；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>结尾关联目标院校项目，展示“为何我适合贵校”，增强针对性。</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_13_04", "moduleId": "p3_7_13"}, {"title": "2.2 为什么选择我们学校和这个专业（Why do you choose our", "section": "二、留学面试核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>university and this major?）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>框架：选校理由（资源/ 师资）→选专业理由（兴趣/ 目标）→两者契</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>合点</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">1. 模板回答：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“I choose your university mainly for its outstanding strength in [Field, e.g., ‘environmental science’]. Your [Research Institute/Laboratory, e.g., ‘Global Environmental Change Lab’] is renowned for studies on [Specific Topic, e.g., ‘carbon neutrality in urban areas’]—I’ve read Professor [Professor’s Name]’s paper on this topic, and his ideas on [Key Idea, e.g., ‘using big data to track carbon emissions’] deeply inspired me. Additionally, your program’s curriculum, such as the course [Course Name, e.g., ‘Practical Environmental Policy’], combines theory with case studies, which perfectly matches my desire to ‘learn by doing’.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>As for this major, my interest in [Field, e.g., ‘environmental science’] started when I participated in a [Experience, e.g., ‘community waste-sorting project’] in my sophomore year.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I realized the importance of scientific solutions to environmental issues, and my long-term career goal is to work in [Career, e.g., ‘international environmental organizations’] to promote sustainable development. Your university’s program, with its focus on [Program Feature, e.g., ‘global environmental governance’], aligns exactly with this goal.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I’m confident that your university’s resources and this major’s focus will help me grow into a professional in this field.”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（我选择贵校，主要因为贵校在[领域，如“环境科学”] 的卓越实力。贵校的[研究所/ 实验室，如“全球环境变化实验室”] 在[具体主题，如“城市碳中和”] 研究方面享誉盛名—— 我读过[教授姓名] 教授关于该主题的论文，他提出的[核心观点，如“用大数据追踪碳排放”] 让我深受启发。此外，项目的课程设置（如《[课程名称，如“环境政策实践”]》）将理论与案例结合，完全契合我“在实践中学习” 的需求。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>选择这个专业，是因为大二参与[经历，如“社区垃圾分类项目”] 时，我开始对[领域，如“环境科学”] 产生兴趣。我意识到环境问题需要科学解决方案，而我的长期职业目标是进入[职业， 如“国际环境组织”] 推动可持续发展。贵校项目聚焦[项目特色，如“全球环境治理”]，与这个目标高度契合。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我相信贵校的资源和专业方向，能帮助我成长为该领域的专业人才。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">2. 讲解：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>选校理由需具体（提及教授、实验室、课程），避免“贵校声誉好” 这类空泛表述；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>选专业理由结合个人经历，说明兴趣起源，体现“长期规划” 而非临时决定；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>强调“学校资源” 与“个人目标” 的契合，证明“我做过调研，并非盲目申请”。</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_13_05", "moduleId": "p3_7_13"}, {"title": "2.3 你的学术优势和劣势是什么（What are your academic", "section": "二、留学面试核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>strengths and weaknesses?）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>框架：优势（结合学术场景+ 例子）→劣势（诚实+ 改进行动+ 成果）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">1. 优势模板：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“My biggest academic strength is my critical thinking ability. When working on academic papers or group projects, I don’t just accept existing theories—I always try to question and analyze. For example, in my junior year, I wrote a paper on [Topic, e.g., ‘urban traffic congestion’]. Instead of following the common view that ‘building more roads solves congestion’, I analyzed data from [City Name] and proposed that ‘optimizing public transport routes’ is more effective. My professor praised this innovative perspective, and the paper was selected as the ‘outstanding undergraduate paper’ of our department.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Another strength is my self-discipline. I always make a study plan at the start of each semester and stick to it—even when facing multiple deadlines, I can prioritize tasks and ensure quality, which helped me maintain a GPA of [GPA Score] during my undergraduate studies.”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（我最大的学术优势是批判性思维能力。写学术论文或做小组项目时，我不会盲目接受现有理论，而是尝试质疑和分析。比如大三时，我写了一篇关于[主题，如“城市交通拥堵”] 的论文。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>没有认同“修更多路就能解决拥堵” 的普遍观点，我分析了[城市名称] 的数据，提出“优化公交路线” 更有效的结论。教授认可这个创新视角，论文还被评为系里的“优秀本科论文”。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>另一个优势是自律。每学期开始我都会制定学习计划并执行—— 即使面临多个截止日期，也能合理排序任务、保证质量，这让我本科期间GPA 保持在[GPA 分数]。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">2. 劣势模板：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“As for weaknesses, I used to struggle with academic presentations. I was nervous about speaking in front of a large audience, which sometimes made my explanations unclear. To improve, I joined my university’s ‘Public Speaking Club’ last year. I practiced giving short presentations every week, asked seniors for feedback, and even recorded myself to adjust my tone and body language.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Now, I feel much more confident. Last month, I presented our research project at a [Event, e.g., ‘university academic forum’], and many listeners said my explanation was clear and logical. I still need to practice more, but I’ve made obvious progress.”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（至于劣势，我以前不擅长学术展示。在很多人面前发言会紧张，有时导致讲解不清晰。为改进，去年我加入了学校的“公共演讲俱乐部”：每周练习简短展示、向学长寻求反馈，甚至录下自己的展示来调整语气和肢体语言。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>现在我自信多了。上个月在[活动，如“校级学术论坛”] 上展示我们的研究项目时，很多听众说我的讲解清晰有条理。虽然还需要更多练习，但已经有了明显进步。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">3. 讲解：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>优势需“学术相关”（如思维、自律、数据分析能力），用具体案例证明，避免“性格好” 这类非学术优势；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>劣势需“真实且可改进”（避免“拖延症”“不喜欢学习” 等致命问题），重点突出“改进行动” 和 “成果”，体现成长心态。</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_13_06", "moduleId": "p3_7_13"}, {"title": "2.4 你毕业后的职业规划是什么（What are your career plans after", "section": "二、留学面试核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>graduation?）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>框架：短期（1-3 年）→中期（3-5 年）→长期（5 年以上）→与留学</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>项目的关联</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">1. 模板回答：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“After graduating from your program, my short-term plan (1-3 years) is to join a [Industry, e.g., ‘renewable energy company’] as an entry-level [Position, e.g., ‘project assistant’]. I want to apply the knowledge I’ve learned—such as [Skill, e.g., ‘solar energy project design’]—to practical work, learn from senior colleagues, and master basic industry workflows.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>In the medium term (3-5 years), I hope to take on more responsibilities, like leading small projects on [Topic, e.g., ‘solar energy promotion in rural areas’]. I also plan to participate in industry conferences to expand my network and stay updated with the latest trends, such as [Trend, e.g., ‘the integration of solar and wind energy’].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>In the long term (5+ years), I aim to become a [Position, e.g., ‘project manager’] in the renewable energy field. I want to lead large-scale projects that contribute to carbon neutrality, and maybe even start a consulting firm to help small and medium-sized enterprises adopt green energy solutions.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Your program’s focus on [Program Feature, e.g., ‘practical renewable energy projects’] will provide me with the skills and knowledge needed to achieve these goals. I believe this study experience is a key step in my career journey.”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（从贵校项目毕业后，我的短期规划（1-3 年）是加入[行业，如“可再生能源公司”]，担任入门级[职位，如“项目助理”]。我想将所学知识（如[技能，如“太阳能项目设计”]）应用到实际工作中，向资深同事学习，掌握行业基础流程。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>中期规划（3-5 年），我希望承担更多责任，比如带领[主题，如“农村太阳能推广”] 的小型项目。同时计划参加行业会议，拓展人脉并关注最新趋势（如[趋势，如“太阳能与风能融合”]）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>长期规划（5 年以上），我目标成为可再生能源领域的[职位，如“项目经理”]，带领推动碳中和的大型项目，甚至可能创办咨询公司，帮助中小企业采用绿色能源方案。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>贵校项目聚焦[项目特色，如“实践型可再生能源项目”]，能为我提供实现这些目标所需的技能和知识。我相信这次留学经历是我职业道路上的关键一步。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">2. 讲解：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>规划需“具体可行”（提及行业、职位、项目方向），避免“我想找个好工作” 这类模糊表述；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>分阶段说明，体现逻辑和长远思考；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>关联留学项目，证明“留学是实现规划的必要环节”，而非“为留学而留学”。</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_13_07", "moduleId": "p3_7_13"}, {"title": "三、模拟面试对话", "section": "三、模拟面试对话", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>Interviewer (I)：Hello! Welcome to today’s interview. Could you start by introducing yourself? （面试官：您好！欢迎参加今天的面试。能先做个自我介绍吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Candidate (C)：Hello! My name is Zhang Wei. I’m a senior at Beijing Forestry University, majoring in Landscape Architecture. I’m passionate about “urban ecological landscape design”—I once led a team to redesign a community park, where we added rain gardens to reduce waterlogging. This experience made me want to learn more about international design concepts. That’s why I’m applying for your Master of Landscape Architecture program.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（考生：您好！我叫张伟，是北京林业大学大四学生，主修风景园林。我对“城市生态景观设计” 充满热情—— 曾带领团队重新设计社区公园，加入雨水花园减少内涝。这次经历让我想学习更多国际设计理念，所以申请贵校的风景园林硕士项目。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I：Great. Why did you choose our university’s Landscape Architecture program specifically? （面试官：很好。为什么特别选择贵校的风景园林项目？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>C：Because your program is famous for “ecological design integration”. I’ve read Professor Lisa’s research on “urban green corridors”—her idea of connecting parks and residential areas to improve biodiversity really impressed me. Also, your course “International Landscape Design Cases” includes field trips to European cities, which I think will help me learn practical design skills. Your program’s focus matches my goal of becoming an ecological landscape designer.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（考生：因为贵校项目以“生态设计融合” 闻名。我读过莉萨教授关于“城市绿色廊道” 的研究 —— 她提出的“连接公园与居民区以提升生物多样性” 的理念让我印象深刻。此外，课程《国际景观设计案例》包含欧洲城市实地考察，我认为这能帮我学习实用设计技能。项目方向与我成为生态景观设计师的目标完全契合。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I：What are your academic strengths and weaknesses? （面试官：你的学术优势和劣势是什么？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>C：My strength is “design feasibility analysis”—I always consider both aesthetics and practicality. For example, in a campus square design project, I adjusted the pavement material to reduce maintenance costs, which was praised by my professor. As for weaknesses, I used to be slow at 3D modeling. But I’ve practiced every day for 6 months using software like SketchUp, and now I can complete a basic model in 2 hours.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（考生：我的优势是“设计可行性分析”—— 会兼顾美观和实用性。比如校园广场设计项目中， 调整铺装材料降低维护成本，得到教授认可。劣势是以前3D 建模速度慢，但6 个月来每天用SketchUp 练习，现在2 小时能完成基础模型。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I：Last question: What are your career plans after graduation? （面试官：最后一个问题：毕业后的职业规划是什么？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>C：Short-term, I want to work in a European design firm as a junior designer to learn international workflows. Medium-term, I hope to lead small-scale ecological projects in Asia.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Long-term, I want to return to China and start a design studio focusing on urban ecological landscape. Your program’s international resources will help me achieve these plans.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（考生：短期想进入欧洲设计公司做初级设计师，学习国际流程；中期希望带领亚洲小型生态项目；长期想回国创办专注城市生态景观的设计工作室。贵校的国际资源能帮我实现这些规划。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I：Thank you for your answers. We’ll contact you soon.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（面试官：感谢你的回答。我们会尽快联系你。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>C：Thank you for your time! （考生：感谢您的时间！）</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_13_08", "moduleId": "p3_7_13"}, {"title": "4.1 高频搭配", "section": "四、单词句型固搭总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. pursue a [Degree/Program]：攻读[学位/ 项目]（例：pursue a master’s program 攻读硕</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>士项目）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. be passionate about [Field/Topic]：对[领域/ 主题] 充满热情（例：be passionate about</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>renewable energy 对可再生能源充满热情）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. align with [Goal/Interest]：与[目标/ 兴趣] 契合（例：align with career goals 与职业目标</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>契合）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. contribute to [Project/Field]：为[项目/ 领域] 做贡献（例：contribute to ecological research</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>为生态研究做贡献）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. acquire [Skill/Knowledge]：获得[技能/ 知识]（例：acquire design skills 获得设计技能）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. stay updated with [Trend/Research]：关注[趋势/ 研究] 最新动态（例：stay updated with</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>industry trends 关注行业趋势）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. take on responsibilities：承担责任（例：take on project leadership responsibilities 承担项</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>目领导责任）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. apply [Knowledge/Skill] to practical work：将[知识/ 技能] 应用于实际工作（例：apply</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>theoretical knowledge to practical work 将理论知识应用于实际工作）</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_13_09", "moduleId": "p3_7_13"}, {"title": "4.2 核心句型", "section": "四、单词句型固搭总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 自我介绍：I’m currently a [Grade/Position] at [Institution], majoring in [Major]. I’m</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>passionate about [Interest], and I once [Experience] which taught me [Skill].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 选校理由：Your university’s [Resource, e.g., lab/professor] is renowned for [Achievement],</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>and your [Program Feature] matches my [Need/Goal].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 学术优势：My academic strength is [Strength], as shown by [Example]—this helped me</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>[Result].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 学术劣势：I used to struggle with [Weakness], but I improved by [Action], and now</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>[Progress].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. 职业规划：Short-term, I want to [Plan 1]; medium-term, I hope to [Plan 2]; long-term, I aim</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>to [Plan 3]. Your program will help me achieve these.</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_13_10", "moduleId": "p3_7_13"}, {"title": "5.1 填词题", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1.  I plan to ________ (攻读) a Master of Business Administration program at your university.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. Your university’s ________ (师资) in computer science includes many world-famous</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>professors.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. My research interests ________ (契合) with the work of your Environmental Science Lab.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4.  I need to ________ (获得) more practical experience to prepare for my future career.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. She attends industry conferences every year to stay ________ (更新) with the latest</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>trends.</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_13_11", "moduleId": "p3_7_13"}, {"title": "5.2 句型仿写", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 仿照“我是[院校] 的[年级] 学生，主修[专业]，对[兴趣] 充满热情” 造句（用“Shanghai</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Jiao Tong University, junior, Biomedical Engineering, ‘medical device innovation’”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 仿照“贵校[资源] 在[领域] 享誉盛名，与我的[目标] 契合” 造句（用“Biomedical</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Innovation Lab, medical device development, goal of becoming a medical device designer”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 仿照“短期我想[计划1]，中期希望[计划2]，长期目标[计划3]” 造句（用“join a medical</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>device company as an intern, lead small R&D projects, start a medical device startup”）。</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_13_12", "moduleId": "p3_7_13"}, {"title": "5.3 情景模拟", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>根据自身情况，补全“为什么选择这个专业” 的回答模板：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“I choose this major because my interest in [领域] started when I [个人经历]. I realized [感悟] and set a career goal to [职业目标]. Your program’s focus on [项目特色，如“practical R&D”] and resources like [具体资源，如“the Medical Device Lab”] align exactly with this goal. I believe studying here will help me [预期收获].”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>答案</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_13_13", "moduleId": "p3_7_13"}, {"title": "5.1 填词题", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. pursue</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. faculty</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. align</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. acquire</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. updated</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_13_14", "moduleId": "p3_7_13"}, {"title": "5.2 句型仿写", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. I’m currently a junior at Shanghai Jiao Tong University, majoring in Biomedical</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Engineering. I’m passionate about “medical device innovation”.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. Your university’s Biomedical Innovation Lab is renowned for medical device development,</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>which aligns with my goal of becoming a medical device designer.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. Short-term, I want to join a medical device company as an intern; medium-term, I hope to</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>lead small R&D projects; long-term, I aim to start a medical device startup.</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_13_15", "moduleId": "p3_7_13"}, {"title": "5.3 情景模拟（示例）", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>“I choose this major because my interest in ‘medical device innovation’ started when I volunteered at a community hospital— I saw many elderly patients struggle with complicated medical devices. I realized the need for user-friendly medical tools and set a career goal to design accessible medical devices. Your program’s focus on ‘practical R&D’ and resources like ‘the Medical Device Prototyping Lab’ align exactly with this goal. I believe studying here will help me master the skills to create devices that improve patients’ lives.”</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_13_16", "moduleId": "p3_7_13"}]}, {"id": "p3_7_14", "code": "7.14", "title": "滔滔不绝- 演讲篇", "articles": [{"title": "1.1 名词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. public speaking [ˌpʌblɪk ˈspiːkɪŋ]：公共演讲（例：practice public speaking 练习公共演讲）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. speech contest [spiːtʃ ˈkɒntest]：演讲比赛（例：participate in a speech contest 参加演讲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>比赛）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. impromptu speech [ɪmˈprɒmptjuː  spiːtʃ]：即兴演讲（例：prepare for an impromptu speech</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>准备即兴演讲）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. prepared speech [prɪˈpeəd  spiːtʃ]：定题演讲（例：write a prepared speech 写定题演讲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>稿）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. judge [dʒʌdʒ]：评委（例：answer questions from judges 回答评委问题）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. audience [ˈɔːdiəns]：听众（例：interact with the audience 与听众互动）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. TED talk [ted tɔːk]：TED 演讲（例：watch TED talks for inspiration 看TED 演讲找灵感）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. Model United Nations (MUN) [ˈmɒdl ˌjuˈnaɪtɪd ˈneɪʃnz]：模拟联合国（例：join a Model United</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Nations conference 参加模拟联合国大会）</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_14_01", "moduleId": "p3_7_14"}, {"title": "1.2 动词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. deliver [dɪˈlɪvə(r)]：发表（演讲）（例：deliver a speech 发表演讲）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. persuade [pəˈsweɪd]：说服（例：persuade the audience to take action 说服听众采取行动）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. inspire [ɪnˈspaɪə(r)]：启发；激励（例：inspire the audience with stories 用故事激励听众）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. cite [saɪt]：引用（例：cite a famous quote 引用一句名言）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. elaborate [ɪˈlæbəreɪt]：详细阐述（例：elaborate on a point 详细阐述一个观点）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. interact [ˌɪntərˈækt]：互动（例：interact with the audience during Q&A 问答环节与听众互</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>动）</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_14_02", "moduleId": "p3_7_14"}, {"title": "1.3 形容词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. coherent [kəʊˈhɪərənt]：条理清晰的（例：a coherent speech 条理清晰的演讲）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. persuasive [pəˈsweɪsɪv]：有说服力的（例：persuasive arguments 有说服力的论点）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. engaging [ɪnˈɡeɪdʒɪŋ]：吸引人的（例：an engaging opening 吸引人的开头）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. fluent [ˈfluːənt]：流利的（例：fluent English speaking 流利的英语表达）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. confident [ˈkɒnfɪdənt]：自信的（例：a confident speaker 自信的演讲者）</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_14_03", "moduleId": "p3_7_14"}, {"title": "2.1.1 国内赛事", "section": "二、演讲核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. “21 世纪杯” 全国英语演讲比赛</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>主办方：21 世纪报社</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>特点：国际公共演讲比赛（IPSC）中国区唯一选拔赛，分“校园选拔→地区复赛→地区决赛→全国总决赛” 四级赛制，侧重“讲好中国故事” 与国际传播能力。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. “外研社杯” 全国英语演讲大赛</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>特点：参赛人数最多、规模最大的英语演讲赛事之一，面向高校学生，提供展示综合语言能力的平台，考察定题演讲、即兴演讲与问答能力。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 全国中学生演讲与辩论联赛</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>主办方：创新人才教育研究会、NSDA 中国特点：含区域赛与总决赛，演讲形式包括原创演讲，优秀选手可晋级NSDA 全美总决赛， 侧重批判性思维与学术表达。</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_14_04", "moduleId": "p3_7_14"}, {"title": "2.1.2 国际赛事/ 活动", "section": "二、演讲核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 国际公共演讲比赛（IPSC）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>特点：“21 世纪杯” 国际赛，吸引全球选手参赛，知名度高，考察选手的跨文化沟通与公共演讲能力。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. TED 演讲大会</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>特点：非传统比赛，邀请全球各界人士分享思想/ 理念，申请成为演讲者需提交原创观点， 受众遍布全球，侧重“有价值的想法” 传播。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 模拟联合国（MUN）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>特点：学术交流活动，学生扮演外交官，通过演讲、辩论协商模拟联合国会议，知名大会包括“中国模拟联合国大会（CNMUN）”“海牙国际模拟联合国大会”，侧重全球视野与协作能力。</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_14_05", "moduleId": "p3_7_14"}, {"title": "2.2 演讲比赛流程（初赛→复赛→决赛）", "section": "二、演讲核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>阶段    核心环节        时长要求           考察重点</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>主题理解、内容逻辑、语言流畅</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>初赛    定题演讲                3-5 分钟</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>度</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>准备3-5 分钟，演讲2-3 分 临场反应、观点组织、即时表达</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>复赛    即兴演讲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>钟       能力</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>定题演讲+ 即兴问               内容深度、感染力、应变与互动决赛           定题5 分钟，问答2-3 分钟答                   能力</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_14_06", "moduleId": "p3_7_14"}, {"title": "2.3.1 定题演讲准备（核心步骤）", "section": "二、演讲核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 明确主题与目的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>避免跑题：从“自身熟悉+ 听众有价值” 的角度切入（例：讲“环保” 可结合自己参与的社区垃圾分类经历）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>明确目的：是“传递知识”（例：讲解“如何高效背单词”）、“说服观点”（例：“青少年应减少短视频使用”）还是“呼吁行动”（例：“一起参与公益植树”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 收集资料支撑观点</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>渠道：权威报告（如WHO 数据）、名人观点、真实案例（个人或新闻）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>示例：讲“健康生活” 可引用“WHO 研究显示：每天久坐超8 小时增加疾病风险”，再结合“身边朋友因运动改善睡眠” 的案例。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 撰写演讲稿（结构模板）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>部分               技巧与示例抓注意力：故事/ 问题/ 名言/ 数据例：“Last month, my friend fell ill 开头  because he sat at his desk for 10 hours a day. Have you ever thought about how sitting affects your health?”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>部分               技巧与示例分点论述（2-3 个论点，每点+ 证据）例：1. 饮食：多吃蔬果（引用研究）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>主体</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 运动：每天30 分钟快走（举案例）3. 睡眠：保证7 小时（讲危害）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>总结+ 呼吁/ 升华例：“Let’s start with small steps—eat one more</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>结尾</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>vegetable today, walk 10 minutes after work. Our health is worth it!”</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_14_07", "moduleId": "p3_7_14"}, {"title": "2.3.2 语言技巧（提升感染力）", "section": "二、演讲核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 发音：准确清晰，注意连读/ 弱读</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>例：“not at all” 连读为/nəˈtætɔːl/，“I am” 弱读为/aɪəm/。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>方法：听TED 演讲模仿，录制自己的声音对比修正。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 语调：有起伏，突出重点</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>强调关键词：“You MUST take action NOW!”（“MUST”“NOW” 语调升高）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>疑问语气：“Do you really want to regret it later?”（句尾语调上扬）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 词汇：丰富不晦涩</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>替换重复词：“good”→“excellent”“wonderful”；“very important”→“vital”“crucial”。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>避免生僻词：用“easy to understand” 代替“comprehensible”。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 语法：正确规范</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>避免低级错误：“He goes to school every day”（不用“go”）；“I have learned English for 5 years”（现在完成时表持续）。</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_14_08", "moduleId": "p3_7_14"}, {"title": "2.3.3 肢体语言（增强自信）", "section": "二、演讲核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 姿势：挺胸抬头，不弯腰/ 插兜，站定不频繁走动。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 眼神：扫视听众（左→右→前→后），不盯着天花板或稿子。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 手势：自然辅助表达（例：强调观点时伸1 根手指，表达“一起” 时张开双手），不夸张</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>或僵硬。</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_14_09", "moduleId": "p3_7_14"}, {"title": "2.3.4 通过演讲提升英语水平", "section": "二、演讲核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 基础：背诵优秀演讲稿（如TED 精选、演讲比赛获奖稿），熟悉结构与表达。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 进阶：自己写稿后修改（可借助工具或老师指导），模拟演讲（对着镜子/ 录视频，修正</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>肢体语言）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 实战：参加校园演讲活动，主动在课堂发言，积累临场经验。</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_14_10", "moduleId": "p3_7_14"}, {"title": "三、模拟演讲稿（示例：定题演讲“Small Steps for a Greener Earth”）", "section": "三、模拟演讲稿（示例：定题演讲“Small Steps for a Greener Earth”）", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>“Good morning, everyone.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Last week, I visited a park and saw plastic bottles everywhere. It made me think: What if every one of us throws one bottle a day? That’s 1.4 billion bottles in China alone! Protecting the earth doesn’t need big actions—it needs small steps.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>First, bring your own bag when shopping. My mom used to forget, but now she keeps a cloth bag in her purse. This small change has saved 50 plastic bags this year.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Second, save water. Turn off the tap when brushing your teeth—you’ll save 20 liters a day.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>My little sister now reminds the whole family to do this! Third, reuse things. Old clothes can be made into rags, empty jars can hold pens. I did this last month, and my desk is now tidy and eco-friendly.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Friends, the earth is our home. Let’s start with these small steps today. A small action from you, a big change for our planet.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Thank you!”</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_14_11", "moduleId": "p3_7_14"}, {"title": "4.1 高频搭配", "section": "四、单词句型固搭总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. participate in a speech contest：参加演讲比赛</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. deliver a prepared/impromptu speech：发表定题/ 即兴演讲</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. cite a research report/quote：引用研究报告/ 名言</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. interact with the audience：与听众互动</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. take small steps：从小事做起</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. improve pronunciation and intonation：提升发音语调</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. support an argument with evidence：用证据支撑论点</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. make a persuasive speech：发表有说服力的演讲</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_14_12", "moduleId": "p3_7_14"}, {"title": "4.2 核心句型", "section": "四、单词句型固搭总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 开头抓注意力：“Last [time/event], I [experience]. Have you ever [question]?”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 分点论述：“First, [point 1]. For example, [evidence]. Second, [point 2]. As [someone] said,</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>[quote].”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 结尾呼吁：“Let’s [action]. Our [goal] is worth it!”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 问答回应：“That’s a great question. I think [view] because [reason].”</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_14_13", "moduleId": "p3_7_14"}, {"title": "5.1 填词题", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. She spent 2 weeks preparing for the ________ (定题演讲) and practiced delivering it every</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>day.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. The ________ (评委) praised his speech for its clear logic and engaging stories.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. In the ________ (即兴演讲) 环节，she only had 3 minutes to prepare a speech about</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“friendship”.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. He likes to ________ (引用) Einstein’s quotes to inspire the audience.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. A ________ (自信的) speaker always makes eye contact with the audience.</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_14_14", "moduleId": "p3_7_14"}, {"title": "5.2 句型仿写", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 仿照“开头：故事+ 问题” 造句（主题：“阅读的重要性”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 仿照“主体：分点+ 例子” 造句（主题：“高效学习”，论点：“制定计划”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 仿照“结尾：呼吁行动” 造句（主题：“节约用电”）。</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_14_15", "moduleId": "p3_7_14"}, {"title": "5.3 情景模拟", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>假设参加“21 世纪杯” 初赛，主题为“我的校园生活”，补全演讲稿框架：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“Good afternoon, everyone.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>开头：（用“校园趣事” 抓注意力）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>主体：1. 学习：（例：“小组合作完成项目”）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 活动：（例：“参加英语角”）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 收获：___________________________________________（例：“学会时间管理”）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>结尾：（总结+ 呼吁“珍惜校园时光”）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Thank you!”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>答案</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_14_16", "moduleId": "p3_7_14"}, {"title": "5.1 填词题", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. prepared speech</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. judges</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. impromptu speech</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. cite</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. confident</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_14_17", "moduleId": "p3_7_14"}, {"title": "5.2 句型仿写", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. Last Friday, I finished a novel that changed my view of life. Have you ever found a book</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>that touched your heart?</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. First, make a daily study plan. For example, I spend 1 hour on math in the morning and 30</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>minutes on English in the evening—this helps me avoid wasting time.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. Let’s turn off the lights when we leave the room, use energy-saving bulbs at home. Small</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>steps like these will help save electricity for our planet!</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_14_18", "moduleId": "p3_7_14"}, {"title": "5.3 情景模拟（示例）", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>“Good afternoon, everyone.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>开头：Last month, my classmates and I stayed up late to prepare for a science project. We laughed, argued, and finally finished it at 2 a.m. That night, I realized how fun campus life can be. Have you ever had such a memorable moment with your classmates? 主体：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 学习：We often do group projects—last week, we analyzed a poem together. My deskmate</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>shared a new idea that made me see the poem in a different way.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 活动：I join the English corner every Thursday. Talking with foreign teachers and</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>classmates has made my English more fluent.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 收获：I used to be bad at time management, but now I make a weekly plan. This helps me</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>balance study and hobbies.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>结尾：Campus life is full of small joys and growth. Let’s cherish every day with our friends and teachers, because these days will be our best memories.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Thank you!”</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_14_19", "moduleId": "p3_7_14"}]}, {"id": "p3_7_15", "code": "7.15", "title": "滔滔不绝- 辩论篇", "articles": [{"title": "1.1 名词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. debate competition [dɪˈbeɪt ˌkɒmpəˈtɪʃn]：辩论赛（例：participate in an English debate</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>competition 参加英语辩论赛）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. BP style [ˌbiː ˈpiː staɪl]：英国议会制（例：use BP style in the debate 辩论采用英国议会制）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. rebuttal [rɪˈbʌtl]：反驳（例：make a strong rebuttal 进行有力反驳）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. proposition [ˌprɒpəˈzɪʃn]：正方（例：the proposition team 正方队伍）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. opposition [ˌɒpəˈzɪʃn]：反方（例：the opposition team 反方队伍）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. argument [ˈɑːɡjumənt]：论点（例：put forward an argument 提出论点）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. evidence [ˈevɪdəns]：论据（例：provide evidence to support the argument 提供论据支撑</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>论点）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. judge [dʒʌdʒ]：评委（例：persuade the judges with logic 用逻辑说服评委）</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_15_01", "moduleId": "p3_7_15"}, {"title": "1.2 动词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. argue [ˈɑːɡjuː]：论证；辩论（例：argue for/against a topic 支持/ 反对某辩题）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. refute [rɪˈfjuːt]：反驳（例：refute the opponent’s claim 反驳对方的主张）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. define [dɪˈfaɪn]：定义（例：define key terms in the debate 定义辩论中的关键术语）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. support [səˈpɔːt]：支撑（例：support the argument with data 用数据支撑论点）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. summarize [ˈsʌməraɪz]：总结（例：summarize the main points of the debate 总结辩论要</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>点）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. persuade [pəˈsweɪd]：说服（例：persuade the audience with facts 用事实说服听众）</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_15_02", "moduleId": "p3_7_15"}, {"title": "1.3 形容词", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. logical [ˈlɒdʒɪkl]：逻辑清晰的（例：a logical argument 逻辑清晰的论点）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. compelling [kəmˈpelɪŋ]：有说服力的（例：compelling evidence 有说服力的论据）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. flawed [flɔːd]：有漏洞的（例：a flawed claim 有漏洞的主张）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. concise [kənˈsaɪs]：简洁的（例：concise expression in debate 辩论中的简洁表达）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. objective [əbˈdʒektɪv]：客观的（例：objective analysis of the topic 对辩题的客观分析）</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_15_03", "moduleId": "p3_7_15"}, {"title": "2.1 常见英辩赛事（国内）", "section": "二、辩论核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. “外研社・国才杯” 全国大学生英语辩论赛</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>特点：国内规模最大、水平最高的英辩赛事之一，侧重逻辑思维与跨文化沟通，采用国际通用赛制（如BP 赛制）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 中国大学生英语辩论赛（CUDC）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>主办方：全国翻译专业学位研究生教育指导委员会、中国外文局CATTI 项目管理中心特点：面向大学生，注重学术性与实战性，考察辩手对社会热点的分析与论证能力。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. NHSDLC（中国高中生美式辩论联赛）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>特点：覆盖中小学，是国内影响力最大的青少年英辩赛事之一，采用美式辩论规则，侧重批判性思维与演讲表达结合。</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_15_04", "moduleId": "p3_7_15"}, {"title": "2.2 BP 赛制（英国议会制）", "section": "二、辩论核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>核心规则：4 支队伍参赛，分“正方” 与“反方”，每队2 人，共8 名辩手，角色分工如下：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>阵营 队伍缩写        角色名称              核心职责开篇立论，定义辩题，提出正方核心正方   OG         首相（Prime Minister）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>论点</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>正方   OG         副首相（Deputy PM）     补充首相论点，反驳反方上院观点反方   OO    反对党领袖（Leader of Opposition）  反驳正方上院，提出反方核心论点反对党副领袖（Deputy Leader of 反方   OO                     补充反方论点，强化反驳正方上院 Opposition）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>正方    CG    政府阁员（Member of Government）  深化正方论点，回应反方上院质疑总结正方观点，强化核心论据，不新正方    CG      政府党鞭（Government Whip）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>增论点</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>阵营 队伍缩写        角色名称              核心职责反方    CO    反对党阁员（Member of Opposition）  深化反方论点，回应正方下院观点总结反方观点，对比正反方优势，不反方    CO      反对党党鞭（Opposition Whip）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>新增论点</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">关键环节：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 开篇立论（各队首辩）：定义辩题、提出核心论点；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 自由辩论：交叉反驳，强化己方立场；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 总结陈词（党鞭）：总结观点，对比双方优势，不新增论点。</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_15_05", "moduleId": "p3_7_15"}, {"title": "2.3.1 语言表达：准确、简洁、有感染力", "section": "二、辩论核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 避免绝对化表达：不用“never”“all”“completely”，改用“mostly”“to a large extent”“in most</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>cases”（例：“AI will replace most jobs” 而非“AI will replace all jobs”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 语速语调适中：强调关键词（如数据、核心论点）时语调升高，陈述事实时语调平稳，避免</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>过快或过慢。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 肢体语言：挺胸抬头，用手势强调论点（如伸出1 根手指表“第一个论点”），与评委、听</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>众保持眼神接触，不夸张、不僵硬。</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_15_06", "moduleId": "p3_7_15"}, {"title": "2.3.2 逻辑论证：严密、有支撑", "section": "二、辩论核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 论点清晰：每个论点聚焦1 个核心（例：辩题“AI 会取代人类大部分工作”，正方论点1：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“AI 提升制造业效率，替代流水线工人”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 论据可靠：用权威数据（如“世界经济论坛报告显示，2030 年AI 将替代8500 万个岗位”）、</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>案例（如“富士康用AI 机器人替代6 万名流水线工人”）或专家观点支撑。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 推理合理：常用“演绎推理”（从普遍规律到具体案例）、“归纳推理”（从多个案例到普遍结</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>论）、“归谬法”（假设对方观点成立，推导荒谬结论，例：“若对方认为‘AI 不会替代客服’， 但目前80% 的基础客服咨询已由AI 处理，这与‘不会替代’矛盾”）。</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_15_07", "moduleId": "p3_7_15"}, {"title": "2.3.3 反驳技巧：抓漏洞、有针对性", "section": "二、辩论核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 听准对方漏洞：关注“数据错误”（如“对方引用的2020 年数据已过时，2023 年最新报告</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>显示相反趋势”）、“逻辑矛盾”（如“对方既说‘AI 效率高’又说‘不会替代工作’，两者矛盾”）、 “定义模糊”（如“对方未明确‘大部分工作’的范围，模糊了辩题核心”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 反驳时机：不打断对方发言，待对方结束后再针对性回应（例：“Thank you for your speech.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>However, your first point about AI’s limitations is flawed because…”）。</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_15_08", "moduleId": "p3_7_15"}, {"title": "2.3.4 团队协作与心态", "section": "二、辩论核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 分工明确：首辩负责立论，二辩负责补充与反驳，党鞭负责总结，赛前沟通统一观点，避免</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>自相矛盾。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 心态平稳：辩论是“观点碰撞” 而非“吵架”，面对激烈反驳时保持理性，不被情绪左右（例：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“I respect your opinion, but let’s look at the evidence again…”）。</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_15_09", "moduleId": "p3_7_15"}, {"title": "2.4.1 开篇陈词（以正方首相为例）", "section": "二、辩论核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>“Honorable judges, distinguished opponents, and dear audience, good afternoon.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I’m [Your Name], Prime Minister of the Opening Government. We firmly stand for the proposition that [Debate Topic, e.g., “Artificial intelligence will replace most human jobs”].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>First, let’s define key terms: By “artificial intelligence”, we mean advanced AI systems capable of autonomous decision-making (e.g., industrial robots, AI customer service).</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“Replace most jobs” refers to AI taking over over 50% of tasks in fields like manufacturing, customer service, and data entry.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Today, we will present three arguments:</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. AI improves efficiency, making it more cost-effective than human labor in manufacturing.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. AI handles repetitive tasks better, reducing human error in customer service.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. AI-driven automation is already expanding, with more industries adopting it.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Let’s start with our first argument…”</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_15_10", "moduleId": "p3_7_15"}, {"title": "2.4.2 主体论证（论点+ 论据+ 关联）", "section": "二、辩论核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>“Our first argument is that AI is more cost-effective than human labor in manufacturing.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>According to a 2024 report by the International Federation of Robotics, factories using AI robots reduce production costs by 30% on average. For example, Foxconn replaced 60,000 human workers with AI robots in 2023, and its production efficiency increased by 45%.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>This shows AI is not just a tool—it directly replaces human roles in labor-intensive fields, as companies prioritize cost-saving and efficiency.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Our second argument…”</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_15_11", "moduleId": "p3_7_15"}, {"title": "2.4.3 反驳对方（总结+ 漏洞+ 反证）", "section": "二、辩论核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>“Thank you, Leader of the Opposition. However, your arguments have two flaws:</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>First, you claimed “AI can’t handle complex tasks”, but you ignored the latest progress—AI systems like GPT-5 now assist in legal document analysis, a task once considered “complex”.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Second, your data about “AI creating more jobs” is outdated. The 2024 World Economic Forum report says AI will create 12 million jobs but replace 85 million, resulting in a net loss.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>In fact, your core claim that “AI won’t replace most jobs” contradicts real-world trends. For instance, 70% of banks in China now use AI for basic transactions, replacing 150,000 teller jobs…”</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_15_12", "moduleId": "p3_7_15"}, {"title": "2.4.4 总结陈词（正方党鞭为例）", "section": "二、辩论核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>“In conclusion, the Opening and Closing Government have proven our proposition:</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. AI replaces manufacturing jobs by cutting costs and improving efficiency.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. AI takes over repetitive tasks in customer service and data entry.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. Latest data shows AI’s replacement effect is already visible, with a net loss of jobs.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The opposition failed to address these facts—they used outdated data and ignored AI’s rapid development.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Therefore, we urge the judges and audience to support our position: Artificial intelligence will replace most human jobs. Thank you.”</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_15_13", "moduleId": "p3_7_15"}, {"title": "三、模拟辩论对话（辩题：AI will replace most human jobs）", "section": "三、模拟辩论对话（辩题：AI will replace most human jobs）", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">正方首相（OG-PM）开篇：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“Honorable judges, opponents, audience. I’m Li Ming, PM of OG. We argue AI will replace most human jobs.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Define “AI”: advanced systems like industrial robots and AI 客服. “Most jobs”: over 50% in labor-intensive and repetitive fields.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Our first point: AI is cheaper for factories. A 2024 report says AI robots cut costs by 30%.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Foxconn replaced 60k workers with AI, efficiency up 45%.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>This proves AI replaces human labor—companies choose AI to save money.”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>反方领袖（OO-Leader）反驳与立论：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“Thank you, PM. But your argument is flawed.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>First, your “cost-saving” claim ignores job creation: AI needs engineers to maintain it.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Foxconn hired 5,000 AI engineers after replacing workers—new jobs offset losses.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Second, “most jobs” is undefined. You only talked about manufacturing, but jobs like doctors, teachers, and artists require human empathy—AI can’t replace that.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Our proposition: AI won’t replace most jobs. Because AI creates new jobs, and human-centric jobs are irreplaceable.”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>正方副首相（OG-Deputy PM）补充反驳：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“Thank you, Leader of Opposition. But your “new jobs” argument is weak:</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5,000 AI engineers can’t offset 60,000 lost jobs. The 2024 WEF report says AI causes a net loss of 73 million jobs globally.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Also, you said “AI can’t replace empathy jobs”—but AI already assists doctors in diagnosis, and AI tutors help students. It’s not “full replacement”, but “replacing most tasks” in these jobs.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>This shows your “irreplacement” claim is incorrect…”</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_15_14", "moduleId": "p3_7_15"}, {"title": "4.1 高频搭配", "section": "四、单词句型固搭总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. define key terms：定义关键术语</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. put forward an argument：提出论点</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. support with data/reports：用数据/ 报告支撑</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. refute the opponent’s flaw：反驳对方漏洞</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. summarize main points：总结要点</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. net loss of jobs：岗位净减少</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. labor-intensive fields：劳动密集型领域</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. human-centric jobs：以人为中心的岗位</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_15_15", "moduleId": "p3_7_15"}, {"title": "4.2 核心句型", "section": "四、单词句型固搭总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 开篇定义：“By [Term], we mean [Definition], and [Term 2] refers to [Definition 2].”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 提出论点：“We will present [number] arguments: 1. [Argument 1]; 2. [Argument 2].”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 论据支撑：“According to [Source], [Data/Fact]. This shows [Link to Argument].”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 反驳漏洞：“Your argument is flawed because [Reason]. For example, [Counter-evidence].”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. 总结对比：“The opposition failed to address [Fact], while we have proven [Our Point].”</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_15_16", "moduleId": "p3_7_15"}, {"title": "5.1 填词题", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. We need to ________ (定义) key terms clearly to avoid confusion in the debate.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. The opposition used outdated data, so we can ________ (反驳) their claim with 2024</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>reports.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. The debater ________ (提出) three strong arguments to support the proposition.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. AI is more cost-effective in ________ (劳动密集型) fields like manufacturing.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. The judge praised our team for having a ________ (逻辑清晰的) argument structure.</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_15_17", "moduleId": "p3_7_15"}, {"title": "5.2 句型仿写", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 仿照“开篇定义” 造句（辩题：“Online education is better than traditional education”，定义</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“online education”“traditional education”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 仿照“论据支撑” 造句（论点：“Online education is more flexible”，用“教育部2024 数据”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 仿照“反驳漏洞” 造句（对方论点：“Online education lacks interaction”，指出漏洞：“忽略AI</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>互动工具”）。</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_15_18", "moduleId": "p3_7_15"}, {"title": "5.3 情景模拟", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>假设你是反方领袖，辩题“Online education is better than traditional education”，补全反驳与立论框架：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“Honorable judges, PM of OG. My name is [Your Name], Leader of the Opposition. We argue “Online education is NOT better than traditional education”.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>First, your definition of “online education” is too narrow—you ignored ________ (对方定义漏洞，如“缺乏线下互动场景”).</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Second, your argument about “flexibility” has a flaw: ________ (反驳漏洞，如“flexibility leads to poor self-discipline”). According to ________ (数据/ 案例，如“2024 学生学习报告：60% online students delay homework”), this shows ________ (反证：“flexibility harms learning efficiency”).</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Our core arguments:</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. Traditional education offers face-to-face interaction, which ________ (论点1：如</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“improves communication skills”).</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. Traditional education has stricter supervision, helping students ________ (论点2：如</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“stay focused”).</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Thank you.”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>答案</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_15_19", "moduleId": "p3_7_15"}, {"title": "5.1 填词题", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. define</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. refute</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. put forward</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. labor-intensive</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. logical</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_15_20", "moduleId": "p3_7_15"}, {"title": "5.2 句型仿写", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. By “online education”, we mean education delivered via online platforms (e.g., live classes,</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>pre-recorded videos). “Traditional education” refers to in-person learning in classrooms with face-to-face teacher-student interaction.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. Our argument is that online education is more flexible. According to a 2024 report by</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>China’s Ministry of Education, 80% of online students can adjust their study time to fit part-time jobs. This shows online education adapts better to students’ diverse schedules.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. Your argument that “online education lacks interaction” is flawed because you ignored</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>AI-powered interaction tools. For example, online platforms like Zoom offer breakout rooms for group discussions, and AI tutors provide real-time feedback—these tools bridge the “interaction gap”.</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_15_21", "moduleId": "p3_7_15"}, {"title": "5.3 情景模拟（示例）", "section": "五、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>“Honorable judges, PM of OG. My name is Wang Yu, Leader of the Opposition. We argue “Online education is NOT better than traditional education”.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>First, your definition of “online education” is too narrow—you ignored the lack of offline practical scenarios (e.g., science labs, art workshops) that online education can’t replicate.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Second, your argument about “flexibility” has a flaw: flexibility often leads to poor self-discipline. According to the 2024 National Student Learning Survey, 60% of online students delay homework by an average of 3 days, compared to 15% of traditional students.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>This shows flexibility doesn’t equal better learning—it harms efficiency.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Our core arguments:</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. Traditional education offers face-to-face interaction, which improves students’</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>communication and teamwork skills (e.g., group projects in classrooms help students practice collaboration).</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. Traditional education has stricter supervision, helping students stay focused (teachers can</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>notice distracted students and adjust teaching in real time).</p>"}], "id": "a_p3_7_15_22", "moduleId": "p3_7_15"}]}], "id": "p3", "file": "场景实战课_面试与演讲_7,11_7,15.md", "title": "场景实战课 · 面试与演讲", "range": "7.11 – 7.15"}, {"name": "场景课 · 职场·旅游·雅思（7.16–7.30）", "modules": [{"id": "p4_7_16", "code": "7.16", "title": "职场赢家- 商务基础", "articles": [{"title": "1.1 商务部门词汇", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. sales department [seɪlz dɪˈpɑːtmənt]：销售部（例：The sales department achieved its target</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>this quarter. 销售部本季度完成了目标。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. marketing department [ˈmɑːkɪtɪŋ dɪˈpɑːtmənt]：市场部（例：The marketing department is</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>promoting the new product. 市场部正在推广新产品。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. human resources department [ˌhjuːmən rɪˈzɔːsɪz dɪˈpɑːtmənt]：人力资源部（简称HR，例：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>HR is hiring new employees. 人力资源部正在招聘新员工。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. finance department [ˈfaɪnæns dɪˈpɑːtmənt]：财务部（例：The finance department will check</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>the budget. 财务部将审核预算。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. R&D department [ˌɑːr ən ˈdiː dɪˈpɑːtmənt]：研发部（全称research and development</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>department，例：The R&D department developed a new technology. 研发部研发了一项新技术。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. legal department [ˈliːɡl dɪˈpɑːtmənt]：法务部（例：The legal department will review the</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>contract. 法务部将审核合同。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. customer service department [ˈkʌstəmə ˈsɜːvɪs dɪˈpɑːtmənt]：客服部（例：The customer</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>service department handles complaints. 客服部处理客户投诉。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_16_01", "moduleId": "p4_7_16"}, {"title": "1.2 职场职位词汇", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. manager [ˈmænɪdʒə(r)]：经理（例：project manager 项目经理；sales manager 销售经理）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. supervisor [ˈsuːpəvaɪzə(r)]：主管（例：team supervisor 团队主管；operation supervisor 运</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>营主管）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. specialist [ˈspeʃəlɪst]：专员（例：marketing specialist 市场专员；training specialist 培训</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>专员）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. assistant [əˈsɪstənt]：助理（例：administrative assistant 行政助理；CEO assistant CEO 助</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>理）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. clerk [klɑːk]：职员（例：office clerk 办公室职员；finance clerk 财务职员）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. secretary [ˈsekrətri]：秘书（例：manager’s secretary 经理秘书）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_16_02", "moduleId": "p4_7_16"}, {"title": "1.3 核心商务搭配词汇", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. draw up [drɔː ʌp]：起草（合同/ 计划，例：draw up an agreement 起草协议）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. meet the deadline [miːt ðə ˈdedlaɪn]：赶截止日期（例：We need to meet the deadline by</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Friday. 我们需在周五前赶完截止日期。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. reach an agreement [riːtʃ ən əˈɡriːmənt]：达成协议（例：We reached an agreement on the</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>price. 我们就价格达成了协议。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. make a profit [meɪk ə ˈprɒfɪt]：盈利（例：The company made a profit last year. 公司去年</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>盈利了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. cut costs [kʌt kɒsts]：削减成本（例：We need to cut production costs. 我们需削减生产成</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>本。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_16_03", "moduleId": "p4_7_16"}, {"title": "2.1 商务部门表达与应用", "section": "二、商务核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>部门英文+ 职场造句</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 销售部（sales department）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>造句：The sales department closed 20 deals this month.（销售部本月促成了20 笔交易。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 市场部（marketing department）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>造句：The marketing department will launch a social media campaign next week.（市场部下周将发起社交媒体推广活动。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 人力资源部（HR）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>造句：HR arranged a training session for new employees.（人力资源部为新员工安排了培训。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 财务部（finance department）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>造句：The finance department provided the budget report to the manager.（财务部向经理提交了预算报告。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. 客服部（customer service department）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>造句：The customer service department resolved the client’s complaint within 24 hours.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（客服部在24 小时内解决了客户的投诉。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_16_04", "moduleId": "p4_7_16"}, {"title": "2.2 职场职位表达与应用", "section": "二、商务核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>职位英文+ 职场造句</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 项目经理（project manager）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>造句：The project manager checked the progress of the new project.（项目经理检查了新项目的进展。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 市场专员（marketing specialist）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>造句：The marketing specialist analyzed the customer feedback.（市场专员分析了客户反馈。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 行政助理（administrative assistant）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>造句：The administrative assistant scheduled a meeting for the team.（行政助理为团队安排了会议。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 财务主管（finance supervisor）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>造句：The finance supervisor reviewed the monthly financial statements.（财务主管审核了月度财务报表。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_16_05", "moduleId": "p4_7_16"}, {"title": "2.3 10 个高频商务固定搭配", "section": "二、商务核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>搭配     含义            职场造句起草（合同/  The legal department will draw up the partnership draw up           计划）       contract.（法务部将起草合作合同。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>提出（建议/  The team leader put forward a new work plan.（团 put forward 方案）         队leader 提出了新的工作计划。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>meet the             We have to work overtime to meet the deadline of          赶截止日期 deadline                         this report.（我们需加班赶这份报告的截止日期。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>跟踪/ 记录</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The assistant keeps track of the client’s orders.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>keep track of  （数据/ 信                     （助理跟踪客户的订单信息。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>息）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>After 3 rounds of negotiation, we reached an reach an           达成协议    agreement with the client.（经过3 轮谈判，我们 agreement 与客户达成了协议。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>make a profit    盈利       This small business made a profit of $50,000 last 搭配     含义            职场造句 quarter.（这家小企业上季度盈利5 万美元。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The company decided to cut administrative costs cut costs   削减成本     to save money.（公司决定削减管理成本以节省开支。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>建立（客户群/ We need to build up a loyal customer base for the build up           信誉）    new brand.（我们需为新品牌建立忠实客户群。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>We finally came to terms with the supplier on come to terms 接受/ 达成共                                        delivery time.（我们最终与供应商就交货时间达成 with      识共识。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>The marketing team will put the new strategy into put into   实施（计划/                                        practice next month.（市场部将于下月实施新策 practice    策略）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>略。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_16_06", "moduleId": "p4_7_16"}, {"title": "2.4 8 个实用商务句型", "section": "二、商务核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 表达对产品/ 服务的兴趣</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句型：We are interested in [产品/ 服务] and would like to know more about [特点/ 优势].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>造句：We are interested in your company’s new software and would like to know more about its functions.（我们对贵公司的新软件感兴趣，想了解更多其功能特点。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 请求提供信息</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句型：Could you please provide us with [信息内容] regarding [事项]? 造句：Could you please provide us with the price list regarding your office supplies?（能否提供贵公司办公用品的价目表？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 感谢支持/ 合作</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句型：Thank you for your [support/cooperation] in [项目/ 活动].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>造句：Thank you for your cooperation in the recent product launch.（感谢您在近期产品发布中的合作。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 感谢及时回复</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句型：We appreciate your prompt response to our [请求/ 询问].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>造句：We appreciate your prompt response to our inquiry about the delivery date.（感谢您对我们交货日期询问的及时回复。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. 告知问题可咨询</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句型：Please let us know if you have any questions/concerns about [事项].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>造句：Please let us know if you have any questions about the new company policy.（若对新公司政策有疑问，请随时告知我们。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. 提供产品/ 服务（带价格）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句型：We are pleased to offer you [产品/ 服务] at the price of [金额] with [条款].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>造句：We are pleased to offer you 100 sets of office chairs at the price of $80 each with free delivery.（我们很高兴为您提供100 把办公椅，单价80 美元，含免费送货。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. 提及协议约定</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句型：According to our agreement, we should [行动] by [日期].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>造句：According to our agreement, we should pay the deposit by the end of this month.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（根据协议，我们应在本月底前支付定金。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. 强调产品/ 服务优势</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句型：We believe our [产品/ 服务] can meet your needs and bring you [收益].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>造句：We believe our logistics service can meet your delivery needs and bring you higher efficiency.（我们相信我们的物流服务能满足您的交货需求，并为您提升效率。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_16_07", "moduleId": "p4_7_16"}, {"title": "三、职场模拟对话", "section": "三、职场模拟对话", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>场景1：请求提供产品信息</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Client (C)：Good morning. I’m calling from ABC Company. We are interested in your office furniture and would like to know more about your products.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（客户：早上好，我是ABC 公司的。我们对贵公司的办公家具感兴趣，想了解更多产品信息。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Sales (S)：Good morning! Thank you for your interest. Could you tell me which type of furniture you’re focusing on (e.g., desks, chairs)? （销售：早上好！感谢您的关注。能否告知您重点关注哪类家具（如办公桌、椅子）？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>C：We need 50 office chairs. Could you please provide us with the price list and delivery time? （客户：我们需要50 把办公椅。能否提供价目表和交货时间？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>S：Sure! I’ll send the price list to your email within 1 hour. For delivery, if you place the order this week, we can deliver them by next Friday. Please let us know if you have any other questions.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（销售：当然！我会在1 小时内将价目表发送到您的邮箱。交货方面，若本周下单，我们可在下周五前送达。如有其他问题，请随时告知。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>C：Great, thank you for your prompt response.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（客户：好的，感谢您的及时回复。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>S：You’re welcome. We look forward to cooperating with you.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（销售：不客气，期待与您合作。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_16_08", "moduleId": "p4_7_16"}, {"title": "5.1 填词题", "section": "四、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. The ________ (市场部) is planning a promotion for the new smartphone.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. Our company needs to ________ (削减成本) to improve profitability.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. The legal department will ________ (起草) a contract for the new partner.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. We have to work overtime to ________ (赶截止日期) of this project.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. The ________ (人力资源部) will hold a training session for new employees next week.</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_16_09", "moduleId": "p4_7_16"}, {"title": "5.2 句型仿写", "section": "四、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 仿照“我们对贵公司的[产品] 感兴趣，想了解更多[特点]” 造句（用“logistics service，</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>delivery speed”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 仿照“感谢您在[项目] 中的[合作]” 造句（用“annual conference，support”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 仿照“根据协议，我们应在[日期] 前[行动]” 造句（用“June 30th，submit the report”）。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_16_10", "moduleId": "p4_7_16"}, {"title": "5.3 情景模拟", "section": "四、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>假设你是销售，回复客户的产品咨询邮件，补全内容：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Dear Mr. Smith, Thank you for your inquiry about our office supplies.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>We are pleased to inform you that we have the items you mentioned in stock. For the price:</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>________ (例：A4 paper is 5 per box, and printers are 300 each).</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>If you place the order before this Friday, ________ (例：we can offer free delivery to your office).</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Please let us know if ________ (例：you have any questions about the product specifications).</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>We appreciate your interest in our products and look forward to your reply.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Best regards, Li Ming</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>答案</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_16_11", "moduleId": "p4_7_16"}, {"title": "5.1 填词题", "section": "四、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. marketing department</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. cut costs</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. draw up</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. meet the deadline</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. human resources department (HR)</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_16_12", "moduleId": "p4_7_16"}, {"title": "5.2 句型仿写", "section": "四、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. We are interested in your company’s logistics service and would like to know more about</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>its delivery speed.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. Thank you for your support in the annual conference.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. According to our agreement, we should submit the report by June 30th.</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_16_13", "moduleId": "p4_7_16"}, {"title": "5.3 情景模拟（示例）", "section": "四、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>Dear Mr. Smith, Thank you for your inquiry about our office supplies.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>We are pleased to inform you that we have the items you mentioned in stock. For the price:</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>A4 paper is 5 per box, and printers are 300 each.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>If you place the order before this Friday, we can offer free delivery to your office.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Please let us know if you have any questions about the product specifications.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>We appreciate your interest in our products and look forward to your reply.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Best regards, Li Ming</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_16_14", "moduleId": "p4_7_16"}]}, {"id": "p4_7_17", "code": "7.17", "title": "职场赢家- 邮件写作", "articles": [{"title": "1.1 邮件核心词汇", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. subject [ˈsʌbdʒɪkt]：邮件主题（例：write a clear subject 写清晰的邮件主题）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. recipient [rɪˈsɪpiənt]：收件人（例：add the recipient’s email 添加收件人邮箱）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. CC (Carbon Copy) [ˌkɑːbən ˈkɒpi]：抄送（例：CC the manager in the email 邮件抄送经理）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. BCC (Blind Carbon Copy) [ˌblaɪnd ˌkɑːbən ˈkɒpi]：密送（例：BCC the HR team 密送人力</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>资源团队）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. attachment [əˈtætʃmənt]：附件（例：add an attachment 添加附件）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. salutation [ˌsæljʊˈteɪʃn]：称呼（例：use a formal salutation 用正式的称呼）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. closing [ˈkləʊzɪŋ]：结尾语（例：choose a polite closing 选礼貌的结尾语）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. inquiry [ɪnˈkwaɪəri]：咨询（例：make an inquiry about products 咨询产品相关问题）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_17_01", "moduleId": "p4_7_17"}, {"title": "1.2 商务沟通词汇", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. follow up [ˈfɒləʊ ʌp]：跟进（例：follow up on the project 跟进项目进展）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. provide [prəˈvaɪd]：提供（例：provide the price list 提供价目表）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. apologize [əˈpɒlədʒaɪz]：道歉（例：apologize for the delay 为延迟道歉）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. update [ˌʌpˈdeɪt]：更新（例：update on the progress 同步进展）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. cooperate [kəʊˈɒpəreɪt]：合作（例：cooperate on the project 合作项目）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_17_02", "moduleId": "p4_7_17"}, {"title": "2.1.1 邮件头部（规范要求）", "section": "二、邮件核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>模块     核心要求              示例收件人（To） 填写“直接处理人” 邮箱，多收件人用  To: john.smith@company.com, 逗号/ 分号隔开，按职位高低排序     lisa.lee@company.com 抄送（CC）  填写“需知晓但不直接处理” 的人，方  CC: manager.wang@company.com</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>便同步信息，无需对方回复</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>密送（BCC） 填写“无需让他人知晓的收件人”，保   BCC: hr@company.com 护隐私（如批量发送时隐藏其他收件人邮箱）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>主题            1. 简洁明了（10 字内最佳）；2. 含   Subject: RE: Inquiry about Office （Subject）  核心信息（如“产品咨询- 办公椅”）； Chairs</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 避免“重要”“紧急” 等泛用词；4. 回</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>复邮件可加“RE:”</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_17_03", "moduleId": "p4_7_17"}, {"title": "2.1.2 称呼（Salutation）", "section": "二、邮件核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>场景         表达方式            示例正式场合/ 初次联系   Dear Mr./Ms./Mrs. + 姓氏     Dear Mr. Smith; Dear Ms. Lee 不知姓名只知头衔          Dear + 头衔         Dear Manager; Dear HR Specialist 熟悉后/ 非正式场合         Hi/Hello + 名字                Hi John; Hello Lisa 群体收件（如团队）       Dear All; Hi Team         Dear All; Hi Marketing Team</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_17_04", "moduleId": "p4_7_17"}, {"title": "2.1.3 正文（Body）", "section": "二、邮件核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">1. 内容要求：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>开头：简单问候+ 直奔主题（说明邮件目的），避免冗余；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>中间：内容多时分点（用1.2.3.），逻辑清晰；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>语言：用简单句+ 常用词，避免复杂句式/ 生僻词，多用委婉表达（如“Could you please...”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">2. 格式要求：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>左对齐顶格写，段落间空一行；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>重要信息（如截止日期、金额）可加粗，但同一邮件颜色不超过3 种。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_17_05", "moduleId": "p4_7_17"}, {"title": "2.1.4 结尾（Closing）", "section": "二、邮件核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>结尾语     正式程度  适用场景          示例搭配 Best regards  中等    通用（正式/ 非正式均可）   Best regards,Li Ming Sincerely    较正式   初次联系/ 重要商务沟通     Sincerely,Wang Yu Kind regards  较亲切   熟悉后/ 日常沟通           Kind regards,Zhang Wei Warm regards  亲切    长期合作/ 关系较好的伙伴   Warm regards,Chen Tao 署名补充：代表公司发邮件时，需在姓名下方加“职位+ 公司名称+ 联系方式”，例：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Best regards, Li Ming Sales Specialist ABC Company Tel: 138-XXXX-XXXX</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_17_06", "moduleId": "p4_7_17"}, {"title": "2.1.5 附件（Attachment）", "section": "二、邮件核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 上传时机：写主题后立即上传，避免遗漏；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 正文提醒：需明确告知收件人“有附件”，例：“Please find the attached price list for your</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>reference.”（附件为价目表，供您参考）；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 格式要求：附件不超过4 个，多附件需打包压缩；特殊格式（如PDF/Excel）可备注打开</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>方式。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_17_07", "moduleId": "p4_7_17"}, {"title": "2.2.1 开头句型（说明目的）", "section": "二、邮件核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>句型      适用场景         职场例句通用（问     I hope this email finds you well. I’m writing I hope this email finds              候+ 目    to inquire about your office chairs.（希望您 you well. I’m writing to...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>的）  一切安好，我写信咨询贵公司的办公椅。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>跟进之前   I’m writing to follow up on our meeting last I’m writing to follow up               的沟通/  week about the project timeline.（我写信跟 on...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>项目  进上周关于项目时间安排的会议。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>We are interested in your logistics service We are interested in...              咨询产品  and would like to know more about the and would like to know                                                     / 服务     delivery time.（我们对贵公司的物流服务感    more about...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>兴趣，想了解更多交货时间相关信息。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_17_08", "moduleId": "p4_7_17"}, {"title": "2.2.2 正文句型（核心沟通）", "section": "二、邮件核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>句型      适用场景         职场例句请求提供   Could you please provide us with the Could you please provide                信息/ 文   product catalog by this Friday?（能否在本 us with... by...? 件   周五前提供产品目录？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>We apologize for the delayed delivery.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>道歉+  We are working on arranging a new   We apologize for... We shipment and will keep you updated.（为     are working on... and will  说明解决 keep you updated.      方案  交货延迟道歉，我们正在安排新的货运， 并会随时同步进展。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句型      适用场景         职场例句 As per our agreement, we will send the As per our agreement, we 提及协议                                             deposit by the end of this month.（根据协 will...            约定议，我们将在本月底前支付定金。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_17_09", "moduleId": "p4_7_17"}, {"title": "2.2.3 结尾句型（礼貌收尾）", "section": "二、邮件核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>句型       适用场景         职场例句 Thank you for your time and Thank you for your time and                   consideration. We look forward to your                感谢关注 consideration.                  reply.（感谢您的时间和关注，期待您的回复。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>If you have any questions, please do not If you have any questions,                                                  hesitate to contact me at please do not hesitate to   开放咨询渠道                             138-XXXX-XXXX.（如有疑问，欢迎随时 contact me.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>致电138-XXXX-XXXX 联系我。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Once again, thank you for your Once again, thank you for                感谢合作     cooperation on this project.（再次感谢您 your cooperation.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>在本项目中的合作。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_17_10", "moduleId": "p4_7_17"}, {"title": "2.3 模拟商务邮件（示例：咨询产品+ 请求资料）", "section": "二、邮件核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>邮件主题：Inquiry about Office Chairs & Request for Price List To: sales@xyz-furniture.com CC: manager.li@abc-company.com BCC: - Attachment: - Dear Ms. Johnson, I hope this email finds you well. My name is Li Ming, and I’m a Procurement Specialist at ABC Company. We are currently renovating our office and need to purchase 50 office chairs. I’m writing to inquire about your company’s office chair products and request relevant information.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Could you please provide us with the following by this Friday (June 14th)?</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. The product catalog of your office chairs (including material, size, and weight details);</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. The price list for bulk orders (we need 50 units);</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. The estimated delivery time after placing an order.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>We are impressed by your company’s reputation for high-quality furniture, and we hope to cooperate with you if the terms are suitable.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>If you have any questions about our needs, please do not hesitate to contact me at 138-1234-5678 or li.ming@abc-company.com.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Thank you for your time and consideration. We look forward to your reply.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Best regards, Li Ming Procurement Specialist ABC Company Tel: 138-1234-5678 Email: li.ming@abc-company.com</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_17_11", "moduleId": "p4_7_17"}, {"title": "5.1 填词题", "section": "三、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. Please write a clear ________ (邮件主题) so the recipient knows the email’s purpose.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. We need to ________ (抄送) the finance department in this email to keep them updated.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. Don’t forget to add the ________ (附件) – the budget report is in the Excel file.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. Use “Dear Mr. Brown” as the ________ (称呼) since it’s our first contact with him.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. I’m writing to ________ (跟进) on the price quote you promised last week.</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_17_12", "moduleId": "p4_7_17"}, {"title": "5.2 句型仿写", "section": "三、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 仿照“我写信咨询贵公司的产品，并请求提供价目表” 造句（用“logistics service，delivery</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>cost details”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 仿照“为延迟回复道歉，我们正在整理资料，会在今天下班前发给您” 造句（用“delayed</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>sample delivery，arranging a new shipment，this weekend”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 仿照“如有疑问，请随时通过电话或邮箱联系我” 造句（用“phone number:</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>139-XXXX-XXXX，email: zhang@company.com”）。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_17_13", "moduleId": "p4_7_17"}, {"title": "5.3 情景模拟", "section": "三、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>假设你是行政助理，需给IT 部门发邮件，请求帮忙修复办公室打印机，补全邮件：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Subject: Request for Repairing Office Printer (3rd Floor)</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Dear IT Team, I hope this email finds you well. I’m Zhang Wei, the Administrative Assistant at the 3rd Floor Office.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Our office printer (model: HP LaserJet Pro M426fdw) has been malfunctioning since this morning. ________ (描述问题：如“它无法打印，且屏幕显示‘paper jam’错误，但我们已检查过无卡纸”)。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>This printer is used by 8 colleagues for daily work, so the malfunction is affecting our efficiency. ________ (请求帮助：如“Could you please send someone to repair it as soon as possible?”).</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>If you need more details about the issue, ________ (开放沟通：如“please contact me at 137-XXXX-XXXX”).</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Thank you for your quick support.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Best regards, Zhang Wei Administrative Assistant</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>答案</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_17_14", "moduleId": "p4_7_17"}, {"title": "5.1 填词题", "section": "三、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. subject</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. CC</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. attachment</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. salutation</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. follow up</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_17_15", "moduleId": "p4_7_17"}, {"title": "5.2 句型仿写", "section": "三、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. I’m writing to inquire about your company’s logistics service and request the delivery cost</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>details.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. We apologize for the delayed sample delivery. We are arranging a new shipment and will</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>send it to you by this weekend.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3.  If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to contact me at 139-XXXX-XXXX or</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>zhang@company.com.</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_17_16", "moduleId": "p4_7_17"}, {"title": "5.3 情景模拟（示例）", "section": "三、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>Subject: Request for Repairing Office Printer (3rd Floor)</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Dear IT Team, I hope this email finds you well. I’m Zhang Wei, the Administrative Assistant at the 3rd Floor Office.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Our office printer (model: HP LaserJet Pro M426fdw) has been malfunctioning since this morning. It can’t print, and the screen shows a “paper jam” error – but we’ve checked and there’s no paper stuck.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>This printer is used by 8 colleagues for daily work, so the malfunction is affecting our efficiency. Could you please send someone to repair it as soon as possible? If you need more details about the issue, please contact me at 137-XXXX-XXXX.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Thank you for your quick support.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Best regards, Zhang Wei Administrative Assistant</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_17_17", "moduleId": "p4_7_17"}]}, {"id": "p4_7_18", "code": "7.18", "title": "职场赢家- 电话沟通", "articles": [{"title": "1.1 电话沟通核心词汇", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. introduce [ˌɪntrəˈdjuːs]：介绍（例：introduce oneself on the phone 电话中自我介绍）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. inquire [ɪnˈkwaɪə(r)]：咨询（例：inquire about delivery time 咨询交货时间）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. confirm [kənˈfɜːm]：确认（例：confirm the meeting time 确认会议时间）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. objection [əbˈdʒekʃn]：异议（例：handle the client’s objection 处理客户异议）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. schedule [ˈʃedjuːl]：安排（例：schedule a meeting 安排会议）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. deliver [dɪˈlɪvə(r)]：交付（例：deliver the product 交付产品）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. budget [ˈbʌdʒɪt]：预算（例：discuss the budget 讨论预算）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. update [ˌʌpˈdeɪt]：更新（例：update the client on progress 向客户同步进展）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_18_01", "moduleId": "p4_7_18"}, {"title": "1.2 职场礼貌表达词汇", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. appreciate [əˈpriːʃieɪt]：感谢；理解（例：appreciate your time 感谢您的时间）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. concern [kənˈsɜːn]：担忧（例：address the client’s concern 回应客户的担忧）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. hesitate [ˈhezɪteɪt]：犹豫（例：don’t hesitate to contact 随时联系）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. assure [əˈʃʊə(r)]：保证（例：assure the client of quality 向客户保证质量）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_18_02", "moduleId": "p4_7_18"}, {"title": "2.1 电话开头（3 大场景）", "section": "二、电话沟通核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>场景       常用句型             职场例句自我介绍        This is [Name] from            This is Li Ming from ABC Trading （正式）           [Company].        Company.（我是ABC 贸易公司的李明。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>自我介绍                                        Hi, it’s Tom. I’m calling about the project.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Hi/Hello, it’s [Name].                      （嗨，我是汤姆，打电话说项目的事。） （非正式场景       常用句型             职场例句 / 熟人）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>May I ask who’s calling? I didn’t catch 询问对方    May I ask who’s calling? /                                            your name.（请问您是哪位？我没听清您身份      Who’s speaking, please? 的名字。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I’m calling to inquire about the delivery time of our order.（我打电话咨询我们订单表明打电       I’m calling to [Purpose:                          的交货时间。）I’m calling to discuss the 话目的      inquire/discuss/schedule].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>details of the upcoming meeting.（我打电话讨论即将召开的会议细节。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_18_03", "moduleId": "p4_7_18"}, {"title": "2.2.1 表达意见/ 想法", "section": "二、电话沟通核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>句型       适用场景         职场例句 I think we should launch the product earlier to catch the market trend.（我认为 I think we should...   提出建议                     我们应该早点推出产品，以跟上市场趋势。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>In my opinion, the budget for this project In my opinion,... / From  表达个人观                                      needs to be adjusted.（在我看来，这个项 my perspective,...     点目的预算需要调整。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_18_04", "moduleId": "p4_7_18"}, {"title": "2.2.2 请求对方做某事", "section": "二、电话沟通核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>句型    适用场景           职场例句 Could you please send me the order contract by Could you   礼貌请求                                    the end of today?（您能在今天下班前把订单合同 please...?   （常用）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>发给我吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Would you mind repeating the delivery address? I Would you  更委婉的请                                want to confirm it.（您介意重复一下交货地址吗？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>mind...?     求我想确认一下。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Would you mind if I take 5 minutes to discuss the Would you  请求允许自                                          quality issue?（我能占用5 分钟讨论质量问题 mind if I...?   己做某事吗？）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_18_05", "moduleId": "p4_7_18"}, {"title": "2.2.3 确认信息（避免误解）", "section": "二、电话沟通核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>句型        适用场景           职场例句 Just to confirm, the meeting is at 2 p.m.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>tomorrow in Conference Room 3.（只是 Just to confirm,...     简单确认关键信息                      确认一下，会议明天下午2 点在3 号会议室。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Let me make sure I understand you correctly. You mean we need to increase Let me make sure I the order quantity to 100 units?（我确认 understand you correctly.  确认理解是否正确 You mean...                 一下是否理解正确：您是说我们需要把订单数量增加到100 件吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I’d like to double-check the budget I’d like to double-check...  再次确认重要信息   figures we discussed earlier.（我想再次确认我们之前讨论的预算数字。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_18_06", "moduleId": "p4_7_18"}, {"title": "2.2.4 处理异议/ 问题（缓解矛盾）", "section": "二、电话沟通核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>句型        适用场景            职场例句 I understand your concern about the delayed delivery, but we are working on I understand your 理解担忧+ 给出解决方                                        a new shipment and will send it next concern, but...        案                         week.（我理解您对交货延迟的担忧，但我们正在安排新的货运，下周会发出。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>We are working on a solution for the We are working                                                     quality issue you mentioned. We’ll on a solution     告知正在解决问题                                           update you by Friday.（我们正在解决您提 for...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>到的质量问题，周五前会向您同步进展。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Rest assured that we will ensure the Rest assured             向对方保证         product meets your standards.（请放心， that...</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>我们会确保产品符合您的标准。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_18_07", "moduleId": "p4_7_18"}, {"title": "2.3 电话结尾（3 大场景）", "section": "二、电话沟通核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>场景        常用句型              职场例句 Thank you for your time. It’s helpful to 感谢对   Thank you for your time. / Thanks                                              discuss the project details with you.（感谢方      for your help.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>您的时间，和您讨论项目细节很有帮助。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Looking forward to hearing from     Looking forward to hearing your 表达期 you. / We look forward to           feedback on the budget.（期待收到您对</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>待</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>cooperating with you.       预算的反馈。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Have a nice day. If you have any</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>正式道</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Have a nice day. / Goodbye.        questions, feel free to call me.（祝您度过</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>别</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>愉快的一天，如有疑问，欢迎随时致电。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_18_08", "moduleId": "p4_7_18"}, {"title": "2.4 电话沟通注意事项", "section": "二、电话沟通核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 语速：适中清晰，避免过快（对方可能听不清）或过慢（显得拖沓），遇到数字、地名时可</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>放慢语速（例：“The order number is A-1-2-3, that’s A one two three.”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 态度：保持礼貌专业，即使对方情绪急躁，也需耐心回应（避免说“这不是我们的问题”，改</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>用“Let’s find a solution together.”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 记录：准备笔和本子，记录关键信息（日期、时间、金额、对方要求），必要时重复确认（例：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“So the delivery date is June 20th, right?”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 后续：若沟通内容复杂（如合同细节、多笔订单），挂电话后发邮件总结（例：“This is to confirm</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>our phone call today: we agreed to adjust the order quantity to 100 units...”），避免遗漏。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_18_09", "moduleId": "p4_7_18"}, {"title": "三、职场模拟对话（场景：咨询订单交货时间）", "section": "三、职场模拟对话（场景：咨询订单交货时间）", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>场景背景：ABC 公司的李明（采购）给XYZ 供应商的王经理（销售）打电话，咨询之前订购的100 件办公椅的交货时间。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Li Ming (LM)：Hello, this is Li Ming from ABC Company. May I speak to Manager Wang, please? （李明：您好，我是ABC 公司的李明，请问王经理在吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Manager Wang (MW)：Hi Li Ming, this is Wang speaking. How can I help you? （王经理：嗨，李明，我是王。有什么能帮您的？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>LM：I’m calling to inquire about the delivery time of our order—we ordered 100 office chairs from your company two weeks ago.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（李明：我打电话咨询我们订单的交货时间—— 两周前我们向贵公司订了100 把办公椅。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>MW：Thank you for following up. Let me check... Oh, the production is almost done, but there’s a small delay in shipping. We originally planned to deliver next Monday, but now it may be Wednesday.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（王经理：感谢您跟进。我查一下…… 哦，生产快结束了，但货运有点小延迟。原本计划下周一交货，现在可能要周三。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>LM：I see. To be honest, we need the chairs for our office renovation next week—Wednesday is a bit tight. I understand shipping issues happen, but could you please try to speed it up if possible? （李明：我明白了。说实话，我们下周办公室装修需要这些椅子，周三有点赶。我知道货运可能出问题，但如果可以，您能帮忙加急一下吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>MW：I understand your concern, Li Ming. I’ll talk to the shipping team today and see if we can arrange delivery on Tuesday. Rest assured I’ll call you back this afternoon to confirm.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（王经理：我理解您的担忧，李明。我今天会和货运团队沟通，看能否安排周二交货。放心， 我今天下午会回电确认。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>LM：That’s great! Thank you for your help, Manager Wang. I’ll wait for your call.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（李明：太好了！谢谢您的帮助，王经理。我等您的回电。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>MW：You’re welcome. Have a nice day! （王经理：不客气，祝您愉快！）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>LM：You too. Goodbye! （李明：您也一样，再见！）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_18_10", "moduleId": "p4_7_18"}, {"title": "5.1 填词题", "section": "四、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. I’m calling to ________ (咨询) about the delivery time of our order.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. Could you please ________ (确认) the meeting time? I want to make sure I don’t miss it.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. The client has a ________ (异议) about the price—we need to explain our cost structure.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. We are working on a ________ (解决方案) for the delayed shipment.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. Thank you for your ________ (时间). It’s very helpful to discuss this with you.</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_18_11", "moduleId": "p4_7_18"}, {"title": "5.2 句型仿写", "section": "四、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 仿照“我打电话咨询贵公司的产品价格” 造句（用“logistics service，shipping cost”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 仿照“我确认一下是否理解正确：您是说我们需要下周提交报告吗？” 造句（用“adjust the</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>budget，by the end of this month”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 仿照“我理解您的担忧，但我们会尽力解决这个问题” 造句（用“the project delay，finish it</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>ahead of schedule”）。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_18_12", "moduleId": "p4_7_18"}, {"title": "5.3 情景模拟", "section": "四、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>假设你是销售，接到客户张小姐的电话，她咨询之前订购的样品何时送达。补全对话：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You：Hello, this is [Your Name] from [Your Company]. How can I help you? Ms. Zhang：Hi, this is Ms. Zhang from XYZ Company. I’m calling to ________ (咨询样品送达时间). We ordered the product sample last Friday.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You：Hi Ms. Zhang! Thank you for calling. Let me check... The sample was shipped yesterday, so it should ________ (预计送达时间：明天到达).</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Ms. Zhang：Tomorrow? That’s good—we need it for a meeting on Thursday. But could you please ________ (请求提供快递单号) so I can track it? You：Of course! The tracking number is SF123456789. I’ll also send it to your email now.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Rest assured ________ (保证样品质量).</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Ms. Zhang：Perfect! Thank you for your quick response.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You：You’re welcome. ________ (道别+ 祝福).</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Ms. Zhang：Goodbye!</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>答案</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_18_13", "moduleId": "p4_7_18"}, {"title": "5.1 填词题", "section": "四、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. inquire</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. confirm</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. objection</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. solution</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. time</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_18_14", "moduleId": "p4_7_18"}, {"title": "5.2 句型仿写", "section": "四、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. I’m calling to inquire about the shipping cost of your logistics service.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. Let me make sure I understand you correctly. You mean we need to adjust the budget by</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>the end of this month?</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3.  I understand your concern about the project delay, but we will try our best to finish it ahead</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>of schedule.</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_18_15", "moduleId": "p4_7_18"}, {"title": "5.3 情景模拟（示例）", "section": "四、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>You：Hello, this is Wang Yu from ABC Company. How can I help you? Ms. Zhang：Hi, this is Ms. Zhang from XYZ Company. I’m calling to inquire about the delivery time of the sample. We ordered the product sample last Friday.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You：Hi Ms. Zhang! Thank you for calling. Let me check... The sample was shipped yesterday, so it should arrive tomorrow.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Ms. Zhang：Tomorrow? That’s good—we need it for a meeting on Thursday. But could you please provide the tracking number so I can track it? You：Of course! The tracking number is SF123456789. I’ll also send it to your email now.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Rest assured the sample meets our quality standards.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Ms. Zhang：Perfect! Thank you for your quick response.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You：You’re welcome. Have a nice day! Ms. Zhang：Goodbye!</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_18_16", "moduleId": "p4_7_18"}]}, {"id": "p4_7_19", "code": "7.19", "title": "职场赢家- 会议英语", "articles": [{"title": "1.1 会议核心词汇", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. agenda [əˈdʒendə]：会议议程（例：introduce the meeting agenda 介绍会议议程）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. facilitator [fəˈsɪlɪteɪtə(r)]：会议主持人（例：act as the meeting facilitator 担任会议主持人）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. roll call [rəʊl kɔːl]：点名（例：take a roll call 进行点名）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. minutes [ˈmɪnɪts]：会议纪要（例：take meeting minutes 记录会议纪要）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. Q&A session [ˌkjuː ənd ˈeɪ ˈseʃn]：问答环节（例：hold a Q&A session 开展问答环节）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. adjourn [əˈdʒɜːn]：散会（例：adjourn the meeting 宣布会议结束）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. action item [ˈækʃn aɪtəm]：待办事项（例：assign action items 分配待办事项）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. consensus [kənˈsensəs]：共识（例：reach a consensus 达成共识）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_19_01", "moduleId": "p4_7_19"}, {"title": "1.2 会议沟通词汇", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. contribute [kənˈtrɪbjuːt]：贡献（观点）（例：contribute ideas to the discussion 为讨论贡</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>献想法）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. clarify [ˈklærəfaɪ]：澄清（例：clarify the project deadline 澄清项目截止日期）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. summarize [ˈsʌməraɪz]：总结（例：summarize the key points 总结关键点）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. align [əˈlaɪn]：达成一致（例：align on the marketing strategy 就营销策略达成一致）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. follow up [ˈfɒləʊ ʌp]：跟进（例：follow up on action items 跟进待办事项）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_19_02", "moduleId": "p4_7_19"}, {"title": "2.1 会议开场（3 大场景）", "section": "二、会议核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>场景           常用句型              职场例句 Let’s take a roll call first: Li Ming, Wang                       Let’s take a roll call to see who’s 点名/ 确认参会                                       Yu, Zhang Wei... Thank you, everyone is                     present. / Is everyone here? here.（我们先点名：李明、王宇、张伟…… 场景           常用句型              职场例句谢谢，所有人都到齐了。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Good morning/afternoon, everyone.  Good afternoon, everyone. Thank you for Thank you for taking time out of       joining today’s project review meeting.开场问候+ 感谢参会 your busy schedules to attend    （大家下午好，感谢参加今天的项目审查 today’s meeting.          会议。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Today’s agenda includes three main items: 1. Review the Q3 project progress;                      Today’s agenda includes [number]</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. Discuss the Q4 marketing strategy; 3.                    main items: 1. [Item 1]; 2. [Item 2];  介绍会议议程                                                      Hold a Q&A session.（今天的议程包括三                          3. [Item 3]. / Let me briefly introduce</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>the agenda for today.            项：1. 审查第三季度项目进度；2. 讨论第四季度营销策略；3. 开展问答环节。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_19_03", "moduleId": "p4_7_19"}, {"title": "2.2.1 引导发言/ 鼓励参与", "section": "二、会议核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>句型          适用场景            职场例句 Now I’d like to open the floor to everyone.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>What do you think about the marketing Now I’d like to open the floor strategy we just proposed?（现在请大家 to everyone. Please feel free  开放讨论，鼓励全员发言 to share your ideas.                  自由发言，对我们刚才提出的营销策略有什么想法？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Let’s start with Ms. Zhang, the sales manager—could you share your Let’s start with               指定人发言，引导讨论方                                                         thoughts on the customer feedback?（我 [Name]—could you share</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>向</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>your thoughts on [Topic]?               们先从销售经理张女士开始—— 能分享一下你对客户反馈的看法吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Thank you for your insightful                         Thank you for your insightful comments,               感谢发言后，邀请他人补 comments, [Name]. Does                                Mr. Li. Does anyone else have additional 句型          适用场景            职场例句 anyone else have anything to      充             suggestions on the project timeline?（感 add?                        谢李总的深刻见解，还有人对项目时间安排有补充建议吗？）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_19_04", "moduleId": "p4_7_19"}, {"title": "2.2.2 回归主题（避免偏离）", "section": "二、会议核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>句型          适用场景            职场例句 I think we’ve gotten a bit sidetracked by the budget details. Let’s bring the focus  I think we’ve gotten a bit back to the core marketing strategy.（我 sidetracked. Let’s bring the  讨论偏离时，拉回主线 focus back to [Main Topic].              觉得我们有点偏离到预算细节了，把重点拉回核心营销策略上吧。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Let’s get back to the point—we need to Let’s get back to the                                                     decide the launch date of the new point—we need to decide  简洁提醒，聚焦关键问题                                                       product today.（回到重点—— 我们今天 [Key Issue] today.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>需要确定新产品的发布日期。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_19_05", "moduleId": "p4_7_19"}, {"title": "2.2.3 同意/ 反对观点（礼貌表达）", "section": "二、会议核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>立场          句型               职场例句 I couldn’t agree more with Mr. Wang’s I couldn’t agree more. / That’s a       suggestion to focus on online promotion.   同意 great point—we should go with that.  （我完全同意王总的建议，聚焦线上推广。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>While I see your point, I think we      While I see your point about lowering the need to consider [Factor]. / I’m afraid   price, I think we need to consider the 反对（委婉）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I have a different opinion—let’s think   production cost first.（虽然我理解你关于 about [Reason].          降价的观点，但我觉得我们得先考虑生产立场          句型               职场例句成本。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_19_06", "moduleId": "p4_7_19"}, {"title": "2.2.4 澄清/ 确认信息（避免误解）", "section": "二、会议核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>句型        适用场景          职场例句 Could you clarify the deadline for the Could you clarify [Point]? I                                              marketing materials? I want to make sure want to make sure I      澄清模糊信息                                                                          it’s October 15th.（能澄清一下营销材料的 understand it correctly.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>截止日期吗？我想确认是10 月15 日。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Just to confirm—are we agreeing to launch the product on November 1st?（确 Just to confirm—are we              确认达成的共识 agreeing to [Decision]?           认一下—— 我们是否达成共识，11 月1 日发布产品？）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_19_07", "moduleId": "p4_7_19"}, {"title": "2.2.5 总结讨论要点（推进会议）", "section": "二、会议核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>句型        适用场景           职场例句 To summarize what we’ve discussed so far: 1. We’ll increase the online ad budget by 20%; 2. The sales team will To summarize what track customer feedback weekly.（总结一 we’ve discussed so far: 阶段性总结讨论内容</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. [Point 1]; 2. [Point 2].              下目前的讨论：1. 我们将把线上广告预算</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>增加20%；2. 销售团队每周跟踪客户反馈。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>It’s important to note                                         It’s important to note that the supplier that [Key Point]—this                               can’t deliver raw materials until October              强调关键信息 will affect the entire                           20th—this will delay the production by 5 project.                       days.（需要注意的是，供应商要到10 月句型        适用场景           职场例句 20 日才能交付原材料，这会导致生产延迟 5 天。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_19_08", "moduleId": "p4_7_19"}, {"title": "2.3 会议结尾（3 大场景）", "section": "二、会议核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>场景          常用句型             职场例句 In conclusion, we’ve discussed the Q4 marketing plan and reached the following consensus: 1. Launch the online                          In conclusion, we’ve campaign on October 25th; 2. All                      discussed [Topics] and departments will provide support by总结会议内容+ 共识  reached the following October 20th.（总之，我们讨论了第四季                     consensus: 1. [Consensus 1];</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. [Consensus 2].       度营销计划，达成以下共识：1. 10 月25</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>日启动线上活动；2. 所有部门10 月20 日前提供支持。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Let’s assign action items: 1. Ms. Li will finalize the marketing materials by Let’s assign action items: 1.                                                  October 20th; 2. Mr. Zhang will report the 分配待办事项+ 责任  [Name] will [Task] by [Date];                                                    progress to the team on October 23rd.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>人             2. [Name] will [Task] by                              （分配待办事项：1. 李女士10 月20 日 [Date].                              前敲定营销材料；2. 张先生10 月23 日向团队汇报进展。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Thank you all for your                                             Thank you all for your valuable ideas and valuable input and                                                              participation. The meeting is adjourned.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>participation. The meeting is宣布散会+ 感谢参与                                    We’ll have our next meeting on October adjourned. / That’s all for                             23rd.（感谢大家的宝贵想法和参与，会议 today’s meeting—have a 结束。下次会议10 月23 日召开。）                        great day!</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_19_09", "moduleId": "p4_7_19"}, {"title": "2.4 会议注意事项", "section": "二、会议核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 发言礼仪：不打断他人发言，等对方说完后再表达观点（可用“May I add something?” 请</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>求补充）；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 态度包容：尊重不同意见，避免争执，用“Let’s discuss this from another angle” 引导理性</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>沟通；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 记录要点：指定专人记录会议纪要（含决策、待办事项、责任人、截止日期），会后24 小</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>时内分发全员；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 控制节奏：主持人需把控会议时间，避免单个议题耗时过长（可用“We need to move on to</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>the next item to stay on schedule” 推进）。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_19_10", "moduleId": "p4_7_19"}, {"title": "三、职场模拟对话（场景：Q4 营销计划会议）", "section": "三、职场模拟对话（场景：Q4 营销计划会议）", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">参会人员：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>主持人（Host）：王宇（市场部经理）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>参会者：李明（销售经理）、张伟（财务专员）、张莉（设计专员）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Host：Good afternoon, everyone. Thank you for joining today’s Q4 marketing plan meeting.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Let’s first confirm everyone is here—Li Ming, Zhang Wei, Zhang Li... Great, all present.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Today’s agenda has three parts: 1. Review Q3 marketing results; 2. Discuss Q4 marketing strategy; 3. Assign action items. Let’s start with Part 1. Li Ming, could you share the Q3 sales feedback related to our marketing campaigns? （主持人：大家下午好，感谢参加今天的Q4 营销计划会议。先确认全员到齐—— 李明、张伟、张莉…… 很好，都在。今天议程分三项：1. 回顾Q3 营销成果；2. 讨论Q4 营销策略；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 分配待办事项。从第一项开始，李明，能分享一下Q3 与营销活动相关的销售反馈吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Li Ming：Sure. Our Q3 online campaign brought in 15% more sales, but customers mentioned the product images were not clear enough. That affected their purchase decisions.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（李明：好的。Q3 线上活动带动销量增长15%，但客户反馈产品图片不够清晰，影响了购买决策。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Zhang Li：I see. While I agree the images need improvement, our design team is busy with the new product launch. Could we delay the image update until November? （张莉：我理解。虽然图片需要优化，但设计团队正忙于新产品发布，能把图片更新推迟到11 月吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Zhang Wei：While I see your point, Zhang Li, we need to consider the budget. If we delay the image update, we might miss the Double 11 sales peak. The budget for image redesign is small—only 5,000 yuan.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（张伟：张莉，虽然我理解你的情况，但我们得考虑预算。如果推迟图片更新，可能会错过双11 销售高峰。图片重设计预算很少，只有5000 元。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Host：Thank you all for the feedback. Let’s get back to the Q4 strategy—we need to balance quality and timing. Just to confirm: are we agreeing to redesign the images by October 25th (before Double 11) with a 5,000-yuan budget? （主持人：感谢大家的反馈。回到Q4 策略—— 我们需要平衡质量和时间。确认一下：我们是否达成共识，10 月25 日前（双11 前）用5000 元预算完成图片重设计？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Li Ming/Zhang Wei/Zhang Li：Yes, that works.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（李明/ 张伟/ 张莉：可以，这样可行。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Host：Great. Now let’s assign action items: 1. Zhang Li, your team will finish the image redesign by October 25th; 2. Zhang Wei, please approve the 5,000-yuan budget by October 18th; 3. Li Ming, you’ll track customer feedback on the new images after launch.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（主持人：很好。现在分配待办事项：1. 张莉，你的团队10 月25 日前完成图片重设计；2.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>张伟，10 月18 日前审批5000 元预算；3. 李明，发布后跟踪客户对新图片的反馈。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Host：To summarize, we’ve agreed on the Q4 image update plan and assigned action items.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Thank you all for your participation. The meeting is adjourned. Our next follow-up meeting is on October 23rd.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（主持人：总结一下，我们就Q4 图片更新计划达成共识，并分配了待办事项。感谢大家参与， 会议结束。下次跟进会议10 月23 日召开。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_19_11", "moduleId": "p4_7_19"}, {"title": "5.1 填词题", "section": "四、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. Let’s take a ________ (点名) to confirm everyone is here.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. The meeting ________ (议程) includes three main items: review, discussion, and Q&A.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. We need to ________ (总结) the key points of today’s meeting in the minutes.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. After discussion, we reached a ________ (共识) on the product launch date.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. Please ________ (跟进) on the action items and report back next week.</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_19_12", "moduleId": "p4_7_19"}, {"title": "5.2 句型仿写", "section": "四、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 仿照“我们先从[某人] 开始，能分享一下对[话题] 的看法吗？” 造句（用“财务专员张伟，</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>预算分配方案”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 仿照“虽然我理解你的观点，但我们得考虑[因素]” 造句（用“推迟会议，项目截止日期”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 仿照“分配待办事项：1. [某人] 将[任务]；2. [某人] 将[任务]” 造句（用“设计部李丽，10</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>月30 日前完成海报设计；市场部王浩，11 月1 日前发布海报”）。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_19_13", "moduleId": "p4_7_19"}, {"title": "5.3 情景模拟", "section": "四、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>假设你是会议主持人，会议即将结束，补全总结与散会内容：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“To wrap up today’s meeting:</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. We’ve discussed the ________ (项目名称：新产品上线准备) and agreed to launch it on</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>November 10th.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">2. Action items:</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Mr. Chen (tech team) will ________ (完成产品测试) by November 5th.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Ms. Huang (marketing team) will ________ (准备上线宣传文案) by November 8th.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Thank you all for your valuable input. ________ (宣布散会：会议结束，下次会议11 月8 日召开)。Have a great day!”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>答案</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_19_14", "moduleId": "p4_7_19"}, {"title": "5.1 填词题", "section": "四、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. roll call</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. agenda</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. summarize</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. consensus</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. follow up</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_19_15", "moduleId": "p4_7_19"}, {"title": "5.2 句型仿写", "section": "四、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. Let’s start with Zhang Wei, the finance specialist—could you share your thoughts on the</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>budget allocation plan?</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. While I see your point about delaying the meeting, I think we need to consider the project</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>deadline.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. Let’s assign action items: 1. Li Li from the design team will finish the poster design by</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>October 30th; 2. Wang Hao from the marketing team will release the poster by November 1st.</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_19_16", "moduleId": "p4_7_19"}, {"title": "5.3 情景模拟（示例）", "section": "四、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>“To wrap up today’s meeting:</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. We’ve discussed the new product launch preparation and agreed to launch it on</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>November 10th.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">2. Action items:</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Mr. Chen (tech team) will complete the product testing by November 5th.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Ms. Huang (marketing team) will prepare the launch promotion copy by November 8th.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Thank you all for your valuable input. The meeting is adjourned, and our next meeting will be on November 8th. Have a great day!”</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_19_17", "moduleId": "p4_7_19"}]}, {"id": "p4_7_20", "code": "7.20", "title": "职场赢家- 谈判话术", "articles": [{"title": "1.1 谈判核心词汇", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. negotiation [nɪˌɡəʊʃiˈeɪʃn]：谈判（例：conduct a business negotiation 进行商务谈判）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. proposal [prəˈpəʊzl]：提议；方案（例：put forward a price proposal 提出价格方案）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. compromise [ˈkɒmprəmaɪz]：妥协；折中（例：reach a compromise 达成折中方案）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. terms [tɜːmz]：条款（例：negotiate the payment terms 协商付款条款）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. concession [kənˈseʃn]：让步（例：make a concession on price 在价格上做出让步）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. mutually beneficial [ˌmjuːtʃuəli ˌbenɪˈfɪʃl]：互利共赢的（例：build a mutually beneficial</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>partnership 建立互利共赢的合作关系）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. delivery time [dɪˈlɪvəri taɪm]：交货时间（例：discuss the delivery time 协商交货时间）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. contract [ˈkɒntrækt]：合同（例：finalize the contract 敲定合同）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_20_01", "moduleId": "p4_7_20"}, {"title": "1.2 谈判沟通词汇", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. propose [prəˈpəʊz]：提议（例：propose a solution 提出解决方案）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. inquire [ɪnˈkwaɪə(r)]：询问（例：inquire about the other party’s needs 询问对方需求）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. respond [rɪˈspɒnd]：回应（例：respond to the proposal 回应提议）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. adjust [əˈdʒʌst]：调整（例：adjust the price 调整价格）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. finalize [ˈfaɪnəlaɪz]：敲定（例：finalize the details 敲定细节）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_20_02", "moduleId": "p4_7_20"}, {"title": "2.1 谈判开场（3 大场景）", "section": "二、谈判核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>场景          常用句型              职场例句 Good morning/afternoon. Thank   Good afternoon, Mr. Smith. Thank you 友好问候+ 表明目                   you for taking the time to meet       for meeting with us. Today, we aim to 的            with us. Today, we aim to discuss   discuss the order terms for your office [Topic] and reach a mutually         furniture and reach a mutually beneficial 场景          常用句型              职场例句 beneficial agreement.         agreement.（下午好，史密斯先生。感谢您与我们会面。今天我们希望讨论贵公司办公家具的订单条款，达成互利共赢的协议。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>We’ve researched your company’s products, and we believe our cooperation in office supplies can bring value to both             We believe our cooperation can sides. Let’s communicate openly to find a                      bring value to both sides. Let’s 强调合作意愿                                            solution that works for everyone.（我们研                  communicate openly to find a solution that works for everyone.  究过贵公司的产品，相信在办公用品领域的合作能为双方带来价值。让我们坦诚沟通，找到对大家都可行的方案。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>To focus our discussion, we’d like to prioritize three key points: the unit price To focus our discussion, we’d like                                                               of the chairs, the delivery time for 50 明确谈判重点       to prioritize [Key Points: price,                                                                  units, and the payment terms.（为聚焦讨 delivery time, payment terms].                          论，我们希望优先协商三个重点：椅子的单价、50 件的交货时间，以及付款条款。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_20_03", "moduleId": "p4_7_20"}, {"title": "2.2.1 提出我方条件/ 观点", "section": "二、谈判核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>句型          适用场景           职场例句 Considering the high quality of our ergonomic chairs and the large quantityConsidering [Factor:</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>(50 units), we propose that the unit pricequality/quantity], we propose              结合客观因素提出条件                                              be $80.（考虑到我们人体工学椅的高品质that [Condition: price/delivery time].                           和50 件的大订单量，我们提议单价为 80 美元。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句型          适用场景           职场例句 Our suggestion is to deliver the chairs within 10 days after the contract is Our suggestion is [Condition],                                                        signed, as this will help you meet your as this will [Benefit: meet    说明条件带来的好处                                                                 office renovation timeline.（我们建议合同 market demand/reduce risk].                            签署后10 天内交货，这样能帮助您赶上办公室装修进度。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_20_04", "moduleId": "p4_7_20"}, {"title": "2.2.2 询问对方需求/ 意见", "section": "二、谈判核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>句型          适用场景           职场例句 What’s your feedback on our proposed unit price of $80? Do you have anyWhat’s your feedback on our 询问对我方提议的反    specific requirements for the deliveryproposal? Do you have any schedule?（您对我们提议的80 美元单价specific requirements for         馈 [Topic]?                      有什么反馈？对交货安排有具体要求吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Could you share your expectations for the payment terms? For example, do you Could you share your                                      prefer monthly installments or a one-time expectations for [Terms:               了解对方对关键条款   payment? We want to find a solution that payment/delivery]? We want to                                      fits both sides.（您能分享一下对付款条款                  的期待 find a solution that fits both                          的期待吗？比如您倾向于按月分期还是一 sides.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>次性付款？我们希望找到双方都合适的方案。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_20_05", "moduleId": "p4_7_20"}, {"title": "2.2.3 回应对方观点（同意/ 异议）", "section": "二、谈判核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>立场        句型             职场例句同意                      That’s a reasonable         That’s a reasonable request to extend 立场        句型             职场例句 request. We can accept     the delivery time by 2 days. We can [Condition] without          accept that without hesitation.（将交货时 hesitation.        间延长2 天，这是合理的要求，我们完全可以接受。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>While we understand your request for a 10% price reduction, we have concerns about the production cost—raw material While we understand your   prices have risen by 5% recently. Let’s request for [Condition], we   discuss alternatives, like adjusting the 异议（委婉）  have concerns about       payment terms.（虽然我们理解您要求降 [Issue: cost/risk]. Let’s                         价10% 的想法，但我们对生产成本有顾 discuss alternatives.                   虑—— 最近原材料价格上涨了5%。我们可以讨论其他方案，比如调整付款条款。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_20_06", "moduleId": "p4_7_20"}, {"title": "2.2.4 做出让步/ 寻求折中", "section": "二、谈判核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>句型        适用场景          职场例句 To show our sincerity in cooperation, we’re willing to reduce the unit price by To show our sincerity, we’re             5% (from 80 to 76), on the condition that willing to [Concession: reduce                 you agree to a one-time payment within 7 price/extend delivery], on the  有条件的让步   days of delivery.（为体现合作诚意，我们 condition that [Our                        愿意将单价降低5%（从80 美元降至76 Requirement].</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>美元），条件是您同意在交货后7 天内一次性付款。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>How about we meet halfway? We can extend the delivery time by 3 days if you How about we meet halfway?                                          can reduce your price request from 10% We can [Our Adjustment] if   提议各让一步                                                     to 5%.（我们各让一步怎么样？如果您能 you can [Their Adjustment].                        将降价要求从10% 降至5%，我们可以将交货时间延长3 天。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_20_07", "moduleId": "p4_7_20"}, {"title": "2.3 谈判结尾（3 大场景）", "section": "二、谈判核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>场景         常用句型             职场例句 To summarize, we’ve agreed on: 1. Unit price of $76 for 50 ergonomic chairs; 2.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Delivery time within 13 days after                  To summarize, we’ve agreed contract signing; 3. One-time payment                      on: 1. [Term 1: price]; 2.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>总结达成的共识                                       within 7 days of delivery.（总结一下，我                    [Term 2: delivery time]; 3.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>[Term 3: payment terms].   们已达成以下共识：1. 50 把人体工学椅单价76 美元；2. 合同签署后13 天内交货；3. 交货后7 天内一次性付款。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>We’ll prepare the contract draft and send it to your email by this Friday (October                        We’ll [Our Action: prepare 20th), and you can provide your                      contract/send draft] by feedback by next Monday (October 确认下一步行动      [Date], and you can [Their 23rd).（我们将于本周五（10 月20 日）                       Action: review/provide feedback] by [Date].     前准备好合同草案并发送至您邮箱，您可于下周一（10 月23 日）前提供反馈。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Thank you for your cooperation and flexibility during the negotiation. We’re                  Thank you for your confident this partnership will help both of                      cooperation and flexibility.礼貌结束+ 表达期                                              us achieve our business goals. Have a                    We’re confident this 待                                           great day!（感谢您在谈判中的合作与灵活                      partnership will be mutually beneficial.         调整。我们相信这次合作将帮助双方实现业务目标，祝您愉快！）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_20_08", "moduleId": "p4_7_20"}, {"title": "2.4 谈判注意事项", "section": "二、谈判核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 情绪管理：保持冷静理性，即使出现分歧也不情绪化，用“Let’s analyze this from a cost</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>perspective”（我们从成本角度分析一下）引导客观讨论；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 积极倾听：不打断对方发言，用“Let me make sure I understand—you mean...”（我确认</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>一下—— 您是说……）确认对方需求，避免误解；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 底线明确：提前明确自身“可让步范围”（如价格最低降至75 美元）和“不可妥协条款”（如</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>付款周期不超过10 天），避免过度让步；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 证据支撑：提出条件时带数据/ 事实（如“Raw material prices rose 5%”），增强说服力，</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>避免空泛表述（如“Our product is good”）。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_20_09", "moduleId": "p4_7_20"}, {"title": "三、职场模拟对话（场景：办公家具订单谈判）", "section": "三、职场模拟对话（场景：办公家具订单谈判）", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">角色：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>甲方（采购方）：李明（ABC 公司采购经理）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>乙方（供应方）：史密斯（XYZ 家具公司销售总监）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Li Ming (LM)：Good afternoon, Mr. Smith. Thank you for meeting with us. Today, we want to discuss the order of 50 ergonomic chairs and reach a mutually beneficial agreement.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（李明：下午好，史密斯先生。感谢您会面。今天我们希望讨论50 把人体工学椅的订单，达成互利共赢的协议。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Mr. Smith (MS)：Good afternoon, Mr. Li. We value your business. Our proposed unit price for the chairs is $80, and we can deliver within 10 days after contract signing. What’s your feedback? （史密斯：下午好，李先生。我们重视与您的合作。我们提议椅子单价80 美元，合同签署后 10 天内交货。您有什么反馈吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>LM：We appreciate your proposal, but we have two concerns. First, the unit price is a bit higher than our budget—we hope to get a 10% reduction. Second, our office renovation will finish on October 30th, so we need the chairs delivered by October 25th (13 days after signing, if we sign on the 12th).</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（李明：感谢您的提议，但我们有两点顾虑。第一，单价超出我们预算，希望能降价10%；第二，我们办公室装修10 月30 日结束，所以需要椅子在10 月25 日前交货（如果12 日签署合同，就是13 天内）。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>MS：While we understand your budget and timeline concerns, a 10% price reduction is challenging—raw material prices rose 5% last month. However, to show our sincerity, we’re willing to reduce the price by 5% (to $76) if you agree to a one-time payment within 7 days of delivery. And we can extend the delivery time to 13 days, which fits your October 25th deadline.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（史密斯：虽然我们理解您的预算和时间顾虑，但降价10% 有难度—— 上个月原材料价格上涨了5%。不过为体现诚意，若您同意交货后7 天内一次性付款，我们愿意降价5%（至76 美元），并且可以将交货时间延长至13 天，刚好满足您10 月25 日的deadline。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>LM：That’s a fair compromise. We accept the 76 unit price and one-time payment within 7 days. Let’s confirm the key terms: 50 chairs at 76 each, delivery by October 25th, payment within 7 days of delivery.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（李明：这是合理的折中方案。我们接受76 美元的单价和7 天内一次性付款。我们确认一下关键条款：50 把椅子，单价76 美元，10 月25 日前交货，交货后7 天内付款。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>MS：Exactly. We’ll prepare the contract draft and send it to your email by this Friday (October 13th). Please provide feedback by Monday (October 16th), and we can sign the contract next Tuesday (October 17th).</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（史密斯：没错。我们将于本周五（10 月13 日）前准备好合同草案发送至您邮箱，请于周一（10 月16 日）前提供反馈，下周二（10 月17 日）可签署合同。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>LM：Perfect. Thank you for your flexibility, Mr. Smith. We’re looking forward to our cooperation.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（李明：很好。感谢您的灵活调整，史密斯先生。我们期待合作。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>MS：Thank you too, Mr. Li. Have a great day! （史密斯：也谢谢您，李先生。祝您愉快！）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_20_10", "moduleId": "p4_7_20"}, {"title": "5.1 填词题", "section": "四、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. We need to ________ (谈判) the payment terms with the supplier before signing the</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>contract.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. To show our sincerity, we’re willing to make a ________ (让步) on the delivery time.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. After discussion, we reached a ________ (折中方案) on the unit price—reducing it by 5%.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. The two sides agreed on all ________ (条款) of the contract, including price and delivery.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. This partnership will be ________ (互利共赢的) for both our companies.</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_20_11", "moduleId": "p4_7_20"}, {"title": "5.2 句型仿写", "section": "四、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 仿照“考虑到[因素]，我们提议[条件]” 造句（用“订单量100 件，单价降至$50”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 仿照“为体现诚意，我们愿意[让步]，条件是[我方要求]” 造句（用“延长付款周期至15</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>天，对方增加订单量至120 件”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 仿照“总结一下，我们已达成共识：1. [条款1]；2. [条款2]；3. [条款3]” 造句（用“100 件</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>产品单价$50，15 天内交货，付款周期15 天”）。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_20_12", "moduleId": "p4_7_20"}, {"title": "5.3 情景模拟", "section": "四、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>假设你是乙方（供应商），与甲方谈判原材料订单，甲方要求降价8%，你方只能接受5%， 且希望甲方缩短付款周期。补全对话：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You：Good morning, Mr. Wang. Thank you for today’s negotiation. Our proposed unit price for the raw material is 100 per ton, with a 30-day payment cycle.   Mr. Wang：Good morning.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>We hope to reduce the unit price by 8%—92 per ton. The 30-day payment cycle is acceptable.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You：While we understand your price request, ________ (说明8% 降价有难度，如“a 8% reduction is challenging due to rising transportation costs”). However, ________ (提出让步：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>接受5% 降价，条件是缩短付款周期至20 天)。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Mr. Wang：A 5% reduction to 95 and 20-day payment cycle—this works for us.   You：Great! To summarize, ________ (总结共识：100 吨原材料单价95，20 天付款周期，10 天内交货)。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>We’ll send the contract draft by tomorrow.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Mr. Wang：Perfect. Thank you for your cooperation.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You：________ (礼貌结束+ 表达期待：Thank you too. We’re confident this cooperation will benefit both sides.)</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>答案</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_20_13", "moduleId": "p4_7_20"}, {"title": "5.1 填词题", "section": "四、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. negotiate</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. concession</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. compromise</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. terms</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. mutually beneficial</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_20_14", "moduleId": "p4_7_20"}, {"title": "5.2 句型仿写", "section": "四、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. Considering the large order quantity (100 units), we propose that the unit price be reduced</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>to $50.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. To show our sincerity, we’re willing to extend the payment cycle to 15 days, on the</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>condition that you increase the order quantity to 120 units.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. To summarize, we’ve agreed on: 1. Unit price of $50 for 100 products; 2. Delivery within</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>15 days; 3. 15-day payment cycle.</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_20_15", "moduleId": "p4_7_20"}, {"title": "5.3 情景模拟（示例）", "section": "四、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>You：Good morning, Mr. Wang. Thank you for today’s negotiation. Our proposed unit price for the raw material is 100 per ton, with a 30-day payment cycle.   Mr. Wang：Good morning.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>We hope to reduce the unit price by 8%—92 per ton. The 30-day payment cycle is acceptable.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You：While we understand your price request, a 8% reduction is challenging due to rising transportation costs (we’ve seen a 6% increase in trucking fees this month). However, to show our sincerity, we’re willing to reduce the unit price by 5% (to 95 per ton), on the condition that you shorten the payment cycle to 20 days.   Mr. Wang：A 5% reduction to 95 and 20-day payment cycle—this works for us.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You：Great! To summarize, we’ve agreed on: 1. 100 tons of raw material at $95 per ton; 2.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>20-day payment cycle; 3. Delivery within 10 days after contract signing. We’ll send the contract draft by tomorrow.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Mr. Wang：Perfect. Thank you for your cooperation.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You：Thank you too. We’re confident this cooperation will benefit both sides. Have a nice day!</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_20_16", "moduleId": "p4_7_20"}]}, {"id": "p4_7_21", "code": "7.21", "title": "职场赢家- 跨文化交际", "articles": [{"title": "1.1 文化差异核心词汇", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. body language [ˈbɒdi ˈlæŋɡwɪdʒ]：肢体语言（例：misunderstand body language 误解肢</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>体语言）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. personal space [ˈpɜːsənl speɪs]：个人空间（例：respect personal space 尊重个人空间）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. work values [wɜːk ˈvæljuːz]：工作价值观（例：different work values 不同的工作价值观）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. cultural norm [ˈkʌltʃərəl nɔːm]：文化规范（例：adapt to cultural norms 适应文化规范）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. dietary restriction [ˈdaɪətəri rɪˈstrɪkʃn]：饮食禁忌（例：respect dietary restrictions 尊重饮</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>食禁忌）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. cultural sensitivity [ˈkʌltʃərəl ˌsensəˈtɪvəti]：文化敏感度（例：develop cultural sensitivity 培</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>养文化敏感度）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_21_01", "moduleId": "p4_7_21"}, {"title": "1.2 冲突处理词汇", "section": "一、词汇预习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. resolve conflict [rɪˈzɒlv ˈkɒnflɪkt]：解决冲突（例：resolve cross-cultural conflicts 解决跨文</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>化冲突）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. compromise [ˈkɒmprəmaɪz]：折中（例：reach a compromise 达成折中方案）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. communicate openly [kəˈmjuːnɪkeɪt ˈəʊpənli]：坦诚沟通（例：communicate openly about</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>differences 坦诚沟通差异）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. bridge the gap [brɪdʒ ðə ɡæp]：弥合差距（例：bridge cultural gaps 弥合文化差距）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. adapt to [əˈdæpt tu]：适应（例：adapt to foreign work cultures 适应外国工作文化）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_21_02", "moduleId": "p4_7_21"}, {"title": "2.1.1 肢体语言差异", "section": "二、跨文化交际核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>文化/ 国  肢体语言解读             职场注意事项</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>家</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>中国/ 日  轻微鞠躬（15°）表问候，深鞠躬（30°+） 与日本同事初次见面时，可轻微鞠躬本     表感谢/ 道歉；避免长时间直视对方（视 回应；交流时眼神温和，不直视过久。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>为不礼貌）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>欧美国家    “OK” 手势表“没问题”；眼神接触表专注/ 与美国同事握手时，力度适中（不过 （美/   尊重；握手有力表自信           轻/ 过重）；交流时保持自然眼神英）                       接触。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>巴西/ 德   “OK” 手势表“冒犯性含义”（巴西：粗俗  与巴西、德国同事沟通时，避免使用国     手势；德国：零/ 无价值）             “OK” 手势，可用“thumbs up” 表 “同意”。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_21_03", "moduleId": "p4_7_21"}, {"title": "2.1.2 社交距离差异", "section": "二、跨文化交际核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>文化区域     社交距离偏好        职场应对技巧拉丁美洲/ 地中  交流时身体距离近（约0.5-1  若对方靠近，不刻意后退；若感到不适， 海（墨西哥/ 意大 米），可能有轻拍手臂等肢体 可自然调整站位（如侧身半步），不表现利）       接触            排斥。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>北欧国家（瑞典/  交流时保持较远距离（约   与瑞典同事沟通时，保持1 米以上距离；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>挪威）              1.2-1.5 米），避免不必要肢体 不主动拍肩、拥抱，以点头、微笑代替。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>接触</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>中国/ 东南亚    中等距离（约0.8-1.2 米）， 与中国同事开会时，座位间隔一拳距离；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>正式场合避免肢体接触    非正式场合可拍肩表友好，但需观察对方反应。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_21_04", "moduleId": "p4_7_21"}, {"title": "2.1.3 工作价值观差异", "section": "二、跨文化交际核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>文化/ 国家       核心工作价值观      职场协作建议美国/ 加拿大      强调个人成就（主动展示  与美国同事合作时，可主成果）、竞争意识、快速  动分享个人工作进展；会决策           议中积极发表观点，不回</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>避“竞争” 话题（如“我负</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>责的部分效率提升了</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>10%”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>日本/ 韩国       强调团队协作（集体利益  与日本同事项目汇报时， 优先）、终身雇佣、循序  多提“团队协作成果”（如渐进           “我们团队通过3 轮测试</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>优化了方案”）；不单独突</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>出个人，避免“个人英雄主</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>义” 表述。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>中东国家（沙特/ 阿联酋）强调人际关系（先建立信  与沙特同事初次合作时， 任再谈工作）、宗教优先  先聊生活（如“您对本地天 （祈祷时间需灵活）    气还适应吗”），再切入工</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>作；避免在祈祷时间（如</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>每日5 次祈祷）安排紧急</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>会议。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_21_05", "moduleId": "p4_7_21"}, {"title": "2.2.1 第一步：积极沟通，直面差异", "section": "二、跨文化交际核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>核心原则：不回避冲突，坦诚表达“差异源于文化”，而非个人对立。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">实用句型：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1.  “I noticed we have different approaches to this task—I think it might come from our cultural</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>backgrounds. Could we talk about how to adjust?”（我注意到我们处理这项任务的方式不同，我想可能源于文化背景差异。我们能聊聊如何调整吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2.  “I don’t want there to be misunderstandings—could you share how things are usually done</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>in your culture for this kind of work?”（我不想产生误解，您能分享一下在您的文化中，这类工作通常如何处理吗？）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_21_06", "moduleId": "p4_7_21"}, {"title": "2.2.2 第二步：寻求共同点，聚焦目标", "section": "二、跨文化交际核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>核心原则：强调“共同目标”（如项目成功、公司利益），弱化文化差异。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">实用句型：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. “Although we have different work styles, we both want this project to meet the deadline.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Let’s focus on that goal together.”（虽然我们工作风格不同，但我们都希望项目如期完成。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>让我们一起聚焦这个目标。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. “No matter what culture we’re from, good communication and quality results are what we</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>need. Let’s find a way that works for both of us.”（无论来自哪种文化，我们都需要良好沟通和高质量成果。让我们找到双方都适用的方式。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_21_07", "moduleId": "p4_7_21"}, {"title": "2.2.3 第三步：尊重包容，灵活适应", "section": "二、跨文化交际核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>核心原则：不强迫对方接受自己的文化，也不否定自身文化，保持“求同存异”。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">实用句型：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1.  “I may not fully understand why this is important in your culture, but I respect your</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>choice—and I’m willing to adjust my schedule to match.”（我可能不完全理解这在您的文化中为何重要，但我尊重您的选择，也愿意调整我的日程来配合。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. “Let’s try a compromise: we can use your approach for the first phase, and my approach</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>for the second. We’ll see what works best.”（我们可以试试折中：第一阶段用您的方法，第二阶段用我的方法，看看哪种更有效。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_21_08", "moduleId": "p4_7_21"}, {"title": "2.3 四类实用跨文化交际句型", "section": "二、跨文化交际核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>场景      句型              职场例句 I understand your culture values building personal trust before work, and I respect 表达理    I understand your culture                                                 that. I’ll be more patient in our initial 解与尊   values [X], and I respect                          conversations.（我理解您的文化重视工作前重      that. I’ll try to adapt.                   建立个人信任，我尊重这一点。在初期沟通中我会更有耐心。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Perhaps we could adjust   Perhaps we could adjust the meeting time to  委婉提 our approach to take       take both your prayer schedule and our 场景      句型              职场例句出建议   both our cultural habits     deadline into account—how about 10 a.m.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>into account.              instead of 9 a.m.?（或许我们可以调整会议时间，兼顾您的祈祷时间和我们的截止日期 —— 改成上午10 点而非9 点怎么样？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Sorry if I offended you by offering  化解尴              Sorry if I offended                                      alcohol—I’m still learning about your cultural 尬（自  you—I’m still learning                                  norms regarding drinking.（很抱歉递酒可能身失   about your cultural                   冒犯了您，我还在学习您的文化中关于饮酒的误）   norms.                   规范。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I hope you can understand that in my culture, we usually confirm details in writing. We can                        I hope you can find a middle ground—like sending a short             understand that this is  请求对                                summary after our verbal discussion.（希望           how we usually do things 方理解                 in my culture. We can   您能理解，在我的文化中，我们通常会书面确 find a middle ground.   认细节。我们可以找折中方案—— 比如口头讨论后发一份简短摘要。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_21_09", "moduleId": "p4_7_21"}, {"title": "2.4 五大高频跨文化固定搭配", "section": "二、跨文化交际核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>搭配      含义            职场例句 It takes time to adapt to the work rhythm in</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>适应（文化/</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>adapt to [sth]                  Japanese companies.（适应日本公司的工作节习惯）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>奏需要时间。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>When planning the dinner, we must take the take [sth] into   考虑（文化差                                               clients’ dietary restrictions into account.（安排 account      异/ 需求）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>晚宴时，我们必须考虑客户的饮食禁忌。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>be sensitive to  对（文化敏感  We need to be sensitive to the religious [sth]       点）保持敏感   holidays of our Middle Eastern partners.（我们搭配      含义            职场例句需要对中东合作伙伴的宗教节日保持敏感。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Regular team-building activities can help             弥合（A 与B     bridge the gap                                       bridge the gap between Chinese and Western between [A] and 之间的）文化                      employees.（定期团建活动有助于弥合中西方员 [B]         差距                  工之间的文化差距。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>When conflicts arise, we should focus on focus on     聚焦共同目   common goals rather than cultural differences.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>common goals    标    （冲突发生时，我们应聚焦共同目标而非文化差异。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_21_10", "moduleId": "p4_7_21"}, {"title": "2.5 三个职场跨文化案例分析", "section": "二、跨文化交际核心模块", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>案例1：项目分工差异（美国同事vs 中国同事）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>背景：美国同事希望“每人独立负责一个模块，最后汇总”，中国同事希望“团队一起讨论，同步推进”，产生分歧。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">沟通话术：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“I understand that in American work culture, independent responsibility helps show individual contributions—and that’s great for efficiency. In my culture, we often work together to avoid mistakes. How about we try a mix: each of us takes a core task, but we have a 15-minute daily check-in to share progress? That way, we get both independence and teamwork.”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（我理解在美国工作文化中，独立负责有助于体现个人贡献，这对效率很有帮助。在我的文化中，我们常一起工作以避免失误。我们试试混合模式怎么样：每人负责一个核心任务，但每天花15 分钟同步进展？这样既能保持独立性，又能兼顾团队协作。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>案例2：饮食禁忌失误（印度客户vs 中国员工）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>背景：邀请印度客户参加晚宴，未注意其“不食牛肉” 的宗教禁忌，客户表现不满。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">应对话术：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“I’m truly sorry for the mistake—I should have asked about your dietary restrictions beforehand. Please let me know what foods you can eat (like vegetarian dishes), and I’ll have the restaurant prepare them right away. This won’t happen again, and I appreciate your patience.”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（非常抱歉犯了这个错误，我本该提前询问您的饮食禁忌。请告诉我您能吃的食物（比如素食）， 我马上让餐厅准备。以后不会再发生这种情况，感谢您的耐心。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>案例3：工作节奏差异（澳大利亚同事vs 中国员工）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>背景：澳大利亚同事习惯“随时提出新想法，灵活调整计划”，中国员工觉得“打乱原有节奏， 影响效率”。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">沟通话术：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“I love that you’re always coming up with creative ideas—that’s a big strength! In my work style, I usually stick to the plan to meet deadlines, so frequent changes make me a bit worried.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Could we set a ‘weekly idea meeting’? We can collect new thoughts then and decide if we need to adjust the plan—this way, we keep creativity and stability.”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（我很欣赏您总能提出有创意的想法，这是很大的优势！在我的工作风格中，我通常会按计划推进以赶上截止日期，所以频繁变动会让我有点担心。我们可以设一个“每周创意会议” 吗？</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>到时收集新想法，再决定是否调整计划—— 这样既能保留创意，又能保持稳定。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_21_11", "moduleId": "p4_7_21"}, {"title": "5.1 填词题", "section": "三、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. We need to ________ (适应) the cultural norms of our German partners when working</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>together.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. When planning the meeting, don’t forget to ________ (考虑) the religious holidays of our</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Saudi clients.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. Good communication can help ________ (弥合) the cultural gap between Chinese and</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Western teams.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. We should be ________ (敏感) to the personal space of our Swedish colleagues—don’t</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>stand too close.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. To resolve the conflict, we decided to ________ (折中) and use a mix of both work styles.</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_21_12", "moduleId": "p4_7_21"}, {"title": "5.2 句型仿写", "section": "三、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 仿照“我理解您的文化重视[X]，我尊重这一点，也愿意调整我的做法” 造句（用“准时参</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>加会议，提前5 分钟到达”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 仿照“我们可以试试折中方案：[方案内容]，这样既能[好处1]，又能[好处2]” 造句（用“周</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>一/ 周三用您的方法，周二/ 周四用我的方法，保持灵活性，保证效率”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 仿照“很抱歉[失误]，我还在学习您的文化规范，以后会更注意” 造句（用“称呼您的名字</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>太随意，职场中用尊称”）。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_21_13", "moduleId": "p4_7_21"}, {"title": "5.3 情景模拟", "section": "三、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>假设你是中国员工，与英国同事合作项目，对方开会时经常打断你发言（英国文化中“打断” 表 “积极参与”，中国文化中“打断” 表“不尊重”），你该如何沟通？补全对话：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You：Hi Tom, I wanted to talk to you about our meetings. I noticed you often share your thoughts while I’m speaking—and I know that in British culture, this means you’re actively engaged, which I appreciate.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Tom：Oh, sorry if I made you uncomfortable! I didn’t realize.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You：No need to apologize. But in my culture, ________ (解释中国文化中“打断” 的含义：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“interrupting someone while they’re speaking is seen as not respecting their opinion”). I hope you can understand.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Tom：That makes sense! I’ll try to wait until you finish.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You：Thank you for being flexible. Maybe we can also ________ (提出折中方案：“take turns speaking—you share your thoughts after I finish, and I’ll do the same for you”). This way, ________ (说明好处：“we both feel respected and can still share ideas actively”).</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Tom：Perfect! That works for me.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>答案</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_21_14", "moduleId": "p4_7_21"}, {"title": "5.1 填词题", "section": "三、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. adapt to</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. take into account</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. bridge</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. sensitive</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. reach a compromise</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_21_15", "moduleId": "p4_7_21"}, {"title": "5.2 句型仿写", "section": "三、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1.  I understand your culture values being on time for meetings, and I respect that. I’ll adjust</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>my routine to arrive 5 minutes early.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. We can try a compromise: use your method on Mondays and Wednesdays, and my</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>method on Tuesdays and Thursdays. This way, we can keep flexibility and ensure efficiency.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. Sorry for calling you by your first name so casually—I’m still learning your cultural norms</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>for workplace titles. I’ll use “Mr. Smith” from now on to show respect.</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_21_16", "moduleId": "p4_7_21"}, {"title": "5.3 情景模拟（示例）", "section": "三、课后练习及答案", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>You：Hi Tom, I wanted to talk to you about our meetings. I noticed you often share your thoughts while I’m speaking—and I know that in British culture, this means you’re actively engaged, which I appreciate.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Tom：Oh, sorry if I made you uncomfortable! I didn’t realize.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You：No need to apologize. But in my culture, interrupting someone while they’re speaking is seen as not respecting their opinion. I hope you can understand.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Tom：That makes sense! I’ll try to wait until you finish.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>You：Thank you for being flexible. Maybe we can also take turns speaking—you share your thoughts after I finish, and I’ll do the same for you. This way, we both feel respected and can still share ideas actively.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>Tom：Perfect! That works for me.</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_21_17", "moduleId": "p4_7_21"}]}, {"id": "p4_7_22", "code": "7.22", "title": "旅游英语- 行前准备", "articles": [{"title": "一、行前准备场景（核心任务：签证/ 文件/ 机票/ 酒店预订）", "section": "一、行前准备场景（核心任务：签证/ 文件/ 机票/ 酒店预订）", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 办理签证& 准备文件</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>【场景图片：书桌摆放护照、签证申请表、照片、银行存款证明】 【图片标注单词】：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. visa [ˈviːzə]：签证</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. passport [ˈpɑːspɔːt]：护照</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. documents [ˈdɒkjuments]：文件（统称）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. bank statement [bæŋk ˈsteɪtmənt]：银行存款证明</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. photos [ˈfəʊtəʊz]：证件照</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>【对话框对话（你↔旅行社工作人员）】</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. 你：I need to prepare documents for my visa application to Japan. What do I need?（我要</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>准备日本签证申请的文件，需要哪些材料？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. 工作人员：You’ll need your passport, 2 recent photos, and a 6-month bank statement.（需</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>要护照、2 张近期证件照，还有6 个月的银行存款证明。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 预订机票</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>【场景图片：手机/ 电脑显示机票预订界面（含“往返”“起飞时间”“航班号” 选项）】 【图片标注单词】：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. book a flight [bʊk ə flaɪt]：预订机票</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. round-trip flight [raʊnd trɪp flaɪt]：往返机票</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. one-way flight [wʌn weɪ flaɪt]：单程机票</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. departure time [dɪˈpɑːtʃə taɪm]：起飞时间</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. arrival time [əˈraɪvl taɪm]：到达时间</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. flight number [flaɪt ˈnʌmbə]：航班号</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>【对话框对话（你↔机票客服）】</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. 你：I’d like to book a round-trip flight to London—departure on July 1st, return on July 15th.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（我想订去伦敦的往返机票，7 月1 日出发，7 月15 日返回。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. 客服：Sure! The best flight is CA937 (departure 14:30) and CA938 (return 16:10). Do you</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>need to choose a seat?（好的！最优航班是CA937（14:30 起飞）和CA938（16:10 返回），需要选座吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 预订酒店</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>【场景图片：酒店预订APP 界面（显示“单人房”“双人房”“入住日期” 选项）】 【图片标注单词】：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. book a hotel [bʊk ə həʊˈtel]：预订酒店</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. single room [ˈsɪŋɡl ruːm]：单人房</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. double room [ˈdʌbl ruːm]：双人房</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. budget [ˈbʌdʒɪt]：预算</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. check-in date [tʃek ɪn deɪt]：入住日期</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. check-out date [tʃek aʊt deɪt]：退房日期</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>【对话框对话（你↔酒店前台）】</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. 你：Do you have a double room available on July 10th? I need to book it for 3 nights.（7 月</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>10 日有双人房吗？我要订3 晚。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. 前台：Yes, we have a double room with a window. The price is $150 per night, including</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>breakfast.（有，有一间带窗的双人房，每晚150 美元，含早餐。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_22_01", "moduleId": "p4_7_22"}, {"title": "二、机场场景（核心流程：值机→行李托运→过安检→候机）", "section": "二、机场场景（核心流程：值机→行李托运→过安检→候机）", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 机场值机</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>【场景图片：机场值机柜台（工作人员递登机牌，你递护照）】 【图片标注单词】：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. check in [tʃek ɪn]：值机</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. check-in counter [tʃek ɪn ˈkaʊntə]：值机柜台</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. boarding pass [ˈbɔːdɪŋ pɑːs]：登机牌</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. boarding gate [ˈbɔːdɪŋ ɡeɪt]：登机口</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. carry-on bag [ˈkæri ɒn bæɡ]：随身行李</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>【对话框对话（你↔值机工作人员）】</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 你：Hi, I’d like to check in for flight CA937 to London. This is my passport.（你好，我要办</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>理CA937 去伦敦的值机，这是我的护照。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 工作人员：Thank you. Do you have any checked luggage?（谢谢。有托运行李吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 你：No, only this carry-on bag.（没有，只有这个随身行李。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 工作人员：Here’s your boarding pass—boarding gate is 18, departure at 14:30.（这是你的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>登机牌，登机口18，14:30 起飞。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 行李托运</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>【场景图片：行李放在值机柜台称重台（显示“23kg”，工作人员指超重提示）】 【图片标注单词】：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. checked luggage [tʃekt ˈlʌɡɪdʒ]：托运行李</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. overweight [ˌəʊvəˈweɪt]：超重的</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. extra charge [ˈekstrə tʃɑːdʒ]：额外费用</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. luggage weight [ˈlʌɡɪdʒ weɪt]：行李重量</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. prohibited items [prəˈhɪbɪtɪd ˈaɪtəmz]：禁止托运物品（如尖锐物品、大容量液体）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>【对话框对话（你↔值机工作人员）】</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. 工作人员：Your luggage is 23kg—it’s 3kg overweight. The extra charge is $50.（你的行李</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>23 公斤，超重3 公斤，额外费用50 美元。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. 你：OK, I’ll pay. Also, can I check if a laptop is allowed in checked luggage?（好的，我来</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>付。另外，笔记本电脑能托运吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. 工作人员：No, laptops must be in your carry-on bag—they’re prohibited in checked</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>luggage.（不行，笔记本电脑必须放随身行李，禁止托运。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 过安检</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>【场景图片：安检处（你把手表、皮带、电脑放进托盘，工作人员持检测仪）】 【图片标注单词】：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. security check [sɪˈkjʊərəti tʃek]：安检</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. metal objects [ˈmetl ˈɒbdʒekts]：金属物品（手表、皮带等）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. tray [treɪ]：安检托盘</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. laptop [ˈlæptɒp]：笔记本电脑</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. liquids [ˈlɪkwɪdz]：液体（需≤100ml）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>【对话框对话（你↔安检工作人员）】</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. 工作人员：Please take off your watch and belt, put them in the tray. Also, take out your</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>laptop and liquids.（请摘下手表和皮带，放进托盘。另外，把电脑和液体拿出来。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. 你：Got it. Is this 100ml bottle of shampoo allowed?（好的。这瓶100 毫升的洗发水可以</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>带吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. 工作人员：Yes, it’s within the limit. You can put it in the tray.（可以，在规定范围内，放进</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>托盘即可。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 候机</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>【场景图片：候机大厅（显示“登机口18”，广播喇叭播放通知，旁边有便利店）】 【图片标注单词】：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. wait for the flight [weɪt fɔː ðə flaɪt]：候机</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. announcement [əˈnaʊnsmənt]：广播通知</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. flight delay [flaɪt dɪˈleɪ]：航班延误</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. boarding gate change [ˈbɔːdɪŋ ɡeɪt tʃeɪndʒ]：登机口变更</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. airport shop [ˈeəpɔːt ʃɒp]：机场商店</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>【对话框对话（1. 广播通知；2. 你↔便利店店员）】</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 广播：Attention passengers! Flight CA937 to London is delayed by 30 minutes. The new</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>departure time is 15:00.（各位乘客请注意！CA937 去伦敦的航班延误30 分钟，新起飞时间15:00。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 你：I’d like to buy a bottle of water and a pack of cookies.（我想买一瓶水和一包饼干。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>店员：That’s $5 total. Cash or card?（一共5 美元，现金还是刷卡？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>你：Card, please.（刷卡，谢谢。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_22_02", "moduleId": "p4_7_22"}, {"title": "三、课后练习（巩固场景表达）", "section": "三、课后练习（巩固场景表达）", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 选词填空（根据场景选单词：visa /boarding pass /checked luggage /security check）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>①Before going abroad, you need to apply for a .（出国前需要申请。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>②After check-in, the staff will give you a ________ with your boarding gate.（值机后， 工作人员会给你含登机口的____。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>③You must go through ________ before entering the waiting area.（进入候机区前必须过 ______。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 情景造句（用括号里的单词造旅游场景句子）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>①（book a hotel / single room / 2 nights）→________________________ ②（flight delay / 1 hour / ask for latest info）→________________________</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 答案</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>a. ①visa；②boarding pass；③security check b. ①I’d like to book a single room for 2 nights in Tokyo.（我想在东京订一间单人房，住2 晚。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>②The flight to Paris is delayed by 1 hour—I need to ask the staff for the latest info.（去巴黎的航班延误1 小时，我要找工作人员问最新信息。）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_22_03", "moduleId": "p4_7_22"}]}, {"id": "p4_7_23", "code": "7.23", "title": "旅游英语- 旅途用语", "articles": [{"title": "1.1 办理入住", "section": "一、酒店场景", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>核心词汇</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. check in（酒店入住）：酒店办理入住手续</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. reception desk（酒店前台）：酒店接待柜台</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. reservation（预订）：提前预约的房间记录</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. passport（护照）：国外入住必备身份证件</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. room number（房间号）：酒店分配的住宿房间编号</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. breakfast time（早餐时间）：酒店提供早餐的时段</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>实用对话</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>你：Good afternoon. I have a reservation under the name of Li Ming. Could I check in now? 前台：Sure! Could you please show me your passport? 你：Here you are. By the way, what time is breakfast served? 前台：Breakfast is from 7 a.m. to 10 a.m. in the first-floor restaurant. Your room number is 502—here’s your key card.</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_23_01", "moduleId": "p4_7_23"}, {"title": "1.2 房间问题沟通", "section": "一、酒店场景", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>核心词汇</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. air conditioner（空调）：房间制冷/ 制热设备</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. maintenance person（维修人员）：负责修理故障设备的工作人员</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. hot water（热水）：洗漱用热水</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. not clean（不干净）：房间卫生不达标状态</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>实用对话</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>你：Hello, this is Li Ming in Room 502. The air conditioner in my room isn’t working—it’s too hot. Could you send someone to fix it? 前台：I’m sorry for the inconvenience! We’ll send a maintenance person to your room in 10 minutes.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>你：Thank you—could you also check if the hot water will be available tonight? 前台：Yes, hot water is supplied 24 hours a day.</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_23_02", "moduleId": "p4_7_23"}, {"title": "1.3 办理退房", "section": "一、酒店场景", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>核心词汇</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. check out（酒店退房）：酒店办理离开手续</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. settle the bill（结算费用）：支付住宿总费用</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. credit card（信用卡）：非现金支付工具</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. cash（现金）：纸币/ 硬币支付方式</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. receipt（收据）：费用支付凭证</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>实用对话</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>你：Good morning. I’d like to check out now—I’m in Room 502.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>前台：Your total bill is $450. How would you like to pay? 你：I’ll pay by credit card. Could I get a receipt, please? 前台：Here’s your receipt and credit card. Thank you for staying with us!</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_23_03", "moduleId": "p4_7_23"}, {"title": "2.1 乘坐公交", "section": "二、交通场景", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>核心词汇</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. bus（公交车）：公共交通车辆</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. bus stop（公交站）：公交车停靠站点</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. one-way ticket（单程票）：仅前往目的地的车票</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. round-trip ticket（往返票）：往返目的地的车票</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. destination（目的地）：出行到达的地点</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>实用对话</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>你（上车后）：One one-way ticket to Central Park, please. How much is it? 司机：$3. Put the money in the box.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>你（问乘客）：Excuse me, is this the stop for Central Park? 乘客：This stop is one before Central Park. I’ll tell you when to get off.</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_23_04", "moduleId": "p4_7_23"}, {"title": "2.2 乘坐地铁", "section": "二、交通场景", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>核心词汇</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. subway（地铁，美式）：地下轨道交通工具</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. subway station（地铁站）：地铁停靠站点</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. ticket vending machine（地铁售票机）：自助购买地铁票的设备</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. turnstile（地铁闸机）：进出地铁站的通道设备</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. platform（站台）：地铁候车区域</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>实用对话</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>你（问工作人员）：Excuse me, could you show me how to buy a subway ticket to Times Square? 工作人员：Press “Single Ride”, select Times Square (Line 1), insert $2.75, and the ticket will come out.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>你（问乘客）：Is this platform for the train going to Times Square? 乘客：Yes! The train is Line 1, direction “Uptown”—it’ll arrive in 2 minutes.</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_23_05", "moduleId": "p4_7_23"}, {"title": "2.3 乘坐出租车", "section": "二、交通场景", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>核心词汇</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. take a taxi（乘坐出租车）：选择出租车作为交通工具</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. destination（目的地）：出租车前往的地点</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. fare（车费）：乘坐出租车的费用</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. tip（小费）：额外支付给司机的报酬</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. change（零钱）：支付后找零的钱</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>实用对话</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>你（上车后）：Could you take me to the Hilton Hotel on 5th Avenue? 司机：No problem. It’ll take about 15 minutes.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>你（到达后）：Here’s $35—keep the change.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>司机：Thank you! Have a nice day!</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_23_06", "moduleId": "p4_7_23"}, {"title": "2.4 租车", "section": "二、交通场景", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>核心词汇</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. rent a car（租车）：租赁汽车作为交通工具</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. car rental company（租车公司）：提供汽车租赁服务的机构</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. driver's license（驾照）：驾驶资格证件（国外需国际驾照）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. insurance（保险）：保障车辆意外的服务</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. gas station（加油站）：给汽车加油的站点</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>实用对话</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>你：I’d like to rent a small car for 3 days. Do you need my driver’s license? 工作人员：Yes, please show your International Driver’s License. Would you like insurance? 你：Yes, I’ll take the insurance. Where’s the nearest gas station? 工作人员：There’s one on Main Street. Return the car with a full tank by 5 p.m. on Friday.</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_23_07", "moduleId": "p4_7_23"}, {"title": "三、课后练习", "section": "三、课后练习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>选词填空</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. When you arrive at the hotel, you need to ________ (check in / check out) first.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. To pay for the hotel stay, you can use ________ (credit card / destination) or cash.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3.  If you want to travel freely, you can ________ (rent a car / take a bus) from a local</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>company.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>情景造句</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. （hotel room /air conditioner /not work /call 前台）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. （subway station / buy a ticket / Times Square）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_23_08", "moduleId": "p4_7_23"}, {"title": "3.3 答案", "section": "三、课后练习", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>选词填空</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. check in</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. credit card</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. rent a car</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>情景造句</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. The air conditioner in my hotel room doesn’t work, so I’ll call the reception.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2.  I need to buy a subway ticket to Times Square at the subway station.</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_23_09", "moduleId": "p4_7_23"}]}, {"id": "p4_7_24", "code": "7.24", "title": "旅游英语- 参观购物", "articles": [{"title": "1.1 询问商品信息", "section": "一、购物场景", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>走进商店（store），向店员（salesperson）了解商品（product）信息时，若对连衣裙感兴趣， 可问：“Excuse me, could you tell me something about this dress? What's it made of?” 店员可能回答：“It's made of cotton and it's very comfortable.” 想知道尺寸（size），可问：“Do you have this in a larger size?”</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_24_01", "moduleId": "p4_7_24"}, {"title": "1.2 砍价", "section": "一、购物场景", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>在市场（market）和摊主（vendor）砍价（bargain）时，可讲：“It's a bit too expensive. Can you give me a discount?” 或“I'll take two if you can make it cheaper.” 摊主可能回应：“OK, I can give you 10% off.”</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_24_02", "moduleId": "p4_7_24"}, {"title": "1.3 支付方式", "section": "一、购物场景", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>决定购买后问店员支付方式：“What are the payment options?” 店员可能答：“We accept cash, credit card and mobile payment.” 若用信用卡支付，可讲：“I'd like to pay by credit card.”</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_24_03", "moduleId": "p4_7_24"}, {"title": "2.1 餐厅点餐", "section": "二、旅游餐饮英语", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>走进餐厅（restaurant），服务员（waiter/waitress）问：“How many people are there in your party?” 回答后，服务员会带你到座位（seat）并给菜单（menu）。浏览后可点：“I'd like to order a steak, medium rare, and a salad.” 有特殊要求（special request）如不要洋葱（no onions）， 可讲：“Could you make sure there are no onions in the salad?”</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_24_04", "moduleId": "p4_7_24"}, {"title": "2.2 描述食物口味", "section": "二、旅游餐饮英语", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>食物上桌后，可分享感受：“This steak is really tender and juicy.” 或“The soup is a bit too salty for my taste.”</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_24_05", "moduleId": "p4_7_24"}, {"title": "2.3 处理账单", "section": "二、旅游餐饮英语", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>用餐结束后要账单：“Excuse me, could I have the bill, please?” 检查金额（amount）后，可问：“Is the tip included in the bill?”</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_24_06", "moduleId": "p4_7_24"}, {"title": "3.1 问路", "section": "三、旅游景点英语", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>在景点（scenic spot）迷路（lose your way）时，向路人（passerby）问路：“Excuse me, how can I get to the Eiffel Tower?” 对方可能指示：“Go straight ahead and turn left at the second intersection. You'll see it.” 回应：“Thank you so much for your help.”</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_24_07", "moduleId": "p4_7_24"}, {"title": "3.2 了解景点历史文化", "section": "三、旅游景点英语", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>到达景点后，可对导游（tour guide）或用语音导览（audio guide）问：“Could you tell me something about the history of this place?” 导游可能介绍：“This castle was built in the 12th century and has witnessed many historical events.”</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_24_08", "moduleId": "p4_7_24"}, {"title": "3.3 拍照留念", "section": "三、旅游景点英语", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>想让别人帮忙拍照，可讲：“Excuse me, could you please take a photo of me?” 并指定角度 （angle）：“Could you please take it from this angle?”</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_24_09", "moduleId": "p4_7_24"}]}, {"id": "p4_7_25", "code": "7.25", "title": "雅思听力- 考试指南", "articles": [{"title": "1.1 考试分类与适用场景", "section": "一、雅思听力考试基础信息", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>雅思分A 类（学术类）和G 类（培训类）：A 类适用于出国留学（申请本科、研究生及以上学位或专业资质），G 类适用于移民（投资移民、技术移民）或申请培训/ 非文凭课程；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>两者听力部分完全一致，阅读、写作、口语有差异。申请英国预科或语言班需考UKVI 类，多数考生选择A 类。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_25_01", "moduleId": "p4_7_25"}, {"title": "1.2 考试时长与题型分布", "section": "一、雅思听力考试基础信息", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>考试总时长约40 分钟：30 分钟做题，10 分钟誊写答案至答题卡（仅听力有专门誊写时间， 阅读需边做边填）。共4 个部分（Part1-Part4），各10 题，总计40 题，难度逐部分递增。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_25_02", "moduleId": "p4_7_25"}, {"title": "二、各Part 题型与核心特点", "section": "二、各Part 题型与核心特点", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>2.1 Part1</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 题型：多为表格/ 笔记填空题，要求“每空填1 个单词或数字”（部分题目允许2-3 词，</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>需看题目提示“NO MORE THAN TWO/THREE WORDS”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 场景：日常对话（租房、旅游咨询等），两人对话（一人提问、一人回答）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 答案词性：名词占70%-80%（姓名、地址、电话号码、事物名称等），数字（日期、时间、</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>价格）和形容词次之，动词、副词极少。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 练习方法：1. 首听做题；2. 对答案后盲听，确认理解；3. 仍有疑问则对照原文精听，分析</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>同义替换或词汇问题。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. 目标：6.5 + 分需尽量全对，为后续难题留容错空间。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2.2 Part2</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 题型：多变，含单选题（3-4 选1）、多选题、配对题、地图题、表格填空题，多为单人独</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>白。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 场景：活动介绍（节日庆典）、场所说明（博物馆开放时间）、服务讲解（健身房会员制度）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 难点：单选题需抓同义替换，配对题需提前记选项，地图题需确定起点并定位文字标识。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 注意：通常考2 种题型，难度略高于Part1，填空题仍属简单题，需减少失误。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2.3 Part3</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 题型：单选题、多选题、配对题、填空题，多为学术场景对话（学生讨论作业分工、师生交</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>流论文思路）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 难点：含较多学术词汇，语速快，易出现陷阱题（听到关键词未必是答案）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 技巧：抓句意而非单个单词，遇同义替换及时反应；错过题目不纠结，专注下一题；通过真</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>题积累学术词汇与固定搭配。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2.4 Part4</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 题型：80%-90% 为填空题，偶尔考选择/ 配对题，多为学术独白（学科讲座、研究报告节</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>选，如环境科学、历史文化）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 答案词性：名词占80%+，动词、形容词各占5%-10%，副词极少。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 注意：必须看题目字数要求（1 词/ 2 词/ 3 词），避免因格式失误丢分。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_25_03", "moduleId": "p4_7_25"}, {"title": "三、听力学习核心技巧", "section": "三、听力学习核心技巧", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 预先读题，预测答案：做题前快速浏览题目，推测空格所需词性或内容（如“price” 后可能</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>填数字）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 关注关键词：重点抓名词、动词及限定词（如“most”“only”），缩小答案范围。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 遵循顺序原则：答案在原文中出现顺序与题目一致，错过一题直接做下一题，避免耗时。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 反复精听：做完题后精听原文，分析错题原因（同义替换、词汇、连读）；可集中练习10 套</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>真题的听力部分，强化手感。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. 留意逻辑关系词：如“but” 提示转折后为重要信息，帮助定位答案。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. 简单记录关键信息：用个人习惯的符号（如缩写）记录听力中的数字、名词，避免遗忘。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_25_04", "moduleId": "p4_7_25"}, {"title": "四、听力评分标准", "section": "四、听力评分标准", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 答错0-1 题：9 分</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 答错2-3 题：8.5 分</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 答错4-5 题：8 分</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 答错6-7 题：7.5 分</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. 答错8-10 题：7 分</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. 答错11-13 题：6.5 分</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. 答错14-17 题：6 分</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. 答错18-21 题：5.5 分</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>9. 答错22-25 题：5 分</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>10. 答错26-28 题：4.5 分</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>11. 答错29-32 题：4 分</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>12. 答错33-35 题：3.5 分</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>13. 答错36-38 题：3 分</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>14. 答错39 题：2.5 分</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>15. 答错40 题：2 分</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_25_05", "moduleId": "p4_7_25"}]}, {"id": "p4_7_26", "code": "7.26", "title": "雅思阅读- 考试指南", "articles": [{"title": "1.1 考试时长与文章特点", "section": "一、雅思阅读考试基础信息", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>考试总时长60 分钟，共3 篇文章（A 类多为学术性文本，涉及自然科学、社会科学等领域；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>G 类含生活、工作相关文本），总计40 题，无额外誊写答案时间（需边做边填答题卡）。核心考查信息抓取能力，无需逐字精读，需通过关键词定位高效解题。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_26_01", "moduleId": "p4_7_26"}, {"title": "1.2 时间分配建议", "section": "一、雅思阅读考试基础信息", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>正常情况下文章难度从易到难，但偶尔会调整顺序（如第一篇较难、后两篇简单），建议时间分配：1. 第一篇10-15 分钟（最简单，快速完成）；2. 第二篇20 分钟；3. 第三篇25-30 分钟（最难，留足时间）。做题时需圈画关键词、关键句，减少重复阅读耗时。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_26_02", "moduleId": "p4_7_26"}, {"title": "2.1 选择题（单选/ 多选）", "section": "二、核心题型与做题技巧", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 特点：题干与选项需匹配文章信息，常涉及同义替换。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 技巧：1. 先浏览文章标题、副标题及首段，了解主旨；2. 提取题干关键词（人名、地名、</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>数字、专业术语等），定位文章对应段落；3. 分析选项与原文匹配度，排除偷换概念、以偏概全、过度推断的干扰项；4. 积累同义替换（如“prohibit” 与“forbid”），提高识别效率。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_26_03", "moduleId": "p4_7_26"}, {"title": "2.2 填空题（摘要填空/ 句子填空）", "section": "二、核心题型与做题技巧", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 特点：多为“从文章选原词填空”，部分需调整词性，部分题目提供单词库（正确率更高）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 技巧：1. 用题干关键词定位答案段落范围；2. 分析空格前后语法结构，判断所需词性（名</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>词、动词、形容词等）；3. 80% 以上为原词填空（无需变形），少数需调整词性（如原文 “productive”→题目“productivity”）；4. 注意空格前后搭配（如介词、主谓关系），确保语法正确。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_26_04", "moduleId": "p4_7_26"}, {"title": "2.3 判断题（True/False/Not Given 或Yes/No/Not Given）", "section": "二、核心题型与做题技巧", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 特点：需判断题干与文章内容的关系，难点在“False” 与“Not Given” 的区分；需注意题</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>型要求（写“T/F/NG” 或“Yes/No/NG”，错写不得分）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 技巧：1. True/Yes：题干与文章内容一致（含同义替换，如题干“larger”→原文“bigger”）；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. False/No：题干与文章内容相悖（逻辑相反，如题干“few buyers”→原文“large number</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>of buyers”）；3. Not Given：文章未提及题干信息（无对应内容，如题干“won a Nobel Prize”→ 原文仅提“remarkable achievements”，未提诺贝尔奖）。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_26_05", "moduleId": "p4_7_26"}, {"title": "2.4 配对题", "section": "二、核心题型与做题技巧", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 类型：1. 段落与标题配对；2. 人物与观点配对；3. 信息与段落配对；部分题目标注“NB”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（Nota Bene，拉丁语“注意”），表示选项可重复使用。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 技巧：1. 段落与标题配对：先读所有标题留印象，再逐段理解段落主旨，匹配对应标题；2.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>人物与观点配对：以人物名为关键词，定位其观点所在句，匹配题干观点；3. 信息与段落配对：提取题干所有关键词，逐段检索匹配，优先定位特殊关键词（数字、专有名词）。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_26_06", "moduleId": "p4_7_26"}, {"title": "2.5 流程图题", "section": "二、核心题型与做题技巧", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 特点：考查事物发展过程或操作步骤，需按文章顺序填空。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 技巧：1. 关注文章中表示顺序的连接词（如“first”“then”“next”“finally”）；2. 按流程图逻辑</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>顺序，用相邻信息定位文章对应部分；3. 提取步骤中的核心动作、对象，匹配文章原词或同义表述。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_26_07", "moduleId": "p4_7_26"}, {"title": "三、高效解题方法：平行阅读法", "section": "三、高效解题方法：平行阅读法", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 适用人群：基础较好（阅读速度快、短时记忆强）的考生，核心是利用“题目顺序与原文顺</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>序大致一致” 的原则，同时处理一篇文章的多种题型。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 步骤：1. 快速浏览文章所有题型及题干，提取各题型关键词（如判断题、选择题、填空题</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>的核心名词、动词）；2. 选择易定位的题目（如含数字、人名的题）作为起始点，带关键词定位原文；3. 解答该题时，留意附近是否有其他题型的关键词，若有则同步解答；4. 按原文顺序逐步推进，交替解答不同题型，减少重复阅读，节省时间。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 注意：非唯一高分方法，基础一般的考生按“题型顺序解题” 也可得分，关键是保证正确率</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>与速度平衡。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_26_08", "moduleId": "p4_7_26"}, {"title": "四、阅读评分标准", "section": "四、阅读评分标准", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 答错0-1 题：9 分</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 答错2-3 题：8.5 分</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 答错4-5 题：8 分</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 答错6-7 题：7.5 分</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. 答错8-10 题：7 分</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>6. 答错11-13 题：6.5 分</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>7. 答错14-17 题：6 分</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>8. 答错18-21 题：5.5 分</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>9. 答错22-25 题：5 分</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>10. 答错26-28 题：4.5 分</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>11. 答错29-32 题：4 分</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>12. 答错33-35 题：3.5 分</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>13. 答错36-38 题：3 分</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>14. 答错39 题：2.5 分</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>15. 答错40 题：2 分</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_26_09", "moduleId": "p4_7_26"}]}, {"id": "p4_7_27", "code": "7.27", "title": "雅思写作- 考试指南", "articles": [{"title": "1.1 考试时长与任务分工", "section": "一、雅思写作基础信息", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>考试总时长60 分钟，需完成2 项任务：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 小作文（图表类）：20 分钟内完成，字数不少于150 词（建议200 词左右），考查数据</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>观察、分析及客观描述能力，题型含柱状图、折线图、饼图、表格、流程图、地图。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 大作文（议论文）：40 分钟内完成，字数不少于250 词（建议300 词左右），考查逻辑</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>思维、观点论证及语言连贯性，话题涉及社会、教育、科技等领域。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_27_01", "moduleId": "p4_7_27"}, {"title": "2.1 核心结构（3-4 段）", "section": "二、小作文写作指南", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 开头段：改写题目（paraphrase），用同义替换/ 句式转换表达图表主题（如</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“shows”→“illustrates”，“people in the USA”→“Americans”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 概括段：提炼图表核心特征（极值、趋势、差异等），不罗列具体数据，仅总结整体规律（如</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“整体呈上升趋势，A 类别占比最高”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 主体段（1-2 段）：从不同角度描述关键信息，对比数据关联（如极值对比、变化幅度差异），</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>分段落时需明确角度（如按时间/ 类别划分）。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_27_02", "moduleId": "p4_7_27"}, {"title": "2.2 写作要点", "section": "二、小作文写作指南", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 客观描述：仅基于图表数据阐述，不主观预测趋势或添加个人观点，可使用副词修饰变化（如</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“rapidly 上升”“sharply 下降”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 突出关键：避免平铺直叙，优先描述极值（最高/ 最低）、显著变化（幅度大）及特殊关</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>联（如A 与B 呈反向变化）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 对比分析：不仅描述单个数据，需说明数据间关系（如“A 比B 高20%”“C 与D 变化趋</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>势一致”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 时间控制：建议25 分钟内完成，预留时间给大作文；可提前准备改写模板（如开头句式）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. 书写规范：划分段落清晰，正确使用标点，保证字体易读。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_27_03", "moduleId": "p4_7_27"}, {"title": "2.3.1 柱状图/ 折线图", "section": "二、小作文写作指南", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>开头：改写图表主题（含时间/ 对象）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>概括：总结整体趋势（上升/ 下降/ 波动/ 平稳）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>主体：对比极值数据，分析变化幅度（如“2003-2013 年，A 类别从10% 升至30%，为增幅最大；B 类别维持5% 不变，为最低”）。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_27_04", "moduleId": "p4_7_27"}, {"title": "2.3.2 饼图", "section": "二、小作文写作指南", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>开头：说明饼图反映的类别占比主题。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>概括：指出占比最高/ 最低的类别。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>主体：按占比大小排序描述，可将相近占比类别合并分析（如“A 占40%，B 占35%，合计占比超七成；C 与D 各占10%、15%，占比较低”）。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_27_05", "moduleId": "p4_7_27"}, {"title": "2.3.3 表格", "section": "二、小作文写作指南", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>开头：阐述表格涵盖的类别（如“不同国家、不同年份的能源消耗”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>概括：总结数据整体差异（如“发达国家消耗高于发展中国家”）或趋势（如“2010-2020 年整体下降”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>主体：分类对比关键数据（按国家/ 时间划分），突出极值与显著变化。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_27_06", "moduleId": "p4_7_27"}, {"title": "2.3.4 流程图", "section": "二、小作文写作指南", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>开头：改写流程主题（如“产品生产步骤”“自然现象形成过程”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>主体：按步骤描述，使用连接词（firstly/secondly/next/finally），明确动作逻辑，复杂流程可分段（如“前期准备→核心步骤→最终结果”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>结尾：总结流程最终产物或目的，不添加额外观点。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_27_07", "moduleId": "p4_7_27"}, {"title": "2.3.5 地图", "section": "二、小作文写作指南", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>开头：说明地图反映的区域（如“某城市2000 年与2020 年布局”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">主体：分静态/ 动态描述：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 静态地图：按方位（中心→四周/ 左→右）说明区域功能与位置关系（如“中心为公园，东</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>侧是学校”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 动态地图：对比不同时间变化（新增/ 消失设施、区域功能转变），用变化词汇</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（appear/disappear/replace/transform into），准确使用方位词（north/south/east/west）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>结尾：总结静态地图的功能分布或动态地图的主要变化趋势。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_27_08", "moduleId": "p4_7_27"}, {"title": "3.1 核心结构（4 段）", "section": "三、大作文写作指南", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 开头段（50-80 词）：改写题目话题，明确文章类型（观点类/ 讨论类/ 利弊类/ 原因解</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>决类），亮明个人立场（同意/ 不同意/ 中立，需贴合题目要求）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 主体段1（120-150 词）：阐述第一个论点，搭配论据（原因/ 举例/ 数据），逻辑连贯</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（如“论点：限制私家车可减污染→论据：汽车尾气占城市污染30%，某城市限行后PM2.5 下降15%”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 主体段2（120-150 词）：阐述第二个论点，与主体段1 形成逻辑关系（对比/ 递进），</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>同样搭配论据，避免论点分散（一段仅围绕一个核心观点）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 结尾段（50-80 词）：总结全文观点，重申中心立场，可适当提建议/ 展望未来，不引入</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>新论点。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_27_09", "moduleId": "p4_7_27"}, {"title": "3.2 写作要点", "section": "三、大作文写作指南", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 精准审题：明确题目类型（如“是否同意” 需亮立场，“讨论双方” 需客观分析），抓关键词</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（绝对化词汇“only/never”、主题词“technology/environment”），避免答非所问。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 逻辑框架：采用“总分总” 结构，主体段论点需支撑开头立场，段落内用逻辑词</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（however/therefore/in addition）衔接。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">3. 语言表达：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>词汇多样：避免重复（如“development→growth”“bad→detrimental”）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>句式复杂：多用复合句/ 长难句（如“Online games, characterized by their immersive nature, can have detrimental effects on teenagers”），避免简单句堆砌。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 避免中式英语：可通过分析高分范文，仿写地道句式；减少逐词翻译，注重句式整体表达。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>5. 检查修正：完成后检查拼写、标点错误，少量错误不影响分数，过多会降低文章质量。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_27_10", "moduleId": "p4_7_27"}]}, {"id": "p4_7_28", "code": "7.28", "title": "雅思口语- 考试指南", "articles": [{"title": "一、考试形式", "section": "一、考试形式", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>雅思口语考试时长11-14 分钟，分3 个部分，采用面对面交流或线上视频形式，核心考察语言表达与沟通能力。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_28_01", "moduleId": "p4_7_28"}, {"title": "1.1 Part1：日常话题问答（4-5 分钟）", "section": "一、考试形式", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 内容：考官先问候，再提问基础话题，覆盖6 类常见问题：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>个人信息类：如“What’s your full name?”（你全名是什么？）、“Where are you from?”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（你来自哪里？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>兴趣爱好类：如“What do you like to do in your free time?”（你空闲时间喜欢做什么？）、 “What kind of music do you enjoy listening to?”（你喜欢听什么类型的音乐？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>日常生活类：如“Where do you live?”（你住在哪里？）、“How often do you go shopping?”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（你多久去购物一次？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>学习工作类：如“What subject are you studying?”（你学什么专业？）、“What do you like about your job/school?”（你喜欢你的工作/ 学校的什么方面？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>是非题：如“Have you ever been in very cold weather?”（你曾经经历过非常寒冷的天气吗？），需先答“是/ 否”，再补充2-3 句原因（避免仅答“Yes/No”）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>描述题：如“Tell me about anything you didn't like at your school.”（说说你在学校里不喜</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>欢的任何事情），需提供细节信息</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 要求：用长难句表达，避免简单主谓宾短句，保证回答连贯。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_28_02", "moduleId": "p4_7_28"}, {"title": "1.2 Part2：话题陈述（3-4 分钟）", "section": "一、考试形式", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 流程：考官给话题卡片，考生有1 分钟准备时间（可记录关键词），随后进行1-2 分钟陈</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>述。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 示例话题卡片：“Describe a person you admire. You should say: who the person is, how</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>you know this person, what this person has done, and explain why you admire this person.”（描述一个你钦佩的人。你应该说：这个人是谁，你怎么认识这个人的，这个人做了什么，以及解释你为什么钦佩这个人。）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 要求：陈述需覆盖卡片上的所有提示问题，逻辑清晰，细节充分。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_28_03", "moduleId": "p4_7_28"}, {"title": "1.3 Part3：深入讨论（4-5 分钟）", "section": "一、考试形式", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 内容：考官基于Part2 的话题，提出更抽象、深入的问题，考察逻辑思维与复杂交流能力。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 示例问题（基于“钦佩的人” 话题）：“In your opinion, what qualities make a person</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>admirable in modern society?”（在你看来，现代社会中一个人具备哪些品质会让人钦佩？）、 “Do you think young people today have different standards for admiring someone compared to the past? Why?”（你认为现在的年轻人与过去相比，钦佩某人的标准有不同吗？为什么？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 要求：需快速理解问题，有条理地论证观点，对听力与表达的即时性要求较高。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_28_04", "moduleId": "p4_7_28"}, {"title": "二、评分标准", "section": "二、评分标准", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>评分从4 个维度展开，共同决定最终成绩，各维度权重均等。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_28_05", "moduleId": "p4_7_28"}, {"title": "2.1 流利度与连贯性", "section": "二、评分标准", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 2.1.1 流利度：避免长时间沉默、频繁重复或犹豫，保持表达流畅。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 2.1.2 连贯性：用连接词（如“firstly”“however”“in addition”）衔接句子与观点，逻辑清晰。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_28_06", "moduleId": "p4_7_28"}, {"title": "2.2 词汇资源", "section": "二、评分标准", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 2.2.1 准确性：避免词汇使用错误，确保表达符合语境。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 2.2.2 丰富性：适当运用高级词汇（如用“detrimental” 替代“bad”），但不强行堆砌。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 2.2.3 多样性：避免重复用词，用同义词或不同表达方式（如用“growth” 替代</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>“development”）。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_28_07", "moduleId": "p4_7_28"}, {"title": "2.3 语法范围与准确性", "section": "二、评分标准", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 2.3.1 多样性：运用多种语法结构，包括时态（一般过去时、现在完成时等）、语态（主动、</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>被动）、从句（定语从句、状语从句等）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 2.3.2 准确性：减少语法错误（如时态混淆、主谓不一致），保证句子结构正确。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_28_08", "moduleId": "p4_7_28"}, {"title": "2.4 发音", "section": "二、评分标准", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 2.4.1 单词发音：元音、辅音发音准确，重音位置正确（如“record” 作动词时重音在第二</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>音节）。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 2.4.2 语音语调：自然流畅，运用连读、弱读、失去爆破等技巧，根据内容情感调整语调（如</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>强调观点时语调稍高）。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_28_09", "moduleId": "p4_7_28"}, {"title": "3.1 有效利用Part2 准备时间", "section": "三、答题技巧", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>快速浏览话题与提示问题，在纸上记录关键词（如人物话题记“name”“how I know”“achievements”），梳理陈述顺序，避免遗漏要点。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_28_10", "moduleId": "p4_7_28"}, {"title": "3.2 善用连接词与过渡语", "section": "三、答题技巧", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 引出观点：“First of all”“In the first place”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 补充观点：“Besides”“Additionally”“Moreover”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 转折观点：“However”“On the other hand”</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 总结观点：“In conclusion”“To sum up”</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_28_11", "moduleId": "p4_7_28"}, {"title": "3.3 扩展回答内容", "section": "三、答题技巧", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>避免简单应答，补充理由、例子或细节。示例：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 问题：“Do you like reading books?”（你喜欢读书吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 扩展回答：“Yes, I really like reading books. It’s a great way to expand my knowledge and</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>imagination—for example, when I read science fiction novels, I can explore different worlds I can’t experience in real life. Also, reading helps me relax after a long day at work;</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>I usually carry a book and read it during my commute.”</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_28_12", "moduleId": "p4_7_28"}, {"title": "3.4 注意语音语调", "section": "三、答题技巧", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>保持适中语速，重点内容（如例子中的“science fiction novels”）稍作强调；避免平铺直叙， 用语调变化传递情感（如表达喜欢时语调稍显轻快）。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_28_13", "moduleId": "p4_7_28"}, {"title": "3.5 与考官互动", "section": "三、答题技巧", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 保持眼神交流，展示自信；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 未听清问题时，礼貌请求重复：“I'm sorry, could you please repeat the question?”（对不起，</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>您能重复一下问题吗？）</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_28_14", "moduleId": "p4_7_28"}, {"title": "4.1 模拟场景", "section": "四、模拟练习与反馈", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 考官问题：“Do you think it's important for young people to learn a second language?”（你</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>认为年轻人学习第二语言重要吗？）</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 考生回答：“Yes, I think it's very important. Learning a second language opens up more job</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>opportunities—if you know English well, you can work in international companies. Also, it helps you understand different cultures better; reading books or watching movies in the original language lets you get a deeper grasp of the culture behind them. And it improves cognitive abilities too, like memory and problem-solving skills.”</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_28_15", "moduleId": "p4_7_28"}, {"title": "4.2 分析", "section": "四、模拟练习与反馈", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 优点：观点明确，用“also”“and” 衔接，有具体理由（工作机会、文化理解、认知提升）与</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>例子，符合流利度与词汇要求。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 改进点：语音语调可更丰富（如强调“international companies” 时稍作停顿），增强表达</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>感染力。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_28_16", "moduleId": "p4_7_28"}]}, {"id": "p4_7_29", "code": "7.29", "title": "雅思综合- 备考指南", "articles": [{"title": "1.1 考试费用", "section": "一、雅思考试难度及费用", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>雅思单次考试费用为2170 元，建议充分准备后再报考，避免重复花费。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_29_01", "moduleId": "p4_7_29"}, {"title": "1.2 分数要求", "section": "一、雅思考试难度及费用", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 留学：多数文科专业要求四科小分6.5-7+，部分学校卡小分6.5；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 工作签证：普通职业总分至少4.5（单项不低于4），医生、护士、教师等特定职业需7+</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>（具体因国家而异）；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 水平参考：6.0 为基本交流水平，7 + 为优秀水平，8 + 为母语水平。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_29_02", "moduleId": "p4_7_29"}, {"title": "1.3 中国大陆考生分数情况", "section": "一、雅思考试难度及费用", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>2023-2024 年官方数据：总分平均5.9，听力5.9、阅读6.3、写作5.8、口语5.5；5.5-6.5 分考生占比66%，7 分占比10%，7 + 占比为个位数，阅读提分相对容易（应试能力适配）。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_29_03", "moduleId": "p4_7_29"}, {"title": "1.4 与四六级的区别", "section": "一、雅思考试难度及费用", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 考察能力：雅思考察听说读写综合运用，四六级侧重文字表达与单词量；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 词汇量：雅思需6000-8000（甚至1 万+），四六级4000-4500 即可通过；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 性质：雅思为选拔性考试，内容更贴近生活，四六级为水平测试。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_29_04", "moduleId": "p4_7_29"}, {"title": "2.1 报名时间", "section": "二、报名与分数有效期", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 纸笔考试：考前12 个工作日截止报名（需提前半个月）；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 机考：考前1 周截止报名，场次多于纸笔，建议关注官网动态。</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 选择建议：打字慢、有屏幕恐惧症选纸笔；偏好实体书写、划重点选纸笔（个人倾向）。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_29_05", "moduleId": "p4_7_29"}, {"title": "2.2 分数有效期与备考时间", "section": "二、报名与分数有效期", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 分数有效期：2 年；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 备考时间：基础好需3 个月- 1 年，基础弱建议预留1 年（高强度训练需求，工作党需</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>合理分配时间）。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_29_06", "moduleId": "p4_7_29"}, {"title": "3.1 国内考试特点", "section": "三、国内外考试区别", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 压分传言：主要集中在口语（主观评分），听力、阅读为客观题（答案固定，无主观偏差）；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 作文评分：大作文、小作文由两位考官独立评分（按官方标准），公平性较高；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 口语评分：依赖考官主观判断（流畅度、表达效果），运气影响存在，但提前练题库、自信</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>交流可提升分数。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_29_07", "moduleId": "p4_7_29"}, {"title": "3.2 国外考试特点", "section": "三、国内外考试区别", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>口语评分稍宽松：部分国家对7 + 分数要求更低（仅需流畅准确表达），具体因国家而异。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_29_08", "moduleId": "p4_7_29"}, {"title": "4.1 考点选择", "section": "四、考点选择与考前准备", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>建议选大城市考点（如杭州优于宁波）：大城市设施更完备（避免小考点设备问题，如音质差）， 举例考点：北京首都经济贸易大学、上海财经大学、广州仲恺农业工程学院。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_29_09", "moduleId": "p4_7_29"}, {"title": "4.2 考试时间安排", "section": "四、考点选择与考前准备", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 笔试：通常为周六/ 周四上午（2025 年纸笔考试共40 场，均在周六）；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 口语：安排在笔试前1 周- 后1 周（含周末，个别为周一/ 周五），与笔试分开进行，</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>时间以准考证为准。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_29_10", "moduleId": "p4_7_29"}, {"title": "4.3 考前物品与纪律", "section": "四、考点选择与考前准备", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 必带物品：准考证、身份证；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 考场提供：铅笔、橡皮（无需自带纸笔）；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>3. 禁止携带：食物、电子设备（手机、智能手表等）、书籍、笔记、草稿纸，矿泉水需撕去标</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>签；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>4. 考场纪律：停笔指令下达后禁止继续书写（两次警告即逐出考场），试卷发下后禁止提前翻</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>看（需按指令操作）。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_29_11", "moduleId": "p4_7_29"}, {"title": "5.1 核心资料：剑桥雅思真题（剑4-19）", "section": "五、备考资料推荐", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 权威性：官方真题，反映考试趋势与难度；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"ln-title\">2. 使用建议：</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>a. 基础弱：从剑12 开始（难度适中，适合熟悉题型、建立信心）；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>b. 基础好：从剑15-19 开始（贴近当前考试难度，适合冲击高分）；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>c. 通用方法：掐时间做题（模拟考试节奏），做完后总结错题（分析同义替换、语法问题）， 无需全做（每套含4 套试卷，量较大，优先攻克核心真题）。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_29_12", "moduleId": "p4_7_29"}, {"title": "5.2 辅助资料", "section": "五、备考资料推荐", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>1. 口语：卡卡AI（练语言组织与造句）、课程圈子题库（Part2 多为原题，需提前准备）；</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>2. 其他：优先以真题为核心，网络资料需筛选（选择适配自身水平的知名材料），无需过度依</p>"}, {"type": "p", "html": "<p>赖额外教材（真题内容足够消化）。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_29_13", "moduleId": "p4_7_29"}, {"title": "六、总结", "section": "六、总结", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p>雅思是“通向世界的门票”，本课程涵盖备考、考试全流程干货（含个人实战经验），建议以“基础巩固+ 真题训练” 为核心，口语提前练题库，阅读/ 听力抓同义替换，写作注重逻辑与词汇多样性。目标无需局限于高分，先突破6.5-7 分（适配多数留学/ 工作需求），后续可根据需求刷分。愿各位尽快获取雅思成绩，奔赴目标院校或职业方向，探索更广阔的世界。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_29_14", "moduleId": "p4_7_29"}]}, {"id": "p4_7_30", "code": "7.30", "title": "大结局-未完待续...", "articles": [{"title": "全文", "section": "", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "html": "<p class=\"empty-note\">原始资料中本章节暂无正文内容。</p>"}], "id": "a_p4_7_30_01", "moduleId": "p4_7_30"}]}], "id": "p4", "file": "场景实战课_职场旅游与雅思_7,16_7,30.md", "title": "场景实战课 · 职场·旅游·雅思", "range": "7.16 – 7.30"}]};
